    "char_end": 163311,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:open",
        "text": "FRANCISCO at his post. Enter to him BERNARDO",
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 44,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp1i0",
        "text": "Who's there?",
        "char_start": 45,
        "char_end": 57,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp2i0",
        "text": "Nay, answer me: stand, and unfold yourself.",
        "char_start": 58,
        "char_end": 101,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp3i0",
        "text": "Long live the king!",
        "char_start": 102,
        "char_end": 121,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp4i0",
        "text": "Bernardo?",
        "char_start": 122,
        "char_end": 131,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp5i0",
        "text": "He.",
        "char_start": 132,
        "char_end": 135,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp6i0",
        "text": "You come most carefully upon your hour.",
        "char_start": 136,
        "char_end": 175,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp7i0",
        "text": "'Tis now struck twelve; get thee to bed, Francisco.",
        "char_start": 176,
        "char_end": 227,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp8i0",
        "text": "For this relief much thanks: 'tis bitter cold,",
        "char_start": 228,
        "char_end": 274,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp8i1",
        "text": "And I am sick at heart.",
        "char_start": 275,
        "char_end": 298,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp9i0",
        "text": "Have you had quiet guard?",
        "char_start": 299,
        "char_end": 324,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp10i0",
        "text": "Not a mouse stirring.",
        "char_start": 325,
        "char_end": 346,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp11i0",
        "text": "Well, good night.",
        "char_start": 347,
        "char_end": 364,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp11i1",
        "text": "If you do meet Horatio and Marcellus,",
        "char_start": 365,
        "char_end": 402,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp11i2",
        "text": "The rivals of my watch, bid them make haste.",
        "char_start": 403,
        "char_end": 447,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp12i0",
        "text": "I think I hear them. Stand, ho! Who's there?",
        "char_start": 448,
        "char_end": 492,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp12i1",
        "text": "Enter HORATIO and MARCELLUS",
        "char_start": 493,
        "char_end": 520,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp13i0",
        "text": "Friends to this ground.",
        "char_start": 521,
        "char_end": 544,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp14i0",
        "text": "And liegemen to the Dane.",
        "char_start": 545,
        "char_end": 570,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp15i0",
        "text": "Give you good night.",
        "char_start": 571,
        "char_end": 591,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp16i0",
        "text": "O, farewell, honest soldier:",
        "char_start": 592,
        "char_end": 620,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp16i1",
        "text": "Who hath relieved you?",
        "char_start": 621,
        "char_end": 643,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp17i0",
        "text": "Bernardo has my place.",
        "char_start": 644,
        "char_end": 666,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp17i1",
        "text": "Give you good night.",
        "char_start": 667,
        "char_end": 687,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp17i2",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 688,
        "char_end": 692,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "FRANCISCO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp18i0",
        "text": "Holla! Bernardo!",
        "char_start": 693,
        "char_end": 709,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp19i0",
        "text": "Say,",
        "char_start": 710,
        "char_end": 714,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp19i1",
        "text": "What, is Horatio there?",
        "char_start": 715,
        "char_end": 738,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp20i0",
        "text": "A piece of him.",
        "char_start": 739,
        "char_end": 754,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp21i0",
        "text": "Welcome, Horatio: welcome, good Marcellus.",
        "char_start": 755,
        "char_end": 797,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp22i0",
        "text": "What, has this thing appear'd again to-night?",
        "char_start": 798,
        "char_end": 843,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp23i0",
        "text": "I have seen nothing.",
        "char_start": 844,
        "char_end": 864,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp24i0",
        "text": "Horatio says 'tis but our fantasy,",
        "char_start": 865,
        "char_end": 899,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp24i1",
        "text": "And will not let belief take hold of him",
        "char_start": 900,
        "char_end": 940,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp24i2",
        "text": "Touching this dreaded sight, twice seen of us:",
        "char_start": 941,
        "char_end": 987,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp24i3",
        "text": "Therefore I have entreated him along",
        "char_start": 988,
        "char_end": 1024,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp24i4",
        "text": "With us to watch the minutes of this night;",
        "char_start": 1025,
        "char_end": 1068,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp24i5",
        "text": "That if again this apparition come,",
        "char_start": 1069,
        "char_end": 1104,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp24i6",
        "text": "He may approve our eyes and speak to it.",
        "char_start": 1105,
        "char_end": 1145,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp25i0",
        "text": "Tush, tush, 'twill not appear.",
        "char_start": 1146,
        "char_end": 1176,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp26i0",
        "text": "Sit down awhile;",
        "char_start": 1177,
        "char_end": 1193,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp26i1",
        "text": "And let us once again assail your ears,",
        "char_start": 1194,
        "char_end": 1233,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp26i2",
        "text": "That are so fortified against our story",
        "char_start": 1234,
        "char_end": 1273,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp26i3",
        "text": "What we have two nights seen.",
        "char_start": 1274,
        "char_end": 1303,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp27i0",
        "text": "Well, sit we down,",
        "char_start": 1304,
        "char_end": 1322,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp27i1",
        "text": "And let us hear Bernardo speak of this.",
        "char_start": 1323,
        "char_end": 1362,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp28i0",
        "text": "Last night of all,",
        "char_start": 1363,
        "char_end": 1381,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp28i1",
        "text": "When yond same star that's westward from the pole",
        "char_start": 1382,
        "char_end": 1431,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp28i2",
        "text": "Had made his course to illume that part of heaven",
        "char_start": 1432,
        "char_end": 1481,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp28i3",
        "text": "Where now it burns, Marcellus and myself,",
        "char_start": 1482,
        "char_end": 1523,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp28i4",
        "text": "The bell then beating one,--",
        "char_start": 1524,
        "char_end": 1552,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp28i5",
        "text": "Enter Ghost",
        "char_start": 1553,
        "char_end": 1564,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp29i0",
        "text": "Peace, break thee off; look, where it comes again!",
        "char_start": 1565,
        "char_end": 1615,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp30i0",
        "text": "In the same figure, like the king that's dead.",
        "char_start": 1616,
        "char_end": 1662,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp31i0",
        "text": "Thou art a scholar; speak to it, Horatio.",
        "char_start": 1663,
        "char_end": 1704,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp32i0",
        "text": "Looks it not like the king? mark it, Horatio.",
        "char_start": 1705,
        "char_end": 1750,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp33i0",
        "text": "Most like: it harrows me with fear and wonder.",
        "char_start": 1751,
        "char_end": 1797,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp34i0",
        "text": "It would be spoke to.",
        "char_start": 1798,
        "char_end": 1819,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp35i0",
        "text": "Question it, Horatio.",
        "char_start": 1820,
        "char_end": 1841,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp36i0",
        "text": "What art thou that usurp'st this time of night,",
        "char_start": 1842,
        "char_end": 1889,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp36i1",
        "text": "Together with that fair and warlike form",
        "char_start": 1890,
        "char_end": 1930,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp36i2",
        "text": "In which the majesty of buried Denmark",
        "char_start": 1931,
        "char_end": 1969,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp36i3",
        "text": "Did sometimes march? by heaven I charge thee, speak!",
        "char_start": 1970,
        "char_end": 2022,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp37i0",
        "text": "It is offended.",
        "char_start": 2023,
        "char_end": 2038,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp38i0",
        "text": "See, it stalks away!",
        "char_start": 2039,
        "char_end": 2059,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp39i0",
        "text": "Stay! speak, speak! I charge thee, speak!",
        "char_start": 2060,
        "char_end": 2101,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp39i1",
        "text": "Exit Ghost",
        "char_start": 2102,
        "char_end": 2112,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp40i0",
        "text": "'Tis gone, and will not answer.",
        "char_start": 2113,
        "char_end": 2144,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp41i0",
        "text": "How now, Horatio! you tremble and look pale:",
        "char_start": 2145,
        "char_end": 2189,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp41i1",
        "text": "Is not this something more than fantasy?",
        "char_start": 2190,
        "char_end": 2230,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp41i2",
        "text": "What think you on't?",
        "char_start": 2231,
        "char_end": 2251,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp42i0",
        "text": "Before my God, I might not this believe",
        "char_start": 2252,
        "char_end": 2291,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp42i1",
        "text": "Without the sensible and true avouch",
        "char_start": 2292,
        "char_end": 2328,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp42i2",
        "text": "Of mine own eyes.",
        "char_start": 2329,
        "char_end": 2346,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp43i0",
        "text": "Is it not like the king?",
        "char_start": 2347,
        "char_end": 2371,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp44i0",
        "text": "As thou art to thyself:",
        "char_start": 2372,
        "char_end": 2395,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp44i1",
        "text": "Such was the very armour he had on",
        "char_start": 2396,
        "char_end": 2430,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp44i2",
        "text": "When he the ambitious Norway combated;",
        "char_start": 2431,
        "char_end": 2469,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp44i3",
        "text": "So frown'd he once, when, in an angry parle,",
        "char_start": 2470,
        "char_end": 2514,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp44i4",
        "text": "He smote the sledded Polacks on the ice.",
        "char_start": 2515,
        "char_end": 2555,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp44i5",
        "text": "'Tis strange.",
        "char_start": 2556,
        "char_end": 2569,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp45i0",
        "text": "Thus twice before, and jump at this dead hour,",
        "char_start": 2570,
        "char_end": 2616,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp45i1",
        "text": "With martial stalk hath he gone by our watch.",
        "char_start": 2617,
        "char_end": 2662,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp46i0",
        "text": "In what particular thought to work I know not;",
        "char_start": 2663,
        "char_end": 2709,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp46i1",
        "text": "But in the gross and scope of my opinion,",
        "char_start": 2710,
        "char_end": 2751,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp46i2",
        "text": "This bodes some strange eruption to our state.",
        "char_start": 2752,
        "char_end": 2798,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i0",
        "text": "Good now, sit down, and tell me, he that knows,",
        "char_start": 2799,
        "char_end": 2846,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i1",
        "text": "Why this same strict and most observant watch",
        "char_start": 2847,
        "char_end": 2892,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i2",
        "text": "So nightly toils the subject of the land,",
        "char_start": 2893,
        "char_end": 2934,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i3",
        "text": "And why such daily cast of brazen cannon,",
        "char_start": 2935,
        "char_end": 2976,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i4",
        "text": "And foreign mart for implements of war;",
        "char_start": 2977,
        "char_end": 3016,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i5",
        "text": "Why such impress of shipwrights, whose sore task",
        "char_start": 3017,
        "char_end": 3065,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i6",
        "text": "Does not divide the Sunday from the week;",
        "char_start": 3066,
        "char_end": 3107,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i7",
        "text": "What might be toward, that this sweaty haste",
        "char_start": 3108,
        "char_end": 3152,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i8",
        "text": "Doth make the night joint-labourer with the day:",
        "char_start": 3153,
        "char_end": 3201,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp47i9",
        "text": "Who is't that can inform me?",
        "char_start": 3202,
        "char_end": 3230,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i0",
        "text": "That can I;",
        "char_start": 3231,
        "char_end": 3242,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i1",
        "text": "At least, the whisper goes so. Our last king,",
        "char_start": 3243,
        "char_end": 3288,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i2",
        "text": "Whose image even but now appear'd to us,",
        "char_start": 3289,
        "char_end": 3329,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i3",
        "text": "Was, as you know, by Fortinbras of Norway,",
        "char_start": 3330,
        "char_end": 3372,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i4",
        "text": "Thereto prick'd on by a most emulate pride,",
        "char_start": 3373,
        "char_end": 3416,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i5",
        "text": "Dared to the combat; in which our valiant Hamlet--",
        "char_start": 3417,
        "char_end": 3467,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i6",
        "text": "For so this side of our known world esteem'd him--",
        "char_start": 3468,
        "char_end": 3518,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i7",
        "text": "Did slay this Fortinbras; who by a seal'd compact,",
        "char_start": 3519,
        "char_end": 3569,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i8",
        "text": "Well ratified by law and heraldry,",
        "char_start": 3570,
        "char_end": 3604,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i9",
        "text": "Did forfeit, with his life, all those his lands",
        "char_start": 3605,
        "char_end": 3652,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i10",
        "text": "Which he stood seized of, to the conqueror:",
        "char_start": 3653,
        "char_end": 3696,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i11",
        "text": "Against the which, a moiety competent",
        "char_start": 3697,
        "char_end": 3734,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i12",
        "text": "Was gaged by our king; which had return'd",
        "char_start": 3735,
        "char_end": 3776,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i13",
        "text": "To the inheritance of Fortinbras,",
        "char_start": 3777,
        "char_end": 3810,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i14",
        "text": "Had he been vanquisher; as, by the same covenant,",
        "char_start": 3811,
        "char_end": 3860,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i15",
        "text": "And carriage of the article design'd,",
        "char_start": 3861,
        "char_end": 3898,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i16",
        "text": "His fell to Hamlet. Now, sir, young Fortinbras,",
        "char_start": 3899,
        "char_end": 3946,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i17",
        "text": "Of unimproved mettle hot and full,",
        "char_start": 3947,
        "char_end": 3981,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i18",
        "text": "Hath in the skirts of Norway here and there",
        "char_start": 3982,
        "char_end": 4025,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i19",
        "text": "Shark'd up a list of lawless resolutes,",
        "char_start": 4026,
        "char_end": 4065,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i20",
        "text": "For food and diet, to some enterprise",
        "char_start": 4066,
        "char_end": 4103,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i21",
        "text": "That hath a stomach in't; which is no other--",
        "char_start": 4104,
        "char_end": 4149,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i22",
        "text": "As it doth well appear unto our state--",
        "char_start": 4150,
        "char_end": 4189,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i23",
        "text": "But to recover of us, by strong hand",
        "char_start": 4190,
        "char_end": 4226,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i24",
        "text": "And terms compulsatory, those foresaid lands",
        "char_start": 4227,
        "char_end": 4271,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i25",
        "text": "So by his father lost: and this, I take it,",
        "char_start": 4272,
        "char_end": 4315,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i26",
        "text": "Is the main motive of our preparations,",
        "char_start": 4316,
        "char_end": 4355,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i27",
        "text": "The source of this our watch and the chief head",
        "char_start": 4356,
        "char_end": 4403,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp48i28",
        "text": "Of this post-haste and romage in the land.",
        "char_start": 4404,
        "char_end": 4446,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp49i0",
        "text": "I think it be no other but e'en so:",
        "char_start": 4447,
        "char_end": 4482,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp49i1",
        "text": "Well may it sort that this portentous figure",
        "char_start": 4483,
        "char_end": 4527,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp49i2",
        "text": "Comes armed through our watch; so like the king",
        "char_start": 4528,
        "char_end": 4575,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp49i3",
        "text": "That was and is the question of these wars.",
        "char_start": 4576,
        "char_end": 4619,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i0",
        "text": "A mote it is to trouble the mind's eye.",
        "char_start": 4620,
        "char_end": 4659,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i1",
        "text": "In the most high and palmy state of Rome,",
        "char_start": 4660,
        "char_end": 4701,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i2",
        "text": "A little ere the mightiest Julius fell,",
        "char_start": 4702,
        "char_end": 4741,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i3",
        "text": "The graves stood tenantless and the sheeted dead",
        "char_start": 4742,
        "char_end": 4790,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i4",
        "text": "Did squeak and gibber in the Roman streets:",
        "char_start": 4791,
        "char_end": 4834,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i5",
        "text": "As stars with trains of fire and dews of blood,",
        "char_start": 4835,
        "char_end": 4882,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i6",
        "text": "Disasters in the sun; and the moist star",
        "char_start": 4883,
        "char_end": 4923,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i7",
        "text": "Upon whose influence Neptune's empire stands",
        "char_start": 4924,
        "char_end": 4968,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i8",
        "text": "Was sick almost to doomsday with eclipse:",
        "char_start": 4969,
        "char_end": 5010,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i9",
        "text": "And even the like precurse of fierce events,",
        "char_start": 5011,
        "char_end": 5055,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i10",
        "text": "As harbingers preceding still the fates",
        "char_start": 5056,
        "char_end": 5095,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i11",
        "text": "And prologue to the omen coming on,",
        "char_start": 5096,
        "char_end": 5131,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i12",
        "text": "Have heaven and earth together demonstrated",
        "char_start": 5132,
        "char_end": 5175,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i13",
        "text": "Unto our climatures and countrymen.--",
        "char_start": 5176,
        "char_end": 5213,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i14",
        "text": "But soft, behold! lo, where it comes again!",
        "char_start": 5214,
        "char_end": 5257,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i15",
        "text": "Re-enter Ghost",
        "char_start": 5258,
        "char_end": 5272,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i16",
        "text": "I'll cross it, though it blast me. Stay, illusion!",
        "char_start": 5273,
        "char_end": 5323,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i17",
        "text": "If thou hast any sound, or use of voice,",
        "char_start": 5324,
        "char_end": 5364,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i18",
        "text": "Speak to me:",
        "char_start": 5365,
        "char_end": 5377,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i19",
        "text": "If there be any good thing to be done,",
        "char_start": 5378,
        "char_end": 5416,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i20",
        "text": "That may to thee do ease and grace to me,",
        "char_start": 5417,
        "char_end": 5458,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i21",
        "text": "Speak to me:",
        "char_start": 5459,
        "char_end": 5471,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i22",
        "text": "Cock crows",
        "char_start": 5472,
        "char_end": 5482,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i23",
        "text": "If thou art privy to thy country's fate,",
        "char_start": 5483,
        "char_end": 5523,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i24",
        "text": "Which, happily, foreknowing may avoid, O, speak!",
        "char_start": 5524,
        "char_end": 5572,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i25",
        "text": "Or if thou hast uphoarded in thy life",
        "char_start": 5573,
        "char_end": 5610,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i26",
        "text": "Extorted treasure in the womb of earth,",
        "char_start": 5611,
        "char_end": 5650,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i27",
        "text": "For which, they say, you spirits oft walk in death,",
        "char_start": 5651,
        "char_end": 5702,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp50i28",
        "text": "Speak of it: stay, and speak! Stop it, Marcellus.",
        "char_start": 5703,
        "char_end": 5752,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp51i0",
        "text": "Shall I strike at it with my partisan?",
        "char_start": 5753,
        "char_end": 5791,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp52i0",
        "text": "Do, if it will not stand.",
        "char_start": 5792,
        "char_end": 5817,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp53i0",
        "text": "'Tis here!",
        "char_start": 5818,
        "char_end": 5828,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp54i0",
        "text": "'Tis here!",
        "char_start": 5829,
        "char_end": 5839,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp55i0",
        "text": "'Tis gone!",
        "char_start": 5840,
        "char_end": 5850,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp55i1",
        "text": "Exit Ghost",
        "char_start": 5851,
        "char_end": 5861,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp55i2",
        "text": "We do it wrong, being so majestical,",
        "char_start": 5862,
        "char_end": 5898,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp55i3",
        "text": "To offer it the show of violence;",
        "char_start": 5899,
        "char_end": 5932,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp55i4",
        "text": "For it is, as the air, invulnerable,",
        "char_start": 5933,
        "char_end": 5969,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp55i5",
        "text": "And our vain blows malicious mockery.",
        "char_start": 5970,
        "char_end": 6007,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp56i0",
        "text": "It was about to speak, when the cock crew.",
        "char_start": 6008,
        "char_end": 6050,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp57i0",
        "text": "And then it started like a guilty thing",
        "char_start": 6051,
        "char_end": 6090,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp57i1",
        "text": "Upon a fearful summons. I have heard,",
        "char_start": 6091,
        "char_end": 6128,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp57i2",
        "text": "The cock, that is the trumpet to the morn,",
        "char_start": 6129,
        "char_end": 6171,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp57i3",
        "text": "Doth with his lofty and shrill-sounding throat",
        "char_start": 6172,
        "char_end": 6218,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp57i4",
        "text": "Awake the god of day; and, at his warning,",
        "char_start": 6219,
        "char_end": 6261,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp57i5",
        "text": "Whether in sea or fire, in earth or air,",
        "char_start": 6262,
        "char_end": 6302,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp57i6",
        "text": "The extravagant and erring spirit hies",
        "char_start": 6303,
        "char_end": 6341,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp57i7",
        "text": "To his confine: and of the truth herein",
        "char_start": 6342,
        "char_end": 6381,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp57i8",
        "text": "This present object made probation.",
        "char_start": 6382,
        "char_end": 6417,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp58i0",
        "text": "It faded on the crowing of the cock.",
        "char_start": 6418,
        "char_end": 6454,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp58i1",
        "text": "Some say that ever 'gainst that season comes",
        "char_start": 6455,
        "char_end": 6499,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp58i2",
        "text": "Wherein our Saviour's birth is celebrated,",
        "char_start": 6500,
        "char_end": 6542,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp58i3",
        "text": "The bird of dawning singeth all night long:",
        "char_start": 6543,
        "char_end": 6586,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp58i4",
        "text": "And then, they say, no spirit dares stir abroad;",
        "char_start": 6587,
        "char_end": 6635,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp58i5",
        "text": "The nights are wholesome; then no planets strike,",
        "char_start": 6636,
        "char_end": 6685,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp58i6",
        "text": "No fairy takes, nor witch hath power to charm,",
        "char_start": 6686,
        "char_end": 6732,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp58i7",
        "text": "So hallow'd and so gracious is the time.",
        "char_start": 6733,
        "char_end": 6773,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp59i0",
        "text": "So have I heard and do in part believe it.",
        "char_start": 6774,
        "char_end": 6816,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp59i1",
        "text": "But, look, the morn, in russet mantle clad,",
        "char_start": 6817,
        "char_end": 6860,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp59i2",
        "text": "Walks o'er the dew of yon high eastward hill:",
        "char_start": 6861,
        "char_end": 6906,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp59i3",
        "text": "Break we our watch up; and by my advice,",
        "char_start": 6907,
        "char_end": 6947,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp59i4",
        "text": "Let us impart what we have seen to-night",
        "char_start": 6948,
        "char_end": 6988,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp59i5",
        "text": "Unto young Hamlet; for, upon my life,",
        "char_start": 6989,
        "char_end": 7026,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp59i6",
        "text": "This spirit, dumb to us, will speak to him.",
        "char_start": 7027,
        "char_end": 7070,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp59i7",
        "text": "Do you consent we shall acquaint him with it,",
        "char_start": 7071,
        "char_end": 7116,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp59i8",
        "text": "As needful in our loves, fitting our duty?",
        "char_start": 7117,
        "char_end": 7159,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp60i0",
        "text": "Let's do't, I pray; and I this morning know",
        "char_start": 7160,
        "char_end": 7203,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp60i1",
        "text": "Where we shall find him most conveniently.",
        "char_start": 7204,
        "char_end": 7246,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "1.1.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s1:sp60i2",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 7247,
        "char_end": 7253,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:open",
        "text": "Enter KING CLAUDIUS, QUEEN GERTRUDE, HAMLET, POLONIUS, LAERTES, VOLTIMAND, CORNELIUS, Lords, and Attendants",
        "char_start": 7254,
        "char_end": 7361,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i0",
        "text": "Though yet of Hamlet our dear brother's death",
        "char_start": 7362,
        "char_end": 7407,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i1",
        "text": "The memory be green, and that it us befitted",
        "char_start": 7408,
        "char_end": 7452,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i2",
        "text": "To bear our hearts in grief and our whole kingdom",
        "char_start": 7453,
        "char_end": 7502,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i3",
        "text": "To be contracted in one brow of woe,",
        "char_start": 7503,
        "char_end": 7539,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i4",
        "text": "Yet so far hath discretion fought with nature",
        "char_start": 7540,
        "char_end": 7585,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i5",
        "text": "That we with wisest sorrow think on him,",
        "char_start": 7586,
        "char_end": 7626,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i6",
        "text": "Together with remembrance of ourselves.",
        "char_start": 7627,
        "char_end": 7666,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i7",
        "text": "Therefore our sometime sister, now our queen,",
        "char_start": 7667,
        "char_end": 7712,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i8",
        "text": "The imperial jointress to this warlike state,",
        "char_start": 7713,
        "char_end": 7758,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i9",
        "text": "Have we, as 'twere with a defeated joy,--",
        "char_start": 7759,
        "char_end": 7800,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i10",
        "text": "With an auspicious and a dropping eye,",
        "char_start": 7801,
        "char_end": 7839,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i11",
        "text": "With mirth in funeral and with dirge in marriage,",
        "char_start": 7840,
        "char_end": 7889,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i12",
        "text": "In equal scale weighing delight and dole,--",
        "char_start": 7890,
        "char_end": 7933,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i13",
        "text": "Taken to wife: nor have we herein barr'd",
        "char_start": 7934,
        "char_end": 7974,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i14",
        "text": "Your better wisdoms, which have freely gone",
        "char_start": 7975,
        "char_end": 8018,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i15",
        "text": "With this affair along. For all, our thanks.",
        "char_start": 8019,
        "char_end": 8063,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i16",
        "text": "Now follows, that you know, young Fortinbras,",
        "char_start": 8064,
        "char_end": 8109,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i17",
        "text": "Holding a weak supposal of our worth,",
        "char_start": 8110,
        "char_end": 8147,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i18",
        "text": "Or thinking by our late dear brother's death",
        "char_start": 8148,
        "char_end": 8192,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i19",
        "text": "Our state to be disjoint and out of frame,",
        "char_start": 8193,
        "char_end": 8235,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i20",
        "text": "Colleagued with the dream of his advantage,",
        "char_start": 8236,
        "char_end": 8279,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i21",
        "text": "He hath not fail'd to pester us with message,",
        "char_start": 8280,
        "char_end": 8325,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i22",
        "text": "Importing the surrender of those lands",
        "char_start": 8326,
        "char_end": 8364,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i23",
        "text": "Lost by his father, with all bonds of law,",
        "char_start": 8365,
        "char_end": 8407,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i24",
        "text": "To our most valiant brother. So much for him.",
        "char_start": 8408,
        "char_end": 8453,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i25",
        "text": "Now for ourself and for this time of meeting:",
        "char_start": 8454,
        "char_end": 8499,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i26",
        "text": "Thus much the business is: we have here writ",
        "char_start": 8500,
        "char_end": 8544,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i27",
        "text": "To Norway, uncle of young Fortinbras,--",
        "char_start": 8545,
        "char_end": 8584,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i28",
        "text": "Who, impotent and bed-rid, scarcely hears",
        "char_start": 8585,
        "char_end": 8626,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i29",
        "text": "Of this his nephew's purpose,--to suppress",
        "char_start": 8627,
        "char_end": 8669,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i30",
        "text": "His further gait herein; in that the levies,",
        "char_start": 8670,
        "char_end": 8714,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i31",
        "text": "The lists and full proportions, are all made",
        "char_start": 8715,
        "char_end": 8759,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i32",
        "text": "Out of his subject: and we here dispatch",
        "char_start": 8760,
        "char_end": 8800,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i33",
        "text": "You, good Cornelius, and you, Voltimand,",
        "char_start": 8801,
        "char_end": 8841,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i34",
        "text": "For bearers of this greeting to old Norway;",
        "char_start": 8842,
        "char_end": 8885,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i35",
        "text": "Giving to you no further personal power",
        "char_start": 8886,
        "char_end": 8925,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i36",
        "text": "To business with the king, more than the scope",
        "char_start": 8926,
        "char_end": 8972,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i37",
        "text": "Of these delated articles allow.",
        "char_start": 8973,
        "char_end": 9005,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp1i38",
        "text": "Farewell, and let your haste commend your duty.",
        "char_start": 9006,
        "char_end": 9053,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp2i0",
        "text": "In that and all things will we show our duty.",
        "char_start": 9054,
        "char_end": 9099,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "CORNELIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp3i0",
        "text": "In that and all things will we show our duty.",
        "char_start": 9100,
        "char_end": 9145,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i0",
        "text": "We doubt it nothing: heartily farewell.",
        "char_start": 9146,
        "char_end": 9185,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i1",
        "text": "Exeunt VOLTIMAND and CORNELIUS",
        "char_start": 9186,
        "char_end": 9216,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i2",
        "text": "And now, Laertes, what's the news with you?",
        "char_start": 9217,
        "char_end": 9260,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i3",
        "text": "You told us of some suit; what is't, Laertes?",
        "char_start": 9261,
        "char_end": 9306,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i4",
        "text": "You cannot speak of reason to the Dane,",
        "char_start": 9307,
        "char_end": 9346,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i5",
        "text": "And loose your voice: what wouldst thou beg, Laertes,",
        "char_start": 9347,
        "char_end": 9400,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i6",
        "text": "That shall not be my offer, not thy asking?",
        "char_start": 9401,
        "char_end": 9444,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i7",
        "text": "The head is not more native to the heart,",
        "char_start": 9445,
        "char_end": 9486,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i8",
        "text": "The hand more instrumental to the mouth,",
        "char_start": 9487,
        "char_end": 9527,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i9",
        "text": "Than is the throne of Denmark to thy father.",
        "char_start": 9528,
        "char_end": 9572,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp4i10",
        "text": "What wouldst thou have, Laertes?",
        "char_start": 9573,
        "char_end": 9605,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp5i0",
        "text": "My dread lord,",
        "char_start": 9606,
        "char_end": 9620,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp5i1",
        "text": "Your leave and favour to return to France;",
        "char_start": 9621,
        "char_end": 9663,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp5i2",
        "text": "From whence though willingly I came to Denmark,",
        "char_start": 9664,
        "char_end": 9711,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp5i3",
        "text": "To show my duty in your coronation,",
        "char_start": 9712,
        "char_end": 9747,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp5i4",
        "text": "Yet now, I must confess, that duty done,",
        "char_start": 9748,
        "char_end": 9788,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp5i5",
        "text": "My thoughts and wishes bend again toward France",
        "char_start": 9789,
        "char_end": 9836,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp5i6",
        "text": "And bow them to your gracious leave and pardon.",
        "char_start": 9837,
        "char_end": 9884,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp6i0",
        "text": "Have you your father's leave? What says Polonius?",
        "char_start": 9885,
        "char_end": 9934,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp7i0",
        "text": "He hath, my lord, wrung from me my slow leave",
        "char_start": 9935,
        "char_end": 9980,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp7i1",
        "text": "By laboursome petition, and at last",
        "char_start": 9981,
        "char_end": 10016,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp7i2",
        "text": "Upon his will I seal'd my hard consent:",
        "char_start": 10017,
        "char_end": 10056,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp7i3",
        "text": "I do beseech you, give him leave to go.",
        "char_start": 10057,
        "char_end": 10096,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp8i0",
        "text": "Take thy fair hour, Laertes; time be thine,",
        "char_start": 10097,
        "char_end": 10140,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp8i1",
        "text": "And thy best graces spend it at thy will!",
        "char_start": 10141,
        "char_end": 10182,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp8i2",
        "text": "But now, my cousin Hamlet, and my son,--",
        "char_start": 10183,
        "char_end": 10223,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp9i0",
        "text": "[Aside] A little more than kin, and less than kind.",
        "char_start": 10224,
        "char_end": 10275,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp10i0",
        "text": "How is it that the clouds still hang on you?",
        "char_start": 10276,
        "char_end": 10320,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp11i0",
        "text": "Not so, my lord; I am too much i' the sun.",
        "char_start": 10321,
        "char_end": 10363,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp12i0",
        "text": "Good Hamlet, cast thy nighted colour off,",
        "char_start": 10364,
        "char_end": 10405,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp12i1",
        "text": "And let thine eye look like a friend on Denmark.",
        "char_start": 10406,
        "char_end": 10454,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp12i2",
        "text": "Do not for ever with thy vailed lids",
        "char_start": 10455,
        "char_end": 10491,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp12i3",
        "text": "Seek for thy noble father in the dust:",
        "char_start": 10492,
        "char_end": 10530,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp12i4",
        "text": "Thou know'st 'tis common; all that lives must die,",
        "char_start": 10531,
        "char_end": 10581,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp12i5",
        "text": "Passing through nature to eternity.",
        "char_start": 10582,
        "char_end": 10617,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp13i0",
        "text": "Ay, madam, it is common.",
        "char_start": 10618,
        "char_end": 10642,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp14i0",
        "text": "If it be,",
        "char_start": 10643,
        "char_end": 10652,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp14i1",
        "text": "Why seems it so particular with thee?",
        "char_start": 10653,
        "char_end": 10690,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i0",
        "text": "Seems, madam! nay it is; I know not 'seems.'",
        "char_start": 10691,
        "char_end": 10735,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i1",
        "text": "'Tis not alone my inky cloak, good mother,",
        "char_start": 10736,
        "char_end": 10778,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i2",
        "text": "Nor customary suits of solemn black,",
        "char_start": 10779,
        "char_end": 10815,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i3",
        "text": "Nor windy suspiration of forced breath,",
        "char_start": 10816,
        "char_end": 10855,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i4",
        "text": "No, nor the fruitful river in the eye,",
        "char_start": 10856,
        "char_end": 10894,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i5",
        "text": "Nor the dejected 'havior of the visage,",
        "char_start": 10895,
        "char_end": 10934,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i6",
        "text": "Together with all forms, moods, shapes of grief,",
        "char_start": 10935,
        "char_end": 10983,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i7",
        "text": "That can denote me truly: these indeed seem,",
        "char_start": 10984,
        "char_end": 11028,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i8",
        "text": "For they are actions that a man might play:",
        "char_start": 11029,
        "char_end": 11072,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i9",
        "text": "But I have that within which passeth show;",
        "char_start": 11073,
        "char_end": 11115,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp15i10",
        "text": "These but the trappings and the suits of woe.",
        "char_start": 11116,
        "char_end": 11161,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i0",
        "text": "'Tis sweet and commendable in your nature, Hamlet,",
        "char_start": 11162,
        "char_end": 11212,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i1",
        "text": "To give these mourning duties to your father:",
        "char_start": 11213,
        "char_end": 11258,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i2",
        "text": "But, you must know, your father lost a father;",
        "char_start": 11259,
        "char_end": 11305,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i3",
        "text": "That father lost, lost his, and the survivor bound",
        "char_start": 11306,
        "char_end": 11356,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i4",
        "text": "In filial obligation for some term",
        "char_start": 11357,
        "char_end": 11391,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i5",
        "text": "To do obsequious sorrow: but to persever",
        "char_start": 11392,
        "char_end": 11432,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i6",
        "text": "In obstinate condolement is a course",
        "char_start": 11433,
        "char_end": 11469,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i7",
        "text": "Of impious stubbornness; 'tis unmanly grief;",
        "char_start": 11470,
        "char_end": 11514,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i8",
        "text": "It shows a will most incorrect to heaven,",
        "char_start": 11515,
        "char_end": 11556,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i9",
        "text": "A heart unfortified, a mind impatient,",
        "char_start": 11557,
        "char_end": 11595,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i10",
        "text": "An understanding simple and unschool'd:",
        "char_start": 11596,
        "char_end": 11635,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i11",
        "text": "For what we know must be and is as common",
        "char_start": 11636,
        "char_end": 11677,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i12",
        "text": "As any the most vulgar thing to sense,",
        "char_start": 11678,
        "char_end": 11716,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i13",
        "text": "Why should we in our peevish opposition",
        "char_start": 11717,
        "char_end": 11756,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i14",
        "text": "Take it to heart? Fie! 'tis a fault to heaven,",
        "char_start": 11757,
        "char_end": 11803,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i15",
        "text": "A fault against the dead, a fault to nature,",
        "char_start": 11804,
        "char_end": 11848,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i16",
        "text": "To reason most absurd: whose common theme",
        "char_start": 11849,
        "char_end": 11890,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i17",
        "text": "Is death of fathers, and who still hath cried,",
        "char_start": 11891,
        "char_end": 11937,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i18",
        "text": "From the first corse till he that died to-day,",
        "char_start": 11938,
        "char_end": 11984,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i19",
        "text": "'This must be so.' We pray you, throw to earth",
        "char_start": 11985,
        "char_end": 12031,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i20",
        "text": "This unprevailing woe, and think of us",
        "char_start": 12032,
        "char_end": 12070,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i21",
        "text": "As of a father: for let the world take note,",
        "char_start": 12071,
        "char_end": 12115,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i22",
        "text": "You are the most immediate to our throne;",
        "char_start": 12116,
        "char_end": 12157,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i23",
        "text": "And with no less nobility of love",
        "char_start": 12158,
        "char_end": 12191,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i24",
        "text": "Than that which dearest father bears his son,",
        "char_start": 12192,
        "char_end": 12237,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i25",
        "text": "Do I impart toward you. For your intent",
        "char_start": 12238,
        "char_end": 12277,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i26",
        "text": "In going back to school in Wittenberg,",
        "char_start": 12278,
        "char_end": 12316,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i27",
        "text": "It is most retrograde to our desire:",
        "char_start": 12317,
        "char_end": 12353,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i28",
        "text": "And we beseech you, bend you to remain",
        "char_start": 12354,
        "char_end": 12392,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i29",
        "text": "Here, in the cheer and comfort of our eye,",
        "char_start": 12393,
        "char_end": 12435,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp16i30",
        "text": "Our chiefest courtier, cousin, and our son.",
        "char_start": 12436,
        "char_end": 12479,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp17i0",
        "text": "Let not thy mother lose her prayers, Hamlet:",
        "char_start": 12480,
        "char_end": 12524,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp17i1",
        "text": "I pray thee, stay with us; go not to Wittenberg.",
        "char_start": 12525,
        "char_end": 12573,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp18i0",
        "text": "I shall in all my best obey you, madam.",
        "char_start": 12574,
        "char_end": 12613,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp19i0",
        "text": "Why, 'tis a loving and a fair reply:",
        "char_start": 12614,
        "char_end": 12650,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp19i1",
        "text": "Be as ourself in Denmark. Madam, come;",
        "char_start": 12651,
        "char_end": 12689,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp19i2",
        "text": "This gentle and unforced accord of Hamlet",
        "char_start": 12690,
        "char_end": 12731,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp19i3",
        "text": "Sits smiling to my heart: in grace whereof,",
        "char_start": 12732,
        "char_end": 12775,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp19i4",
        "text": "No jocund health that Denmark drinks to-day,",
        "char_start": 12776,
        "char_end": 12820,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp19i5",
        "text": "But the great cannon to the clouds shall tell,",
        "char_start": 12821,
        "char_end": 12867,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp19i6",
        "text": "And the king's rouse the heavens all bruit again,",
        "char_start": 12868,
        "char_end": 12917,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp19i7",
        "text": "Re-speaking earthly thunder. Come away.",
        "char_start": 12918,
        "char_end": 12957,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp19i8",
        "text": "Exeunt all but HAMLET",
        "char_start": 12958,
        "char_end": 12979,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i0",
        "text": "O, that this too too solid flesh would melt",
        "char_start": 12980,
        "char_end": 13023,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i1",
        "text": "Thaw and resolve itself into a dew!",
        "char_start": 13024,
        "char_end": 13059,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i2",
        "text": "Or that the Everlasting had not fix'd",
        "char_start": 13060,
        "char_end": 13097,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i3",
        "text": "His canon 'gainst self-slaughter! O God! God!",
        "char_start": 13098,
        "char_end": 13143,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i4",
        "text": "How weary, stale, flat and unprofitable,",
        "char_start": 13144,
        "char_end": 13184,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i5",
        "text": "Seem to me all the uses of this world!",
        "char_start": 13185,
        "char_end": 13223,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i6",
        "text": "Fie on't! ah fie! 'tis an unweeded garden,",
        "char_start": 13224,
        "char_end": 13266,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i7",
        "text": "That grows to seed; things rank and gross in nature",
        "char_start": 13267,
        "char_end": 13318,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i8",
        "text": "Possess it merely. That it should come to this!",
        "char_start": 13319,
        "char_end": 13366,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i9",
        "text": "But two months dead: nay, not so much, not two:",
        "char_start": 13367,
        "char_end": 13414,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i10",
        "text": "So excellent a king; that was, to this,",
        "char_start": 13415,
        "char_end": 13454,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i11",
        "text": "Hyperion to a satyr; so loving to my mother",
        "char_start": 13455,
        "char_end": 13498,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i12",
        "text": "That he might not beteem the winds of heaven",
        "char_start": 13499,
        "char_end": 13543,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i13",
        "text": "Visit her face too roughly. Heaven and earth!",
        "char_start": 13544,
        "char_end": 13589,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i14",
        "text": "Must I remember? why, she would hang on him,",
        "char_start": 13590,
        "char_end": 13634,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i15",
        "text": "As if increase of appetite had grown",
        "char_start": 13635,
        "char_end": 13671,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i16",
        "text": "By what it fed on: and yet, within a month--",
        "char_start": 13672,
        "char_end": 13716,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i17",
        "text": "Let me not think on't--Frailty, thy name is woman!--",
        "char_start": 13717,
        "char_end": 13769,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i18",
        "text": "A little month, or ere those shoes were old",
        "char_start": 13770,
        "char_end": 13813,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i19",
        "text": "With which she follow'd my poor father's body,",
        "char_start": 13814,
        "char_end": 13860,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i20",
        "text": "Like Niobe, all tears:--why she, even she--",
        "char_start": 13861,
        "char_end": 13904,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i21",
        "text": "O, God! a beast, that wants discourse of reason,",
        "char_start": 13905,
        "char_end": 13953,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i22",
        "text": "Would have mourn'd longer--married with my uncle,",
        "char_start": 13954,
        "char_end": 14003,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i23",
        "text": "My father's brother, but no more like my father",
        "char_start": 14004,
        "char_end": 14051,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i24",
        "text": "Than I to Hercules: within a month:",
        "char_start": 14052,
        "char_end": 14087,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i25",
        "text": "Ere yet the salt of most unrighteous tears",
        "char_start": 14088,
        "char_end": 14130,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i26",
        "text": "Had left the flushing in her galled eyes,",
        "char_start": 14131,
        "char_end": 14172,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i27",
        "text": "She married. O, most wicked speed, to post",
        "char_start": 14173,
        "char_end": 14215,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i28",
        "text": "With such dexterity to incestuous sheets!",
        "char_start": 14216,
        "char_end": 14257,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i29",
        "text": "It is not nor it cannot come to good:",
        "char_start": 14258,
        "char_end": 14295,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i30",
        "text": "But break, my heart; for I must hold my tongue.",
        "char_start": 14296,
        "char_end": 14343,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp20i31",
        "text": "Enter HORATIO, MARCELLUS, and BERNARDO",
        "char_start": 14344,
        "char_end": 14382,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp21i0",
        "text": "Hail to your lordship!",
        "char_start": 14383,
        "char_end": 14405,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp22i0",
        "text": "I am glad to see you well:",
        "char_start": 14406,
        "char_end": 14432,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp22i1",
        "text": "Horatio,--or I do forget myself.",
        "char_start": 14433,
        "char_end": 14465,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp23i0",
        "text": "The same, my lord, and your poor servant ever.",
        "char_start": 14466,
        "char_end": 14512,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp24i0",
        "text": "Sir, my good friend; I'll change that name with you:",
        "char_start": 14513,
        "char_end": 14565,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp24i1",
        "text": "And what make you from Wittenberg, Horatio? Marcellus?",
        "char_start": 14566,
        "char_end": 14620,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp25i0",
        "text": "My good lord--",
        "char_start": 14621,
        "char_end": 14635,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp26i0",
        "text": "I am very glad to see you. Good even, sir.",
        "char_start": 14636,
        "char_end": 14678,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp26i1",
        "text": "But what, in faith, make you from Wittenberg?",
        "char_start": 14679,
        "char_end": 14724,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp27i0",
        "text": "A truant disposition, good my lord.",
        "char_start": 14725,
        "char_end": 14760,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp28i0",
        "text": "I would not hear your enemy say so,",
        "char_start": 14761,
        "char_end": 14796,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp28i1",
        "text": "Nor shall you do mine ear that violence,",
        "char_start": 14797,
        "char_end": 14837,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp28i2",
        "text": "To make it truster of your own report",
        "char_start": 14838,
        "char_end": 14875,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp28i3",
        "text": "Against yourself: I know you are no truant.",
        "char_start": 14876,
        "char_end": 14919,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp28i4",
        "text": "But what is your affair in Elsinore?",
        "char_start": 14920,
        "char_end": 14956,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp28i5",
        "text": "We'll teach you to drink deep ere you depart.",
        "char_start": 14957,
        "char_end": 15002,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp29i0",
        "text": "My lord, I came to see your father's funeral.",
        "char_start": 15003,
        "char_end": 15048,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp30i0",
        "text": "I pray thee, do not mock me, fellow-student;",
        "char_start": 15049,
        "char_end": 15093,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp30i1",
        "text": "I think it was to see my mother's wedding.",
        "char_start": 15094,
        "char_end": 15136,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp31i0",
        "text": "Indeed, my lord, it follow'd hard upon.",
        "char_start": 15137,
        "char_end": 15176,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp32i0",
        "text": "Thrift, thrift, Horatio! the funeral baked meats",
        "char_start": 15177,
        "char_end": 15225,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp32i1",
        "text": "Did coldly furnish forth the marriage tables.",
        "char_start": 15226,
        "char_end": 15271,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp32i2",
        "text": "Would I had met my dearest foe in heaven",
        "char_start": 15272,
        "char_end": 15312,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp32i3",
        "text": "Or ever I had seen that day, Horatio!",
        "char_start": 15313,
        "char_end": 15350,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp32i4",
        "text": "My father!--methinks I see my father.",
        "char_start": 15351,
        "char_end": 15388,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp33i0",
        "text": "Where, my lord?",
        "char_start": 15389,
        "char_end": 15404,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp34i0",
        "text": "In my mind's eye, Horatio.",
        "char_start": 15405,
        "char_end": 15431,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp35i0",
        "text": "I saw him once; he was a goodly king.",
        "char_start": 15432,
        "char_end": 15469,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp36i0",
        "text": "He was a man, take him for all in all,",
        "char_start": 15470,
        "char_end": 15508,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp36i1",
        "text": "I shall not look upon his like again.",
        "char_start": 15509,
        "char_end": 15546,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp37i0",
        "text": "My lord, I think I saw him yesternight.",
        "char_start": 15547,
        "char_end": 15586,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp38i0",
        "text": "Saw? who?",
        "char_start": 15587,
        "char_end": 15596,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp39i0",
        "text": "My lord, the king your father.",
        "char_start": 15597,
        "char_end": 15627,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp40i0",
        "text": "The king my father!",
        "char_start": 15628,
        "char_end": 15647,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp41i0",
        "text": "Season your admiration for awhile",
        "char_start": 15648,
        "char_end": 15681,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp41i1",
        "text": "With an attent ear, till I may deliver,",
        "char_start": 15682,
        "char_end": 15721,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp41i2",
        "text": "Upon the witness of these gentlemen,",
        "char_start": 15722,
        "char_end": 15758,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp41i3",
        "text": "This marvel to you.",
        "char_start": 15759,
        "char_end": 15778,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp42i0",
        "text": "For God's love, let me hear.",
        "char_start": 15779,
        "char_end": 15807,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i0",
        "text": "Two nights together had these gentlemen,",
        "char_start": 15808,
        "char_end": 15848,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i1",
        "text": "Marcellus and Bernardo, on their watch,",
        "char_start": 15849,
        "char_end": 15888,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i2",
        "text": "In the dead vast and middle of the night,",
        "char_start": 15889,
        "char_end": 15930,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.203",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i3",
        "text": "Been thus encounter'd. A figure like your father,",
        "char_start": 15931,
        "char_end": 15980,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.204",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i4",
        "text": "Armed at point exactly, cap-a-pe,",
        "char_start": 15981,
        "char_end": 16014,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.205",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i5",
        "text": "Appears before them, and with solemn march",
        "char_start": 16015,
        "char_end": 16057,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.206",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i6",
        "text": "Goes slow and stately by them: thrice he walk'd",
        "char_start": 16058,
        "char_end": 16105,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.207",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i7",
        "text": "By their oppress'd and fear-surprised eyes,",
        "char_start": 16106,
        "char_end": 16149,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.208",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i8",
        "text": "Within his truncheon's length; whilst they, distilled",
        "char_start": 16150,
        "char_end": 16203,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.209",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i9",
        "text": "Almost to jelly with the act of fear,",
        "char_start": 16204,
        "char_end": 16241,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.210",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i10",
        "text": "Stand dumb and speak not to him. This to me",
        "char_start": 16242,
        "char_end": 16285,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.211",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i11",
        "text": "In dreadful secrecy impart they did;",
        "char_start": 16286,
        "char_end": 16322,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.212",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i12",
        "text": "And I with them the third night kept the watch;",
        "char_start": 16323,
        "char_end": 16370,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.213",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i13",
        "text": "Where, as they had deliver'd, both in time,",
        "char_start": 16371,
        "char_end": 16414,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.214",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i14",
        "text": "Form of the thing, each word made true and good,",
        "char_start": 16415,
        "char_end": 16463,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.215",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i15",
        "text": "The apparition comes: I knew your father;",
        "char_start": 16464,
        "char_end": 16505,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.216",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp43i16",
        "text": "These hands are not more like.",
        "char_start": 16506,
        "char_end": 16536,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.217",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp44i0",
        "text": "But where was this?",
        "char_start": 16537,
        "char_end": 16556,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.218",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp45i0",
        "text": "My lord, upon the platform where we watch'd.",
        "char_start": 16557,
        "char_end": 16601,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.219",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp46i0",
        "text": "Did you not speak to it?",
        "char_start": 16602,
        "char_end": 16626,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.220",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp47i0",
        "text": "My lord, I did;",
        "char_start": 16627,
        "char_end": 16642,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.221",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp47i1",
        "text": "But answer made it none: yet once methought",
        "char_start": 16643,
        "char_end": 16686,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.222",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp47i2",
        "text": "It lifted up its head and did address",
        "char_start": 16687,
        "char_end": 16724,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.223",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp47i3",
        "text": "Itself to motion, like as it would speak;",
        "char_start": 16725,
        "char_end": 16766,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.224",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp47i4",
        "text": "But even then the morning cock crew loud,",
        "char_start": 16767,
        "char_end": 16808,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.225",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp47i5",
        "text": "And at the sound it shrunk in haste away,",
        "char_start": 16809,
        "char_end": 16850,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.226",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp47i6",
        "text": "And vanish'd from our sight.",
        "char_start": 16851,
        "char_end": 16879,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.227",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp48i0",
        "text": "'Tis very strange.",
        "char_start": 16880,
        "char_end": 16898,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.228",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp49i0",
        "text": "As I do live, my honour'd lord, 'tis true;",
        "char_start": 16899,
        "char_end": 16941,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.229",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp49i1",
        "text": "And we did think it writ down in our duty",
        "char_start": 16942,
        "char_end": 16983,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.230",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp49i2",
        "text": "To let you know of it.",
        "char_start": 16984,
        "char_end": 17006,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.231",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp50i0",
        "text": "Indeed, indeed, sirs, but this troubles me.",
        "char_start": 17007,
        "char_end": 17050,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.232",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp50i1",
        "text": "Hold you the watch to-night?",
        "char_start": 17051,
        "char_end": 17079,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.233",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp51i0",
        "text": "We do, my lord.",
        "char_start": 17080,
        "char_end": 17095,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.234",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp52i0",
        "text": "We do, my lord.",
        "char_start": 17096,
        "char_end": 17111,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.234",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp53i0",
        "text": "Arm'd, say you?",
        "char_start": 17112,
        "char_end": 17127,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.235",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp54i0",
        "text": "Arm'd, my lord.",
        "char_start": 17128,
        "char_end": 17143,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.236",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp55i0",
        "text": "Arm'd, my lord.",
        "char_start": 17144,
        "char_end": 17159,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.236",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp56i0",
        "text": "From top to toe?",
        "char_start": 17160,
        "char_end": 17176,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.237",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp57i0",
        "text": "My lord, from head to foot.",
        "char_start": 17177,
        "char_end": 17204,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.238",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp58i0",
        "text": "My lord, from head to foot.",
        "char_start": 17205,
        "char_end": 17232,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.238",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp59i0",
        "text": "Then saw you not his face?",
        "char_start": 17233,
        "char_end": 17259,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.239",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp60i0",
        "text": "O, yes, my lord; he wore his beaver up.",
        "char_start": 17260,
        "char_end": 17299,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.240",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp61i0",
        "text": "What, look'd he frowningly?",
        "char_start": 17300,
        "char_end": 17327,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.241",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp62i0",
        "text": "A countenance more in sorrow than in anger.",
        "char_start": 17328,
        "char_end": 17371,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.242",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp63i0",
        "text": "Pale or red?",
        "char_start": 17372,
        "char_end": 17384,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.243",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp64i0",
        "text": "Nay, very pale.",
        "char_start": 17385,
        "char_end": 17400,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.244",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp65i0",
        "text": "And fix'd his eyes upon you?",
        "char_start": 17401,
        "char_end": 17429,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.245",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp66i0",
        "text": "Most constantly.",
        "char_start": 17430,
        "char_end": 17446,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.246",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp67i0",
        "text": "I would I had been there.",
        "char_start": 17447,
        "char_end": 17472,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.247",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp68i0",
        "text": "It would have much amazed you.",
        "char_start": 17473,
        "char_end": 17503,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.248",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp69i0",
        "text": "Very like, very like. Stay'd it long?",
        "char_start": 17504,
        "char_end": 17541,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.249",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp70i0",
        "text": "While one with moderate haste might tell a hundred.",
        "char_start": 17542,
        "char_end": 17593,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.250",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp71i0",
        "text": "Longer, longer.",
        "char_start": 17594,
        "char_end": 17609,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.251",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp72i0",
        "text": "Longer, longer.",
        "char_start": 17610,
        "char_end": 17625,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.251",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "BERNARDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp73i0",
        "text": "Not when I saw't.",
        "char_start": 17626,
        "char_end": 17643,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.252",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp74i0",
        "text": "His beard was grizzled--no?",
        "char_start": 17644,
        "char_end": 17671,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.253",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp75i0",
        "text": "It was, as I have seen it in his life,",
        "char_start": 17672,
        "char_end": 17710,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.254",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp75i1",
        "text": "A sable silver'd.",
        "char_start": 17711,
        "char_end": 17728,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.255",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp76i0",
        "text": "I will watch to-night;",
        "char_start": 17729,
        "char_end": 17751,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.256",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp76i1",
        "text": "Perchance 'twill walk again.",
        "char_start": 17752,
        "char_end": 17780,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.257",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp77i0",
        "text": "I warrant it will.",
        "char_start": 17781,
        "char_end": 17799,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.258",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i0",
        "text": "If it assume my noble father's person,",
        "char_start": 17800,
        "char_end": 17838,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.259",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i1",
        "text": "I'll speak to it, though hell itself should gape",
        "char_start": 17839,
        "char_end": 17887,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.260",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i2",
        "text": "And bid me hold my peace. I pray you all,",
        "char_start": 17888,
        "char_end": 17929,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.261",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i3",
        "text": "If you have hitherto conceal'd this sight,",
        "char_start": 17930,
        "char_end": 17972,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.262",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i4",
        "text": "Let it be tenable in your silence still;",
        "char_start": 17973,
        "char_end": 18013,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.263",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i5",
        "text": "And whatsoever else shall hap to-night,",
        "char_start": 18014,
        "char_end": 18053,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.264",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i6",
        "text": "Give it an understanding, but no tongue:",
        "char_start": 18054,
        "char_end": 18094,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.265",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i7",
        "text": "I will requite your loves. So, fare you well:",
        "char_start": 18095,
        "char_end": 18140,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.266",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i8",
        "text": "Upon the platform, 'twixt eleven and twelve,",
        "char_start": 18141,
        "char_end": 18185,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.267",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp78i9",
        "text": "I'll visit you.",
        "char_start": 18186,
        "char_end": 18201,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.268",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp79i0",
        "text": "Our duty to your honour.",
        "char_start": 18202,
        "char_end": 18226,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.269",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "All"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp80i0",
        "text": "Your loves, as mine to you: farewell.",
        "char_start": 18227,
        "char_end": 18264,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.270",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp80i1",
        "text": "Exeunt all but HAMLET",
        "char_start": 18265,
        "char_end": 18286,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp80i2",
        "text": "My father's spirit in arms! all is not well;",
        "char_start": 18287,
        "char_end": 18331,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.271",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp80i3",
        "text": "I doubt some foul play: would the night were come!",
        "char_start": 18332,
        "char_end": 18382,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.272",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp80i4",
        "text": "Till then sit still, my soul: foul deeds will rise,",
        "char_start": 18383,
        "char_end": 18434,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.273",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp80i5",
        "text": "Though all the earth o'erwhelm them, to men's eyes.",
        "char_start": 18435,
        "char_end": 18486,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "1.2.274",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s2:sp80i6",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 18487,
        "char_end": 18491,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:open",
        "text": "Enter LAERTES and OPHELIA",
        "char_start": 18492,
        "char_end": 18517,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp1i0",
        "text": "My necessaries are embark'd: farewell:",
        "char_start": 18518,
        "char_end": 18556,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp1i1",
        "text": "And, sister, as the winds give benefit",
        "char_start": 18557,
        "char_end": 18595,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp1i2",
        "text": "And convoy is assistant, do not sleep,",
        "char_start": 18596,
        "char_end": 18634,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp1i3",
        "text": "But let me hear from you.",
        "char_start": 18635,
        "char_end": 18660,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp2i0",
        "text": "Do you doubt that?",
        "char_start": 18661,
        "char_end": 18679,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp3i0",
        "text": "For Hamlet and the trifling of his favour,",
        "char_start": 18680,
        "char_end": 18722,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp3i1",
        "text": "Hold it a fashion and a toy in blood,",
        "char_start": 18723,
        "char_end": 18760,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp3i2",
        "text": "A violet in the youth of primy nature,",
        "char_start": 18761,
        "char_end": 18799,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp3i3",
        "text": "Forward, not permanent, sweet, not lasting,",
        "char_start": 18800,
        "char_end": 18843,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp3i4",
        "text": "The perfume and suppliance of a minute; No more.",
        "char_start": 18844,
        "char_end": 18892,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp4i0",
        "text": "No more but so?",
        "char_start": 18893,
        "char_end": 18908,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i0",
        "text": "Think it no more;",
        "char_start": 18909,
        "char_end": 18926,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i1",
        "text": "For nature, crescent, does not grow alone",
        "char_start": 18927,
        "char_end": 18968,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i2",
        "text": "In thews and bulk, but, as this temple waxes,",
        "char_start": 18969,
        "char_end": 19014,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i3",
        "text": "The inward service of the mind and soul",
        "char_start": 19015,
        "char_end": 19054,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i4",
        "text": "Grows wide withal. Perhaps he loves you now,",
        "char_start": 19055,
        "char_end": 19099,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i5",
        "text": "And now no soil nor cautel doth besmirch",
        "char_start": 19100,
        "char_end": 19140,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i6",
        "text": "The virtue of his will: but you must fear,",
        "char_start": 19141,
        "char_end": 19183,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i7",
        "text": "His greatness weigh'd, his will is not his own;",
        "char_start": 19184,
        "char_end": 19231,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i8",
        "text": "For he himself is subject to his birth:",
        "char_start": 19232,
        "char_end": 19271,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i9",
        "text": "He may not, as unvalued persons do,",
        "char_start": 19272,
        "char_end": 19307,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i10",
        "text": "Carve for himself; for on his choice depends",
        "char_start": 19308,
        "char_end": 19352,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i11",
        "text": "The safety and health of this whole state;",
        "char_start": 19353,
        "char_end": 19395,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i12",
        "text": "And therefore must his choice be circumscribed",
        "char_start": 19396,
        "char_end": 19442,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i13",
        "text": "Unto the voice and yielding of that body",
        "char_start": 19443,
        "char_end": 19483,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i14",
        "text": "Whereof he is the head. Then if he says he loves you,",
        "char_start": 19484,
        "char_end": 19537,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i15",
        "text": "It fits your wisdom so far to believe it",
        "char_start": 19538,
        "char_end": 19578,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i16",
        "text": "As he in his particular act and place",
        "char_start": 19579,
        "char_end": 19616,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i17",
        "text": "May give his saying deed; which is no further",
        "char_start": 19617,
        "char_end": 19662,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i18",
        "text": "Than the main voice of Denmark goes withal.",
        "char_start": 19663,
        "char_end": 19706,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i19",
        "text": "Then weigh what loss your honour may sustain,",
        "char_start": 19707,
        "char_end": 19752,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i20",
        "text": "If with too credent ear you list his songs,",
        "char_start": 19753,
        "char_end": 19796,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i21",
        "text": "Or lose your heart, or your chaste treasure open",
        "char_start": 19797,
        "char_end": 19845,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i22",
        "text": "To his unmaster'd importunity.",
        "char_start": 19846,
        "char_end": 19876,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i23",
        "text": "Fear it, Ophelia, fear it, my dear sister,",
        "char_start": 19877,
        "char_end": 19919,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i24",
        "text": "And keep you in the rear of your affection,",
        "char_start": 19920,
        "char_end": 19963,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i25",
        "text": "Out of the shot and danger of desire.",
        "char_start": 19964,
        "char_end": 20001,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i26",
        "text": "The chariest maid is prodigal enough,",
        "char_start": 20002,
        "char_end": 20039,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i27",
        "text": "If she unmask her beauty to the moon:",
        "char_start": 20040,
        "char_end": 20077,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i28",
        "text": "Virtue itself 'scapes not calumnious strokes:",
        "char_start": 20078,
        "char_end": 20123,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i29",
        "text": "The canker galls the infants of the spring,",
        "char_start": 20124,
        "char_end": 20167,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i30",
        "text": "Too oft before their buttons be disclosed,",
        "char_start": 20168,
        "char_end": 20210,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i31",
        "text": "And in the morn and liquid dew of youth",
        "char_start": 20211,
        "char_end": 20250,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i32",
        "text": "Contagious blastments are most imminent.",
        "char_start": 20251,
        "char_end": 20291,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i33",
        "text": "Be wary then; best safety lies in fear:",
        "char_start": 20292,
        "char_end": 20331,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp5i34",
        "text": "Youth to itself rebels, though none else near.",
        "char_start": 20332,
        "char_end": 20378,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp6i0",
        "text": "I shall the effect of this good lesson keep,",
        "char_start": 20379,
        "char_end": 20423,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp6i1",
        "text": "As watchman to my heart. But, good my brother,",
        "char_start": 20424,
        "char_end": 20470,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp6i2",
        "text": "Do not, as some ungracious pastors do,",
        "char_start": 20471,
        "char_end": 20509,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp6i3",
        "text": "Show me the steep and thorny way to heaven;",
        "char_start": 20510,
        "char_end": 20553,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp6i4",
        "text": "Whiles, like a puff'd and reckless libertine,",
        "char_start": 20554,
        "char_end": 20599,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp6i5",
        "text": "Himself the primrose path of dalliance treads,",
        "char_start": 20600,
        "char_end": 20646,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp6i6",
        "text": "And recks not his own rede.",
        "char_start": 20647,
        "char_end": 20674,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp7i0",
        "text": "O, fear me not.",
        "char_start": 20675,
        "char_end": 20690,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp7i1",
        "text": "I stay too long: but here my father comes.",
        "char_start": 20691,
        "char_end": 20733,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp7i2",
        "text": "Enter POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 20734,
        "char_end": 20748,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp7i3",
        "text": "A double blessing is a double grace,",
        "char_start": 20749,
        "char_end": 20785,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp7i4",
        "text": "Occasion smiles upon a second leave.",
        "char_start": 20786,
        "char_end": 20822,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i0",
        "text": "Yet here, Laertes! aboard, aboard, for shame!",
        "char_start": 20823,
        "char_end": 20868,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i1",
        "text": "The wind sits in the shoulder of your sail,",
        "char_start": 20869,
        "char_end": 20912,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i2",
        "text": "And you are stay'd for. There; my blessing with thee!",
        "char_start": 20913,
        "char_end": 20966,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i3",
        "text": "And these few precepts in thy memory",
        "char_start": 20967,
        "char_end": 21003,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i4",
        "text": "See thou character. Give thy thoughts no tongue,",
        "char_start": 21004,
        "char_end": 21052,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i5",
        "text": "Nor any unproportioned thought his act.",
        "char_start": 21053,
        "char_end": 21092,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i6",
        "text": "Be thou familiar, but by no means vulgar.",
        "char_start": 21093,
        "char_end": 21134,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i7",
        "text": "Those friends thou hast, and their adoption tried,",
        "char_start": 21135,
        "char_end": 21185,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i8",
        "text": "Grapple them to thy soul with hoops of steel;",
        "char_start": 21186,
        "char_end": 21231,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i9",
        "text": "But do not dull thy palm with entertainment",
        "char_start": 21232,
        "char_end": 21275,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i10",
        "text": "Of each new-hatch'd, unfledged comrade. Beware",
        "char_start": 21276,
        "char_end": 21322,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i11",
        "text": "Of entrance to a quarrel, but being in,",
        "char_start": 21323,
        "char_end": 21362,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i12",
        "text": "Bear't that the opposed may beware of thee.",
        "char_start": 21363,
        "char_end": 21406,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i13",
        "text": "Give every man thy ear, but few thy voice;",
        "char_start": 21407,
        "char_end": 21449,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i14",
        "text": "Take each man's censure, but reserve thy judgment.",
        "char_start": 21450,
        "char_end": 21500,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i15",
        "text": "Costly thy habit as thy purse can buy,",
        "char_start": 21501,
        "char_end": 21539,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i16",
        "text": "But not express'd in fancy; rich, not gaudy;",
        "char_start": 21540,
        "char_end": 21584,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i17",
        "text": "For the apparel oft proclaims the man,",
        "char_start": 21585,
        "char_end": 21623,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i18",
        "text": "And they in France of the best rank and station",
        "char_start": 21624,
        "char_end": 21671,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i19",
        "text": "Are of a most select and generous chief in that.",
        "char_start": 21672,
        "char_end": 21720,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i20",
        "text": "Neither a borrower nor a lender be;",
        "char_start": 21721,
        "char_end": 21756,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i21",
        "text": "For loan oft loses both itself and friend,",
        "char_start": 21757,
        "char_end": 21799,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i22",
        "text": "And borrowing dulls the edge of husbandry.",
        "char_start": 21800,
        "char_end": 21842,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i23",
        "text": "This above all: to thine ownself be true,",
        "char_start": 21843,
        "char_end": 21884,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i24",
        "text": "And it must follow, as the night the day,",
        "char_start": 21885,
        "char_end": 21926,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i25",
        "text": "Thou canst not then be false to any man.",
        "char_start": 21927,
        "char_end": 21967,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp8i26",
        "text": "Farewell: my blessing season this in thee!",
        "char_start": 21968,
        "char_end": 22010,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp9i0",
        "text": "Most humbly do I take my leave, my lord.",
        "char_start": 22011,
        "char_end": 22051,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp10i0",
        "text": "The time invites you; go; your servants tend.",
        "char_start": 22052,
        "char_end": 22097,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp11i0",
        "text": "Farewell, Ophelia; and remember well",
        "char_start": 22098,
        "char_end": 22134,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp11i1",
        "text": "What I have said to you.",
        "char_start": 22135,
        "char_end": 22159,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp12i0",
        "text": "'Tis in my memory lock'd,",
        "char_start": 22160,
        "char_end": 22185,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp12i1",
        "text": "And you yourself shall keep the key of it.",
        "char_start": 22186,
        "char_end": 22228,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp13i0",
        "text": "Farewell.",
        "char_start": 22229,
        "char_end": 22238,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp13i1",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 22239,
        "char_end": 22243,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp14i0",
        "text": "What is't, Ophelia, be hath said to you?",
        "char_start": 22244,
        "char_end": 22284,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp15i0",
        "text": "So please you, something touching the Lord Hamlet.",
        "char_start": 22285,
        "char_end": 22335,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp16i0",
        "text": "Marry, well bethought:",
        "char_start": 22336,
        "char_end": 22358,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp16i1",
        "text": "'Tis told me, he hath very oft of late",
        "char_start": 22359,
        "char_end": 22397,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp16i2",
        "text": "Given private time to you; and you yourself",
        "char_start": 22398,
        "char_end": 22441,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp16i3",
        "text": "Have of your audience been most free and bounteous:",
        "char_start": 22442,
        "char_end": 22493,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp16i4",
        "text": "If it be so, as so 'tis put on me,",
        "char_start": 22494,
        "char_end": 22528,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp16i5",
        "text": "And that in way of caution, I must tell you,",
        "char_start": 22529,
        "char_end": 22573,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp16i6",
        "text": "You do not understand yourself so clearly",
        "char_start": 22574,
        "char_end": 22615,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp16i7",
        "text": "As it behoves my daughter and your honour.",
        "char_start": 22616,
        "char_end": 22658,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp16i8",
        "text": "What is between you? give me up the truth.",
        "char_start": 22659,
        "char_end": 22701,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp17i0",
        "text": "He hath, my lord, of late made many tenders",
        "char_start": 22702,
        "char_end": 22745,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp17i1",
        "text": "Of his affection to me.",
        "char_start": 22746,
        "char_end": 22769,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp18i0",
        "text": "Affection! pooh! you speak like a green girl,",
        "char_start": 22770,
        "char_end": 22815,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp18i1",
        "text": "Unsifted in such perilous circumstance.",
        "char_start": 22816,
        "char_end": 22855,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp18i2",
        "text": "Do you believe his tenders, as you call them?",
        "char_start": 22856,
        "char_end": 22901,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp19i0",
        "text": "I do not know, my lord, what I should think.",
        "char_start": 22902,
        "char_end": 22946,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp20i0",
        "text": "Marry, I'll teach you: think yourself a baby;",
        "char_start": 22947,
        "char_end": 22992,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp20i1",
        "text": "That you have ta'en these tenders for true pay,",
        "char_start": 22993,
        "char_end": 23040,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp20i2",
        "text": "Which are not sterling. Tender yourself more dearly;",
        "char_start": 23041,
        "char_end": 23093,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp20i3",
        "text": "Or--not to crack the wind of the poor phrase,",
        "char_start": 23094,
        "char_end": 23139,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp20i4",
        "text": "Running it thus--you'll tender me a fool.",
        "char_start": 23140,
        "char_end": 23181,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp21i0",
        "text": "My lord, he hath importuned me with love",
        "char_start": 23182,
        "char_end": 23222,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp21i1",
        "text": "In honourable fashion.",
        "char_start": 23223,
        "char_end": 23245,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp22i0",
        "text": "Ay, fashion you may call it; go to, go to.",
        "char_start": 23246,
        "char_end": 23288,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp23i0",
        "text": "And hath given countenance to his speech, my lord,",
        "char_start": 23289,
        "char_end": 23339,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp23i1",
        "text": "With almost all the holy vows of heaven.",
        "char_start": 23340,
        "char_end": 23380,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i0",
        "text": "Ay, springes to catch woodcocks. I do know,",
        "char_start": 23381,
        "char_end": 23424,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i1",
        "text": "When the blood burns, how prodigal the soul",
        "char_start": 23425,
        "char_end": 23468,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i2",
        "text": "Lends the tongue vows: these blazes, daughter,",
        "char_start": 23469,
        "char_end": 23515,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i3",
        "text": "Giving more light than heat, extinct in both,",
        "char_start": 23516,
        "char_end": 23561,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i4",
        "text": "Even in their promise, as it is a-making,",
        "char_start": 23562,
        "char_end": 23603,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i5",
        "text": "You must not take for fire. From this time",
        "char_start": 23604,
        "char_end": 23646,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i6",
        "text": "Be somewhat scanter of your maiden presence;",
        "char_start": 23647,
        "char_end": 23691,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i7",
        "text": "Set your entreatments at a higher rate",
        "char_start": 23692,
        "char_end": 23730,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i8",
        "text": "Than a command to parley. For Lord Hamlet,",
        "char_start": 23731,
        "char_end": 23773,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i9",
        "text": "Believe so much in him, that he is young",
        "char_start": 23774,
        "char_end": 23814,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i10",
        "text": "And with a larger tether may he walk",
        "char_start": 23815,
        "char_end": 23851,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i11",
        "text": "Than may be given you: in few, Ophelia,",
        "char_start": 23852,
        "char_end": 23891,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i12",
        "text": "Do not believe his vows; for they are brokers,",
        "char_start": 23892,
        "char_end": 23938,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i13",
        "text": "Not of that dye which their investments show,",
        "char_start": 23939,
        "char_end": 23984,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i14",
        "text": "But mere implorators of unholy suits,",
        "char_start": 23985,
        "char_end": 24022,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i15",
        "text": "Breathing like sanctified and pious bawds,",
        "char_start": 24023,
        "char_end": 24065,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i16",
        "text": "The better to beguile. This is for all:",
        "char_start": 24066,
        "char_end": 24105,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i17",
        "text": "I would not, in plain terms, from this time forth,",
        "char_start": 24106,
        "char_end": 24156,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i18",
        "text": "Have you so slander any moment leisure,",
        "char_start": 24157,
        "char_end": 24196,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i19",
        "text": "As to give words or talk with the Lord Hamlet.",
        "char_start": 24197,
        "char_end": 24243,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp24i20",
        "text": "Look to't, I charge you: come your ways.",
        "char_start": 24244,
        "char_end": 24284,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp25i0",
        "text": "I shall obey, my lord.",
        "char_start": 24285,
        "char_end": 24307,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "1.3.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s3:sp25i1",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 24308,
        "char_end": 24314,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:open",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET, HORATIO, and MARCELLUS",
        "char_start": 24315,
        "char_end": 24351,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp1i0",
        "text": "The air bites shrewdly; it is very cold.",
        "char_start": 24352,
        "char_end": 24392,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp2i0",
        "text": "It is a nipping and an eager air.",
        "char_start": 24393,
        "char_end": 24426,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp3i0",
        "text": "What hour now?",
        "char_start": 24427,
        "char_end": 24441,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp4i0",
        "text": "I think it lacks of twelve.",
        "char_start": 24442,
        "char_end": 24469,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp5i0",
        "text": "No, it is struck.",
        "char_start": 24470,
        "char_end": 24487,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp6i0",
        "text": "Indeed? I heard it not: then it draws near the season",
        "char_start": 24488,
        "char_end": 24541,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp6i1",
        "text": "Wherein the spirit held his wont to walk.",
        "char_start": 24542,
        "char_end": 24583,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp6i2",
        "text": "A flourish of trumpets, and ordnance shot off, within",
        "char_start": 24584,
        "char_end": 24637,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp6i3",
        "text": "What does this mean, my lord?",
        "char_start": 24638,
        "char_end": 24667,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp7i0",
        "text": "The king doth wake to-night and takes his rouse,",
        "char_start": 24668,
        "char_end": 24716,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp7i1",
        "text": "Keeps wassail, and the swaggering up-spring reels;",
        "char_start": 24717,
        "char_end": 24767,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp7i2",
        "text": "And, as he drains his draughts of Rhenish down,",
        "char_start": 24768,
        "char_end": 24815,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp7i3",
        "text": "The kettle-drum and trumpet thus bray out",
        "char_start": 24816,
        "char_end": 24857,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp7i4",
        "text": "The triumph of his pledge.",
        "char_start": 24858,
        "char_end": 24884,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp8i0",
        "text": "Is it a custom?",
        "char_start": 24885,
        "char_end": 24900,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i0",
        "text": "Ay, marry, is't:",
        "char_start": 24901,
        "char_end": 24917,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i1",
        "text": "But to my mind, though I am native here",
        "char_start": 24918,
        "char_end": 24957,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i2",
        "text": "And to the manner born, it is a custom",
        "char_start": 24958,
        "char_end": 24996,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i3",
        "text": "More honour'd in the breach than the observance.",
        "char_start": 24997,
        "char_end": 25045,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i4",
        "text": "This heavy-headed revel east and west",
        "char_start": 25046,
        "char_end": 25083,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i5",
        "text": "Makes us traduced and tax'd of other nations:",
        "char_start": 25084,
        "char_end": 25129,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i6",
        "text": "They clepe us drunkards, and with swinish phrase",
        "char_start": 25130,
        "char_end": 25178,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i7",
        "text": "Soil our addition; and indeed it takes",
        "char_start": 25179,
        "char_end": 25217,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i8",
        "text": "From our achievements, though perform'd at height,",
        "char_start": 25218,
        "char_end": 25268,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i9",
        "text": "The pith and marrow of our attribute.",
        "char_start": 25269,
        "char_end": 25306,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i10",
        "text": "So, oft it chances in particular men,",
        "char_start": 25307,
        "char_end": 25344,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i11",
        "text": "That for some vicious mole of nature in them,",
        "char_start": 25345,
        "char_end": 25390,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i12",
        "text": "As, in their birth--wherein they are not guilty,",
        "char_start": 25391,
        "char_end": 25439,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i13",
        "text": "Since nature cannot choose his origin--",
        "char_start": 25440,
        "char_end": 25479,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i14",
        "text": "By the o'ergrowth of some complexion,",
        "char_start": 25480,
        "char_end": 25517,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i15",
        "text": "Oft breaking down the pales and forts of reason,",
        "char_start": 25518,
        "char_end": 25566,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i16",
        "text": "Or by some habit that too much o'er-leavens",
        "char_start": 25567,
        "char_end": 25610,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i17",
        "text": "The form of plausive manners, that these men,",
        "char_start": 25611,
        "char_end": 25656,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i18",
        "text": "Carrying, I say, the stamp of one defect,",
        "char_start": 25657,
        "char_end": 25698,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i19",
        "text": "Being nature's livery, or fortune's star,--",
        "char_start": 25699,
        "char_end": 25742,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i20",
        "text": "Their virtues else--be they as pure as grace,",
        "char_start": 25743,
        "char_end": 25788,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i21",
        "text": "As infinite as man may undergo--",
        "char_start": 25789,
        "char_end": 25821,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i22",
        "text": "Shall in the general censure take corruption",
        "char_start": 25822,
        "char_end": 25866,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i23",
        "text": "From that particular fault: the dram of eale",
        "char_start": 25867,
        "char_end": 25911,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i24",
        "text": "Doth all the noble substance of a doubt",
        "char_start": 25912,
        "char_end": 25951,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp9i25",
        "text": "To his own scandal.",
        "char_start": 25952,
        "char_end": 25971,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp10i0",
        "text": "Look, my lord, it comes!",
        "char_start": 25972,
        "char_end": 25996,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp10i1",
        "text": "Enter Ghost",
        "char_start": 25997,
        "char_end": 26008,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i0",
        "text": "Angels and ministers of grace defend us!",
        "char_start": 26009,
        "char_end": 26049,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i1",
        "text": "Be thou a spirit of health or goblin damn'd,",
        "char_start": 26050,
        "char_end": 26094,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i2",
        "text": "Bring with thee airs from heaven or blasts from hell,",
        "char_start": 26095,
        "char_end": 26148,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i3",
        "text": "Be thy intents wicked or charitable,",
        "char_start": 26149,
        "char_end": 26185,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i4",
        "text": "Thou comest in such a questionable shape",
        "char_start": 26186,
        "char_end": 26226,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i5",
        "text": "That I will speak to thee: I'll call thee Hamlet,",
        "char_start": 26227,
        "char_end": 26276,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i6",
        "text": "King, father, royal Dane: O, answer me!",
        "char_start": 26277,
        "char_end": 26316,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i7",
        "text": "Let me not burst in ignorance; but tell",
        "char_start": 26317,
        "char_end": 26356,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i8",
        "text": "Why thy canonized bones, hearsed in death,",
        "char_start": 26357,
        "char_end": 26399,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i9",
        "text": "Have burst their cerements; why the sepulchre,",
        "char_start": 26400,
        "char_end": 26446,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i10",
        "text": "Wherein we saw thee quietly inurn'd,",
        "char_start": 26447,
        "char_end": 26483,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i11",
        "text": "Hath oped his ponderous and marble jaws,",
        "char_start": 26484,
        "char_end": 26524,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i12",
        "text": "To cast thee up again. What may this mean,",
        "char_start": 26525,
        "char_end": 26567,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i13",
        "text": "That thou, dead corse, again in complete steel",
        "char_start": 26568,
        "char_end": 26614,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i14",
        "text": "Revisit'st thus the glimpses of the moon,",
        "char_start": 26615,
        "char_end": 26656,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i15",
        "text": "Making night hideous; and we fools of nature",
        "char_start": 26657,
        "char_end": 26701,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i16",
        "text": "So horridly to shake our disposition",
        "char_start": 26702,
        "char_end": 26738,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i17",
        "text": "With thoughts beyond the reaches of our souls?",
        "char_start": 26739,
        "char_end": 26785,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i18",
        "text": "Say, why is this? wherefore? what should we do?",
        "char_start": 26786,
        "char_end": 26833,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp11i19",
        "text": "Ghost beckons HAMLET",
        "char_start": 26834,
        "char_end": 26854,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp12i0",
        "text": "It beckons you to go away with it,",
        "char_start": 26855,
        "char_end": 26889,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp12i1",
        "text": "As if it some impartment did desire",
        "char_start": 26890,
        "char_end": 26925,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp12i2",
        "text": "To you alone.",
        "char_start": 26926,
        "char_end": 26939,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp13i0",
        "text": "Look, with what courteous action",
        "char_start": 26940,
        "char_end": 26972,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp13i1",
        "text": "It waves you to a more removed ground:",
        "char_start": 26973,
        "char_end": 27011,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp13i2",
        "text": "But do not go with it.",
        "char_start": 27012,
        "char_end": 27034,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp14i0",
        "text": "No, by no means.",
        "char_start": 27035,
        "char_end": 27051,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp15i0",
        "text": "It will not speak; then I will follow it.",
        "char_start": 27052,
        "char_end": 27093,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp16i0",
        "text": "Do not, my lord.",
        "char_start": 27094,
        "char_end": 27110,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp17i0",
        "text": "Why, what should be the fear?",
        "char_start": 27111,
        "char_end": 27140,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp17i1",
        "text": "I do not set my life in a pin's fee;",
        "char_start": 27141,
        "char_end": 27177,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp17i2",
        "text": "And for my soul, what can it do to that,",
        "char_start": 27178,
        "char_end": 27218,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp17i3",
        "text": "Being a thing immortal as itself?",
        "char_start": 27219,
        "char_end": 27252,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp17i4",
        "text": "It waves me forth again: I'll follow it.",
        "char_start": 27253,
        "char_end": 27293,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i0",
        "text": "What if it tempt you toward the flood, my lord,",
        "char_start": 27294,
        "char_end": 27341,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i1",
        "text": "Or to the dreadful summit of the cliff",
        "char_start": 27342,
        "char_end": 27380,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i2",
        "text": "That beetles o'er his base into the sea,",
        "char_start": 27381,
        "char_end": 27421,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i3",
        "text": "And there assume some other horrible form,",
        "char_start": 27422,
        "char_end": 27464,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i4",
        "text": "Which might deprive your sovereignty of reason",
        "char_start": 27465,
        "char_end": 27511,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i5",
        "text": "And draw you into madness? think of it:",
        "char_start": 27512,
        "char_end": 27551,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i6",
        "text": "The very place puts toys of desperation,",
        "char_start": 27552,
        "char_end": 27592,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i7",
        "text": "Without more motive, into every brain",
        "char_start": 27593,
        "char_end": 27630,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i8",
        "text": "That looks so many fathoms to the sea",
        "char_start": 27631,
        "char_end": 27668,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp18i9",
        "text": "And hears it roar beneath.",
        "char_start": 27669,
        "char_end": 27695,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp19i0",
        "text": "It waves me still.",
        "char_start": 27696,
        "char_end": 27714,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp19i1",
        "text": "Go on; I'll follow thee.",
        "char_start": 27715,
        "char_end": 27739,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp20i0",
        "text": "You shall not go, my lord.",
        "char_start": 27740,
        "char_end": 27766,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp21i0",
        "text": "Hold off your hands.",
        "char_start": 27767,
        "char_end": 27787,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp22i0",
        "text": "Be ruled; you shall not go.",
        "char_start": 27788,
        "char_end": 27815,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp23i0",
        "text": "My fate cries out,",
        "char_start": 27816,
        "char_end": 27834,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp23i1",
        "text": "And makes each petty artery in this body",
        "char_start": 27835,
        "char_end": 27875,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp23i2",
        "text": "As hardy as the Nemean lion's nerve.",
        "char_start": 27876,
        "char_end": 27912,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp23i3",
        "text": "Still am I call'd. Unhand me, gentlemen.",
        "char_start": 27913,
        "char_end": 27953,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp23i4",
        "text": "By heaven, I'll make a ghost of him that lets me!",
        "char_start": 27954,
        "char_end": 28003,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp23i5",
        "text": "I say, away! Go on; I'll follow thee.",
        "char_start": 28004,
        "char_end": 28041,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp23i6",
        "text": "Exeunt Ghost and HAMLET",
        "char_start": 28042,
        "char_end": 28065,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp24i0",
        "text": "He waxes desperate with imagination.",
        "char_start": 28066,
        "char_end": 28102,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp25i0",
        "text": "Let's follow; 'tis not fit thus to obey him.",
        "char_start": 28103,
        "char_end": 28147,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp26i0",
        "text": "Have after. To what issue will this come?",
        "char_start": 28148,
        "char_end": 28189,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp27i0",
        "text": "Something is rotten in the state of Denmark.",
        "char_start": 28190,
        "char_end": 28234,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp28i0",
        "text": "Heaven will direct it.",
        "char_start": 28235,
        "char_end": 28257,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp29i0",
        "text": "Nay, let's follow him.",
        "char_start": 28258,
        "char_end": 28280,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "1.4.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s4:sp29i1",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 28281,
        "char_end": 28287,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:open",
        "text": "Enter GHOST and HAMLET",
        "char_start": 28288,
        "char_end": 28310,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp1i0",
        "text": "Where wilt thou lead me? speak; I'll go no further.",
        "char_start": 28311,
        "char_end": 28362,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp2i0",
        "text": "Mark me.",
        "char_start": 28363,
        "char_end": 28371,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp3i0",
        "text": "I will.",
        "char_start": 28372,
        "char_end": 28379,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp4i0",
        "text": "My hour is almost come,",
        "char_start": 28380,
        "char_end": 28403,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp4i1",
        "text": "When I to sulphurous and tormenting flames",
        "char_start": 28404,
        "char_end": 28446,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp4i2",
        "text": "Must render up myself.",
        "char_start": 28447,
        "char_end": 28469,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp5i0",
        "text": "Alas, poor ghost!",
        "char_start": 28470,
        "char_end": 28487,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp6i0",
        "text": "Pity me not, but lend thy serious hearing",
        "char_start": 28488,
        "char_end": 28529,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp6i1",
        "text": "To what I shall unfold.",
        "char_start": 28530,
        "char_end": 28553,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp7i0",
        "text": "Speak; I am bound to hear.",
        "char_start": 28554,
        "char_end": 28580,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp8i0",
        "text": "So art thou to revenge, when thou shalt hear.",
        "char_start": 28581,
        "char_end": 28626,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp9i0",
        "text": "What?",
        "char_start": 28627,
        "char_end": 28632,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i0",
        "text": "I am thy father's spirit,",
        "char_start": 28633,
        "char_end": 28658,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i1",
        "text": "Doom'd for a certain term to walk the night,",
        "char_start": 28659,
        "char_end": 28703,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i2",
        "text": "And for the day confined to fast in fires,",
        "char_start": 28704,
        "char_end": 28746,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i3",
        "text": "Till the foul crimes done in my days of nature",
        "char_start": 28747,
        "char_end": 28793,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i4",
        "text": "Are burnt and purged away. But that I am forbid",
        "char_start": 28794,
        "char_end": 28841,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i5",
        "text": "To tell the secrets of my prison-house,",
        "char_start": 28842,
        "char_end": 28881,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i6",
        "text": "I could a tale unfold whose lightest word",
        "char_start": 28882,
        "char_end": 28923,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i7",
        "text": "Would harrow up thy soul, freeze thy young blood,",
        "char_start": 28924,
        "char_end": 28973,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i8",
        "text": "Make thy two eyes, like stars, start from their spheres,",
        "char_start": 28974,
        "char_end": 29030,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i9",
        "text": "Thy knotted and combined locks to part",
        "char_start": 29031,
        "char_end": 29069,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i10",
        "text": "And each particular hair to stand on end,",
        "char_start": 29070,
        "char_end": 29111,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i11",
        "text": "Like quills upon the fretful porpentine:",
        "char_start": 29112,
        "char_end": 29152,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i12",
        "text": "But this eternal blazon must not be",
        "char_start": 29153,
        "char_end": 29188,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i13",
        "text": "To ears of flesh and blood. List, list, O, list!",
        "char_start": 29189,
        "char_end": 29237,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp10i14",
        "text": "If thou didst ever thy dear father love--",
        "char_start": 29238,
        "char_end": 29279,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp11i0",
        "text": "O God!",
        "char_start": 29280,
        "char_end": 29286,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp12i0",
        "text": "Revenge his foul and most unnatural murder.",
        "char_start": 29287,
        "char_end": 29330,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp13i0",
        "text": "Murder!",
        "char_start": 29331,
        "char_end": 29338,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp14i0",
        "text": "Murder most foul, as in the best it is;",
        "char_start": 29339,
        "char_end": 29378,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp14i1",
        "text": "But this most foul, strange and unnatural.",
        "char_start": 29379,
        "char_end": 29421,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp15i0",
        "text": "Haste me to know't, that I, with wings as swift",
        "char_start": 29422,
        "char_end": 29469,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp15i1",
        "text": "As meditation or the thoughts of love,",
        "char_start": 29470,
        "char_end": 29508,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp15i2",
        "text": "May sweep to my revenge.",
        "char_start": 29509,
        "char_end": 29533,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i0",
        "text": "I find thee apt;",
        "char_start": 29534,
        "char_end": 29550,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i1",
        "text": "And duller shouldst thou be than the fat weed",
        "char_start": 29551,
        "char_end": 29596,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i2",
        "text": "That roots itself in ease on Lethe wharf,",
        "char_start": 29597,
        "char_end": 29638,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i3",
        "text": "Wouldst thou not stir in this. Now, Hamlet, hear:",
        "char_start": 29639,
        "char_end": 29688,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i4",
        "text": "'Tis given out that, sleeping in my orchard,",
        "char_start": 29689,
        "char_end": 29733,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i5",
        "text": "A serpent stung me; so the whole ear of Denmark",
        "char_start": 29734,
        "char_end": 29781,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i6",
        "text": "Is by a forged process of my death",
        "char_start": 29782,
        "char_end": 29816,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i7",
        "text": "Rankly abused: but know, thou noble youth,",
        "char_start": 29817,
        "char_end": 29859,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i8",
        "text": "The serpent that did sting thy father's life",
        "char_start": 29860,
        "char_end": 29904,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp16i9",
        "text": "Now wears his crown.",
        "char_start": 29905,
        "char_end": 29925,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp17i0",
        "text": "O my prophetic soul! My uncle!",
        "char_start": 29926,
        "char_end": 29956,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i0",
        "text": "Ay, that incestuous, that adulterate beast,",
        "char_start": 29957,
        "char_end": 30000,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i1",
        "text": "With witchcraft of his wit, with traitorous gifts,--",
        "char_start": 30001,
        "char_end": 30053,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i2",
        "text": "O wicked wit and gifts, that have the power",
        "char_start": 30054,
        "char_end": 30097,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i3",
        "text": "So to seduce!--won to his shameful lust",
        "char_start": 30098,
        "char_end": 30137,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i4",
        "text": "The will of my most seeming-virtuous queen:",
        "char_start": 30138,
        "char_end": 30181,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i5",
        "text": "O Hamlet, what a falling-off was there!",
        "char_start": 30182,
        "char_end": 30221,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i6",
        "text": "From me, whose love was of that dignity",
        "char_start": 30222,
        "char_end": 30261,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i7",
        "text": "That it went hand in hand even with the vow",
        "char_start": 30262,
        "char_end": 30305,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i8",
        "text": "I made to her in marriage, and to decline",
        "char_start": 30306,
        "char_end": 30347,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i9",
        "text": "Upon a wretch whose natural gifts were poor",
        "char_start": 30348,
        "char_end": 30391,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i10",
        "text": "To those of mine!",
        "char_start": 30392,
        "char_end": 30409,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i11",
        "text": "But virtue, as it never will be moved,",
        "char_start": 30410,
        "char_end": 30448,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i12",
        "text": "Though lewdness court it in a shape of heaven,",
        "char_start": 30449,
        "char_end": 30495,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i13",
        "text": "So lust, though to a radiant angel link'd,",
        "char_start": 30496,
        "char_end": 30538,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i14",
        "text": "Will sate itself in a celestial bed,",
        "char_start": 30539,
        "char_end": 30575,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i15",
        "text": "And prey on garbage.",
        "char_start": 30576,
        "char_end": 30596,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i16",
        "text": "But, soft! methinks I scent the morning air;",
        "char_start": 30597,
        "char_end": 30641,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i17",
        "text": "Brief let me be. Sleeping within my orchard,",
        "char_start": 30642,
        "char_end": 30686,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i18",
        "text": "My custom always of the afternoon,",
        "char_start": 30687,
        "char_end": 30721,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i19",
        "text": "Upon my secure hour thy uncle stole,",
        "char_start": 30722,
        "char_end": 30758,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i20",
        "text": "With juice of cursed hebenon in a vial,",
        "char_start": 30759,
        "char_end": 30798,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i21",
        "text": "And in the porches of my ears did pour",
        "char_start": 30799,
        "char_end": 30837,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i22",
        "text": "The leperous distilment; whose effect",
        "char_start": 30838,
        "char_end": 30875,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i23",
        "text": "Holds such an enmity with blood of man",
        "char_start": 30876,
        "char_end": 30914,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i24",
        "text": "That swift as quicksilver it courses through",
        "char_start": 30915,
        "char_end": 30959,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i25",
        "text": "The natural gates and alleys of the body,",
        "char_start": 30960,
        "char_end": 31001,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i26",
        "text": "And with a sudden vigour doth posset",
        "char_start": 31002,
        "char_end": 31038,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i27",
        "text": "And curd, like eager droppings into milk,",
        "char_start": 31039,
        "char_end": 31080,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i28",
        "text": "The thin and wholesome blood: so did it mine;",
        "char_start": 31081,
        "char_end": 31126,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i29",
        "text": "And a most instant tetter bark'd about,",
        "char_start": 31127,
        "char_end": 31166,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i30",
        "text": "Most lazar-like, with vile and loathsome crust,",
        "char_start": 31167,
        "char_end": 31214,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i31",
        "text": "All my smooth body.",
        "char_start": 31215,
        "char_end": 31234,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i32",
        "text": "Thus was I, sleeping, by a brother's hand",
        "char_start": 31235,
        "char_end": 31276,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i33",
        "text": "Of life, of crown, of queen, at once dispatch'd:",
        "char_start": 31277,
        "char_end": 31325,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i34",
        "text": "Cut off even in the blossoms of my sin,",
        "char_start": 31326,
        "char_end": 31365,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i35",
        "text": "Unhousel'd, disappointed, unanel'd,",
        "char_start": 31366,
        "char_end": 31401,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i36",
        "text": "No reckoning made, but sent to my account",
        "char_start": 31402,
        "char_end": 31443,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i37",
        "text": "With all my imperfections on my head:",
        "char_start": 31444,
        "char_end": 31481,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i38",
        "text": "O, horrible! O, horrible! most horrible!",
        "char_start": 31482,
        "char_end": 31522,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i39",
        "text": "If thou hast nature in thee, bear it not;",
        "char_start": 31523,
        "char_end": 31564,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i40",
        "text": "Let not the royal bed of Denmark be",
        "char_start": 31565,
        "char_end": 31600,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i41",
        "text": "A couch for luxury and damned incest.",
        "char_start": 31601,
        "char_end": 31638,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i42",
        "text": "But, howsoever thou pursuest this act,",
        "char_start": 31639,
        "char_end": 31677,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i43",
        "text": "Taint not thy mind, nor let thy soul contrive",
        "char_start": 31678,
        "char_end": 31723,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i44",
        "text": "Against thy mother aught: leave her to heaven",
        "char_start": 31724,
        "char_end": 31769,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i45",
        "text": "And to those thorns that in her bosom lodge,",
        "char_start": 31770,
        "char_end": 31814,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i46",
        "text": "To prick and sting her. Fare thee well at once!",
        "char_start": 31815,
        "char_end": 31862,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i47",
        "text": "The glow-worm shows the matin to be near,",
        "char_start": 31863,
        "char_end": 31904,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i48",
        "text": "And 'gins to pale his uneffectual fire:",
        "char_start": 31905,
        "char_end": 31944,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i49",
        "text": "Adieu, adieu! Hamlet, remember me.",
        "char_start": 31945,
        "char_end": 31979,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp18i50",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 31980,
        "char_end": 31984,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i0",
        "text": "O all you host of heaven! O earth! what else?",
        "char_start": 31985,
        "char_end": 32030,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i1",
        "text": "And shall I couple hell? O, fie! Hold, hold, my heart;",
        "char_start": 32031,
        "char_end": 32085,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i2",
        "text": "And you, my sinews, grow not instant old,",
        "char_start": 32086,
        "char_end": 32127,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i3",
        "text": "But bear me stiffly up. Remember thee!",
        "char_start": 32128,
        "char_end": 32166,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i4",
        "text": "Ay, thou poor ghost, while memory holds a seat",
        "char_start": 32167,
        "char_end": 32213,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i5",
        "text": "In this distracted globe. Remember thee!",
        "char_start": 32214,
        "char_end": 32254,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i6",
        "text": "Yea, from the table of my memory",
        "char_start": 32255,
        "char_end": 32287,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i7",
        "text": "I'll wipe away all trivial fond records,",
        "char_start": 32288,
        "char_end": 32328,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i8",
        "text": "All saws of books, all forms, all pressures past,",
        "char_start": 32329,
        "char_end": 32378,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i9",
        "text": "That youth and observation copied there;",
        "char_start": 32379,
        "char_end": 32419,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i10",
        "text": "And thy commandment all alone shall live",
        "char_start": 32420,
        "char_end": 32460,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i11",
        "text": "Within the book and volume of my brain,",
        "char_start": 32461,
        "char_end": 32500,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i12",
        "text": "Unmix'd with baser matter: yes, by heaven!",
        "char_start": 32501,
        "char_end": 32543,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i13",
        "text": "O most pernicious woman!",
        "char_start": 32544,
        "char_end": 32568,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i14",
        "text": "O villain, villain, smiling, damned villain!",
        "char_start": 32569,
        "char_end": 32613,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i15",
        "text": "My tables,--meet it is I set it down,",
        "char_start": 32614,
        "char_end": 32651,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i16",
        "text": "That one may smile, and smile, and be a villain;",
        "char_start": 32652,
        "char_end": 32700,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i17",
        "text": "At least I'm sure it may be so in Denmark:",
        "char_start": 32701,
        "char_end": 32743,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i18",
        "text": "Writing",
        "char_start": 32744,
        "char_end": 32751,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i19",
        "text": "So, uncle, there you are. Now to my word;",
        "char_start": 32752,
        "char_end": 32793,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i20",
        "text": "It is 'Adieu, adieu! remember me.'",
        "char_start": 32794,
        "char_end": 32828,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp19i21",
        "text": "I have sworn 't.",
        "char_start": 32829,
        "char_end": 32845,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp20i0",
        "text": "[Within] My lord, my lord,--",
        "char_start": 32846,
        "char_end": 32874,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp21i0",
        "text": "[Within] My lord, my lord,--",
        "char_start": 32875,
        "char_end": 32903,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp22i0",
        "text": "[Within] Lord Hamlet,--",
        "char_start": 32904,
        "char_end": 32927,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp23i0",
        "text": "[Within] Heaven secure him!",
        "char_start": 32928,
        "char_end": 32955,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp24i0",
        "text": "So be it!",
        "char_start": 32956,
        "char_end": 32965,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp25i0",
        "text": "[Within] Hillo, ho, ho, my lord!",
        "char_start": 32966,
        "char_end": 32998,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp26i0",
        "text": "Hillo, ho, ho, boy! come, bird, come.",
        "char_start": 32999,
        "char_end": 33036,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp26i1",
        "text": "Enter HORATIO and MARCELLUS",
        "char_start": 33037,
        "char_end": 33064,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp27i0",
        "text": "How is't, my noble lord?",
        "char_start": 33065,
        "char_end": 33089,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp28i0",
        "text": "What news, my lord?",
        "char_start": 33090,
        "char_end": 33109,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp29i0",
        "text": "O, wonderful!",
        "char_start": 33110,
        "char_end": 33123,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp30i0",
        "text": "Good my lord, tell it.",
        "char_start": 33124,
        "char_end": 33146,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp31i0",
        "text": "No; you'll reveal it.",
        "char_start": 33147,
        "char_end": 33168,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp32i0",
        "text": "Not I, my lord, by heaven.",
        "char_start": 33169,
        "char_end": 33195,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp33i0",
        "text": "Nor I, my lord.",
        "char_start": 33196,
        "char_end": 33211,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp34i0",
        "text": "How say you, then; would heart of man once think it?",
        "char_start": 33212,
        "char_end": 33264,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp34i1",
        "text": "But you'll be secret?",
        "char_start": 33265,
        "char_end": 33286,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp35i0",
        "text": "Ay, by heaven, my lord.",
        "char_start": 33287,
        "char_end": 33310,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp36i0",
        "text": "Ay, by heaven, my lord.",
        "char_start": 33311,
        "char_end": 33334,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp37i0",
        "text": "There's ne'er a villain dwelling in all Denmark",
        "char_start": 33335,
        "char_end": 33382,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp37i1",
        "text": "But he's an arrant knave.",
        "char_start": 33383,
        "char_end": 33408,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp38i0",
        "text": "There needs no ghost, my lord, come from the grave",
        "char_start": 33409,
        "char_end": 33459,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp38i1",
        "text": "To tell us this.",
        "char_start": 33460,
        "char_end": 33476,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp39i0",
        "text": "Why, right; you are i' the right;",
        "char_start": 33477,
        "char_end": 33510,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp39i1",
        "text": "And so, without more circumstance at all,",
        "char_start": 33511,
        "char_end": 33552,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp39i2",
        "text": "I hold it fit that we shake hands and part:",
        "char_start": 33553,
        "char_end": 33596,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp39i3",
        "text": "You, as your business and desire shall point you;",
        "char_start": 33597,
        "char_end": 33646,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp39i4",
        "text": "For every man has business and desire,",
        "char_start": 33647,
        "char_end": 33685,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp39i5",
        "text": "Such as it is; and for mine own poor part,",
        "char_start": 33686,
        "char_end": 33728,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp39i6",
        "text": "Look you, I'll go pray.",
        "char_start": 33729,
        "char_end": 33752,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp40i0",
        "text": "These are but wild and whirling words, my lord.",
        "char_start": 33753,
        "char_end": 33800,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp41i0",
        "text": "I'm sorry they offend you, heartily;",
        "char_start": 33801,
        "char_end": 33837,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp41i1",
        "text": "Yes, 'faith heartily.",
        "char_start": 33838,
        "char_end": 33859,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp42i0",
        "text": "There's no offence, my lord.",
        "char_start": 33860,
        "char_end": 33888,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp43i0",
        "text": "Yes, by Saint Patrick, but there is, Horatio,",
        "char_start": 33889,
        "char_end": 33934,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp43i1",
        "text": "And much offence too. Touching this vision here,",
        "char_start": 33935,
        "char_end": 33983,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp43i2",
        "text": "It is an honest ghost, that let me tell you:",
        "char_start": 33984,
        "char_end": 34028,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp43i3",
        "text": "For your desire to know what is between us,",
        "char_start": 34029,
        "char_end": 34072,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp43i4",
        "text": "O'ermaster 't as you may. And now, good friends,",
        "char_start": 34073,
        "char_end": 34121,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp43i5",
        "text": "As you are friends, scholars and soldiers,",
        "char_start": 34122,
        "char_end": 34164,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp43i6",
        "text": "Give me one poor request.",
        "char_start": 34165,
        "char_end": 34190,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp44i0",
        "text": "What is't, my lord? we will.",
        "char_start": 34191,
        "char_end": 34219,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp45i0",
        "text": "Never make known what you have seen to-night.",
        "char_start": 34220,
        "char_end": 34265,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp46i0",
        "text": "My lord, we will not.",
        "char_start": 34266,
        "char_end": 34287,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp47i0",
        "text": "My lord, we will not.",
        "char_start": 34288,
        "char_end": 34309,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp48i0",
        "text": "Nay, but swear't.",
        "char_start": 34310,
        "char_end": 34327,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp49i0",
        "text": "In faith,",
        "char_start": 34328,
        "char_end": 34337,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp49i1",
        "text": "My lord, not I.",
        "char_start": 34338,
        "char_end": 34353,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp50i0",
        "text": "Nor I, my lord, in faith.",
        "char_start": 34354,
        "char_end": 34379,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp51i0",
        "text": "Upon my sword.",
        "char_start": 34380,
        "char_end": 34394,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp52i0",
        "text": "We have sworn, my lord, already.",
        "char_start": 34395,
        "char_end": 34427,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "MARCELLUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp53i0",
        "text": "Indeed, upon my sword, indeed.",
        "char_start": 34428,
        "char_end": 34458,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp54i0",
        "text": "[Beneath] Swear.",
        "char_start": 34459,
        "char_end": 34475,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp55i0",
        "text": "Ah, ha, boy! say'st thou so? art thou there,",
        "char_start": 34476,
        "char_end": 34520,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp55i1",
        "text": "truepenny?",
        "char_start": 34521,
        "char_end": 34531,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp55i2",
        "text": "Come on--you hear this fellow in the cellarage--",
        "char_start": 34532,
        "char_end": 34580,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp55i3",
        "text": "Consent to swear.",
        "char_start": 34581,
        "char_end": 34598,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp56i0",
        "text": "Propose the oath, my lord.",
        "char_start": 34599,
        "char_end": 34625,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp57i0",
        "text": "Never to speak of this that you have seen,",
        "char_start": 34626,
        "char_end": 34668,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp57i1",
        "text": "Swear by my sword.",
        "char_start": 34669,
        "char_end": 34687,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp58i0",
        "text": "[Beneath] Swear.",
        "char_start": 34688,
        "char_end": 34704,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp59i0",
        "text": "Hic et ubique? then we'll shift our ground.",
        "char_start": 34705,
        "char_end": 34748,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp59i1",
        "text": "Come hither, gentlemen,",
        "char_start": 34749,
        "char_end": 34772,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp59i2",
        "text": "And lay your hands again upon my sword:",
        "char_start": 34773,
        "char_end": 34812,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp59i3",
        "text": "Never to speak of this that you have heard,",
        "char_start": 34813,
        "char_end": 34856,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp59i4",
        "text": "Swear by my sword.",
        "char_start": 34857,
        "char_end": 34875,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp60i0",
        "text": "[Beneath] Swear.",
        "char_start": 34876,
        "char_end": 34892,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp61i0",
        "text": "Well said, old mole! canst work i' the earth so fast?",
        "char_start": 34893,
        "char_end": 34946,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp61i1",
        "text": "A worthy pioner! Once more remove, good friends.",
        "char_start": 34947,
        "char_end": 34995,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp62i0",
        "text": "O day and night, but this is wondrous strange!",
        "char_start": 34996,
        "char_end": 35042,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i0",
        "text": "And therefore as a stranger give it welcome.",
        "char_start": 35043,
        "char_end": 35087,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i1",
        "text": "There are more things in heaven and earth, Horatio,",
        "char_start": 35088,
        "char_end": 35139,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i2",
        "text": "Than are dreamt of in your philosophy. But come;",
        "char_start": 35140,
        "char_end": 35188,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i3",
        "text": "Here, as before, never, so help you mercy,",
        "char_start": 35189,
        "char_end": 35231,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i4",
        "text": "How strange or odd soe'er I bear myself,",
        "char_start": 35232,
        "char_end": 35272,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i5",
        "text": "As I perchance hereafter shall think meet",
        "char_start": 35273,
        "char_end": 35314,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i6",
        "text": "To put an antic disposition on,",
        "char_start": 35315,
        "char_end": 35346,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i7",
        "text": "That you, at such times seeing me, never shall,",
        "char_start": 35347,
        "char_end": 35394,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i8",
        "text": "With arms encumber'd thus, or this headshake,",
        "char_start": 35395,
        "char_end": 35440,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i9",
        "text": "Or by pronouncing of some doubtful phrase,",
        "char_start": 35441,
        "char_end": 35483,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i10",
        "text": "As 'Well, well, we know,' or 'We could, an if we would,'",
        "char_start": 35484,
        "char_end": 35540,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i11",
        "text": "Or 'If we list to speak,' or 'There be, an if they might,'",
        "char_start": 35541,
        "char_end": 35599,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i12",
        "text": "Or such ambiguous giving out, to note",
        "char_start": 35600,
        "char_end": 35637,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i13",
        "text": "That you know aught of me: this not to do,",
        "char_start": 35638,
        "char_end": 35680,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp63i14",
        "text": "So grace and mercy at your most need help you, Swear.",
        "char_start": 35681,
        "char_end": 35734,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp64i0",
        "text": "[Beneath] Swear.",
        "char_start": 35735,
        "char_end": 35751,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i0",
        "text": "Rest, rest, perturbed spirit!",
        "char_start": 35752,
        "char_end": 35781,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i1",
        "text": "They swear",
        "char_start": 35782,
        "char_end": 35792,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i2",
        "text": "So, gentlemen,",
        "char_start": 35793,
        "char_end": 35807,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i3",
        "text": "With all my love I do commend me to you:",
        "char_start": 35808,
        "char_end": 35848,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i4",
        "text": "And what so poor a man as Hamlet is",
        "char_start": 35849,
        "char_end": 35884,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.203",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i5",
        "text": "May do, to express his love and friending to you,",
        "char_start": 35885,
        "char_end": 35934,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.204",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i6",
        "text": "God willing, shall not lack. Let us go in together;",
        "char_start": 35935,
        "char_end": 35986,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.205",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i7",
        "text": "And still your fingers on your lips, I pray.",
        "char_start": 35987,
        "char_end": 36031,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.206",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i8",
        "text": "The time is out of joint: O cursed spite,",
        "char_start": 36032,
        "char_end": 36073,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.207",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i9",
        "text": "That ever I was born to set it right!",
        "char_start": 36074,
        "char_end": 36111,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.208",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i10",
        "text": "Nay, come, let's go together.",
        "char_start": 36112,
        "char_end": 36141,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "1.5.209",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a1s5:sp65i11",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 36142,
        "char_end": 36148,
        "act": 1,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:open",
        "text": "Enter POLONIUS and REYNALDO",
        "char_start": 36149,
        "char_end": 36176,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp1i0",
        "text": "Give him this money and these notes, Reynaldo.",
        "char_start": 36177,
        "char_end": 36223,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp2i0",
        "text": "I will, my lord.",
        "char_start": 36224,
        "char_end": 36240,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp3i0",
        "text": "You shall do marvellous wisely, good Reynaldo,",
        "char_start": 36241,
        "char_end": 36287,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp3i1",
        "text": "Before you visit him, to make inquire",
        "char_start": 36288,
        "char_end": 36325,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp3i2",
        "text": "Of his behavior.",
        "char_start": 36326,
        "char_end": 36342,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp4i0",
        "text": "My lord, I did intend it.",
        "char_start": 36343,
        "char_end": 36368,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i0",
        "text": "Marry, well said; very well said. Look you, sir,",
        "char_start": 36369,
        "char_end": 36417,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i1",
        "text": "Inquire me first what Danskers are in Paris;",
        "char_start": 36418,
        "char_end": 36462,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i2",
        "text": "And how, and who, what means, and where they keep,",
        "char_start": 36463,
        "char_end": 36513,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i3",
        "text": "What company, at what expense; and finding",
        "char_start": 36514,
        "char_end": 36556,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i4",
        "text": "By this encompassment and drift of question",
        "char_start": 36557,
        "char_end": 36600,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i5",
        "text": "That they do know my son, come you more nearer",
        "char_start": 36601,
        "char_end": 36647,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i6",
        "text": "Than your particular demands will touch it:",
        "char_start": 36648,
        "char_end": 36691,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i7",
        "text": "Take you, as 'twere, some distant knowledge of him;",
        "char_start": 36692,
        "char_end": 36743,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i8",
        "text": "As thus, 'I know his father and his friends,",
        "char_start": 36744,
        "char_end": 36788,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp5i9",
        "text": "And in part him: ' do you mark this, Reynaldo?",
        "char_start": 36789,
        "char_end": 36835,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp6i0",
        "text": "Ay, very well, my lord.",
        "char_start": 36836,
        "char_end": 36859,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp7i0",
        "text": "'And in part him; but' you may say 'not well:",
        "char_start": 36860,
        "char_end": 36905,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp7i1",
        "text": "But, if't be he I mean, he's very wild;",
        "char_start": 36906,
        "char_end": 36945,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp7i2",
        "text": "Addicted so and so:' and there put on him",
        "char_start": 36946,
        "char_end": 36987,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp7i3",
        "text": "What forgeries you please; marry, none so rank",
        "char_start": 36988,
        "char_end": 37034,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp7i4",
        "text": "As may dishonour him; take heed of that;",
        "char_start": 37035,
        "char_end": 37075,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp7i5",
        "text": "But, sir, such wanton, wild and usual slips",
        "char_start": 37076,
        "char_end": 37119,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp7i6",
        "text": "As are companions noted and most known",
        "char_start": 37120,
        "char_end": 37158,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp7i7",
        "text": "To youth and liberty.",
        "char_start": 37159,
        "char_end": 37180,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp8i0",
        "text": "As gaming, my lord.",
        "char_start": 37181,
        "char_end": 37200,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp9i0",
        "text": "Ay, or drinking, fencing, swearing, quarrelling,",
        "char_start": 37201,
        "char_end": 37249,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp9i1",
        "text": "Drabbing: you may go so far.",
        "char_start": 37250,
        "char_end": 37278,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp10i0",
        "text": "My lord, that would dishonour him.",
        "char_start": 37279,
        "char_end": 37313,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp11i0",
        "text": "'Faith, no; as you may season it in the charge",
        "char_start": 37314,
        "char_end": 37360,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp11i1",
        "text": "You must not put another scandal on him,",
        "char_start": 37361,
        "char_end": 37401,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp11i2",
        "text": "That he is open to incontinency;",
        "char_start": 37402,
        "char_end": 37434,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp11i3",
        "text": "That's not my meaning: but breathe his faults so quaintly",
        "char_start": 37435,
        "char_end": 37492,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp11i4",
        "text": "That they may seem the taints of liberty,",
        "char_start": 37493,
        "char_end": 37534,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp11i5",
        "text": "The flash and outbreak of a fiery mind,",
        "char_start": 37535,
        "char_end": 37574,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp11i6",
        "text": "A savageness in unreclaimed blood,",
        "char_start": 37575,
        "char_end": 37609,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp11i7",
        "text": "Of general assault.",
        "char_start": 37610,
        "char_end": 37629,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp12i0",
        "text": "But, my good lord,--",
        "char_start": 37630,
        "char_end": 37650,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp13i0",
        "text": "Wherefore should you do this?",
        "char_start": 37651,
        "char_end": 37680,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp14i0",
        "text": "Ay, my lord,",
        "char_start": 37681,
        "char_end": 37693,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp14i1",
        "text": "I would know that.",
        "char_start": 37694,
        "char_end": 37712,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i0",
        "text": "Marry, sir, here's my drift;",
        "char_start": 37713,
        "char_end": 37741,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i1",
        "text": "And I believe, it is a fetch of wit:",
        "char_start": 37742,
        "char_end": 37778,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i2",
        "text": "You laying these slight sullies on my son,",
        "char_start": 37779,
        "char_end": 37821,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i3",
        "text": "As 'twere a thing a little soil'd i' the working, Mark you,",
        "char_start": 37822,
        "char_end": 37881,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i4",
        "text": "Your party in converse, him you would sound,",
        "char_start": 37882,
        "char_end": 37926,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i5",
        "text": "Having ever seen in the prenominate crimes",
        "char_start": 37927,
        "char_end": 37969,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i6",
        "text": "The youth you breathe of guilty, be assured",
        "char_start": 37970,
        "char_end": 38013,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i7",
        "text": "He closes with you in this consequence;",
        "char_start": 38014,
        "char_end": 38053,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i8",
        "text": "'Good sir,' or so, or 'friend,' or 'gentleman,'",
        "char_start": 38054,
        "char_end": 38101,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i9",
        "text": "According to the phrase or the addition",
        "char_start": 38102,
        "char_end": 38141,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp15i10",
        "text": "Of man and country.",
        "char_start": 38142,
        "char_end": 38161,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp16i0",
        "text": "Very good, my lord.",
        "char_start": 38162,
        "char_end": 38181,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp17i0",
        "text": "And then, sir, does he this--he does--what was I",
        "char_start": 38182,
        "char_end": 38230,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp17i1",
        "text": "about to say? By the mass, I was about to say",
        "char_start": 38231,
        "char_end": 38276,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp17i2",
        "text": "something: where did I leave?",
        "char_start": 38277,
        "char_end": 38306,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp18i0",
        "text": "At 'closes in the consequence,' at 'friend or so,'",
        "char_start": 38307,
        "char_end": 38357,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp18i1",
        "text": "and 'gentleman.'",
        "char_start": 38358,
        "char_end": 38374,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i0",
        "text": "At 'closes in the consequence,' ay, marry;",
        "char_start": 38375,
        "char_end": 38417,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i1",
        "text": "He closes thus: 'I know the gentleman;",
        "char_start": 38418,
        "char_end": 38456,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i2",
        "text": "I saw him yesterday, or t' other day,",
        "char_start": 38457,
        "char_end": 38494,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i3",
        "text": "Or then, or then; with such, or such; and, as you say,",
        "char_start": 38495,
        "char_end": 38549,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i4",
        "text": "There was a' gaming; there o'ertook in's rouse;",
        "char_start": 38550,
        "char_end": 38597,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i5",
        "text": "There falling out at tennis:' or perchance,",
        "char_start": 38598,
        "char_end": 38641,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i6",
        "text": "'I saw him enter such a house of sale,'",
        "char_start": 38642,
        "char_end": 38681,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i7",
        "text": "Videlicet, a brothel, or so forth.",
        "char_start": 38682,
        "char_end": 38716,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i8",
        "text": "See you now;",
        "char_start": 38717,
        "char_end": 38729,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i9",
        "text": "Your bait of falsehood takes this carp of truth:",
        "char_start": 38730,
        "char_end": 38778,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i10",
        "text": "And thus do we of wisdom and of reach,",
        "char_start": 38779,
        "char_end": 38817,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i11",
        "text": "With windlasses and with assays of bias,",
        "char_start": 38818,
        "char_end": 38858,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i12",
        "text": "By indirections find directions out:",
        "char_start": 38859,
        "char_end": 38895,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i13",
        "text": "So by my former lecture and advice,",
        "char_start": 38896,
        "char_end": 38931,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp19i14",
        "text": "Shall you my son. You have me, have you not?",
        "char_start": 38932,
        "char_end": 38976,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp20i0",
        "text": "My lord, I have.",
        "char_start": 38977,
        "char_end": 38993,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp21i0",
        "text": "God be wi' you; fare you well.",
        "char_start": 38994,
        "char_end": 39024,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp22i0",
        "text": "Good my lord!",
        "char_start": 39025,
        "char_end": 39038,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp23i0",
        "text": "Observe his inclination in yourself.",
        "char_start": 39039,
        "char_end": 39075,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp24i0",
        "text": "I shall, my lord.",
        "char_start": 39076,
        "char_end": 39093,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp25i0",
        "text": "And let him ply his music.",
        "char_start": 39094,
        "char_end": 39120,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp26i0",
        "text": "Well, my lord.",
        "char_start": 39121,
        "char_end": 39135,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "REYNALDO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp27i0",
        "text": "Farewell!",
        "char_start": 39136,
        "char_end": 39145,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp27i1",
        "text": "Exit REYNALDO",
        "char_start": 39146,
        "char_end": 39159,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp27i2",
        "text": "Enter OPHELIA",
        "char_start": 39160,
        "char_end": 39173,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp27i3",
        "text": "How now, Ophelia! what's the matter?",
        "char_start": 39174,
        "char_end": 39210,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp28i0",
        "text": "O, my lord, my lord, I have been so affrighted!",
        "char_start": 39211,
        "char_end": 39258,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp29i0",
        "text": "With what, i' the name of God?",
        "char_start": 39259,
        "char_end": 39289,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp30i0",
        "text": "My lord, as I was sewing in my closet,",
        "char_start": 39290,
        "char_end": 39328,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp30i1",
        "text": "Lord Hamlet, with his doublet all unbraced;",
        "char_start": 39329,
        "char_end": 39372,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp30i2",
        "text": "No hat upon his head; his stockings foul'd,",
        "char_start": 39373,
        "char_end": 39416,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp30i3",
        "text": "Ungarter'd, and down-gyved to his ancle;",
        "char_start": 39417,
        "char_end": 39457,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp30i4",
        "text": "Pale as his shirt; his knees knocking each other;",
        "char_start": 39458,
        "char_end": 39507,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp30i5",
        "text": "And with a look so piteous in purport",
        "char_start": 39508,
        "char_end": 39545,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp30i6",
        "text": "As if he had been loosed out of hell",
        "char_start": 39546,
        "char_end": 39582,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp30i7",
        "text": "To speak of horrors,--he comes before me.",
        "char_start": 39583,
        "char_end": 39624,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp31i0",
        "text": "Mad for thy love?",
        "char_start": 39625,
        "char_end": 39642,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp32i0",
        "text": "My lord, I do not know;",
        "char_start": 39643,
        "char_end": 39666,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp32i1",
        "text": "But truly, I do fear it.",
        "char_start": 39667,
        "char_end": 39691,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp33i0",
        "text": "What said he?",
        "char_start": 39692,
        "char_end": 39705,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i0",
        "text": "He took me by the wrist and held me hard;",
        "char_start": 39706,
        "char_end": 39747,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i1",
        "text": "Then goes he to the length of all his arm;",
        "char_start": 39748,
        "char_end": 39790,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i2",
        "text": "And, with his other hand thus o'er his brow,",
        "char_start": 39791,
        "char_end": 39835,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i3",
        "text": "He falls to such perusal of my face",
        "char_start": 39836,
        "char_end": 39871,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i4",
        "text": "As he would draw it. Long stay'd he so;",
        "char_start": 39872,
        "char_end": 39911,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i5",
        "text": "At last, a little shaking of mine arm",
        "char_start": 39912,
        "char_end": 39949,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i6",
        "text": "And thrice his head thus waving up and down,",
        "char_start": 39950,
        "char_end": 39994,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i7",
        "text": "He raised a sigh so piteous and profound",
        "char_start": 39995,
        "char_end": 40035,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i8",
        "text": "As it did seem to shatter all his bulk",
        "char_start": 40036,
        "char_end": 40074,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i9",
        "text": "And end his being: that done, he lets me go:",
        "char_start": 40075,
        "char_end": 40119,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i10",
        "text": "And, with his head over his shoulder turn'd,",
        "char_start": 40120,
        "char_end": 40164,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i11",
        "text": "He seem'd to find his way without his eyes;",
        "char_start": 40165,
        "char_end": 40208,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i12",
        "text": "For out o' doors he went without their helps,",
        "char_start": 40209,
        "char_end": 40254,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp34i13",
        "text": "And, to the last, bended their light on me.",
        "char_start": 40255,
        "char_end": 40298,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp35i0",
        "text": "Come, go with me: I will go seek the king.",
        "char_start": 40299,
        "char_end": 40341,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp35i1",
        "text": "This is the very ecstasy of love,",
        "char_start": 40342,
        "char_end": 40375,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp35i2",
        "text": "Whose violent property fordoes itself",
        "char_start": 40376,
        "char_end": 40413,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp35i3",
        "text": "And leads the will to desperate undertakings",
        "char_start": 40414,
        "char_end": 40458,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp35i4",
        "text": "As oft as any passion under heaven",
        "char_start": 40459,
        "char_end": 40493,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp35i5",
        "text": "That does afflict our natures. I am sorry.",
        "char_start": 40494,
        "char_end": 40536,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp35i6",
        "text": "What, have you given him any hard words of late?",
        "char_start": 40537,
        "char_end": 40585,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp36i0",
        "text": "No, my good lord, but, as you did command,",
        "char_start": 40586,
        "char_end": 40628,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp36i1",
        "text": "I did repel his fetters and denied",
        "char_start": 40629,
        "char_end": 40663,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp36i2",
        "text": "His access to me.",
        "char_start": 40664,
        "char_end": 40681,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i0",
        "text": "That hath made him mad.",
        "char_start": 40682,
        "char_end": 40705,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i1",
        "text": "I am sorry that with better heed and judgment",
        "char_start": 40706,
        "char_end": 40751,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i2",
        "text": "I had not quoted him: I fear'd he did but trifle,",
        "char_start": 40752,
        "char_end": 40801,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i3",
        "text": "And meant to wreck thee; but, beshrew my jealousy!",
        "char_start": 40802,
        "char_end": 40852,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i4",
        "text": "By heaven, it is as proper to our age",
        "char_start": 40853,
        "char_end": 40890,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i5",
        "text": "To cast beyond ourselves in our opinions",
        "char_start": 40891,
        "char_end": 40931,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i6",
        "text": "As it is common for the younger sort",
        "char_start": 40932,
        "char_end": 40968,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i7",
        "text": "To lack discretion. Come, go we to the king:",
        "char_start": 40969,
        "char_end": 41013,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i8",
        "text": "This must be known; which, being kept close, might",
        "char_start": 41014,
        "char_end": 41064,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i9",
        "text": "move",
        "char_start": 41065,
        "char_end": 41069,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i10",
        "text": "More grief to hide than hate to utter love.",
        "char_start": 41070,
        "char_end": 41113,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "2.1.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s1:sp37i11",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 41114,
        "char_end": 41120,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:open",
        "text": "Enter KING CLAUDIUS, QUEEN GERTRUDE, ROSENCRANTZ, GUILDENSTERN, and Attendants",
        "char_start": 41121,
        "char_end": 41199,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i0",
        "text": "Welcome, dear Rosencrantz and Guildenstern!",
        "char_start": 41200,
        "char_end": 41243,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i1",
        "text": "Moreover that we much did long to see you,",
        "char_start": 41244,
        "char_end": 41286,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i2",
        "text": "The need we have to use you did provoke",
        "char_start": 41287,
        "char_end": 41326,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i3",
        "text": "Our hasty sending. Something have you heard",
        "char_start": 41327,
        "char_end": 41370,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i4",
        "text": "Of Hamlet's transformation; so call it,",
        "char_start": 41371,
        "char_end": 41410,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i5",
        "text": "Sith nor the exterior nor the inward man",
        "char_start": 41411,
        "char_end": 41451,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i6",
        "text": "Resembles that it was. What it should be,",
        "char_start": 41452,
        "char_end": 41493,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i7",
        "text": "More than his father's death, that thus hath put him",
        "char_start": 41494,
        "char_end": 41546,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i8",
        "text": "So much from the understanding of himself,",
        "char_start": 41547,
        "char_end": 41589,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i9",
        "text": "I cannot dream of: I entreat you both,",
        "char_start": 41590,
        "char_end": 41628,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i10",
        "text": "That, being of so young days brought up with him,",
        "char_start": 41629,
        "char_end": 41678,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i11",
        "text": "And sith so neighbour'd to his youth and havior,",
        "char_start": 41679,
        "char_end": 41727,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i12",
        "text": "That you vouchsafe your rest here in our court",
        "char_start": 41728,
        "char_end": 41774,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i13",
        "text": "Some little time: so by your companies",
        "char_start": 41775,
        "char_end": 41813,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i14",
        "text": "To draw him on to pleasures, and to gather,",
        "char_start": 41814,
        "char_end": 41857,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i15",
        "text": "So much as from occasion you may glean,",
        "char_start": 41858,
        "char_end": 41897,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i16",
        "text": "Whether aught, to us unknown, afflicts him thus,",
        "char_start": 41898,
        "char_end": 41946,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp1i17",
        "text": "That, open'd, lies within our remedy.",
        "char_start": 41947,
        "char_end": 41984,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp2i0",
        "text": "Good gentlemen, he hath much talk'd of you;",
        "char_start": 41985,
        "char_end": 42028,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp2i1",
        "text": "And sure I am two men there are not living",
        "char_start": 42029,
        "char_end": 42071,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp2i2",
        "text": "To whom he more adheres. If it will please you",
        "char_start": 42072,
        "char_end": 42118,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp2i3",
        "text": "To show us so much gentry and good will",
        "char_start": 42119,
        "char_end": 42158,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp2i4",
        "text": "As to expend your time with us awhile,",
        "char_start": 42159,
        "char_end": 42197,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp2i5",
        "text": "For the supply and profit of our hope,",
        "char_start": 42198,
        "char_end": 42236,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp2i6",
        "text": "Your visitation shall receive such thanks",
        "char_start": 42237,
        "char_end": 42278,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp2i7",
        "text": "As fits a king's remembrance.",
        "char_start": 42279,
        "char_end": 42308,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp3i0",
        "text": "Both your majesties",
        "char_start": 42309,
        "char_end": 42328,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp3i1",
        "text": "Might, by the sovereign power you have of us,",
        "char_start": 42329,
        "char_end": 42374,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp3i2",
        "text": "Put your dread pleasures more into command",
        "char_start": 42375,
        "char_end": 42417,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp3i3",
        "text": "Than to entreaty.",
        "char_start": 42418,
        "char_end": 42435,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp4i0",
        "text": "But we both obey,",
        "char_start": 42436,
        "char_end": 42453,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp4i1",
        "text": "And here give up ourselves, in the full bent",
        "char_start": 42454,
        "char_end": 42498,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp4i2",
        "text": "To lay our service freely at your feet,",
        "char_start": 42499,
        "char_end": 42538,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp4i3",
        "text": "To be commanded.",
        "char_start": 42539,
        "char_end": 42555,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp5i0",
        "text": "Thanks, Rosencrantz and gentle Guildenstern.",
        "char_start": 42556,
        "char_end": 42600,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp6i0",
        "text": "Thanks, Guildenstern and gentle Rosencrantz:",
        "char_start": 42601,
        "char_end": 42645,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp6i1",
        "text": "And I beseech you instantly to visit",
        "char_start": 42646,
        "char_end": 42682,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp6i2",
        "text": "My too much changed son. Go, some of you,",
        "char_start": 42683,
        "char_end": 42724,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp6i3",
        "text": "And bring these gentlemen where Hamlet is.",
        "char_start": 42725,
        "char_end": 42767,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp7i0",
        "text": "Heavens make our presence and our practises",
        "char_start": 42768,
        "char_end": 42811,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp7i1",
        "text": "Pleasant and helpful to him!",
        "char_start": 42812,
        "char_end": 42840,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp8i0",
        "text": "Ay, amen!",
        "char_start": 42841,
        "char_end": 42850,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp8i1",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ, GUILDENSTERN, and some Attendants",
        "char_start": 42851,
        "char_end": 42904,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp8i2",
        "text": "Enter POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 42905,
        "char_end": 42919,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp9i0",
        "text": "The ambassadors from Norway, my good lord,",
        "char_start": 42920,
        "char_end": 42962,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp9i1",
        "text": "Are joyfully return'd.",
        "char_start": 42963,
        "char_end": 42985,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp10i0",
        "text": "Thou still hast been the father of good news.",
        "char_start": 42986,
        "char_end": 43031,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp11i0",
        "text": "Have I, my lord? I assure my good liege,",
        "char_start": 43032,
        "char_end": 43072,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp11i1",
        "text": "I hold my duty, as I hold my soul,",
        "char_start": 43073,
        "char_end": 43107,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp11i2",
        "text": "Both to my God and to my gracious king:",
        "char_start": 43108,
        "char_end": 43147,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp11i3",
        "text": "And I do think, or else this brain of mine",
        "char_start": 43148,
        "char_end": 43190,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp11i4",
        "text": "Hunts not the trail of policy so sure",
        "char_start": 43191,
        "char_end": 43228,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp11i5",
        "text": "As it hath used to do, that I have found",
        "char_start": 43229,
        "char_end": 43269,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp11i6",
        "text": "The very cause of Hamlet's lunacy.",
        "char_start": 43270,
        "char_end": 43304,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp12i0",
        "text": "O, speak of that; that do I long to hear.",
        "char_start": 43305,
        "char_end": 43346,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp13i0",
        "text": "Give first admittance to the ambassadors;",
        "char_start": 43347,
        "char_end": 43388,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp13i1",
        "text": "My news shall be the fruit to that great feast.",
        "char_start": 43389,
        "char_end": 43436,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp14i0",
        "text": "Thyself do grace to them, and bring them in.",
        "char_start": 43437,
        "char_end": 43481,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp14i1",
        "text": "Exit POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 43482,
        "char_end": 43495,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp14i2",
        "text": "He tells me, my dear Gertrude, he hath found",
        "char_start": 43496,
        "char_end": 43540,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp14i3",
        "text": "The head and source of all your son's distemper.",
        "char_start": 43541,
        "char_end": 43589,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp15i0",
        "text": "I doubt it is no other but the main;",
        "char_start": 43590,
        "char_end": 43626,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp15i1",
        "text": "His father's death, and our o'erhasty marriage.",
        "char_start": 43627,
        "char_end": 43674,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp16i0",
        "text": "Well, we shall sift him.",
        "char_start": 43675,
        "char_end": 43699,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp16i1",
        "text": "Re-enter POLONIUS, with VOLTIMAND and CORNELIUS",
        "char_start": 43700,
        "char_end": 43747,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp16i2",
        "text": "Welcome, my good friends!",
        "char_start": 43748,
        "char_end": 43773,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp16i3",
        "text": "Say, Voltimand, what from our brother Norway?",
        "char_start": 43774,
        "char_end": 43819,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i0",
        "text": "Most fair return of greetings and desires.",
        "char_start": 43820,
        "char_end": 43862,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i1",
        "text": "Upon our first, he sent out to suppress",
        "char_start": 43863,
        "char_end": 43902,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i2",
        "text": "His nephew's levies; which to him appear'd",
        "char_start": 43903,
        "char_end": 43945,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i3",
        "text": "To be a preparation 'gainst the Polack;",
        "char_start": 43946,
        "char_end": 43985,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i4",
        "text": "But, better look'd into, he truly found",
        "char_start": 43986,
        "char_end": 44025,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i5",
        "text": "It was against your highness: whereat grieved,",
        "char_start": 44026,
        "char_end": 44072,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i6",
        "text": "That so his sickness, age and impotence",
        "char_start": 44073,
        "char_end": 44112,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i7",
        "text": "Was falsely borne in hand, sends out arrests",
        "char_start": 44113,
        "char_end": 44157,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i8",
        "text": "On Fortinbras; which he, in brief, obeys;",
        "char_start": 44158,
        "char_end": 44199,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i9",
        "text": "Receives rebuke from Norway, and in fine",
        "char_start": 44200,
        "char_end": 44240,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i10",
        "text": "Makes vow before his uncle never more",
        "char_start": 44241,
        "char_end": 44278,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i11",
        "text": "To give the assay of arms against your majesty.",
        "char_start": 44279,
        "char_end": 44326,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i12",
        "text": "Whereon old Norway, overcome with joy,",
        "char_start": 44327,
        "char_end": 44365,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i13",
        "text": "Gives him three thousand crowns in annual fee,",
        "char_start": 44366,
        "char_end": 44412,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i14",
        "text": "And his commission to employ those soldiers,",
        "char_start": 44413,
        "char_end": 44457,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i15",
        "text": "So levied as before, against the Polack:",
        "char_start": 44458,
        "char_end": 44498,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i16",
        "text": "With an entreaty, herein further shown,",
        "char_start": 44499,
        "char_end": 44538,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i17",
        "text": "Giving a paper",
        "char_start": 44539,
        "char_end": 44553,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i18",
        "text": "That it might please you to give quiet pass",
        "char_start": 44554,
        "char_end": 44597,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i19",
        "text": "Through your dominions for this enterprise,",
        "char_start": 44598,
        "char_end": 44641,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i20",
        "text": "On such regards of safety and allowance",
        "char_start": 44642,
        "char_end": 44681,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp17i21",
        "text": "As therein are set down.",
        "char_start": 44682,
        "char_end": 44706,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "VOLTIMAND"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp18i0",
        "text": "It likes us well;",
        "char_start": 44707,
        "char_end": 44724,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp18i1",
        "text": "And at our more consider'd time well read,",
        "char_start": 44725,
        "char_end": 44767,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp18i2",
        "text": "Answer, and think upon this business.",
        "char_start": 44768,
        "char_end": 44805,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp18i3",
        "text": "Meantime we thank you for your well-took labour:",
        "char_start": 44806,
        "char_end": 44854,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp18i4",
        "text": "Go to your rest; at night we'll feast together:",
        "char_start": 44855,
        "char_end": 44902,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp18i5",
        "text": "Most welcome home!",
        "char_start": 44903,
        "char_end": 44921,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp18i6",
        "text": "Exeunt VOLTIMAND and CORNELIUS",
        "char_start": 44922,
        "char_end": 44952,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i0",
        "text": "This business is well ended.",
        "char_start": 44953,
        "char_end": 44981,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i1",
        "text": "My liege, and madam, to expostulate",
        "char_start": 44982,
        "char_end": 45017,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i2",
        "text": "What majesty should be, what duty is,",
        "char_start": 45018,
        "char_end": 45055,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i3",
        "text": "Why day is day, night night, and time is time,",
        "char_start": 45056,
        "char_end": 45102,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i4",
        "text": "Were nothing but to waste night, day and time.",
        "char_start": 45103,
        "char_end": 45149,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i5",
        "text": "Therefore, since brevity is the soul of wit,",
        "char_start": 45150,
        "char_end": 45194,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i6",
        "text": "And tediousness the limbs and outward flourishes,",
        "char_start": 45195,
        "char_end": 45244,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i7",
        "text": "I will be brief: your noble son is mad:",
        "char_start": 45245,
        "char_end": 45284,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i8",
        "text": "Mad call I it; for, to define true madness,",
        "char_start": 45285,
        "char_end": 45328,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i9",
        "text": "What is't but to be nothing else but mad?",
        "char_start": 45329,
        "char_end": 45370,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp19i10",
        "text": "But let that go.",
        "char_start": 45371,
        "char_end": 45387,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp20i0",
        "text": "More matter, with less art.",
        "char_start": 45388,
        "char_end": 45415,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i0",
        "text": "Madam, I swear I use no art at all.",
        "char_start": 45416,
        "char_end": 45451,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i1",
        "text": "That he is mad, 'tis true: 'tis true 'tis pity;",
        "char_start": 45452,
        "char_end": 45499,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i2",
        "text": "And pity 'tis 'tis true: a foolish figure;",
        "char_start": 45500,
        "char_end": 45542,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i3",
        "text": "But farewell it, for I will use no art.",
        "char_start": 45543,
        "char_end": 45582,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i4",
        "text": "Mad let us grant him, then: and now remains",
        "char_start": 45583,
        "char_end": 45626,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i5",
        "text": "That we find out the cause of this effect,",
        "char_start": 45627,
        "char_end": 45669,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i6",
        "text": "Or rather say, the cause of this defect,",
        "char_start": 45670,
        "char_end": 45710,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i7",
        "text": "For this effect defective comes by cause:",
        "char_start": 45711,
        "char_end": 45752,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i8",
        "text": "Thus it remains, and the remainder thus. Perpend.",
        "char_start": 45753,
        "char_end": 45802,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i9",
        "text": "I have a daughter--have while she is mine--",
        "char_start": 45803,
        "char_end": 45846,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i10",
        "text": "Who, in her duty and obedience, mark,",
        "char_start": 45847,
        "char_end": 45884,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i11",
        "text": "Hath given me this: now gather, and surmise.",
        "char_start": 45885,
        "char_end": 45929,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i12",
        "text": "Reads",
        "char_start": 45930,
        "char_end": 45935,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i13",
        "text": "'To the celestial and my soul's idol, the most",
        "char_start": 45936,
        "char_end": 45982,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i14",
        "text": "beautified Ophelia,'--",
        "char_start": 45983,
        "char_end": 46005,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i15",
        "text": "That's an ill phrase, a vile phrase; 'beautified' is",
        "char_start": 46006,
        "char_end": 46058,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i16",
        "text": "a vile phrase: but you shall hear. Thus:",
        "char_start": 46059,
        "char_end": 46099,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i17",
        "text": "Reads",
        "char_start": 46100,
        "char_end": 46105,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp21i18",
        "text": "'In her excellent white bosom, these, & c.'",
        "char_start": 46106,
        "char_end": 46149,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp22i0",
        "text": "Came this from Hamlet to her?",
        "char_start": 46150,
        "char_end": 46179,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i0",
        "text": "Good madam, stay awhile; I will be faithful.",
        "char_start": 46180,
        "char_end": 46224,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i1",
        "text": "Reads",
        "char_start": 46225,
        "char_end": 46230,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i2",
        "text": "'Doubt thou the stars are fire;",
        "char_start": 46231,
        "char_end": 46262,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i3",
        "text": "Doubt that the sun doth move;",
        "char_start": 46263,
        "char_end": 46292,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i4",
        "text": "Doubt truth to be a liar;",
        "char_start": 46293,
        "char_end": 46318,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i5",
        "text": "But never doubt I love.",
        "char_start": 46319,
        "char_end": 46342,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i6",
        "text": "'O dear Ophelia, I am ill at these numbers;",
        "char_start": 46343,
        "char_end": 46386,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i7",
        "text": "I have not art to reckon my groans: but that",
        "char_start": 46387,
        "char_end": 46431,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i8",
        "text": "I love thee best, O most best, believe it. Adieu.",
        "char_start": 46432,
        "char_end": 46481,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i9",
        "text": "'Thine evermore most dear lady, whilst",
        "char_start": 46482,
        "char_end": 46520,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i10",
        "text": "this machine is to him, HAMLET.'",
        "char_start": 46521,
        "char_end": 46553,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i11",
        "text": "This, in obedience, hath my daughter shown me,",
        "char_start": 46554,
        "char_end": 46600,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i12",
        "text": "And more above, hath his solicitings,",
        "char_start": 46601,
        "char_end": 46638,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i13",
        "text": "As they fell out by time, by means and place,",
        "char_start": 46639,
        "char_end": 46684,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp23i14",
        "text": "All given to mine ear.",
        "char_start": 46685,
        "char_end": 46707,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp24i0",
        "text": "But how hath she",
        "char_start": 46708,
        "char_end": 46724,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp24i1",
        "text": "Received his love?",
        "char_start": 46725,
        "char_end": 46743,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp25i0",
        "text": "What do you think of me?",
        "char_start": 46744,
        "char_end": 46768,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp26i0",
        "text": "As of a man faithful and honourable.",
        "char_start": 46769,
        "char_end": 46805,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i0",
        "text": "I would fain prove so. But what might you think,",
        "char_start": 46806,
        "char_end": 46854,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i1",
        "text": "When I had seen this hot love on the wing--",
        "char_start": 46855,
        "char_end": 46898,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i2",
        "text": "As I perceived it, I must tell you that,",
        "char_start": 46899,
        "char_end": 46939,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i3",
        "text": "Before my daughter told me--what might you,",
        "char_start": 46940,
        "char_end": 46983,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i4",
        "text": "Or my dear majesty your queen here, think,",
        "char_start": 46984,
        "char_end": 47026,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i5",
        "text": "If I had play'd the desk or table-book,",
        "char_start": 47027,
        "char_end": 47066,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i6",
        "text": "Or given my heart a winking, mute and dumb,",
        "char_start": 47067,
        "char_end": 47110,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i7",
        "text": "Or look'd upon this love with idle sight;",
        "char_start": 47111,
        "char_end": 47152,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i8",
        "text": "What might you think? No, I went round to work,",
        "char_start": 47153,
        "char_end": 47200,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i9",
        "text": "And my young mistress thus I did bespeak:",
        "char_start": 47201,
        "char_end": 47242,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i10",
        "text": "'Lord Hamlet is a prince, out of thy star;",
        "char_start": 47243,
        "char_end": 47285,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i11",
        "text": "This must not be:' and then I precepts gave her,",
        "char_start": 47286,
        "char_end": 47334,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i12",
        "text": "That she should lock herself from his resort,",
        "char_start": 47335,
        "char_end": 47380,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i13",
        "text": "Admit no messengers, receive no tokens.",
        "char_start": 47381,
        "char_end": 47420,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i14",
        "text": "Which done, she took the fruits of my advice;",
        "char_start": 47421,
        "char_end": 47466,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i15",
        "text": "And he, repulsed--a short tale to make--",
        "char_start": 47467,
        "char_end": 47507,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i16",
        "text": "Fell into a sadness, then into a fast,",
        "char_start": 47508,
        "char_end": 47546,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i17",
        "text": "Thence to a watch, thence into a weakness,",
        "char_start": 47547,
        "char_end": 47589,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i18",
        "text": "Thence to a lightness, and, by this declension,",
        "char_start": 47590,
        "char_end": 47637,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i19",
        "text": "Into the madness wherein now he raves,",
        "char_start": 47638,
        "char_end": 47676,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp27i20",
        "text": "And all we mourn for.",
        "char_start": 47677,
        "char_end": 47698,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp28i0",
        "text": "Do you think 'tis this?",
        "char_start": 47699,
        "char_end": 47722,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp29i0",
        "text": "It may be, very likely.",
        "char_start": 47723,
        "char_end": 47746,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp30i0",
        "text": "Hath there been such a time--I'd fain know that--",
        "char_start": 47747,
        "char_end": 47796,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp30i1",
        "text": "That I have positively said 'Tis so,'",
        "char_start": 47797,
        "char_end": 47834,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp30i2",
        "text": "When it proved otherwise?",
        "char_start": 47835,
        "char_end": 47860,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp31i0",
        "text": "Not that I know.",
        "char_start": 47861,
        "char_end": 47877,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp32i0",
        "text": "[Pointing to his head and shoulder]",
        "char_start": 47878,
        "char_end": 47913,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp32i1",
        "text": "Take this from this, if this be otherwise:",
        "char_start": 47914,
        "char_end": 47956,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp32i2",
        "text": "If circumstances lead me, I will find",
        "char_start": 47957,
        "char_end": 47994,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp32i3",
        "text": "Where truth is hid, though it were hid indeed",
        "char_start": 47995,
        "char_end": 48040,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp32i4",
        "text": "Within the centre.",
        "char_start": 48041,
        "char_end": 48059,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp33i0",
        "text": "How may we try it further?",
        "char_start": 48060,
        "char_end": 48086,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp34i0",
        "text": "You know, sometimes he walks four hours together",
        "char_start": 48087,
        "char_end": 48135,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp34i1",
        "text": "Here in the lobby.",
        "char_start": 48136,
        "char_end": 48154,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp35i0",
        "text": "So he does indeed.",
        "char_start": 48155,
        "char_end": 48173,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp36i0",
        "text": "At such a time I'll loose my daughter to him:",
        "char_start": 48174,
        "char_end": 48219,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp36i1",
        "text": "Be you and I behind an arras then;",
        "char_start": 48220,
        "char_end": 48254,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp36i2",
        "text": "Mark the encounter: if he love her not",
        "char_start": 48255,
        "char_end": 48293,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp36i3",
        "text": "And be not from his reason fall'n thereon,",
        "char_start": 48294,
        "char_end": 48336,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp36i4",
        "text": "Let me be no assistant for a state,",
        "char_start": 48337,
        "char_end": 48372,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp36i5",
        "text": "But keep a farm and carters.",
        "char_start": 48373,
        "char_end": 48401,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp37i0",
        "text": "We will try it.",
        "char_start": 48402,
        "char_end": 48417,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp38i0",
        "text": "But, look, where sadly the poor wretch comes reading.",
        "char_start": 48418,
        "char_end": 48471,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp39i0",
        "text": "Away, I do beseech you, both away:",
        "char_start": 48472,
        "char_end": 48506,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp39i1",
        "text": "I'll board him presently.",
        "char_start": 48507,
        "char_end": 48532,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp39i2",
        "text": "Exeunt KING CLAUDIUS, QUEEN GERTRUDE, and Attendants",
        "char_start": 48533,
        "char_end": 48585,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp39i3",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET, reading",
        "char_start": 48586,
        "char_end": 48607,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp39i4",
        "text": "O, give me leave:",
        "char_start": 48608,
        "char_end": 48625,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp39i5",
        "text": "How does my good Lord Hamlet?",
        "char_start": 48626,
        "char_end": 48655,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp40i0",
        "text": "Well, God-a-mercy.",
        "char_start": 48656,
        "char_end": 48674,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp41i0",
        "text": "Do you know me, my lord?",
        "char_start": 48675,
        "char_end": 48699,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp42i0",
        "text": "Excellent well; you are a fishmonger.",
        "char_start": 48700,
        "char_end": 48737,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp43i0",
        "text": "Not I, my lord.",
        "char_start": 48738,
        "char_end": 48753,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp44i0",
        "text": "Then I would you were so honest a man.",
        "char_start": 48754,
        "char_end": 48792,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp45i0",
        "text": "Honest, my lord!",
        "char_start": 48793,
        "char_end": 48809,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp46i0",
        "text": "Ay, sir; to be honest, as this world goes, is to be",
        "char_start": 48810,
        "char_end": 48861,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp46i1",
        "text": "one man picked out of ten thousand.",
        "char_start": 48862,
        "char_end": 48897,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp47i0",
        "text": "That's very true, my lord.",
        "char_start": 48898,
        "char_end": 48924,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp48i0",
        "text": "For if the sun breed maggots in a dead dog, being a",
        "char_start": 48925,
        "char_end": 48976,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp48i1",
        "text": "god kissing carrion,--Have you a daughter?",
        "char_start": 48977,
        "char_end": 49019,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp49i0",
        "text": "I have, my lord.",
        "char_start": 49020,
        "char_end": 49036,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp50i0",
        "text": "Let her not walk i' the sun: conception is a",
        "char_start": 49037,
        "char_end": 49081,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp50i1",
        "text": "blessing: but not as your daughter may conceive.",
        "char_start": 49082,
        "char_end": 49130,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp50i2",
        "text": "Friend, look to 't.",
        "char_start": 49131,
        "char_end": 49150,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp51i0",
        "text": "[Aside] How say you by that? Still harping on my",
        "char_start": 49151,
        "char_end": 49199,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp51i1",
        "text": "daughter: yet he knew me not at first; he said I",
        "char_start": 49200,
        "char_end": 49248,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.203",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp51i2",
        "text": "was a fishmonger: he is far gone, far gone: and",
        "char_start": 49249,
        "char_end": 49296,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.204",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp51i3",
        "text": "truly in my youth I suffered much extremity for",
        "char_start": 49297,
        "char_end": 49344,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.205",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp51i4",
        "text": "love; very near this. I'll speak to him again.",
        "char_start": 49345,
        "char_end": 49391,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.206",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp51i5",
        "text": "What do you read, my lord?",
        "char_start": 49392,
        "char_end": 49418,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.207",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp52i0",
        "text": "Words, words, words.",
        "char_start": 49419,
        "char_end": 49439,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.208",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp53i0",
        "text": "What is the matter, my lord?",
        "char_start": 49440,
        "char_end": 49468,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.209",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp54i0",
        "text": "Between who?",
        "char_start": 49469,
        "char_end": 49481,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.210",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp55i0",
        "text": "I mean, the matter that you read, my lord.",
        "char_start": 49482,
        "char_end": 49524,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.211",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp56i0",
        "text": "Slanders, sir: for the satirical rogue says here",
        "char_start": 49525,
        "char_end": 49573,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.212",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp56i1",
        "text": "that old men have grey beards, that their faces are",
        "char_start": 49574,
        "char_end": 49625,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.213",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp56i2",
        "text": "wrinkled, their eyes purging thick amber and",
        "char_start": 49626,
        "char_end": 49670,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.214",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp56i3",
        "text": "plum-tree gum and that they have a plentiful lack of",
        "char_start": 49671,
        "char_end": 49723,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.215",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp56i4",
        "text": "wit, together with most weak hams: all which, sir,",
        "char_start": 49724,
        "char_end": 49774,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.216",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp56i5",
        "text": "though I most powerfully and potently believe, yet",
        "char_start": 49775,
        "char_end": 49825,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.217",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp56i6",
        "text": "I hold it not honesty to have it thus set down, for",
        "char_start": 49826,
        "char_end": 49877,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.218",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp56i7",
        "text": "yourself, sir, should be old as I am, if like a crab",
        "char_start": 49878,
        "char_end": 49930,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.219",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp56i8",
        "text": "you could go backward.",
        "char_start": 49931,
        "char_end": 49953,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.220",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp57i0",
        "text": "[Aside] Though this be madness, yet there is method",
        "char_start": 49954,
        "char_end": 50005,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.221",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp57i1",
        "text": "in 't. Will you walk out of the air, my lord?",
        "char_start": 50006,
        "char_end": 50051,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.222",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp58i0",
        "text": "Into my grave.",
        "char_start": 50052,
        "char_end": 50066,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.223",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp59i0",
        "text": "Indeed, that is out o' the air.",
        "char_start": 50067,
        "char_end": 50098,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.224",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp59i1",
        "text": "Aside",
        "char_start": 50099,
        "char_end": 50104,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp59i2",
        "text": "How pregnant sometimes his replies are! a happiness",
        "char_start": 50105,
        "char_end": 50156,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.225",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp59i3",
        "text": "that often madness hits on, which reason and sanity",
        "char_start": 50157,
        "char_end": 50208,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.226",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp59i4",
        "text": "could not so prosperously be delivered of. I will",
        "char_start": 50209,
        "char_end": 50258,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.227",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp59i5",
        "text": "leave him, and suddenly contrive the means of",
        "char_start": 50259,
        "char_end": 50304,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.228",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp59i6",
        "text": "meeting between him and my daughter.--My honourable",
        "char_start": 50305,
        "char_end": 50356,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.229",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp59i7",
        "text": "lord, I will most humbly take my leave of you.",
        "char_start": 50357,
        "char_end": 50403,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.230",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp60i0",
        "text": "You cannot, sir, take from me any thing that I will",
        "char_start": 50404,
        "char_end": 50455,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.231",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp60i1",
        "text": "more willingly part withal: except my life, except",
        "char_start": 50456,
        "char_end": 50506,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.232",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp60i2",
        "text": "my life, except my life.",
        "char_start": 50507,
        "char_end": 50531,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.233",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp61i0",
        "text": "Fare you well, my lord.",
        "char_start": 50532,
        "char_end": 50555,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.234",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp62i0",
        "text": "These tedious old fools!",
        "char_start": 50556,
        "char_end": 50580,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.235",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp62i1",
        "text": "Enter ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 50581,
        "char_end": 50615,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp63i0",
        "text": "You go to seek the Lord Hamlet; there he is.",
        "char_start": 50616,
        "char_end": 50660,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.236",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp64i0",
        "text": "[To POLONIUS] God save you, sir!",
        "char_start": 50661,
        "char_end": 50693,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.237",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp64i1",
        "text": "Exit POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 50694,
        "char_end": 50707,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp65i0",
        "text": "My honoured lord!",
        "char_start": 50708,
        "char_end": 50725,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.238",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp66i0",
        "text": "My most dear lord!",
        "char_start": 50726,
        "char_end": 50744,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.239",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp67i0",
        "text": "My excellent good friends! How dost thou,",
        "char_start": 50745,
        "char_end": 50786,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.240",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp67i1",
        "text": "Guildenstern? Ah, Rosencrantz! Good lads, how do ye both?",
        "char_start": 50787,
        "char_end": 50844,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.241",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp68i0",
        "text": "As the indifferent children of the earth.",
        "char_start": 50845,
        "char_end": 50886,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.242",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp69i0",
        "text": "Happy, in that we are not over-happy;",
        "char_start": 50887,
        "char_end": 50924,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.243",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp69i1",
        "text": "On fortune's cap we are not the very button.",
        "char_start": 50925,
        "char_end": 50969,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.244",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp70i0",
        "text": "Nor the soles of her shoe?",
        "char_start": 50970,
        "char_end": 50996,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.245",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp71i0",
        "text": "Neither, my lord.",
        "char_start": 50997,
        "char_end": 51014,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.246",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp72i0",
        "text": "Then you live about her waist, or in the middle of",
        "char_start": 51015,
        "char_end": 51065,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.247",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp72i1",
        "text": "her favours?",
        "char_start": 51066,
        "char_end": 51078,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.248",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp73i0",
        "text": "'Faith, her privates we.",
        "char_start": 51079,
        "char_end": 51103,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.249",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp74i0",
        "text": "In the secret parts of fortune? O, most true; she",
        "char_start": 51104,
        "char_end": 51153,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.250",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp74i1",
        "text": "is a strumpet. What's the news?",
        "char_start": 51154,
        "char_end": 51185,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.251",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp75i0",
        "text": "None, my lord, but that the world's grown honest.",
        "char_start": 51186,
        "char_end": 51235,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.252",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp76i0",
        "text": "Then is doomsday near: but your news is not true.",
        "char_start": 51236,
        "char_end": 51285,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.253",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp76i1",
        "text": "Let me question more in particular: what have you,",
        "char_start": 51286,
        "char_end": 51336,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.254",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp76i2",
        "text": "my good friends, deserved at the hands of fortune,",
        "char_start": 51337,
        "char_end": 51387,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.255",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp76i3",
        "text": "that she sends you to prison hither?",
        "char_start": 51388,
        "char_end": 51424,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.256",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp77i0",
        "text": "Prison, my lord!",
        "char_start": 51425,
        "char_end": 51441,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.257",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp78i0",
        "text": "Denmark's a prison.",
        "char_start": 51442,
        "char_end": 51461,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.258",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp79i0",
        "text": "Then is the world one.",
        "char_start": 51462,
        "char_end": 51484,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.259",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp80i0",
        "text": "A goodly one; in which there are many confines,",
        "char_start": 51485,
        "char_end": 51532,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.260",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp80i1",
        "text": "wards and dungeons, Denmark being one o' the worst.",
        "char_start": 51533,
        "char_end": 51584,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.261",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp81i0",
        "text": "We think not so, my lord.",
        "char_start": 51585,
        "char_end": 51610,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.262",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp82i0",
        "text": "Why, then, 'tis none to you; for there is nothing",
        "char_start": 51611,
        "char_end": 51660,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.263",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp82i1",
        "text": "either good or bad, but thinking makes it so: to me",
        "char_start": 51661,
        "char_end": 51712,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.264",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp82i2",
        "text": "it is a prison.",
        "char_start": 51713,
        "char_end": 51728,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.265",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp83i0",
        "text": "Why then, your ambition makes it one; 'tis too",
        "char_start": 51729,
        "char_end": 51775,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.266",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp83i1",
        "text": "narrow for your mind.",
        "char_start": 51776,
        "char_end": 51797,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.267",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp84i0",
        "text": "O God, I could be bounded in a nut shell and count",
        "char_start": 51798,
        "char_end": 51848,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.268",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp84i1",
        "text": "myself a king of infinite space, were it not that I",
        "char_start": 51849,
        "char_end": 51900,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.269",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp84i2",
        "text": "have bad dreams.",
        "char_start": 51901,
        "char_end": 51917,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.270",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp85i0",
        "text": "Which dreams indeed are ambition, for the very",
        "char_start": 51918,
        "char_end": 51964,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.271",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp85i1",
        "text": "substance of the ambitious is merely the shadow of a dream.",
        "char_start": 51965,
        "char_end": 52024,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.272",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp86i0",
        "text": "A dream itself is but a shadow.",
        "char_start": 52025,
        "char_end": 52056,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.273",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp87i0",
        "text": "Truly, and I hold ambition of so airy and light a",
        "char_start": 52057,
        "char_end": 52106,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.274",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp87i1",
        "text": "quality that it is but a shadow's shadow.",
        "char_start": 52107,
        "char_end": 52148,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.275",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp88i0",
        "text": "Then are our beggars bodies, and our monarchs and",
        "char_start": 52149,
        "char_end": 52198,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.276",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp88i1",
        "text": "outstretched heroes the beggars' shadows. Shall we",
        "char_start": 52199,
        "char_end": 52249,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.277",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp88i2",
        "text": "to the court? for, by my fay, I cannot reason.",
        "char_start": 52250,
        "char_end": 52296,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.278",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp89i0",
        "text": "We'll wait upon you.",
        "char_start": 52297,
        "char_end": 52317,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.279",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp90i0",
        "text": "We'll wait upon you.",
        "char_start": 52318,
        "char_end": 52338,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.279",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp91i0",
        "text": "No such matter: I will not sort you with the rest",
        "char_start": 52339,
        "char_end": 52388,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.280",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp91i1",
        "text": "of my servants, for, to speak to you like an honest",
        "char_start": 52389,
        "char_end": 52440,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.281",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp91i2",
        "text": "man, I am most dreadfully attended. But, in the",
        "char_start": 52441,
        "char_end": 52488,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.282",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp91i3",
        "text": "beaten way of friendship, what make you at Elsinore?",
        "char_start": 52489,
        "char_end": 52541,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.283",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp92i0",
        "text": "To visit you, my lord; no other occasion.",
        "char_start": 52542,
        "char_end": 52583,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.284",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp93i0",
        "text": "Beggar that I am, I am even poor in thanks; but I",
        "char_start": 52584,
        "char_end": 52633,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.285",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp93i1",
        "text": "thank you: and sure, dear friends, my thanks are",
        "char_start": 52634,
        "char_end": 52682,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.286",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp93i2",
        "text": "too dear a halfpenny. Were you not sent for? Is it",
        "char_start": 52683,
        "char_end": 52733,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.287",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp93i3",
        "text": "your own inclining? Is it a free visitation? Come,",
        "char_start": 52734,
        "char_end": 52784,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.288",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp93i4",
        "text": "deal justly with me: come, come; nay, speak.",
        "char_start": 52785,
        "char_end": 52829,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.289",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp94i0",
        "text": "What should we say, my lord?",
        "char_start": 52830,
        "char_end": 52858,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.290",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp95i0",
        "text": "Why, any thing, but to the purpose. You were sent",
        "char_start": 52859,
        "char_end": 52908,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.291",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp95i1",
        "text": "for; and there is a kind of confession in your looks",
        "char_start": 52909,
        "char_end": 52961,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.292",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp95i2",
        "text": "which your modesties have not craft enough to colour:",
        "char_start": 52962,
        "char_end": 53015,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.293",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp95i3",
        "text": "I know the good king and queen have sent for you.",
        "char_start": 53016,
        "char_end": 53065,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.294",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp96i0",
        "text": "To what end, my lord?",
        "char_start": 53066,
        "char_end": 53087,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.295",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp97i0",
        "text": "That you must teach me. But let me conjure you, by",
        "char_start": 53088,
        "char_end": 53138,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.296",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp97i1",
        "text": "the rights of our fellowship, by the consonancy of",
        "char_start": 53139,
        "char_end": 53189,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.297",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp97i2",
        "text": "our youth, by the obligation of our ever-preserved",
        "char_start": 53190,
        "char_end": 53240,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.298",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp97i3",
        "text": "love, and by what more dear a better proposer could",
        "char_start": 53241,
        "char_end": 53292,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.299",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp97i4",
        "text": "charge you withal, be even and direct with me,",
        "char_start": 53293,
        "char_end": 53339,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.300",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp97i5",
        "text": "whether you were sent for, or no?",
        "char_start": 53340,
        "char_end": 53373,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.301",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp98i0",
        "text": "[Aside to GUILDENSTERN] What say you?",
        "char_start": 53374,
        "char_end": 53411,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.302",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp99i0",
        "text": "[Aside] Nay, then, I have an eye of you.--If you",
        "char_start": 53412,
        "char_end": 53460,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.303",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp99i1",
        "text": "love me, hold not off.",
        "char_start": 53461,
        "char_end": 53483,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.304",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp100i0",
        "text": "My lord, we were sent for.",
        "char_start": 53484,
        "char_end": 53510,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.305",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i0",
        "text": "I will tell you why; so shall my anticipation",
        "char_start": 53511,
        "char_end": 53556,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.306",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i1",
        "text": "prevent your discovery, and your secrecy to the king",
        "char_start": 53557,
        "char_end": 53609,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.307",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i2",
        "text": "and queen moult no feather. I have of late--but",
        "char_start": 53610,
        "char_end": 53657,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.308",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i3",
        "text": "wherefore I know not--lost all my mirth, forgone all",
        "char_start": 53658,
        "char_end": 53710,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.309",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i4",
        "text": "custom of exercises; and indeed it goes so heavily",
        "char_start": 53711,
        "char_end": 53761,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.310",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i5",
        "text": "with my disposition that this goodly frame, the",
        "char_start": 53762,
        "char_end": 53809,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.311",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i6",
        "text": "earth, seems to me a sterile promontory, this most",
        "char_start": 53810,
        "char_end": 53860,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.312",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i7",
        "text": "excellent canopy, the air, look you, this brave",
        "char_start": 53861,
        "char_end": 53908,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.313",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i8",
        "text": "o'erhanging firmament, this majestical roof fretted",
        "char_start": 53909,
        "char_end": 53960,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.314",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i9",
        "text": "with golden fire, why, it appears no other thing to",
        "char_start": 53961,
        "char_end": 54012,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.315",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i10",
        "text": "me than a foul and pestilent congregation of vapours.",
        "char_start": 54013,
        "char_end": 54066,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.316",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i11",
        "text": "What a piece of work is a man! how noble in reason!",
        "char_start": 54067,
        "char_end": 54118,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.317",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i12",
        "text": "how infinite in faculty! in form and moving how",
        "char_start": 54119,
        "char_end": 54166,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.318",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i13",
        "text": "express and admirable! in action how like an angel!",
        "char_start": 54167,
        "char_end": 54218,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.319",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i14",
        "text": "in apprehension how like a god! the beauty of the",
        "char_start": 54219,
        "char_end": 54268,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.320",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i15",
        "text": "world! the paragon of animals! And yet, to me,",
        "char_start": 54269,
        "char_end": 54315,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.321",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i16",
        "text": "what is this quintessence of dust? man delights not",
        "char_start": 54316,
        "char_end": 54367,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.322",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i17",
        "text": "me: no, nor woman neither, though by your smiling",
        "char_start": 54368,
        "char_end": 54417,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.323",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp101i18",
        "text": "you seem to say so.",
        "char_start": 54418,
        "char_end": 54437,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.324",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp102i0",
        "text": "My lord, there was no such stuff in my thoughts.",
        "char_start": 54438,
        "char_end": 54486,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.325",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp103i0",
        "text": "Why did you laugh then, when I said 'man delights not me'?",
        "char_start": 54487,
        "char_end": 54545,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.326",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp104i0",
        "text": "To think, my lord, if you delight not in man, what",
        "char_start": 54546,
        "char_end": 54596,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.327",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp104i1",
        "text": "lenten entertainment the players shall receive from",
        "char_start": 54597,
        "char_end": 54648,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.328",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp104i2",
        "text": "you: we coted them on the way; and hither are they",
        "char_start": 54649,
        "char_end": 54699,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.329",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp104i3",
        "text": "coming, to offer you service.",
        "char_start": 54700,
        "char_end": 54729,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.330",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp105i0",
        "text": "He that plays the king shall be welcome; his majesty",
        "char_start": 54730,
        "char_end": 54782,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.331",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp105i1",
        "text": "shall have tribute of me; the adventurous knight",
        "char_start": 54783,
        "char_end": 54831,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.332",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp105i2",
        "text": "shall use his foil and target; the lover shall not",
        "char_start": 54832,
        "char_end": 54882,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.333",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp105i3",
        "text": "sigh gratis; the humourous man shall end his part",
        "char_start": 54883,
        "char_end": 54932,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.334",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp105i4",
        "text": "in peace; the clown shall make those laugh whose",
        "char_start": 54933,
        "char_end": 54981,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.335",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp105i5",
        "text": "lungs are tickled o' the sere; and the lady shall",
        "char_start": 54982,
        "char_end": 55031,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.336",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp105i6",
        "text": "say her mind freely, or the blank verse shall halt",
        "char_start": 55032,
        "char_end": 55082,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.337",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp105i7",
        "text": "for't. What players are they?",
        "char_start": 55083,
        "char_end": 55112,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.338",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp106i0",
        "text": "Even those you were wont to take delight in, the",
        "char_start": 55113,
        "char_end": 55161,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.339",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp106i1",
        "text": "tragedians of the city.",
        "char_start": 55162,
        "char_end": 55185,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.340",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp107i0",
        "text": "How chances it they travel? their residence, both",
        "char_start": 55186,
        "char_end": 55235,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.341",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp107i1",
        "text": "in reputation and profit, was better both ways.",
        "char_start": 55236,
        "char_end": 55283,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.342",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp108i0",
        "text": "I think their inhibition comes by the means of the",
        "char_start": 55284,
        "char_end": 55334,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.343",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp108i1",
        "text": "late innovation.",
        "char_start": 55335,
        "char_end": 55351,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.344",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp109i0",
        "text": "Do they hold the same estimation they did when I was",
        "char_start": 55352,
        "char_end": 55404,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.345",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp109i1",
        "text": "in the city? are they so followed?",
        "char_start": 55405,
        "char_end": 55439,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.346",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp110i0",
        "text": "No, indeed, are they not.",
        "char_start": 55440,
        "char_end": 55465,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.347",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp111i0",
        "text": "How comes it? do they grow rusty?",
        "char_start": 55466,
        "char_end": 55499,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.348",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp112i0",
        "text": "Nay, their endeavour keeps in the wonted pace: but",
        "char_start": 55500,
        "char_end": 55550,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.349",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp112i1",
        "text": "there is, sir, an aery of children, little eyases,",
        "char_start": 55551,
        "char_end": 55601,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.350",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp112i2",
        "text": "that cry out on the top of question, and are most",
        "char_start": 55602,
        "char_end": 55651,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.351",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp112i3",
        "text": "tyrannically clapped for't: these are now the",
        "char_start": 55652,
        "char_end": 55697,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.352",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp112i4",
        "text": "fashion, and so berattle the common stages--so they",
        "char_start": 55698,
        "char_end": 55749,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.353",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp112i5",
        "text": "call them--that many wearing rapiers are afraid of",
        "char_start": 55750,
        "char_end": 55800,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.354",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp112i6",
        "text": "goose-quills and dare scarce come thither.",
        "char_start": 55801,
        "char_end": 55843,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.355",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp113i0",
        "text": "What, are they children? who maintains 'em? how are",
        "char_start": 55844,
        "char_end": 55895,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.356",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp113i1",
        "text": "they escoted? Will they pursue the quality no",
        "char_start": 55896,
        "char_end": 55941,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.357",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp113i2",
        "text": "longer than they can sing? will they not say",
        "char_start": 55942,
        "char_end": 55986,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.358",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp113i3",
        "text": "afterwards, if they should grow themselves to common",
        "char_start": 55987,
        "char_end": 56039,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.359",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp113i4",
        "text": "players--as it is most like, if their means are no",
        "char_start": 56040,
        "char_end": 56090,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.360",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp113i5",
        "text": "better--their writers do them wrong, to make them",
        "char_start": 56091,
        "char_end": 56140,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.361",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp113i6",
        "text": "exclaim against their own succession?",
        "char_start": 56141,
        "char_end": 56178,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.362",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp114i0",
        "text": "'Faith, there has been much to do on both sides; and",
        "char_start": 56179,
        "char_end": 56231,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.363",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp114i1",
        "text": "the nation holds it no sin to tarre them to",
        "char_start": 56232,
        "char_end": 56275,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.364",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp114i2",
        "text": "controversy: there was, for a while, no money bid",
        "char_start": 56276,
        "char_end": 56325,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.365",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp114i3",
        "text": "for argument, unless the poet and the player went to",
        "char_start": 56326,
        "char_end": 56378,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.366",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp114i4",
        "text": "cuffs in the question.",
        "char_start": 56379,
        "char_end": 56401,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.367",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp115i0",
        "text": "Is't possible?",
        "char_start": 56402,
        "char_end": 56416,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.368",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp116i0",
        "text": "O, there has been much throwing about of brains.",
        "char_start": 56417,
        "char_end": 56465,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.369",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp117i0",
        "text": "Do the boys carry it away?",
        "char_start": 56466,
        "char_end": 56492,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.370",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp118i0",
        "text": "Ay, that they do, my lord; Hercules and his load too.",
        "char_start": 56493,
        "char_end": 56546,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.371",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp119i0",
        "text": "It is not very strange; for mine uncle is king of",
        "char_start": 56547,
        "char_end": 56596,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.372",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp119i1",
        "text": "Denmark, and those that would make mows at him while",
        "char_start": 56597,
        "char_end": 56649,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.373",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp119i2",
        "text": "my father lived, give twenty, forty, fifty, an",
        "char_start": 56650,
        "char_end": 56696,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.374",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp119i3",
        "text": "hundred ducats a-piece for his picture in little.",
        "char_start": 56697,
        "char_end": 56746,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.375",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp119i4",
        "text": "'Sblood, there is something in this more than",
        "char_start": 56747,
        "char_end": 56792,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.376",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp119i5",
        "text": "natural, if philosophy could find it out.",
        "char_start": 56793,
        "char_end": 56834,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.377",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp119i6",
        "text": "Flourish of trumpets within",
        "char_start": 56835,
        "char_end": 56862,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp120i0",
        "text": "There are the players.",
        "char_start": 56863,
        "char_end": 56885,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.378",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp121i0",
        "text": "Gentlemen, you are welcome to Elsinore. Your hands,",
        "char_start": 56886,
        "char_end": 56937,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.379",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp121i1",
        "text": "come then: the appurtenance of welcome is fashion",
        "char_start": 56938,
        "char_end": 56987,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.380",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp121i2",
        "text": "and ceremony: let me comply with you in this garb,",
        "char_start": 56988,
        "char_end": 57038,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.381",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp121i3",
        "text": "lest my extent to the players, which, I tell you,",
        "char_start": 57039,
        "char_end": 57088,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.382",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp121i4",
        "text": "must show fairly outward, should more appear like",
        "char_start": 57089,
        "char_end": 57138,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.383",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp121i5",
        "text": "entertainment than yours. You are welcome: but my",
        "char_start": 57139,
        "char_end": 57188,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.384",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp121i6",
        "text": "uncle-father and aunt-mother are deceived.",
        "char_start": 57189,
        "char_end": 57231,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.385",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp122i0",
        "text": "In what, my dear lord?",
        "char_start": 57232,
        "char_end": 57254,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.386",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp123i0",
        "text": "I am but mad north-north-west: when the wind is",
        "char_start": 57255,
        "char_end": 57302,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.387",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp123i1",
        "text": "southerly I know a hawk from a handsaw.",
        "char_start": 57303,
        "char_end": 57342,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.388",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp123i2",
        "text": "Enter POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 57343,
        "char_end": 57357,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp124i0",
        "text": "Well be with you, gentlemen!",
        "char_start": 57358,
        "char_end": 57386,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.389",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp125i0",
        "text": "Hark you, Guildenstern; and you too: at each ear a",
        "char_start": 57387,
        "char_end": 57437,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.390",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp125i1",
        "text": "hearer: that great baby you see there is not yet",
        "char_start": 57438,
        "char_end": 57486,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.391",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp125i2",
        "text": "out of his swaddling-clouts.",
        "char_start": 57487,
        "char_end": 57515,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.392",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp126i0",
        "text": "Happily he's the second time come to them; for they",
        "char_start": 57516,
        "char_end": 57567,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.393",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp126i1",
        "text": "say an old man is twice a child.",
        "char_start": 57568,
        "char_end": 57600,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.394",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp127i0",
        "text": "I will prophesy he comes to tell me of the players;",
        "char_start": 57601,
        "char_end": 57652,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.395",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp127i1",
        "text": "mark it. You say right, sir: o' Monday morning;",
        "char_start": 57653,
        "char_end": 57700,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.396",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp127i2",
        "text": "'twas so indeed.",
        "char_start": 57701,
        "char_end": 57717,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.397",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp128i0",
        "text": "My lord, I have news to tell you.",
        "char_start": 57718,
        "char_end": 57751,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.398",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp129i0",
        "text": "My lord, I have news to tell you.",
        "char_start": 57752,
        "char_end": 57785,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.399",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp129i1",
        "text": "When Roscius was an actor in Rome,--",
        "char_start": 57786,
        "char_end": 57822,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.400",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp130i0",
        "text": "The actors are come hither, my lord.",
        "char_start": 57823,
        "char_end": 57859,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.401",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp131i0",
        "text": "Buz, buz!",
        "char_start": 57860,
        "char_end": 57869,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.402",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp132i0",
        "text": "Upon mine honour,--",
        "char_start": 57870,
        "char_end": 57889,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.403",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp133i0",
        "text": "Then came each actor on his ass,--",
        "char_start": 57890,
        "char_end": 57924,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.404",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp134i0",
        "text": "The best actors in the world, either for tragedy,",
        "char_start": 57925,
        "char_end": 57974,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.405",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp134i1",
        "text": "comedy, history, pastoral, pastoral-comical,",
        "char_start": 57975,
        "char_end": 58019,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.406",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp134i2",
        "text": "historical-pastoral, tragical-historical, tragical-",
        "char_start": 58020,
        "char_end": 58071,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.407",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp134i3",
        "text": "comical-historical-pastoral, scene individable, or",
        "char_start": 58072,
        "char_end": 58122,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.408",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp134i4",
        "text": "poem unlimited: Seneca cannot be too heavy, nor",
        "char_start": 58123,
        "char_end": 58170,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.409",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp134i5",
        "text": "Plautus too light. For the law of writ and the",
        "char_start": 58171,
        "char_end": 58217,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.410",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp134i6",
        "text": "liberty, these are the only men.",
        "char_start": 58218,
        "char_end": 58250,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.411",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp135i0",
        "text": "O Jephthah, judge of Israel, what a treasure hadst thou!",
        "char_start": 58251,
        "char_end": 58307,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.412",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp136i0",
        "text": "What a treasure had he, my lord?",
        "char_start": 58308,
        "char_end": 58340,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.413",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp137i0",
        "text": "Why,",
        "char_start": 58341,
        "char_end": 58345,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.414",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp137i1",
        "text": "'One fair daughter and no more,",
        "char_start": 58346,
        "char_end": 58377,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.415",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp137i2",
        "text": "The which he loved passing well.'",
        "char_start": 58378,
        "char_end": 58411,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.416",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp138i0",
        "text": "[Aside] Still on my daughter.",
        "char_start": 58412,
        "char_end": 58441,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.417",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp139i0",
        "text": "Am I not i' the right, old Jephthah?",
        "char_start": 58442,
        "char_end": 58478,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.418",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp140i0",
        "text": "If you call me Jephthah, my lord, I have a daughter",
        "char_start": 58479,
        "char_end": 58530,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.419",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp140i1",
        "text": "that I love passing well.",
        "char_start": 58531,
        "char_end": 58556,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.420",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp141i0",
        "text": "Nay, that follows not.",
        "char_start": 58557,
        "char_end": 58579,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.421",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp142i0",
        "text": "What follows, then, my lord?",
        "char_start": 58580,
        "char_end": 58608,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.422",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i0",
        "text": "Why,",
        "char_start": 58609,
        "char_end": 58613,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.423",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i1",
        "text": "'As by lot, God wot,'",
        "char_start": 58614,
        "char_end": 58635,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.424",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i2",
        "text": "and then, you know,",
        "char_start": 58636,
        "char_end": 58655,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.425",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i3",
        "text": "'It came to pass, as most like it was,'--",
        "char_start": 58656,
        "char_end": 58697,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.426",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i4",
        "text": "the first row of the pious chanson will show you",
        "char_start": 58698,
        "char_end": 58746,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.427",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i5",
        "text": "more; for look, where my abridgement comes.",
        "char_start": 58747,
        "char_end": 58790,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.428",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i6",
        "text": "Enter four or five Players",
        "char_start": 58791,
        "char_end": 58817,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i7",
        "text": "You are welcome, masters; welcome, all. I am glad",
        "char_start": 58818,
        "char_end": 58867,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.429",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i8",
        "text": "to see thee well. Welcome, good friends. O, my old",
        "char_start": 58868,
        "char_end": 58918,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.430",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i9",
        "text": "friend! thy face is valenced since I saw thee last:",
        "char_start": 58919,
        "char_end": 58970,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.431",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i10",
        "text": "comest thou to beard me in Denmark? What, my young",
        "char_start": 58971,
        "char_end": 59021,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.432",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i11",
        "text": "lady and mistress! By'r lady, your ladyship is",
        "char_start": 59022,
        "char_end": 59068,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.433",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i12",
        "text": "nearer to heaven than when I saw you last, by the",
        "char_start": 59069,
        "char_end": 59118,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.434",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i13",
        "text": "altitude of a chopine. Pray God, your voice, like",
        "char_start": 59119,
        "char_end": 59168,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.435",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i14",
        "text": "apiece of uncurrent gold, be not cracked within the",
        "char_start": 59169,
        "char_end": 59220,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.436",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i15",
        "text": "ring. Masters, you are all welcome. We'll e'en",
        "char_start": 59221,
        "char_end": 59267,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.437",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i16",
        "text": "to't like French falconers, fly at any thing we see:",
        "char_start": 59268,
        "char_end": 59320,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.438",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i17",
        "text": "we'll have a speech straight: come, give us a taste",
        "char_start": 59321,
        "char_end": 59372,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.439",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp143i18",
        "text": "of your quality; come, a passionate speech.",
        "char_start": 59373,
        "char_end": 59416,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.440",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp144i0",
        "text": "What speech, my lord?",
        "char_start": 59417,
        "char_end": 59438,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.441",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i0",
        "text": "I heard thee speak me a speech once, but it was",
        "char_start": 59439,
        "char_end": 59486,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.442",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i1",
        "text": "never acted; or, if it was, not above once; for the",
        "char_start": 59487,
        "char_end": 59538,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.443",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i2",
        "text": "play, I remember, pleased not the million; 'twas",
        "char_start": 59539,
        "char_end": 59587,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.444",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i3",
        "text": "caviare to the general: but it was--as I received",
        "char_start": 59588,
        "char_end": 59637,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.445",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i4",
        "text": "it, and others, whose judgments in such matters",
        "char_start": 59638,
        "char_end": 59685,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.446",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i5",
        "text": "cried in the top of mine--an excellent play, well",
        "char_start": 59686,
        "char_end": 59735,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.447",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i6",
        "text": "digested in the scenes, set down with as much",
        "char_start": 59736,
        "char_end": 59781,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.448",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i7",
        "text": "modesty as cunning. I remember, one said there",
        "char_start": 59782,
        "char_end": 59828,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.449",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i8",
        "text": "were no sallets in the lines to make the matter",
        "char_start": 59829,
        "char_end": 59876,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.450",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i9",
        "text": "savoury, nor no matter in the phrase that might",
        "char_start": 59877,
        "char_end": 59924,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.451",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i10",
        "text": "indict the author of affectation; but called it an",
        "char_start": 59925,
        "char_end": 59975,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.452",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i11",
        "text": "honest method, as wholesome as sweet, and by very",
        "char_start": 59976,
        "char_end": 60025,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.453",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i12",
        "text": "much more handsome than fine. One speech in it I",
        "char_start": 60026,
        "char_end": 60074,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.454",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i13",
        "text": "chiefly loved: 'twas Aeneas' tale to Dido; and",
        "char_start": 60075,
        "char_end": 60121,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.455",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i14",
        "text": "thereabout of it especially, where he speaks of",
        "char_start": 60122,
        "char_end": 60169,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.456",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i15",
        "text": "Priam's slaughter: if it live in your memory, begin",
        "char_start": 60170,
        "char_end": 60221,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.457",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i16",
        "text": "at this line: let me see, let me see--",
        "char_start": 60222,
        "char_end": 60260,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.458",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i17",
        "text": "'The rugged Pyrrhus, like the Hyrcanian beast,'--",
        "char_start": 60261,
        "char_end": 60310,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.459",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i18",
        "text": "it is not so:--it begins with Pyrrhus:--",
        "char_start": 60311,
        "char_end": 60351,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.460",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i19",
        "text": "'The rugged Pyrrhus, he whose sable arms,",
        "char_start": 60352,
        "char_end": 60393,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.461",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i20",
        "text": "Black as his purpose, did the night resemble",
        "char_start": 60394,
        "char_end": 60438,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.462",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i21",
        "text": "When he lay couched in the ominous horse,",
        "char_start": 60439,
        "char_end": 60480,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.463",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i22",
        "text": "Hath now this dread and black complexion smear'd",
        "char_start": 60481,
        "char_end": 60529,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.464",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i23",
        "text": "With heraldry more dismal; head to foot",
        "char_start": 60530,
        "char_end": 60569,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.465",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i24",
        "text": "Now is he total gules; horridly trick'd",
        "char_start": 60570,
        "char_end": 60609,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.466",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i25",
        "text": "With blood of fathers, mothers, daughters, sons,",
        "char_start": 60610,
        "char_end": 60658,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.467",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i26",
        "text": "Baked and impasted with the parching streets,",
        "char_start": 60659,
        "char_end": 60704,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.468",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i27",
        "text": "That lend a tyrannous and damned light",
        "char_start": 60705,
        "char_end": 60743,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.469",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i28",
        "text": "To their lord's murder: roasted in wrath and fire,",
        "char_start": 60744,
        "char_end": 60794,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.470",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i29",
        "text": "And thus o'er-sized with coagulate gore,",
        "char_start": 60795,
        "char_end": 60835,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.471",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i30",
        "text": "With eyes like carbuncles, the hellish Pyrrhus",
        "char_start": 60836,
        "char_end": 60882,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.472",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i31",
        "text": "Old grandsire Priam seeks.'",
        "char_start": 60883,
        "char_end": 60910,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.473",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp145i32",
        "text": "So, proceed you.",
        "char_start": 60911,
        "char_end": 60927,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.474",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp146i0",
        "text": "'Fore God, my lord, well spoken, with good accent and",
        "char_start": 60928,
        "char_end": 60981,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.475",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp146i1",
        "text": "good discretion.",
        "char_start": 60982,
        "char_end": 60998,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.476",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i0",
        "text": "'Anon he finds him",
        "char_start": 60999,
        "char_end": 61017,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.477",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i1",
        "text": "Striking too short at Greeks; his antique sword,",
        "char_start": 61018,
        "char_end": 61066,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.478",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i2",
        "text": "Rebellious to his arm, lies where it falls,",
        "char_start": 61067,
        "char_end": 61110,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.479",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i3",
        "text": "Repugnant to command: unequal match'd,",
        "char_start": 61111,
        "char_end": 61149,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.480",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i4",
        "text": "Pyrrhus at Priam drives; in rage strikes wide;",
        "char_start": 61150,
        "char_end": 61196,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.481",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i5",
        "text": "But with the whiff and wind of his fell sword",
        "char_start": 61197,
        "char_end": 61242,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.482",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i6",
        "text": "The unnerved father falls. Then senseless Ilium,",
        "char_start": 61243,
        "char_end": 61291,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.483",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i7",
        "text": "Seeming to feel this blow, with flaming top",
        "char_start": 61292,
        "char_end": 61335,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.484",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i8",
        "text": "Stoops to his base, and with a hideous crash",
        "char_start": 61336,
        "char_end": 61380,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.485",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i9",
        "text": "Takes prisoner Pyrrhus' ear: for, lo! his sword,",
        "char_start": 61381,
        "char_end": 61429,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.486",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i10",
        "text": "Which was declining on the milky head",
        "char_start": 61430,
        "char_end": 61467,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.487",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i11",
        "text": "Of reverend Priam, seem'd i' the air to stick:",
        "char_start": 61468,
        "char_end": 61514,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.488",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i12",
        "text": "So, as a painted tyrant, Pyrrhus stood,",
        "char_start": 61515,
        "char_end": 61554,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.489",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i13",
        "text": "And like a neutral to his will and matter,",
        "char_start": 61555,
        "char_end": 61597,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.490",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i14",
        "text": "Did nothing.",
        "char_start": 61598,
        "char_end": 61610,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.491",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i15",
        "text": "But, as we often see, against some storm,",
        "char_start": 61611,
        "char_end": 61652,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.492",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i16",
        "text": "A silence in the heavens, the rack stand still,",
        "char_start": 61653,
        "char_end": 61700,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.493",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i17",
        "text": "The bold winds speechless and the orb below",
        "char_start": 61701,
        "char_end": 61744,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.494",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i18",
        "text": "As hush as death, anon the dreadful thunder",
        "char_start": 61745,
        "char_end": 61788,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.495",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i19",
        "text": "Doth rend the region, so, after Pyrrhus' pause,",
        "char_start": 61789,
        "char_end": 61836,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.496",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i20",
        "text": "Aroused vengeance sets him new a-work;",
        "char_start": 61837,
        "char_end": 61875,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.497",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i21",
        "text": "And never did the Cyclops' hammers fall",
        "char_start": 61876,
        "char_end": 61915,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.498",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i22",
        "text": "On Mars's armour forged for proof eterne",
        "char_start": 61916,
        "char_end": 61956,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.499",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i23",
        "text": "With less remorse than Pyrrhus' bleeding sword",
        "char_start": 61957,
        "char_end": 62003,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.500",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i24",
        "text": "Now falls on Priam.",
        "char_start": 62004,
        "char_end": 62023,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.501",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i25",
        "text": "Out, out, thou strumpet, Fortune! All you gods,",
        "char_start": 62024,
        "char_end": 62071,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.502",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i26",
        "text": "In general synod 'take away her power;",
        "char_start": 62072,
        "char_end": 62110,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.503",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i27",
        "text": "Break all the spokes and fellies from her wheel,",
        "char_start": 62111,
        "char_end": 62159,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.504",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i28",
        "text": "And bowl the round nave down the hill of heaven,",
        "char_start": 62160,
        "char_end": 62208,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.505",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp147i29",
        "text": "As low as to the fiends!'",
        "char_start": 62209,
        "char_end": 62234,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.506",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp148i0",
        "text": "This is too long.",
        "char_start": 62235,
        "char_end": 62252,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.507",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp149i0",
        "text": "It shall to the barber's, with your beard. Prithee,",
        "char_start": 62253,
        "char_end": 62304,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.508",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp149i1",
        "text": "say on: he's for a jig or a tale of bawdry, or he",
        "char_start": 62305,
        "char_end": 62354,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.509",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp149i2",
        "text": "sleeps: say on: come to Hecuba.",
        "char_start": 62355,
        "char_end": 62386,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.510",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp150i0",
        "text": "'But who, O, who had seen the mobled queen--'",
        "char_start": 62387,
        "char_end": 62432,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.511",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp151i0",
        "text": "'The mobled queen?'",
        "char_start": 62433,
        "char_end": 62452,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.512",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp152i0",
        "text": "That's good; 'mobled queen' is good.",
        "char_start": 62453,
        "char_end": 62489,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.513",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i0",
        "text": "'Run barefoot up and down, threatening the flames",
        "char_start": 62490,
        "char_end": 62539,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.514",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i1",
        "text": "With bisson rheum; a clout upon that head",
        "char_start": 62540,
        "char_end": 62581,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.515",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i2",
        "text": "Where late the diadem stood, and for a robe,",
        "char_start": 62582,
        "char_end": 62626,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.516",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i3",
        "text": "About her lank and all o'er-teemed loins,",
        "char_start": 62627,
        "char_end": 62668,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.517",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i4",
        "text": "A blanket, in the alarm of fear caught up;",
        "char_start": 62669,
        "char_end": 62711,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.518",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i5",
        "text": "Who this had seen, with tongue in venom steep'd,",
        "char_start": 62712,
        "char_end": 62760,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.519",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i6",
        "text": "'Gainst Fortune's state would treason have",
        "char_start": 62761,
        "char_end": 62803,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.520",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i7",
        "text": "pronounced:",
        "char_start": 62804,
        "char_end": 62815,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.521",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i8",
        "text": "But if the gods themselves did see her then",
        "char_start": 62816,
        "char_end": 62859,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.522",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i9",
        "text": "When she saw Pyrrhus make malicious sport",
        "char_start": 62860,
        "char_end": 62901,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.523",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i10",
        "text": "In mincing with his sword her husband's limbs,",
        "char_start": 62902,
        "char_end": 62948,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.524",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i11",
        "text": "The instant burst of clamour that she made,",
        "char_start": 62949,
        "char_end": 62992,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.525",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i12",
        "text": "Unless things mortal move them not at all,",
        "char_start": 62993,
        "char_end": 63035,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.526",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i13",
        "text": "Would have made milch the burning eyes of heaven,",
        "char_start": 63036,
        "char_end": 63085,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.527",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp153i14",
        "text": "And passion in the gods.'",
        "char_start": 63086,
        "char_end": 63111,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.528",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp154i0",
        "text": "Look, whether he has not turned his colour and has",
        "char_start": 63112,
        "char_end": 63162,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.529",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp154i1",
        "text": "tears in's eyes. Pray you, no more.",
        "char_start": 63163,
        "char_end": 63198,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.530",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp155i0",
        "text": "'Tis well: I'll have thee speak out the rest soon.",
        "char_start": 63199,
        "char_end": 63249,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.531",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp155i1",
        "text": "Good my lord, will you see the players well",
        "char_start": 63250,
        "char_end": 63293,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.532",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp155i2",
        "text": "bestowed? Do you hear, let them be well used; for",
        "char_start": 63294,
        "char_end": 63343,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.533",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp155i3",
        "text": "they are the abstract and brief chronicles of the",
        "char_start": 63344,
        "char_end": 63393,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.534",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp155i4",
        "text": "time: after your death you were better have a bad",
        "char_start": 63394,
        "char_end": 63443,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.535",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp155i5",
        "text": "epitaph than their ill report while you live.",
        "char_start": 63444,
        "char_end": 63489,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.536",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp156i0",
        "text": "My lord, I will use them according to their desert.",
        "char_start": 63490,
        "char_end": 63541,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.537",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp157i0",
        "text": "God's bodykins, man, much better: use every man",
        "char_start": 63542,
        "char_end": 63589,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.538",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp157i1",
        "text": "after his desert, and who should 'scape whipping?",
        "char_start": 63590,
        "char_end": 63639,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.539",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp157i2",
        "text": "Use them after your own honour and dignity: the less",
        "char_start": 63640,
        "char_end": 63692,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.540",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp157i3",
        "text": "they deserve, the more merit is in your bounty.",
        "char_start": 63693,
        "char_end": 63740,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.541",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp157i4",
        "text": "Take them in.",
        "char_start": 63741,
        "char_end": 63754,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.542",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp158i0",
        "text": "Come, sirs.",
        "char_start": 63755,
        "char_end": 63766,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.543",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp159i0",
        "text": "Follow him, friends: we'll hear a play to-morrow.",
        "char_start": 63767,
        "char_end": 63816,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.544",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp159i1",
        "text": "Exit POLONIUS with all the Players but the First",
        "char_start": 63817,
        "char_end": 63865,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp159i2",
        "text": "Dost thou hear me, old friend; can you play the",
        "char_start": 63866,
        "char_end": 63913,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.545",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp159i3",
        "text": "Murder of Gonzago?",
        "char_start": 63914,
        "char_end": 63932,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.546",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp160i0",
        "text": "Ay, my lord.",
        "char_start": 63933,
        "char_end": 63945,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.547",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp161i0",
        "text": "We'll ha't to-morrow night. You could, for a need,",
        "char_start": 63946,
        "char_end": 63996,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.548",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp161i1",
        "text": "study a speech of some dozen or sixteen lines, which",
        "char_start": 63997,
        "char_end": 64049,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.549",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp161i2",
        "text": "I would set down and insert in't, could you not?",
        "char_start": 64050,
        "char_end": 64098,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.550",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp162i0",
        "text": "Ay, my lord.",
        "char_start": 64099,
        "char_end": 64111,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.551",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp163i0",
        "text": "Very well. Follow that lord; and look you mock him",
        "char_start": 64112,
        "char_end": 64162,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.552",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp163i1",
        "text": "not.",
        "char_start": 64163,
        "char_end": 64167,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.553",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp163i2",
        "text": "Exit First Player",
        "char_start": 64168,
        "char_end": 64185,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp163i3",
        "text": "My good friends, I'll leave you till night: you are",
        "char_start": 64186,
        "char_end": 64237,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.554",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp163i4",
        "text": "welcome to Elsinore.",
        "char_start": 64238,
        "char_end": 64258,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.555",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp164i0",
        "text": "Good my lord!",
        "char_start": 64259,
        "char_end": 64272,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.556",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i0",
        "text": "Ay, so, God be wi' ye;",
        "char_start": 64273,
        "char_end": 64295,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.557",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i1",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 64296,
        "char_end": 64331,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i2",
        "text": "Now I am alone.",
        "char_start": 64332,
        "char_end": 64347,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.558",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i3",
        "text": "O, what a rogue and peasant slave am I!",
        "char_start": 64348,
        "char_end": 64387,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.559",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i4",
        "text": "Is it not monstrous that this player here,",
        "char_start": 64388,
        "char_end": 64430,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.560",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i5",
        "text": "But in a fiction, in a dream of passion,",
        "char_start": 64431,
        "char_end": 64471,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.561",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i6",
        "text": "Could force his soul so to his own conceit",
        "char_start": 64472,
        "char_end": 64514,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.562",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i7",
        "text": "That from her working all his visage wann'd,",
        "char_start": 64515,
        "char_end": 64559,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.563",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i8",
        "text": "Tears in his eyes, distraction in's aspect,",
        "char_start": 64560,
        "char_end": 64603,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.564",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i9",
        "text": "A broken voice, and his whole function suiting",
        "char_start": 64604,
        "char_end": 64650,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.565",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i10",
        "text": "With forms to his conceit? and all for nothing!",
        "char_start": 64651,
        "char_end": 64698,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.566",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i11",
        "text": "For Hecuba!",
        "char_start": 64699,
        "char_end": 64710,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.567",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i12",
        "text": "What's Hecuba to him, or he to Hecuba,",
        "char_start": 64711,
        "char_end": 64749,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.568",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i13",
        "text": "That he should weep for her? What would he do,",
        "char_start": 64750,
        "char_end": 64796,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.569",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i14",
        "text": "Had he the motive and the cue for passion",
        "char_start": 64797,
        "char_end": 64838,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.570",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i15",
        "text": "That I have? He would drown the stage with tears",
        "char_start": 64839,
        "char_end": 64887,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.571",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i16",
        "text": "And cleave the general ear with horrid speech,",
        "char_start": 64888,
        "char_end": 64934,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.572",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i17",
        "text": "Make mad the guilty and appal the free,",
        "char_start": 64935,
        "char_end": 64974,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.573",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i18",
        "text": "Confound the ignorant, and amaze indeed",
        "char_start": 64975,
        "char_end": 65014,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.574",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i19",
        "text": "The very faculties of eyes and ears. Yet I,",
        "char_start": 65015,
        "char_end": 65058,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.575",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i20",
        "text": "A dull and muddy-mettled rascal, peak,",
        "char_start": 65059,
        "char_end": 65097,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.576",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i21",
        "text": "Like John-a-dreams, unpregnant of my cause,",
        "char_start": 65098,
        "char_end": 65141,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.577",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i22",
        "text": "And can say nothing; no, not for a king,",
        "char_start": 65142,
        "char_end": 65182,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.578",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i23",
        "text": "Upon whose property and most dear life",
        "char_start": 65183,
        "char_end": 65221,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.579",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i24",
        "text": "A damn'd defeat was made. Am I a coward?",
        "char_start": 65222,
        "char_end": 65262,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.580",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i25",
        "text": "Who calls me villain? breaks my pate across?",
        "char_start": 65263,
        "char_end": 65307,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.581",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i26",
        "text": "Plucks off my beard, and blows it in my face?",
        "char_start": 65308,
        "char_end": 65353,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.582",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i27",
        "text": "Tweaks me by the nose? gives me the lie i' the throat,",
        "char_start": 65354,
        "char_end": 65408,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.583",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i28",
        "text": "As deep as to the lungs? who does me this?",
        "char_start": 65409,
        "char_end": 65451,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.584",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i29",
        "text": "Ha!",
        "char_start": 65452,
        "char_end": 65455,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.585",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i30",
        "text": "'Swounds, I should take it: for it cannot be",
        "char_start": 65456,
        "char_end": 65500,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.586",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i31",
        "text": "But I am pigeon-liver'd and lack gall",
        "char_start": 65501,
        "char_end": 65538,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.587",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i32",
        "text": "To make oppression bitter, or ere this",
        "char_start": 65539,
        "char_end": 65577,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.588",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i33",
        "text": "I should have fatted all the region kites",
        "char_start": 65578,
        "char_end": 65619,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.589",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i34",
        "text": "With this slave's offal: bloody, bawdy villain!",
        "char_start": 65620,
        "char_end": 65667,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.590",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i35",
        "text": "Remorseless, treacherous, lecherous, kindless villain!",
        "char_start": 65668,
        "char_end": 65722,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.591",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i36",
        "text": "O, vengeance!",
        "char_start": 65723,
        "char_end": 65736,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.592",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i37",
        "text": "Why, what an ass am I! This is most brave,",
        "char_start": 65737,
        "char_end": 65779,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.593",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i38",
        "text": "That I, the son of a dear father murder'd,",
        "char_start": 65780,
        "char_end": 65822,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.594",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i39",
        "text": "Prompted to my revenge by heaven and hell,",
        "char_start": 65823,
        "char_end": 65865,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.595",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i40",
        "text": "Must, like a whore, unpack my heart with words,",
        "char_start": 65866,
        "char_end": 65913,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.596",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i41",
        "text": "And fall a-cursing, like a very drab,",
        "char_start": 65914,
        "char_end": 65951,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.597",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i42",
        "text": "A scullion!",
        "char_start": 65952,
        "char_end": 65963,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.598",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i43",
        "text": "Fie upon't! foh! About, my brain! I have heard",
        "char_start": 65964,
        "char_end": 66010,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.599",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i44",
        "text": "That guilty creatures sitting at a play",
        "char_start": 66011,
        "char_end": 66050,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.600",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i45",
        "text": "Have by the very cunning of the scene",
        "char_start": 66051,
        "char_end": 66088,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.601",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i46",
        "text": "Been struck so to the soul that presently",
        "char_start": 66089,
        "char_end": 66130,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.602",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i47",
        "text": "They have proclaim'd their malefactions;",
        "char_start": 66131,
        "char_end": 66171,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.603",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i48",
        "text": "For murder, though it have no tongue, will speak",
        "char_start": 66172,
        "char_end": 66220,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.604",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i49",
        "text": "With most miraculous organ. I'll have these players",
        "char_start": 66221,
        "char_end": 66272,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.605",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i50",
        "text": "Play something like the murder of my father",
        "char_start": 66273,
        "char_end": 66316,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.606",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i51",
        "text": "Before mine uncle: I'll observe his looks;",
        "char_start": 66317,
        "char_end": 66359,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.607",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i52",
        "text": "I'll tent him to the quick: if he but blench,",
        "char_start": 66360,
        "char_end": 66405,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.608",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i53",
        "text": "I know my course. The spirit that I have seen",
        "char_start": 66406,
        "char_end": 66451,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.609",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i54",
        "text": "May be the devil: and the devil hath power",
        "char_start": 66452,
        "char_end": 66494,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.610",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i55",
        "text": "To assume a pleasing shape; yea, and perhaps",
        "char_start": 66495,
        "char_end": 66539,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.611",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i56",
        "text": "Out of my weakness and my melancholy,",
        "char_start": 66540,
        "char_end": 66577,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.612",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i57",
        "text": "As he is very potent with such spirits,",
        "char_start": 66578,
        "char_end": 66617,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.613",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i58",
        "text": "Abuses me to damn me: I'll have grounds",
        "char_start": 66618,
        "char_end": 66657,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.614",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i59",
        "text": "More relative than this: the play 's the thing",
        "char_start": 66658,
        "char_end": 66704,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.615",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i60",
        "text": "Wherein I'll catch the conscience of the king.",
        "char_start": 66705,
        "char_end": 66751,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "2.2.616",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a2s2:sp165i61",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 66752,
        "char_end": 66756,
        "act": 2,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:open",
        "text": "Enter KING CLAUDIUS, QUEEN GERTRUDE, POLONIUS, OPHELIA, ROSENCRANTZ, and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 66757,
        "char_end": 66842,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp1i0",
        "text": "And can you, by no drift of circumstance,",
        "char_start": 66843,
        "char_end": 66884,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp1i1",
        "text": "Get from him why he puts on this confusion,",
        "char_start": 66885,
        "char_end": 66928,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp1i2",
        "text": "Grating so harshly all his days of quiet",
        "char_start": 66929,
        "char_end": 66969,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp1i3",
        "text": "With turbulent and dangerous lunacy?",
        "char_start": 66970,
        "char_end": 67006,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp2i0",
        "text": "He does confess he feels himself distracted;",
        "char_start": 67007,
        "char_end": 67051,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp2i1",
        "text": "But from what cause he will by no means speak.",
        "char_start": 67052,
        "char_end": 67098,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp3i0",
        "text": "Nor do we find him forward to be sounded,",
        "char_start": 67099,
        "char_end": 67140,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp3i1",
        "text": "But, with a crafty madness, keeps aloof,",
        "char_start": 67141,
        "char_end": 67181,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp3i2",
        "text": "When we would bring him on to some confession",
        "char_start": 67182,
        "char_end": 67227,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp3i3",
        "text": "Of his true state.",
        "char_start": 67228,
        "char_end": 67246,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp4i0",
        "text": "Did he receive you well?",
        "char_start": 67247,
        "char_end": 67271,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp5i0",
        "text": "Most like a gentleman.",
        "char_start": 67272,
        "char_end": 67294,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp6i0",
        "text": "But with much forcing of his disposition.",
        "char_start": 67295,
        "char_end": 67336,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp7i0",
        "text": "Niggard of question; but, of our demands,",
        "char_start": 67337,
        "char_end": 67378,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp7i1",
        "text": "Most free in his reply.",
        "char_start": 67379,
        "char_end": 67402,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp8i0",
        "text": "Did you assay him?",
        "char_start": 67403,
        "char_end": 67421,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp8i1",
        "text": "To any pastime?",
        "char_start": 67422,
        "char_end": 67437,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp9i0",
        "text": "Madam, it so fell out, that certain players",
        "char_start": 67438,
        "char_end": 67481,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp9i1",
        "text": "We o'er-raught on the way: of these we told him;",
        "char_start": 67482,
        "char_end": 67530,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp9i2",
        "text": "And there did seem in him a kind of joy",
        "char_start": 67531,
        "char_end": 67570,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp9i3",
        "text": "To hear of it: they are about the court,",
        "char_start": 67571,
        "char_end": 67611,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp9i4",
        "text": "And, as I think, they have already order",
        "char_start": 67612,
        "char_end": 67652,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp9i5",
        "text": "This night to play before him.",
        "char_start": 67653,
        "char_end": 67683,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp10i0",
        "text": "'Tis most true:",
        "char_start": 67684,
        "char_end": 67699,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp10i1",
        "text": "And he beseech'd me to entreat your majesties",
        "char_start": 67700,
        "char_end": 67745,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp10i2",
        "text": "To hear and see the matter.",
        "char_start": 67746,
        "char_end": 67773,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp11i0",
        "text": "With all my heart; and it doth much content me",
        "char_start": 67774,
        "char_end": 67820,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp11i1",
        "text": "To hear him so inclined.",
        "char_start": 67821,
        "char_end": 67845,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp11i2",
        "text": "Good gentlemen, give him a further edge,",
        "char_start": 67846,
        "char_end": 67886,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp11i3",
        "text": "And drive his purpose on to these delights.",
        "char_start": 67887,
        "char_end": 67930,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp12i0",
        "text": "We shall, my lord.",
        "char_start": 67931,
        "char_end": 67949,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp12i1",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 67950,
        "char_end": 67985,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i0",
        "text": "Sweet Gertrude, leave us too;",
        "char_start": 67986,
        "char_end": 68015,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i1",
        "text": "For we have closely sent for Hamlet hither,",
        "char_start": 68016,
        "char_end": 68059,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i2",
        "text": "That he, as 'twere by accident, may here",
        "char_start": 68060,
        "char_end": 68100,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i3",
        "text": "Affront Ophelia:",
        "char_start": 68101,
        "char_end": 68117,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i4",
        "text": "Her father and myself, lawful espials,",
        "char_start": 68118,
        "char_end": 68156,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i5",
        "text": "Will so bestow ourselves that, seeing, unseen,",
        "char_start": 68157,
        "char_end": 68203,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i6",
        "text": "We may of their encounter frankly judge,",
        "char_start": 68204,
        "char_end": 68244,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i7",
        "text": "And gather by him, as he is behaved,",
        "char_start": 68245,
        "char_end": 68281,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i8",
        "text": "If 't be the affliction of his love or no",
        "char_start": 68282,
        "char_end": 68323,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp13i9",
        "text": "That thus he suffers for.",
        "char_start": 68324,
        "char_end": 68349,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp14i0",
        "text": "I shall obey you.",
        "char_start": 68350,
        "char_end": 68367,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp14i1",
        "text": "And for your part, Ophelia, I do wish",
        "char_start": 68368,
        "char_end": 68405,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp14i2",
        "text": "That your good beauties be the happy cause",
        "char_start": 68406,
        "char_end": 68448,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp14i3",
        "text": "Of Hamlet's wildness: so shall I hope your virtues",
        "char_start": 68449,
        "char_end": 68499,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp14i4",
        "text": "Will bring him to his wonted way again,",
        "char_start": 68500,
        "char_end": 68539,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp14i5",
        "text": "To both your honours.",
        "char_start": 68540,
        "char_end": 68561,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp15i0",
        "text": "Madam, I wish it may.",
        "char_start": 68562,
        "char_end": 68583,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp15i1",
        "text": "Exit QUEEN GERTRUDE",
        "char_start": 68584,
        "char_end": 68603,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp16i0",
        "text": "Ophelia, walk you here. Gracious, so please you,",
        "char_start": 68604,
        "char_end": 68652,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp16i1",
        "text": "We will bestow ourselves.",
        "char_start": 68653,
        "char_end": 68678,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp16i2",
        "text": "To OPHELIA",
        "char_start": 68679,
        "char_end": 68689,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp16i3",
        "text": "Read on this book;",
        "char_start": 68690,
        "char_end": 68708,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp16i4",
        "text": "That show of such an exercise may colour",
        "char_start": 68709,
        "char_end": 68749,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp16i5",
        "text": "Your loneliness. We are oft to blame in this,--",
        "char_start": 68750,
        "char_end": 68797,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp16i6",
        "text": "'Tis too much proved--that with devotion's visage",
        "char_start": 68798,
        "char_end": 68847,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp16i7",
        "text": "And pious action we do sugar o'er",
        "char_start": 68848,
        "char_end": 68881,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp16i8",
        "text": "The devil himself.",
        "char_start": 68882,
        "char_end": 68900,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp17i0",
        "text": "[Aside] O, 'tis too true!",
        "char_start": 68901,
        "char_end": 68926,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp17i1",
        "text": "How smart a lash that speech doth give my conscience!",
        "char_start": 68927,
        "char_end": 68980,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp17i2",
        "text": "The harlot's cheek, beautied with plastering art,",
        "char_start": 68981,
        "char_end": 69030,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp17i3",
        "text": "Is not more ugly to the thing that helps it",
        "char_start": 69031,
        "char_end": 69074,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp17i4",
        "text": "Than is my deed to my most painted word:",
        "char_start": 69075,
        "char_end": 69115,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp17i5",
        "text": "O heavy burthen!",
        "char_start": 69116,
        "char_end": 69132,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp18i0",
        "text": "I hear him coming: let's withdraw, my lord.",
        "char_start": 69133,
        "char_end": 69176,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp18i1",
        "text": "Exeunt KING CLAUDIUS and POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 69177,
        "char_end": 69210,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp18i2",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET",
        "char_start": 69211,
        "char_end": 69223,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i0",
        "text": "To be, or not to be, that is the question,",
        "char_start": 69224,
        "char_end": 69266,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i1",
        "text": "Whether 'tis nobler in the mind to suffer",
        "char_start": 69267,
        "char_end": 69308,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i2",
        "text": "The slings and arrows of outrageous fortune,",
        "char_start": 69309,
        "char_end": 69353,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i3",
        "text": "Or to take arms against a sea of troubles,",
        "char_start": 69354,
        "char_end": 69396,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i4",
        "text": "And by opposing end them? To die: to sleep;",
        "char_start": 69397,
        "char_end": 69440,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i5",
        "text": "No more; and by a sleep to say we end",
        "char_start": 69441,
        "char_end": 69478,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i6",
        "text": "The heart-ache and the thousand natural shocks",
        "char_start": 69479,
        "char_end": 69525,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i7",
        "text": "That flesh is heir to, 'tis a consummation",
        "char_start": 69526,
        "char_end": 69568,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i8",
        "text": "Devoutly to be wish'd. To die, to sleep;",
        "char_start": 69569,
        "char_end": 69609,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i9",
        "text": "To sleep: perchance to dream: ay, there's the rub;",
        "char_start": 69610,
        "char_end": 69660,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i10",
        "text": "For in that sleep of death what dreams may come",
        "char_start": 69661,
        "char_end": 69708,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i11",
        "text": "When we have shuffled off this mortal coil,",
        "char_start": 69709,
        "char_end": 69752,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i12",
        "text": "Must give us pause: there's the respect",
        "char_start": 69753,
        "char_end": 69792,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i13",
        "text": "That makes calamity of so long life;",
        "char_start": 69793,
        "char_end": 69829,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i14",
        "text": "For who would bear the whips and scorns of time,",
        "char_start": 69830,
        "char_end": 69878,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i15",
        "text": "The oppressor's wrong, the proud man's contumely,",
        "char_start": 69879,
        "char_end": 69928,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i16",
        "text": "The pangs of despised love, the law's delay,",
        "char_start": 69929,
        "char_end": 69973,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i17",
        "text": "The insolence of office and the spurns",
        "char_start": 69974,
        "char_end": 70012,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i18",
        "text": "That patient merit of the unworthy takes,",
        "char_start": 70013,
        "char_end": 70054,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i19",
        "text": "When he himself might his quietus make",
        "char_start": 70055,
        "char_end": 70093,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i20",
        "text": "With a bare bodkin? who would fardels bear,",
        "char_start": 70094,
        "char_end": 70137,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i21",
        "text": "To grunt and sweat under a weary life,",
        "char_start": 70138,
        "char_end": 70176,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i22",
        "text": "But that the dread of something after death,",
        "char_start": 70177,
        "char_end": 70221,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i23",
        "text": "The undiscover'd country from whose bourn",
        "char_start": 70222,
        "char_end": 70263,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i24",
        "text": "No traveller returns, puzzles the will",
        "char_start": 70264,
        "char_end": 70302,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i25",
        "text": "And makes us rather bear those ills we have",
        "char_start": 70303,
        "char_end": 70346,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i26",
        "text": "Than fly to others that we know not of?",
        "char_start": 70347,
        "char_end": 70386,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i27",
        "text": "Thus conscience does make cowards of us all;",
        "char_start": 70387,
        "char_end": 70431,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i28",
        "text": "And thus the native hue of resolution",
        "char_start": 70432,
        "char_end": 70469,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i29",
        "text": "Is sicklied o'er with the pale cast of thought,",
        "char_start": 70470,
        "char_end": 70517,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i30",
        "text": "And enterprises of great pith and moment",
        "char_start": 70518,
        "char_end": 70558,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i31",
        "text": "With this regard their currents turn awry,",
        "char_start": 70559,
        "char_end": 70601,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i32",
        "text": "And lose the name of action.--Soft you now!",
        "char_start": 70602,
        "char_end": 70645,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i33",
        "text": "The fair Ophelia! Nymph, in thy orisons",
        "char_start": 70646,
        "char_end": 70685,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp19i34",
        "text": "Be all my sins remember'd.",
        "char_start": 70686,
        "char_end": 70712,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp20i0",
        "text": "Good my lord,",
        "char_start": 70713,
        "char_end": 70726,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp20i1",
        "text": "How does your honour for this many a day?",
        "char_start": 70727,
        "char_end": 70768,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp21i0",
        "text": "I humbly thank you; well, well, well.",
        "char_start": 70769,
        "char_end": 70806,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp22i0",
        "text": "My lord, I have remembrances of yours,",
        "char_start": 70807,
        "char_end": 70845,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp22i1",
        "text": "That I have longed long to re-deliver;",
        "char_start": 70846,
        "char_end": 70884,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp22i2",
        "text": "I pray you, now receive them.",
        "char_start": 70885,
        "char_end": 70914,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp23i0",
        "text": "No, not I;",
        "char_start": 70915,
        "char_end": 70925,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp23i1",
        "text": "I never gave you aught.",
        "char_start": 70926,
        "char_end": 70949,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp24i0",
        "text": "My honour'd lord, you know right well you did;",
        "char_start": 70950,
        "char_end": 70996,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp24i1",
        "text": "And, with them, words of so sweet breath composed",
        "char_start": 70997,
        "char_end": 71046,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp24i2",
        "text": "As made the things more rich: their perfume lost,",
        "char_start": 71047,
        "char_end": 71096,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp24i3",
        "text": "Take these again; for to the noble mind",
        "char_start": 71097,
        "char_end": 71136,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp24i4",
        "text": "Rich gifts wax poor when givers prove unkind.",
        "char_start": 71137,
        "char_end": 71182,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp24i5",
        "text": "There, my lord.",
        "char_start": 71183,
        "char_end": 71198,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp25i0",
        "text": "Ha, ha! are you honest?",
        "char_start": 71199,
        "char_end": 71222,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp26i0",
        "text": "My lord?",
        "char_start": 71223,
        "char_end": 71231,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp27i0",
        "text": "Are you fair?",
        "char_start": 71232,
        "char_end": 71245,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp28i0",
        "text": "What means your lordship?",
        "char_start": 71246,
        "char_end": 71271,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp29i0",
        "text": "That if you be honest and fair, your honesty should",
        "char_start": 71272,
        "char_end": 71323,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp29i1",
        "text": "admit no discourse to your beauty.",
        "char_start": 71324,
        "char_end": 71358,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp30i0",
        "text": "Could beauty, my lord, have better commerce than",
        "char_start": 71359,
        "char_end": 71407,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp30i1",
        "text": "with honesty?",
        "char_start": 71408,
        "char_end": 71421,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp31i0",
        "text": "Ay, truly; for the power of beauty will sooner",
        "char_start": 71422,
        "char_end": 71468,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp31i1",
        "text": "transform honesty from what it is to a bawd than the",
        "char_start": 71469,
        "char_end": 71521,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp31i2",
        "text": "force of honesty can translate beauty into his",
        "char_start": 71522,
        "char_end": 71568,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp31i3",
        "text": "likeness: this was sometime a paradox, but now the",
        "char_start": 71569,
        "char_end": 71619,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp31i4",
        "text": "time gives it proof. I did love you once.",
        "char_start": 71620,
        "char_end": 71661,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp32i0",
        "text": "Indeed, my lord, you made me believe so.",
        "char_start": 71662,
        "char_end": 71702,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp33i0",
        "text": "You should not have believed me; for virtue cannot",
        "char_start": 71703,
        "char_end": 71753,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp33i1",
        "text": "so inoculate our old stock but we shall relish of",
        "char_start": 71754,
        "char_end": 71803,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp33i2",
        "text": "it: I loved you not.",
        "char_start": 71804,
        "char_end": 71824,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp34i0",
        "text": "I was the more deceived.",
        "char_start": 71825,
        "char_end": 71849,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i0",
        "text": "Get thee to a nunnery: why wouldst thou be a",
        "char_start": 71850,
        "char_end": 71894,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i1",
        "text": "breeder of sinners? I am myself indifferent honest;",
        "char_start": 71895,
        "char_end": 71946,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i2",
        "text": "but yet I could accuse me of such things that it",
        "char_start": 71947,
        "char_end": 71995,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i3",
        "text": "were better my mother had not borne me: I am very",
        "char_start": 71996,
        "char_end": 72045,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i4",
        "text": "proud, revengeful, ambitious, with more offences at",
        "char_start": 72046,
        "char_end": 72097,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i5",
        "text": "my beck than I have thoughts to put them in,",
        "char_start": 72098,
        "char_end": 72142,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i6",
        "text": "imagination to give them shape, or time to act them",
        "char_start": 72143,
        "char_end": 72194,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i7",
        "text": "in. What should such fellows as I do crawling",
        "char_start": 72195,
        "char_end": 72240,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i8",
        "text": "between earth and heaven? We are arrant knaves,",
        "char_start": 72241,
        "char_end": 72288,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i9",
        "text": "all; believe none of us. Go thy ways to a nunnery.",
        "char_start": 72289,
        "char_end": 72339,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp35i10",
        "text": "Where's your father?",
        "char_start": 72340,
        "char_end": 72360,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp36i0",
        "text": "At home, my lord.",
        "char_start": 72361,
        "char_end": 72378,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp37i0",
        "text": "Let the doors be shut upon him, that he may play the",
        "char_start": 72379,
        "char_end": 72431,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp37i1",
        "text": "fool no where but in's own house. Farewell.",
        "char_start": 72432,
        "char_end": 72475,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp38i0",
        "text": "O, help him, you sweet heavens!",
        "char_start": 72476,
        "char_end": 72507,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp39i0",
        "text": "If thou dost marry, I'll give thee this plague for",
        "char_start": 72508,
        "char_end": 72558,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp39i1",
        "text": "thy dowry: be thou as chaste as ice, as pure as",
        "char_start": 72559,
        "char_end": 72606,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp39i2",
        "text": "snow, thou shalt not escape calumny. Get thee to a",
        "char_start": 72607,
        "char_end": 72657,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp39i3",
        "text": "nunnery, go: farewell. Or, if thou wilt needs",
        "char_start": 72658,
        "char_end": 72703,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp39i4",
        "text": "marry, marry a fool; for wise men know well enough",
        "char_start": 72704,
        "char_end": 72754,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp39i5",
        "text": "what monsters you make of them. To a nunnery, go,",
        "char_start": 72755,
        "char_end": 72804,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp39i6",
        "text": "and quickly too. Farewell.",
        "char_start": 72805,
        "char_end": 72831,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp40i0",
        "text": "O heavenly powers, restore him!",
        "char_start": 72832,
        "char_end": 72863,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i0",
        "text": "I have heard of your paintings too, well enough; God",
        "char_start": 72864,
        "char_end": 72916,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i1",
        "text": "has given you one face, and you make yourselves",
        "char_start": 72917,
        "char_end": 72964,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i2",
        "text": "another: you jig, you amble, and you lisp, and",
        "char_start": 72965,
        "char_end": 73011,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i3",
        "text": "nick-name God's creatures, and make your wantonness",
        "char_start": 73012,
        "char_end": 73063,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i4",
        "text": "your ignorance. Go to, I'll no more on't; it hath",
        "char_start": 73064,
        "char_end": 73113,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i5",
        "text": "made me mad. I say, we will have no more marriages:",
        "char_start": 73114,
        "char_end": 73165,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i6",
        "text": "those that are married already, all but one, shall",
        "char_start": 73166,
        "char_end": 73216,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i7",
        "text": "live; the rest shall keep as they are. To a",
        "char_start": 73217,
        "char_end": 73260,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i8",
        "text": "nunnery, go.",
        "char_start": 73261,
        "char_end": 73273,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp41i9",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 73274,
        "char_end": 73278,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i0",
        "text": "O, what a noble mind is here o'erthrown!",
        "char_start": 73279,
        "char_end": 73319,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i1",
        "text": "The courtier's, soldier's, scholar's, eye, tongue, sword;",
        "char_start": 73320,
        "char_end": 73377,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i2",
        "text": "The expectancy and rose of the fair state,",
        "char_start": 73378,
        "char_end": 73420,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i3",
        "text": "The glass of fashion and the mould of form,",
        "char_start": 73421,
        "char_end": 73464,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i4",
        "text": "The observed of all observers, quite, quite down!",
        "char_start": 73465,
        "char_end": 73514,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i5",
        "text": "And I, of ladies most deject and wretched,",
        "char_start": 73515,
        "char_end": 73557,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i6",
        "text": "That suck'd the honey of his music vows,",
        "char_start": 73558,
        "char_end": 73598,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i7",
        "text": "Now see that noble and most sovereign reason,",
        "char_start": 73599,
        "char_end": 73644,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i8",
        "text": "Like sweet bells jangled, out of tune and harsh;",
        "char_start": 73645,
        "char_end": 73693,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i9",
        "text": "That unmatch'd form and feature of blown youth",
        "char_start": 73694,
        "char_end": 73740,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i10",
        "text": "Blasted with ecstasy: O, woe is me,",
        "char_start": 73741,
        "char_end": 73776,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i11",
        "text": "To have seen what I have seen, see what I see!",
        "char_start": 73777,
        "char_end": 73823,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp42i12",
        "text": "Re-enter KING CLAUDIUS and POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 73824,
        "char_end": 73859,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i0",
        "text": "Love! his affections do not that way tend;",
        "char_start": 73860,
        "char_end": 73902,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i1",
        "text": "Nor what he spake, though it lack'd form a little,",
        "char_start": 73903,
        "char_end": 73953,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i2",
        "text": "Was not like madness. There's something in his soul,",
        "char_start": 73954,
        "char_end": 74006,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i3",
        "text": "O'er which his melancholy sits on brood;",
        "char_start": 74007,
        "char_end": 74047,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i4",
        "text": "And I do doubt the hatch and the disclose",
        "char_start": 74048,
        "char_end": 74089,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i5",
        "text": "Will be some danger: which for to prevent,",
        "char_start": 74090,
        "char_end": 74132,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i6",
        "text": "I have in quick determination",
        "char_start": 74133,
        "char_end": 74162,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i7",
        "text": "Thus set it down: he shall with speed to England,",
        "char_start": 74163,
        "char_end": 74212,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i8",
        "text": "For the demand of our neglected tribute",
        "char_start": 74213,
        "char_end": 74252,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i9",
        "text": "Haply the seas and countries different",
        "char_start": 74253,
        "char_end": 74291,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i10",
        "text": "With variable objects shall expel",
        "char_start": 74292,
        "char_end": 74325,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i11",
        "text": "This something-settled matter in his heart,",
        "char_start": 74326,
        "char_end": 74369,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i12",
        "text": "Whereon his brains still beating puts him thus",
        "char_start": 74370,
        "char_end": 74416,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp43i13",
        "text": "From fashion of himself. What think you on't?",
        "char_start": 74417,
        "char_end": 74462,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i0",
        "text": "It shall do well: but yet do I believe",
        "char_start": 74463,
        "char_end": 74501,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i1",
        "text": "The origin and commencement of his grief",
        "char_start": 74502,
        "char_end": 74542,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i2",
        "text": "Sprung from neglected love. How now, Ophelia!",
        "char_start": 74543,
        "char_end": 74588,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i3",
        "text": "You need not tell us what Lord Hamlet said;",
        "char_start": 74589,
        "char_end": 74632,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i4",
        "text": "We heard it all. My lord, do as you please;",
        "char_start": 74633,
        "char_end": 74676,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i5",
        "text": "But, if you hold it fit, after the play",
        "char_start": 74677,
        "char_end": 74716,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i6",
        "text": "Let his queen mother all alone entreat him",
        "char_start": 74717,
        "char_end": 74759,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i7",
        "text": "To show his grief: let her be round with him;",
        "char_start": 74760,
        "char_end": 74805,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i8",
        "text": "And I'll be placed, so please you, in the ear",
        "char_start": 74806,
        "char_end": 74851,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i9",
        "text": "Of all their conference. If she find him not,",
        "char_start": 74852,
        "char_end": 74897,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i10",
        "text": "To England send him, or confine him where",
        "char_start": 74898,
        "char_end": 74939,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp44i11",
        "text": "Your wisdom best shall think.",
        "char_start": 74940,
        "char_end": 74969,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp45i0",
        "text": "It shall be so:",
        "char_start": 74970,
        "char_end": 74985,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp45i1",
        "text": "Madness in great ones must not unwatch'd go.",
        "char_start": 74986,
        "char_end": 75030,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "3.1.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s1:sp45i2",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 75031,
        "char_end": 75037,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:open",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET and Players",
        "char_start": 75038,
        "char_end": 75062,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i0",
        "text": "Speak the speech, I pray you, as I pronounced it to",
        "char_start": 75063,
        "char_end": 75114,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i1",
        "text": "you, trippingly on the tongue: but if you mouth it,",
        "char_start": 75115,
        "char_end": 75166,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i2",
        "text": "as many of your players do, I had as lief the",
        "char_start": 75167,
        "char_end": 75212,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i3",
        "text": "town-crier spoke my lines. Nor do not saw the air",
        "char_start": 75213,
        "char_end": 75262,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i4",
        "text": "too much with your hand, thus, but use all gently;",
        "char_start": 75263,
        "char_end": 75313,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i5",
        "text": "for in the very torrent, tempest, and, as I may say,",
        "char_start": 75314,
        "char_end": 75366,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i6",
        "text": "the whirlwind of passion, you must acquire and beget",
        "char_start": 75367,
        "char_end": 75419,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i7",
        "text": "a temperance that may give it smoothness. O, it",
        "char_start": 75420,
        "char_end": 75467,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i8",
        "text": "offends me to the soul to hear a robustious",
        "char_start": 75468,
        "char_end": 75511,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i9",
        "text": "periwig-pated fellow tear a passion to tatters, to",
        "char_start": 75512,
        "char_end": 75562,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i10",
        "text": "very rags, to split the ears of the groundlings, who",
        "char_start": 75563,
        "char_end": 75615,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i11",
        "text": "for the most part are capable of nothing but",
        "char_start": 75616,
        "char_end": 75660,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i12",
        "text": "inexplicable dumbshows and noise: I would have such",
        "char_start": 75661,
        "char_end": 75712,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i13",
        "text": "a fellow whipped for o'erdoing Termagant; it",
        "char_start": 75713,
        "char_end": 75757,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp1i14",
        "text": "out-herods Herod: pray you, avoid it.",
        "char_start": 75758,
        "char_end": 75795,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp2i0",
        "text": "I warrant your honour.",
        "char_start": 75796,
        "char_end": 75818,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i0",
        "text": "Be not too tame neither, but let your own discretion",
        "char_start": 75819,
        "char_end": 75871,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i1",
        "text": "be your tutor: suit the action to the word, the",
        "char_start": 75872,
        "char_end": 75919,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i2",
        "text": "word to the action; with this special o'erstep not",
        "char_start": 75920,
        "char_end": 75970,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i3",
        "text": "the modesty of nature: for any thing so overdone is",
        "char_start": 75971,
        "char_end": 76022,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i4",
        "text": "from the purpose of playing, whose end, both at the",
        "char_start": 76023,
        "char_end": 76074,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i5",
        "text": "first and now, was and is, to hold, as 'twere, the",
        "char_start": 76075,
        "char_end": 76125,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i6",
        "text": "mirror up to nature; to show virtue her own feature,",
        "char_start": 76126,
        "char_end": 76178,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i7",
        "text": "scorn her own image, and the very age and body of",
        "char_start": 76179,
        "char_end": 76228,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i8",
        "text": "the time his form and pressure. Now this overdone,",
        "char_start": 76229,
        "char_end": 76279,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i9",
        "text": "or come tardy off, though it make the unskilful",
        "char_start": 76280,
        "char_end": 76327,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i10",
        "text": "laugh, cannot but make the judicious grieve; the",
        "char_start": 76328,
        "char_end": 76376,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i11",
        "text": "censure of the which one must in your allowance",
        "char_start": 76377,
        "char_end": 76424,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i12",
        "text": "o'erweigh a whole theatre of others. O, there be",
        "char_start": 76425,
        "char_end": 76473,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i13",
        "text": "players that I have seen play, and heard others",
        "char_start": 76474,
        "char_end": 76521,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i14",
        "text": "praise, and that highly, not to speak it profanely,",
        "char_start": 76522,
        "char_end": 76573,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i15",
        "text": "that, neither having the accent of Christians nor",
        "char_start": 76574,
        "char_end": 76623,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i16",
        "text": "the gait of Christian, pagan, nor man, have so",
        "char_start": 76624,
        "char_end": 76670,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i17",
        "text": "strutted and bellowed that I have thought some of",
        "char_start": 76671,
        "char_end": 76720,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i18",
        "text": "nature's journeymen had made men and not made them",
        "char_start": 76721,
        "char_end": 76771,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp3i19",
        "text": "well, they imitated humanity so abominably.",
        "char_start": 76772,
        "char_end": 76815,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp4i0",
        "text": "I hope we have reformed that indifferently with us,",
        "char_start": 76816,
        "char_end": 76867,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp4i1",
        "text": "sir.",
        "char_start": 76868,
        "char_end": 76872,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Player"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i0",
        "text": "O, reform it altogether. And let those that play",
        "char_start": 76873,
        "char_end": 76921,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i1",
        "text": "your clowns speak no more than is set down for them;",
        "char_start": 76922,
        "char_end": 76974,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i2",
        "text": "for there be of them that will themselves laugh, to",
        "char_start": 76975,
        "char_end": 77026,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i3",
        "text": "set on some quantity of barren spectators to laugh",
        "char_start": 77027,
        "char_end": 77077,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i4",
        "text": "too; though, in the mean time, some necessary",
        "char_start": 77078,
        "char_end": 77123,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i5",
        "text": "question of the play be then to be considered:",
        "char_start": 77124,
        "char_end": 77170,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i6",
        "text": "that's villanous, and shows a most pitiful ambition",
        "char_start": 77171,
        "char_end": 77222,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i7",
        "text": "in the fool that uses it. Go, make you ready.",
        "char_start": 77223,
        "char_end": 77268,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i8",
        "text": "Exeunt Players",
        "char_start": 77269,
        "char_end": 77283,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i9",
        "text": "Enter POLONIUS, ROSENCRANTZ, and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 77284,
        "char_end": 77329,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp5i10",
        "text": "How now, my lord! I will the king hear this piece of work?",
        "char_start": 77330,
        "char_end": 77388,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp6i0",
        "text": "And the queen too, and that presently.",
        "char_start": 77389,
        "char_end": 77427,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp7i0",
        "text": "Bid the players make haste.",
        "char_start": 77428,
        "char_end": 77455,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp7i1",
        "text": "Exit POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 77456,
        "char_end": 77469,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp7i2",
        "text": "Will you two help to hasten them?",
        "char_start": 77470,
        "char_end": 77503,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp8i0",
        "text": "We will, my lord.",
        "char_start": 77504,
        "char_end": 77521,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp8i1",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 77522,
        "char_end": 77557,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp9i0",
        "text": "We will, my lord.",
        "char_start": 77558,
        "char_end": 77575,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp9i1",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 77576,
        "char_end": 77611,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp10i0",
        "text": "What ho! Horatio!",
        "char_start": 77612,
        "char_end": 77629,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp10i1",
        "text": "Enter HORATIO",
        "char_start": 77630,
        "char_end": 77643,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp11i0",
        "text": "Here, sweet lord, at your service.",
        "char_start": 77644,
        "char_end": 77678,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp12i0",
        "text": "Horatio, thou art e'en as just a man",
        "char_start": 77679,
        "char_end": 77715,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp12i1",
        "text": "As e'er my conversation coped withal.",
        "char_start": 77716,
        "char_end": 77753,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp13i0",
        "text": "O, my dear lord,--",
        "char_start": 77754,
        "char_end": 77772,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i0",
        "text": "Nay, do not think I flatter;",
        "char_start": 77773,
        "char_end": 77801,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i1",
        "text": "For what advancement may I hope from thee",
        "char_start": 77802,
        "char_end": 77843,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i2",
        "text": "That no revenue hast but thy good spirits,",
        "char_start": 77844,
        "char_end": 77886,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i3",
        "text": "To feed and clothe thee? Why should the poor be flatter'd?",
        "char_start": 77887,
        "char_end": 77945,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i4",
        "text": "No, let the candied tongue lick absurd pomp,",
        "char_start": 77946,
        "char_end": 77990,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i5",
        "text": "And crook the pregnant hinges of the knee",
        "char_start": 77991,
        "char_end": 78032,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i6",
        "text": "Where thrift may follow fawning. Dost thou hear?",
        "char_start": 78033,
        "char_end": 78081,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i7",
        "text": "Since my dear soul was mistress of her choice",
        "char_start": 78082,
        "char_end": 78127,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i8",
        "text": "And could of men distinguish, her election",
        "char_start": 78128,
        "char_end": 78170,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i9",
        "text": "Hath seal'd thee for herself; for thou hast been",
        "char_start": 78171,
        "char_end": 78219,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i10",
        "text": "As one, in suffering all, that suffers nothing,",
        "char_start": 78220,
        "char_end": 78267,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i11",
        "text": "A man that fortune's buffets and rewards",
        "char_start": 78268,
        "char_end": 78308,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i12",
        "text": "Hast ta'en with equal thanks: and blest are those",
        "char_start": 78309,
        "char_end": 78358,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i13",
        "text": "Whose blood and judgment are so well commingled,",
        "char_start": 78359,
        "char_end": 78407,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i14",
        "text": "That they are not a pipe for fortune's finger",
        "char_start": 78408,
        "char_end": 78453,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i15",
        "text": "To sound what stop she please. Give me that man",
        "char_start": 78454,
        "char_end": 78501,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i16",
        "text": "That is not passion's slave, and I will wear him",
        "char_start": 78502,
        "char_end": 78550,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i17",
        "text": "In my heart's core, ay, in my heart of heart,",
        "char_start": 78551,
        "char_end": 78596,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i18",
        "text": "As I do thee.--Something too much of this.--",
        "char_start": 78597,
        "char_end": 78641,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i19",
        "text": "There is a play to-night before the king;",
        "char_start": 78642,
        "char_end": 78683,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i20",
        "text": "One scene of it comes near the circumstance",
        "char_start": 78684,
        "char_end": 78727,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i21",
        "text": "Which I have told thee of my father's death:",
        "char_start": 78728,
        "char_end": 78772,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i22",
        "text": "I prithee, when thou seest that act afoot,",
        "char_start": 78773,
        "char_end": 78815,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i23",
        "text": "Even with the very comment of thy soul",
        "char_start": 78816,
        "char_end": 78854,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i24",
        "text": "Observe mine uncle: if his occulted guilt",
        "char_start": 78855,
        "char_end": 78896,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i25",
        "text": "Do not itself unkennel in one speech,",
        "char_start": 78897,
        "char_end": 78934,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i26",
        "text": "It is a damned ghost that we have seen,",
        "char_start": 78935,
        "char_end": 78974,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i27",
        "text": "And my imaginations are as foul",
        "char_start": 78975,
        "char_end": 79006,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i28",
        "text": "As Vulcan's stithy. Give him heedful note;",
        "char_start": 79007,
        "char_end": 79049,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i29",
        "text": "For I mine eyes will rivet to his face,",
        "char_start": 79050,
        "char_end": 79089,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i30",
        "text": "And after we will both our judgments join",
        "char_start": 79090,
        "char_end": 79131,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp14i31",
        "text": "In censure of his seeming.",
        "char_start": 79132,
        "char_end": 79158,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp15i0",
        "text": "Well, my lord:",
        "char_start": 79159,
        "char_end": 79173,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp15i1",
        "text": "If he steal aught the whilst this play is playing,",
        "char_start": 79174,
        "char_end": 79224,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp15i2",
        "text": "And 'scape detecting, I will pay the theft.",
        "char_start": 79225,
        "char_end": 79268,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp16i0",
        "text": "They are coming to the play; I must be idle:",
        "char_start": 79269,
        "char_end": 79313,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp16i1",
        "text": "Get you a place.",
        "char_start": 79314,
        "char_end": 79330,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp16i2",
        "text": "Danish march. A flourish. Enter KING CLAUDIUS, QUEEN GERTRUDE, POLONIUS, OPHELIA, ROSENCRANTZ, GUILDENSTERN, and others",
        "char_start": 79331,
        "char_end": 79450,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp17i0",
        "text": "How fares our cousin Hamlet?",
        "char_start": 79451,
        "char_end": 79479,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp18i0",
        "text": "Excellent, i' faith; of the chameleon's dish: I eat",
        "char_start": 79480,
        "char_end": 79531,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp18i1",
        "text": "the air, promise-crammed: you cannot feed capons so.",
        "char_start": 79532,
        "char_end": 79584,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp19i0",
        "text": "I have nothing with this answer, Hamlet; these words",
        "char_start": 79585,
        "char_end": 79637,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp19i1",
        "text": "are not mine.",
        "char_start": 79638,
        "char_end": 79651,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp20i0",
        "text": "No, nor mine now.",
        "char_start": 79652,
        "char_end": 79669,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp20i1",
        "text": "To POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 79670,
        "char_end": 79681,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp20i2",
        "text": "My lord, you played once i' the university, you say?",
        "char_start": 79682,
        "char_end": 79734,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp21i0",
        "text": "That did I, my lord; and was accounted a good actor.",
        "char_start": 79735,
        "char_end": 79787,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp22i0",
        "text": "What did you enact?",
        "char_start": 79788,
        "char_end": 79807,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp23i0",
        "text": "I did enact Julius Caesar: I was killed i' the",
        "char_start": 79808,
        "char_end": 79854,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp23i1",
        "text": "Capitol; Brutus killed me.",
        "char_start": 79855,
        "char_end": 79881,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp24i0",
        "text": "It was a brute part of him to kill so capital a calf",
        "char_start": 79882,
        "char_end": 79934,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp24i1",
        "text": "there. Be the players ready?",
        "char_start": 79935,
        "char_end": 79963,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp25i0",
        "text": "Ay, my lord; they stay upon your patience.",
        "char_start": 79964,
        "char_end": 80006,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp26i0",
        "text": "Come hither, my dear Hamlet, sit by me.",
        "char_start": 80007,
        "char_end": 80046,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp27i0",
        "text": "No, good mother, here's metal more attractive.",
        "char_start": 80047,
        "char_end": 80093,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp28i0",
        "text": "[To KING CLAUDIUS] O, ho! do you mark that?",
        "char_start": 80094,
        "char_end": 80137,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp29i0",
        "text": "Lady, shall I lie in your lap?",
        "char_start": 80138,
        "char_end": 80168,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp29i1",
        "text": "Lying down at OPHELIA's feet",
        "char_start": 80169,
        "char_end": 80197,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp30i0",
        "text": "No, my lord.",
        "char_start": 80198,
        "char_end": 80210,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp31i0",
        "text": "I mean, my head upon your lap?",
        "char_start": 80211,
        "char_end": 80241,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp32i0",
        "text": "Ay, my lord.",
        "char_start": 80242,
        "char_end": 80254,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp33i0",
        "text": "Do you think I meant country matters?",
        "char_start": 80255,
        "char_end": 80292,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp34i0",
        "text": "I think nothing, my lord.",
        "char_start": 80293,
        "char_end": 80318,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp35i0",
        "text": "That's a fair thought to lie between maids' legs.",
        "char_start": 80319,
        "char_end": 80368,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp36i0",
        "text": "What is, my lord?",
        "char_start": 80369,
        "char_end": 80386,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp37i0",
        "text": "Nothing.",
        "char_start": 80387,
        "char_end": 80395,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp38i0",
        "text": "You are merry, my lord.",
        "char_start": 80396,
        "char_end": 80419,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp39i0",
        "text": "Who, I?",
        "char_start": 80420,
        "char_end": 80427,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp40i0",
        "text": "Ay, my lord.",
        "char_start": 80428,
        "char_end": 80440,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp41i0",
        "text": "O God, your only jig-maker. What should a man do",
        "char_start": 80441,
        "char_end": 80489,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp41i1",
        "text": "but be merry? for, look you, how cheerfully my",
        "char_start": 80490,
        "char_end": 80536,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp41i2",
        "text": "mother looks, and my father died within these two hours.",
        "char_start": 80537,
        "char_end": 80593,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp42i0",
        "text": "Nay, 'tis twice two months, my lord.",
        "char_start": 80594,
        "char_end": 80630,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i0",
        "text": "So long? Nay then, let the devil wear black, for",
        "char_start": 80631,
        "char_end": 80679,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i1",
        "text": "I'll have a suit of sables. O heavens! die two",
        "char_start": 80680,
        "char_end": 80726,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i2",
        "text": "months ago, and not forgotten yet? Then there's",
        "char_start": 80727,
        "char_end": 80774,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i3",
        "text": "hope a great man's memory may outlive his life half",
        "char_start": 80775,
        "char_end": 80826,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i4",
        "text": "a year: but, by'r lady, he must build churches,",
        "char_start": 80827,
        "char_end": 80874,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i5",
        "text": "then; or else shall he suffer not thinking on, with",
        "char_start": 80875,
        "char_end": 80926,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i6",
        "text": "the hobby-horse, whose epitaph is 'For, O, for, O,",
        "char_start": 80927,
        "char_end": 80977,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i7",
        "text": "the hobby-horse is forgot.'",
        "char_start": 80978,
        "char_end": 81005,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i8",
        "text": "Hautboys play. The dumb-show enters",
        "char_start": 81006,
        "char_end": 81041,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i9",
        "text": "Enter a King and a Queen very lovingly; the Queen embracing him, and he her. She kneels, and makes show of protestation unto him. He takes her up, and declines his head upon her neck: lays him down upon a bank of flowers: she, seeing him asleep, leaves him. Anon comes in a fellow, takes off his crown, kisses it, and pours poison in the King's ears, and exit. The Queen returns; finds the King dead, and makes passionate action. The Poisoner, with some two or three Mutes, comes in again, seeming to lament with her. The dead body is carried away. The Poisoner wooes the Queen with gifts: she seems loath and unwilling awhile, but in the end accepts his love",
        "char_start": 81042,
        "char_end": 81701,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp43i10",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 81702,
        "char_end": 81708,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp44i0",
        "text": "What means this, my lord?",
        "char_start": 81709,
        "char_end": 81734,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp45i0",
        "text": "Marry, this is miching mallecho; it means mischief.",
        "char_start": 81735,
        "char_end": 81786,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp46i0",
        "text": "Belike this show imports the argument of the play.",
        "char_start": 81787,
        "char_end": 81837,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp46i1",
        "text": "Enter Prologue",
        "char_start": 81838,
        "char_end": 81852,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp47i0",
        "text": "We shall know by this fellow: the players cannot",
        "char_start": 81853,
        "char_end": 81901,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp47i1",
        "text": "keep counsel; they'll tell all.",
        "char_start": 81902,
        "char_end": 81933,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp48i0",
        "text": "Will he tell us what this show meant?",
        "char_start": 81934,
        "char_end": 81971,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp49i0",
        "text": "Ay, or any show that you'll show him: be not you",
        "char_start": 81972,
        "char_end": 82020,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp49i1",
        "text": "ashamed to show, he'll not shame to tell you what it means.",
        "char_start": 82021,
        "char_end": 82080,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp50i0",
        "text": "You are naught, you are naught: I'll mark the play.",
        "char_start": 82081,
        "char_end": 82132,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp51i0",
        "text": "For us, and for our tragedy,",
        "char_start": 82133,
        "char_end": 82161,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Prologue"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp51i1",
        "text": "Here stooping to your clemency,",
        "char_start": 82162,
        "char_end": 82193,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Prologue"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp51i2",
        "text": "We beg your hearing patiently.",
        "char_start": 82194,
        "char_end": 82224,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Prologue"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp51i3",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 82225,
        "char_end": 82229,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "Prologue"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp52i0",
        "text": "Is this a prologue, or the posy of a ring?",
        "char_start": 82230,
        "char_end": 82272,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp53i0",
        "text": "'Tis brief, my lord.",
        "char_start": 82273,
        "char_end": 82293,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp54i0",
        "text": "As woman's love.",
        "char_start": 82294,
        "char_end": 82310,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp54i1",
        "text": "Enter two Players, King and Queen",
        "char_start": 82311,
        "char_end": 82344,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp55i0",
        "text": "Full thirty times hath Phoebus' cart gone round",
        "char_start": 82345,
        "char_end": 82392,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp55i1",
        "text": "Neptune's salt wash and Tellus' orbed ground,",
        "char_start": 82393,
        "char_end": 82438,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp55i2",
        "text": "And thirty dozen moons with borrow'd sheen",
        "char_start": 82439,
        "char_end": 82481,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp55i3",
        "text": "About the world have times twelve thirties been,",
        "char_start": 82482,
        "char_end": 82530,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp55i4",
        "text": "Since love our hearts and Hymen did our hands",
        "char_start": 82531,
        "char_end": 82576,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp55i5",
        "text": "Unite commutual in most sacred bands.",
        "char_start": 82577,
        "char_end": 82614,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i0",
        "text": "So many journeys may the sun and moon",
        "char_start": 82615,
        "char_end": 82652,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i1",
        "text": "Make us again count o'er ere love be done!",
        "char_start": 82653,
        "char_end": 82695,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i2",
        "text": "But, woe is me, you are so sick of late,",
        "char_start": 82696,
        "char_end": 82736,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i3",
        "text": "So far from cheer and from your former state,",
        "char_start": 82737,
        "char_end": 82782,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i4",
        "text": "That I distrust you. Yet, though I distrust,",
        "char_start": 82783,
        "char_end": 82827,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i5",
        "text": "Discomfort you, my lord, it nothing must:",
        "char_start": 82828,
        "char_end": 82869,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i6",
        "text": "For women's fear and love holds quantity;",
        "char_start": 82870,
        "char_end": 82911,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i7",
        "text": "In neither aught, or in extremity.",
        "char_start": 82912,
        "char_end": 82946,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i8",
        "text": "Now, what my love is, proof hath made you know;",
        "char_start": 82947,
        "char_end": 82994,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i9",
        "text": "And as my love is sized, my fear is so:",
        "char_start": 82995,
        "char_end": 83034,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i10",
        "text": "Where love is great, the littlest doubts are fear;",
        "char_start": 83035,
        "char_end": 83085,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp56i11",
        "text": "Where little fears grow great, great love grows there.",
        "char_start": 83086,
        "char_end": 83140,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp57i0",
        "text": "'Faith, I must leave thee, love, and shortly too;",
        "char_start": 83141,
        "char_end": 83190,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp57i1",
        "text": "My operant powers their functions leave to do:",
        "char_start": 83191,
        "char_end": 83237,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp57i2",
        "text": "And thou shalt live in this fair world behind,",
        "char_start": 83238,
        "char_end": 83284,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp57i3",
        "text": "Honour'd, beloved; and haply one as kind",
        "char_start": 83285,
        "char_end": 83325,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp57i4",
        "text": "For husband shalt thou--",
        "char_start": 83326,
        "char_end": 83350,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp58i0",
        "text": "O, confound the rest!",
        "char_start": 83351,
        "char_end": 83372,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp58i1",
        "text": "Such love must needs be treason in my breast:",
        "char_start": 83373,
        "char_end": 83418,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp58i2",
        "text": "In second husband let me be accurst!",
        "char_start": 83419,
        "char_end": 83455,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp58i3",
        "text": "None wed the second but who kill'd the first.",
        "char_start": 83456,
        "char_end": 83501,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp59i0",
        "text": "[Aside] Wormwood, wormwood.",
        "char_start": 83502,
        "char_end": 83529,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp60i0",
        "text": "The instances that second marriage move",
        "char_start": 83530,
        "char_end": 83569,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp60i1",
        "text": "Are base respects of thrift, but none of love:",
        "char_start": 83570,
        "char_end": 83616,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp60i2",
        "text": "A second time I kill my husband dead,",
        "char_start": 83617,
        "char_end": 83654,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp60i3",
        "text": "When second husband kisses me in bed.",
        "char_start": 83655,
        "char_end": 83692,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i0",
        "text": "I do believe you think what now you speak;",
        "char_start": 83693,
        "char_end": 83735,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i1",
        "text": "But what we do determine oft we break.",
        "char_start": 83736,
        "char_end": 83774,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i2",
        "text": "Purpose is but the slave to memory,",
        "char_start": 83775,
        "char_end": 83810,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i3",
        "text": "Of violent birth, but poor validity;",
        "char_start": 83811,
        "char_end": 83847,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i4",
        "text": "Which now, like fruit unripe, sticks on the tree;",
        "char_start": 83848,
        "char_end": 83897,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i5",
        "text": "But fall, unshaken, when they mellow be.",
        "char_start": 83898,
        "char_end": 83938,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i6",
        "text": "Most necessary 'tis that we forget",
        "char_start": 83939,
        "char_end": 83973,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i7",
        "text": "To pay ourselves what to ourselves is debt:",
        "char_start": 83974,
        "char_end": 84017,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i8",
        "text": "What to ourselves in passion we propose,",
        "char_start": 84018,
        "char_end": 84058,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i9",
        "text": "The passion ending, doth the purpose lose.",
        "char_start": 84059,
        "char_end": 84101,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i10",
        "text": "The violence of either grief or joy",
        "char_start": 84102,
        "char_end": 84137,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i11",
        "text": "Their own enactures with themselves destroy:",
        "char_start": 84138,
        "char_end": 84182,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i12",
        "text": "Where joy most revels, grief doth most lament;",
        "char_start": 84183,
        "char_end": 84229,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i13",
        "text": "Grief joys, joy grieves, on slender accident.",
        "char_start": 84230,
        "char_end": 84275,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i14",
        "text": "This world is not for aye, nor 'tis not strange",
        "char_start": 84276,
        "char_end": 84323,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i15",
        "text": "That even our loves should with our fortunes change;",
        "char_start": 84324,
        "char_end": 84376,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i16",
        "text": "For 'tis a question left us yet to prove,",
        "char_start": 84377,
        "char_end": 84418,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i17",
        "text": "Whether love lead fortune, or else fortune love.",
        "char_start": 84419,
        "char_end": 84467,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i18",
        "text": "The great man down, you mark his favourite flies;",
        "char_start": 84468,
        "char_end": 84517,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i19",
        "text": "The poor advanced makes friends of enemies.",
        "char_start": 84518,
        "char_end": 84561,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i20",
        "text": "And hitherto doth love on fortune tend;",
        "char_start": 84562,
        "char_end": 84601,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i21",
        "text": "For who not needs shall never lack a friend,",
        "char_start": 84602,
        "char_end": 84646,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.203",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i22",
        "text": "And who in want a hollow friend doth try,",
        "char_start": 84647,
        "char_end": 84688,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.204",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i23",
        "text": "Directly seasons him his enemy.",
        "char_start": 84689,
        "char_end": 84720,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.205",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i24",
        "text": "But, orderly to end where I begun,",
        "char_start": 84721,
        "char_end": 84755,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.206",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i25",
        "text": "Our wills and fates do so contrary run",
        "char_start": 84756,
        "char_end": 84794,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.207",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i26",
        "text": "That our devices still are overthrown;",
        "char_start": 84795,
        "char_end": 84833,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.208",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i27",
        "text": "Our thoughts are ours, their ends none of our own:",
        "char_start": 84834,
        "char_end": 84884,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.209",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i28",
        "text": "So think thou wilt no second husband wed;",
        "char_start": 84885,
        "char_end": 84926,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.210",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp61i29",
        "text": "But die thy thoughts when thy first lord is dead.",
        "char_start": 84927,
        "char_end": 84976,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.211",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp62i0",
        "text": "Nor earth to me give food, nor heaven light!",
        "char_start": 84977,
        "char_end": 85021,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.212",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp62i1",
        "text": "Sport and repose lock from me day and night!",
        "char_start": 85022,
        "char_end": 85066,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.213",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp62i2",
        "text": "To desperation turn my trust and hope!",
        "char_start": 85067,
        "char_end": 85105,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.214",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp62i3",
        "text": "An anchor's cheer in prison be my scope!",
        "char_start": 85106,
        "char_end": 85146,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.215",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp62i4",
        "text": "Each opposite that blanks the face of joy",
        "char_start": 85147,
        "char_end": 85188,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.216",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp62i5",
        "text": "Meet what I would have well and it destroy!",
        "char_start": 85189,
        "char_end": 85232,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.217",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp62i6",
        "text": "Both here and hence pursue me lasting strife,",
        "char_start": 85233,
        "char_end": 85278,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.218",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp62i7",
        "text": "If, once a widow, ever I be wife!",
        "char_start": 85279,
        "char_end": 85312,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.219",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp63i0",
        "text": "If she should break it now!",
        "char_start": 85313,
        "char_end": 85340,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.220",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp64i0",
        "text": "'Tis deeply sworn. Sweet, leave me here awhile;",
        "char_start": 85341,
        "char_end": 85388,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.221",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp64i1",
        "text": "My spirits grow dull, and fain I would beguile",
        "char_start": 85389,
        "char_end": 85435,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.222",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp64i2",
        "text": "The tedious day with sleep.",
        "char_start": 85436,
        "char_end": 85463,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.223",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp64i3",
        "text": "Sleeps",
        "char_start": 85464,
        "char_end": 85470,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "Player King"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp65i0",
        "text": "Sleep rock thy brain,",
        "char_start": 85471,
        "char_end": 85492,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.224",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp65i1",
        "text": "And never come mischance between us twain!",
        "char_start": 85493,
        "char_end": 85535,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.225",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp65i2",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 85536,
        "char_end": 85540,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "Player Queen"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp66i0",
        "text": "Madam, how like you this play?",
        "char_start": 85541,
        "char_end": 85571,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.226",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp67i0",
        "text": "The lady protests too much, methinks.",
        "char_start": 85572,
        "char_end": 85609,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.227",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp68i0",
        "text": "O, but she'll keep her word.",
        "char_start": 85610,
        "char_end": 85638,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.228",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp69i0",
        "text": "Have you heard the argument? Is there no offence in 't?",
        "char_start": 85639,
        "char_end": 85694,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.229",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp70i0",
        "text": "No, no, they do but jest, poison in jest; no offence",
        "char_start": 85695,
        "char_end": 85747,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.230",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp70i1",
        "text": "i' the world.",
        "char_start": 85748,
        "char_end": 85761,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.231",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp71i0",
        "text": "What do you call the play?",
        "char_start": 85762,
        "char_end": 85788,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.232",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp72i0",
        "text": "The Mouse-trap. Marry, how? Tropically. This play",
        "char_start": 85789,
        "char_end": 85838,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.233",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp72i1",
        "text": "is the image of a murder done in Vienna: Gonzago is",
        "char_start": 85839,
        "char_end": 85890,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.234",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp72i2",
        "text": "the duke's name; his wife, Baptista: you shall see",
        "char_start": 85891,
        "char_end": 85941,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.235",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp72i3",
        "text": "anon; 'tis a knavish piece of work: but what o'",
        "char_start": 85942,
        "char_end": 85989,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.236",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp72i4",
        "text": "that? your majesty and we that have free souls, it",
        "char_start": 85990,
        "char_end": 86040,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.237",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp72i5",
        "text": "touches us not: let the galled jade wince, our",
        "char_start": 86041,
        "char_end": 86087,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.238",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp72i6",
        "text": "withers are unwrung.",
        "char_start": 86088,
        "char_end": 86108,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.239",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp72i7",
        "text": "Enter LUCIANUS",
        "char_start": 86109,
        "char_end": 86123,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp72i8",
        "text": "This is one Lucianus, nephew to the king.",
        "char_start": 86124,
        "char_end": 86165,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.240",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp73i0",
        "text": "You are as good as a chorus, my lord.",
        "char_start": 86166,
        "char_end": 86203,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.241",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp74i0",
        "text": "I could interpret between you and your love, if I",
        "char_start": 86204,
        "char_end": 86253,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.242",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp74i1",
        "text": "could see the puppets dallying.",
        "char_start": 86254,
        "char_end": 86285,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.243",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp75i0",
        "text": "You are keen, my lord, you are keen.",
        "char_start": 86286,
        "char_end": 86322,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.244",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp76i0",
        "text": "It would cost you a groaning to take off my edge.",
        "char_start": 86323,
        "char_end": 86372,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.245",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp77i0",
        "text": "Still better, and worse.",
        "char_start": 86373,
        "char_end": 86397,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.246",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp78i0",
        "text": "So you must take your husbands. Begin, murderer;",
        "char_start": 86398,
        "char_end": 86446,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.247",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp78i1",
        "text": "pox, leave thy damnable faces, and begin. Come:",
        "char_start": 86447,
        "char_end": 86494,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.248",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp78i2",
        "text": "'the croaking raven doth bellow for revenge.'",
        "char_start": 86495,
        "char_end": 86540,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.249",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp79i0",
        "text": "Thoughts black, hands apt, drugs fit, and time agreeing;",
        "char_start": 86541,
        "char_end": 86597,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.250",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LUCIANUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp79i1",
        "text": "Confederate season, else no creature seeing;",
        "char_start": 86598,
        "char_end": 86642,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.251",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LUCIANUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp79i2",
        "text": "Thou mixture rank, of midnight weeds collected,",
        "char_start": 86643,
        "char_end": 86690,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.252",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LUCIANUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp79i3",
        "text": "With Hecate's ban thrice blasted, thrice infected,",
        "char_start": 86691,
        "char_end": 86741,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.253",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LUCIANUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp79i4",
        "text": "Thy natural magic and dire property,",
        "char_start": 86742,
        "char_end": 86778,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.254",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LUCIANUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp79i5",
        "text": "On wholesome life usurp immediately.",
        "char_start": 86779,
        "char_end": 86815,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.255",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LUCIANUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp79i6",
        "text": "Pours the poison into the sleeper's ears",
        "char_start": 86816,
        "char_end": 86856,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LUCIANUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp80i0",
        "text": "He poisons him i' the garden for's estate. His",
        "char_start": 86857,
        "char_end": 86903,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.256",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp80i1",
        "text": "name's Gonzago: the story is extant, and writ in",
        "char_start": 86904,
        "char_end": 86952,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.257",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp80i2",
        "text": "choice Italian: you shall see anon how the murderer",
        "char_start": 86953,
        "char_end": 87004,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.258",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp80i3",
        "text": "gets the love of Gonzago's wife.",
        "char_start": 87005,
        "char_end": 87037,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.259",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp81i0",
        "text": "The king rises.",
        "char_start": 87038,
        "char_end": 87053,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.260",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp82i0",
        "text": "What, frighted with false fire!",
        "char_start": 87054,
        "char_end": 87085,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.261",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp83i0",
        "text": "How fares my lord?",
        "char_start": 87086,
        "char_end": 87104,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.262",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp84i0",
        "text": "Give o'er the play.",
        "char_start": 87105,
        "char_end": 87124,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.263",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp85i0",
        "text": "Give me some light: away!",
        "char_start": 87125,
        "char_end": 87150,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.264",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp86i0",
        "text": "Lights, lights, lights!",
        "char_start": 87151,
        "char_end": 87174,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.265",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "All"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp86i1",
        "text": "Exeunt all but HAMLET and HORATIO",
        "char_start": 87175,
        "char_end": 87208,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "All"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp87i0",
        "text": "Why, let the stricken deer go weep,",
        "char_start": 87209,
        "char_end": 87244,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.266",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp87i1",
        "text": "The hart ungalled play;",
        "char_start": 87245,
        "char_end": 87268,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.267",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp87i2",
        "text": "For some must watch, while some must sleep:",
        "char_start": 87269,
        "char_end": 87312,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.268",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp87i3",
        "text": "So runs the world away.",
        "char_start": 87313,
        "char_end": 87336,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.269",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp87i4",
        "text": "Would not this, sir, and a forest of feathers-- if",
        "char_start": 87337,
        "char_end": 87387,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.270",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp87i5",
        "text": "the rest of my fortunes turn Turk with me--with two",
        "char_start": 87388,
        "char_end": 87439,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.271",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp87i6",
        "text": "Provincial roses on my razed shoes, get me a",
        "char_start": 87440,
        "char_end": 87484,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.272",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp87i7",
        "text": "fellowship in a cry of players, sir?",
        "char_start": 87485,
        "char_end": 87521,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.273",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp88i0",
        "text": "Half a share.",
        "char_start": 87522,
        "char_end": 87535,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.274",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp89i0",
        "text": "A whole one, I.",
        "char_start": 87536,
        "char_end": 87551,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.275",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp89i1",
        "text": "For thou dost know, O Damon dear,",
        "char_start": 87552,
        "char_end": 87585,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.276",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp89i2",
        "text": "This realm dismantled was",
        "char_start": 87586,
        "char_end": 87611,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.277",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp89i3",
        "text": "Of Jove himself; and now reigns here",
        "char_start": 87612,
        "char_end": 87648,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.278",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp89i4",
        "text": "A very, very--pajock.",
        "char_start": 87649,
        "char_end": 87670,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.279",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp90i0",
        "text": "You might have rhymed.",
        "char_start": 87671,
        "char_end": 87693,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.280",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp91i0",
        "text": "O good Horatio, I'll take the ghost's word for a",
        "char_start": 87694,
        "char_end": 87742,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.281",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp91i1",
        "text": "thousand pound. Didst perceive?",
        "char_start": 87743,
        "char_end": 87774,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.282",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp92i0",
        "text": "Very well, my lord.",
        "char_start": 87775,
        "char_end": 87794,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.283",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp93i0",
        "text": "Upon the talk of the poisoning?",
        "char_start": 87795,
        "char_end": 87826,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.284",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp94i0",
        "text": "I did very well note him.",
        "char_start": 87827,
        "char_end": 87852,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.285",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp95i0",
        "text": "Ah, ha! Come, some music! come, the recorders!",
        "char_start": 87853,
        "char_end": 87899,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.286",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp95i1",
        "text": "For if the king like not the comedy,",
        "char_start": 87900,
        "char_end": 87936,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.287",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp95i2",
        "text": "Why then, belike, he likes it not, perdy.",
        "char_start": 87937,
        "char_end": 87978,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.288",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp95i3",
        "text": "Come, some music!",
        "char_start": 87979,
        "char_end": 87996,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.289",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp95i4",
        "text": "Re-enter ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 87997,
        "char_end": 88034,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp96i0",
        "text": "Good my lord, vouchsafe me a word with you.",
        "char_start": 88035,
        "char_end": 88078,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.290",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp97i0",
        "text": "Sir, a whole history.",
        "char_start": 88079,
        "char_end": 88100,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.291",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp98i0",
        "text": "The king, sir,--",
        "char_start": 88101,
        "char_end": 88117,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.292",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp99i0",
        "text": "Ay, sir, what of him?",
        "char_start": 88118,
        "char_end": 88139,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.293",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp100i0",
        "text": "Is in his retirement marvellous distempered.",
        "char_start": 88140,
        "char_end": 88184,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.294",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp101i0",
        "text": "With drink, sir?",
        "char_start": 88185,
        "char_end": 88201,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.295",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp102i0",
        "text": "No, my lord, rather with choler.",
        "char_start": 88202,
        "char_end": 88234,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.296",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp103i0",
        "text": "Your wisdom should show itself more richer to",
        "char_start": 88235,
        "char_end": 88280,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.297",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp103i1",
        "text": "signify this to his doctor; for, for me to put him",
        "char_start": 88281,
        "char_end": 88331,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.298",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp103i2",
        "text": "to his purgation would perhaps plunge him into far",
        "char_start": 88332,
        "char_end": 88382,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.299",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp103i3",
        "text": "more choler.",
        "char_start": 88383,
        "char_end": 88395,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.300",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp104i0",
        "text": "Good my lord, put your discourse into some frame and",
        "char_start": 88396,
        "char_end": 88448,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.301",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp104i1",
        "text": "start not so wildly from my affair.",
        "char_start": 88449,
        "char_end": 88484,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.302",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp105i0",
        "text": "I am tame, sir: pronounce.",
        "char_start": 88485,
        "char_end": 88511,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.303",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp106i0",
        "text": "The queen, your mother, in most great affliction of",
        "char_start": 88512,
        "char_end": 88563,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.304",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp106i1",
        "text": "spirit, hath sent me to you.",
        "char_start": 88564,
        "char_end": 88592,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.305",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp107i0",
        "text": "You are welcome.",
        "char_start": 88593,
        "char_end": 88609,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.306",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp108i0",
        "text": "Nay, good my lord, this courtesy is not of the right",
        "char_start": 88610,
        "char_end": 88662,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.307",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp108i1",
        "text": "breed. If it shall please you to make me a",
        "char_start": 88663,
        "char_end": 88705,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.308",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp108i2",
        "text": "wholesome answer, I will do your mother's",
        "char_start": 88706,
        "char_end": 88747,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.309",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp108i3",
        "text": "commandment: if not, your pardon and my return",
        "char_start": 88748,
        "char_end": 88794,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.310",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp108i4",
        "text": "shall be the end of my business.",
        "char_start": 88795,
        "char_end": 88827,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.311",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp109i0",
        "text": "Sir, I cannot.",
        "char_start": 88828,
        "char_end": 88842,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.312",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp110i0",
        "text": "What, my lord?",
        "char_start": 88843,
        "char_end": 88857,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.313",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp111i0",
        "text": "Make you a wholesome answer; my wit's diseased: but,",
        "char_start": 88858,
        "char_end": 88910,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.314",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp111i1",
        "text": "sir, such answer as I can make, you shall command;",
        "char_start": 88911,
        "char_end": 88961,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.315",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp111i2",
        "text": "or, rather, as you say, my mother: therefore no",
        "char_start": 88962,
        "char_end": 89009,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.316",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp111i3",
        "text": "more, but to the matter: my mother, you say,--",
        "char_start": 89010,
        "char_end": 89056,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.317",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp112i0",
        "text": "Then thus she says; your behavior hath struck her",
        "char_start": 89057,
        "char_end": 89106,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.318",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp112i1",
        "text": "into amazement and admiration.",
        "char_start": 89107,
        "char_end": 89137,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.319",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp113i0",
        "text": "O wonderful son, that can so astonish a mother! But",
        "char_start": 89138,
        "char_end": 89189,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.320",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp113i1",
        "text": "is there no sequel at the heels of this mother's",
        "char_start": 89190,
        "char_end": 89238,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.321",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp113i2",
        "text": "admiration? Impart.",
        "char_start": 89239,
        "char_end": 89258,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.322",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp114i0",
        "text": "She desires to speak with you in her closet, ere you",
        "char_start": 89259,
        "char_end": 89311,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.323",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp114i1",
        "text": "go to bed.",
        "char_start": 89312,
        "char_end": 89322,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.324",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp115i0",
        "text": "We shall obey, were she ten times our mother. Have",
        "char_start": 89323,
        "char_end": 89373,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.325",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp115i1",
        "text": "you any further trade with us?",
        "char_start": 89374,
        "char_end": 89404,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.326",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp116i0",
        "text": "My lord, you once did love me.",
        "char_start": 89405,
        "char_end": 89435,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.327",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp117i0",
        "text": "So I do still, by these pickers and stealers.",
        "char_start": 89436,
        "char_end": 89481,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.328",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp118i0",
        "text": "Good my lord, what is your cause of distemper? you",
        "char_start": 89482,
        "char_end": 89532,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.329",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp118i1",
        "text": "do, surely, bar the door upon your own liberty, if",
        "char_start": 89533,
        "char_end": 89583,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.330",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp118i2",
        "text": "you deny your griefs to your friend.",
        "char_start": 89584,
        "char_end": 89620,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.331",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp119i0",
        "text": "Sir, I lack advancement.",
        "char_start": 89621,
        "char_end": 89645,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.332",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp120i0",
        "text": "How can that be, when you have the voice of the king",
        "char_start": 89646,
        "char_end": 89698,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.333",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp120i1",
        "text": "himself for your succession in Denmark?",
        "char_start": 89699,
        "char_end": 89738,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.334",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp121i0",
        "text": "Ay, but sir, 'While the grass grows,'--the proverb",
        "char_start": 89739,
        "char_end": 89789,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.335",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp121i1",
        "text": "is something musty.",
        "char_start": 89790,
        "char_end": 89809,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.336",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp121i2",
        "text": "Re-enter Players with recorders",
        "char_start": 89810,
        "char_end": 89841,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp121i3",
        "text": "O, the recorders! let me see one. To withdraw with",
        "char_start": 89842,
        "char_end": 89892,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.337",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp121i4",
        "text": "you:--why do you go about to recover the wind of me,",
        "char_start": 89893,
        "char_end": 89945,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.338",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp121i5",
        "text": "as if you would drive me into a toil?",
        "char_start": 89946,
        "char_end": 89983,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.339",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp122i0",
        "text": "O, my lord, if my duty be too bold, my love is too",
        "char_start": 89984,
        "char_end": 90034,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.340",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp122i1",
        "text": "unmannerly.",
        "char_start": 90035,
        "char_end": 90046,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.341",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp123i0",
        "text": "I do not well understand that. Will you play upon",
        "char_start": 90047,
        "char_end": 90096,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.342",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp123i1",
        "text": "this pipe?",
        "char_start": 90097,
        "char_end": 90107,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.343",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp124i0",
        "text": "My lord, I cannot.",
        "char_start": 90108,
        "char_end": 90126,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.344",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp125i0",
        "text": "I pray you.",
        "char_start": 90127,
        "char_end": 90138,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.345",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp126i0",
        "text": "Believe me, I cannot.",
        "char_start": 90139,
        "char_end": 90160,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.346",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp127i0",
        "text": "I do beseech you.",
        "char_start": 90161,
        "char_end": 90178,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.347",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp128i0",
        "text": "I know no touch of it, my lord.",
        "char_start": 90179,
        "char_end": 90210,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.348",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp129i0",
        "text": "'Tis as easy as lying: govern these ventages with",
        "char_start": 90211,
        "char_end": 90260,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.349",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp129i1",
        "text": "your lingers and thumb, give it breath with your",
        "char_start": 90261,
        "char_end": 90309,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.350",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp129i2",
        "text": "mouth, and it will discourse most eloquent music.",
        "char_start": 90310,
        "char_end": 90359,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.351",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp129i3",
        "text": "Look you, these are the stops.",
        "char_start": 90360,
        "char_end": 90390,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.352",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp130i0",
        "text": "But these cannot I command to any utterance of",
        "char_start": 90391,
        "char_end": 90437,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.353",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp130i1",
        "text": "harmony; I have not the skill.",
        "char_start": 90438,
        "char_end": 90468,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.354",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i0",
        "text": "Why, look you now, how unworthy a thing you make of",
        "char_start": 90469,
        "char_end": 90520,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.355",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i1",
        "text": "me! You would play upon me; you would seem to know",
        "char_start": 90521,
        "char_end": 90571,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.356",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i2",
        "text": "my stops; you would pluck out the heart of my",
        "char_start": 90572,
        "char_end": 90617,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.357",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i3",
        "text": "mystery; you would sound me from my lowest note to",
        "char_start": 90618,
        "char_end": 90668,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.358",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i4",
        "text": "the top of my compass: and there is much music,",
        "char_start": 90669,
        "char_end": 90716,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.359",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i5",
        "text": "excellent voice, in this little organ; yet cannot",
        "char_start": 90717,
        "char_end": 90766,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.360",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i6",
        "text": "you make it speak. 'Sblood, do you think I am",
        "char_start": 90767,
        "char_end": 90812,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.361",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i7",
        "text": "easier to be played on than a pipe? Call me what",
        "char_start": 90813,
        "char_end": 90861,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.362",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i8",
        "text": "instrument you will, though you can fret me, yet you",
        "char_start": 90862,
        "char_end": 90914,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.363",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i9",
        "text": "cannot play upon me.",
        "char_start": 90915,
        "char_end": 90935,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.364",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i10",
        "text": "Enter POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 90936,
        "char_end": 90950,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp131i11",
        "text": "God bless you, sir!",
        "char_start": 90951,
        "char_end": 90970,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.365",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp132i0",
        "text": "My lord, the queen would speak with you, and",
        "char_start": 90971,
        "char_end": 91015,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.366",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp132i1",
        "text": "presently.",
        "char_start": 91016,
        "char_end": 91026,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.367",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp133i0",
        "text": "Do you see yonder cloud that's almost in shape of a camel?",
        "char_start": 91027,
        "char_end": 91085,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.368",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp134i0",
        "text": "By the mass, and 'tis like a camel, indeed.",
        "char_start": 91086,
        "char_end": 91129,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.369",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp135i0",
        "text": "Methinks it is like a weasel.",
        "char_start": 91130,
        "char_end": 91159,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.370",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp136i0",
        "text": "It is backed like a weasel.",
        "char_start": 91160,
        "char_end": 91187,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.371",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp137i0",
        "text": "Or like a whale?",
        "char_start": 91188,
        "char_end": 91204,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.372",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp138i0",
        "text": "Very like a whale.",
        "char_start": 91205,
        "char_end": 91223,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.373",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp139i0",
        "text": "Then I will come to my mother by and by. They fool",
        "char_start": 91224,
        "char_end": 91274,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.374",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp139i1",
        "text": "me to the top of my bent. I will come by and by.",
        "char_start": 91275,
        "char_end": 91323,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.375",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp140i0",
        "text": "I will say so.",
        "char_start": 91324,
        "char_end": 91338,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.376",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i0",
        "text": "By and by is easily said.",
        "char_start": 91339,
        "char_end": 91364,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.377",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i1",
        "text": "Exit POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 91365,
        "char_end": 91378,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i2",
        "text": "Leave me, friends.",
        "char_start": 91379,
        "char_end": 91397,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.378",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i3",
        "text": "Exeunt all but HAMLET",
        "char_start": 91398,
        "char_end": 91419,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i4",
        "text": "Tis now the very witching time of night,",
        "char_start": 91420,
        "char_end": 91460,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.379",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i5",
        "text": "When churchyards yawn and hell itself breathes out",
        "char_start": 91461,
        "char_end": 91511,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.380",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i6",
        "text": "Contagion to this world: now could I drink hot blood,",
        "char_start": 91512,
        "char_end": 91565,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.381",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i7",
        "text": "And do such bitter business as the day",
        "char_start": 91566,
        "char_end": 91604,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.382",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i8",
        "text": "Would quake to look on. Soft! now to my mother.",
        "char_start": 91605,
        "char_end": 91652,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.383",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i9",
        "text": "O heart, lose not thy nature; let not ever",
        "char_start": 91653,
        "char_end": 91695,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.384",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i10",
        "text": "The soul of Nero enter this firm bosom:",
        "char_start": 91696,
        "char_end": 91735,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.385",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i11",
        "text": "Let me be cruel, not unnatural:",
        "char_start": 91736,
        "char_end": 91767,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.386",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i12",
        "text": "I will speak daggers to her, but use none;",
        "char_start": 91768,
        "char_end": 91810,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.387",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i13",
        "text": "My tongue and soul in this be hypocrites;",
        "char_start": 91811,
        "char_end": 91852,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.388",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i14",
        "text": "How in my words soever she be shent,",
        "char_start": 91853,
        "char_end": 91889,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.389",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i15",
        "text": "To give them seals never, my soul, consent!",
        "char_start": 91890,
        "char_end": 91933,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "3.2.390",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s2:sp141i16",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 91934,
        "char_end": 91938,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:open",
        "text": "Enter KING CLAUDIUS, ROSENCRANTZ, and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 91939,
        "char_end": 91989,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp1i0",
        "text": "I like him not, nor stands it safe with us",
        "char_start": 91990,
        "char_end": 92032,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp1i1",
        "text": "To let his madness range. Therefore prepare you;",
        "char_start": 92033,
        "char_end": 92081,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp1i2",
        "text": "I your commission will forthwith dispatch,",
        "char_start": 92082,
        "char_end": 92124,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp1i3",
        "text": "And he to England shall along with you:",
        "char_start": 92125,
        "char_end": 92164,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp1i4",
        "text": "The terms of our estate may not endure",
        "char_start": 92165,
        "char_end": 92203,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp1i5",
        "text": "Hazard so dangerous as doth hourly grow",
        "char_start": 92204,
        "char_end": 92243,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp1i6",
        "text": "Out of his lunacies.",
        "char_start": 92244,
        "char_end": 92264,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp2i0",
        "text": "We will ourselves provide:",
        "char_start": 92265,
        "char_end": 92291,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp2i1",
        "text": "Most holy and religious fear it is",
        "char_start": 92292,
        "char_end": 92326,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp2i2",
        "text": "To keep those many many bodies safe",
        "char_start": 92327,
        "char_end": 92362,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp2i3",
        "text": "That live and feed upon your majesty.",
        "char_start": 92363,
        "char_end": 92400,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i0",
        "text": "The single and peculiar life is bound,",
        "char_start": 92401,
        "char_end": 92439,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i1",
        "text": "With all the strength and armour of the mind,",
        "char_start": 92440,
        "char_end": 92485,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i2",
        "text": "To keep itself from noyance; but much more",
        "char_start": 92486,
        "char_end": 92528,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i3",
        "text": "That spirit upon whose weal depend and rest",
        "char_start": 92529,
        "char_end": 92572,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i4",
        "text": "The lives of many. The cease of majesty",
        "char_start": 92573,
        "char_end": 92612,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i5",
        "text": "Dies not alone; but, like a gulf, doth draw",
        "char_start": 92613,
        "char_end": 92656,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i6",
        "text": "What's near it with it: it is a massy wheel,",
        "char_start": 92657,
        "char_end": 92701,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i7",
        "text": "Fix'd on the summit of the highest mount,",
        "char_start": 92702,
        "char_end": 92743,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i8",
        "text": "To whose huge spokes ten thousand lesser things",
        "char_start": 92744,
        "char_end": 92791,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i9",
        "text": "Are mortised and adjoin'd; which, when it falls,",
        "char_start": 92792,
        "char_end": 92840,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i10",
        "text": "Each small annexment, petty consequence,",
        "char_start": 92841,
        "char_end": 92881,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i11",
        "text": "Attends the boisterous ruin. Never alone",
        "char_start": 92882,
        "char_end": 92922,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp3i12",
        "text": "Did the king sigh, but with a general groan.",
        "char_start": 92923,
        "char_end": 92967,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp4i0",
        "text": "Arm you, I pray you, to this speedy voyage;",
        "char_start": 92968,
        "char_end": 93011,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp4i1",
        "text": "For we will fetters put upon this fear,",
        "char_start": 93012,
        "char_end": 93051,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp4i2",
        "text": "Which now goes too free-footed.",
        "char_start": 93052,
        "char_end": 93083,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp5i0",
        "text": "We will haste us.",
        "char_start": 93084,
        "char_end": 93101,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp5i1",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 93102,
        "char_end": 93137,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp5i2",
        "text": "Enter POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 93138,
        "char_end": 93152,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp6i0",
        "text": "We will haste us.",
        "char_start": 93153,
        "char_end": 93170,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp6i1",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 93171,
        "char_end": 93206,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp6i2",
        "text": "Enter POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 93207,
        "char_end": 93221,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp7i0",
        "text": "My lord, he's going to his mother's closet:",
        "char_start": 93222,
        "char_end": 93265,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp7i1",
        "text": "Behind the arras I'll convey myself,",
        "char_start": 93266,
        "char_end": 93302,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp7i2",
        "text": "To hear the process; and warrant she'll tax him home:",
        "char_start": 93303,
        "char_end": 93356,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp7i3",
        "text": "And, as you said, and wisely was it said,",
        "char_start": 93357,
        "char_end": 93398,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp7i4",
        "text": "'Tis meet that some more audience than a mother,",
        "char_start": 93399,
        "char_end": 93447,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp7i5",
        "text": "Since nature makes them partial, should o'erhear",
        "char_start": 93448,
        "char_end": 93496,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp7i6",
        "text": "The speech, of vantage. Fare you well, my liege:",
        "char_start": 93497,
        "char_end": 93545,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp7i7",
        "text": "I'll call upon you ere you go to bed,",
        "char_start": 93546,
        "char_end": 93583,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp7i8",
        "text": "And tell you what I know.",
        "char_start": 93584,
        "char_end": 93609,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i0",
        "text": "Thanks, dear my lord.",
        "char_start": 93610,
        "char_end": 93631,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i1",
        "text": "Exit POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 93632,
        "char_end": 93645,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i2",
        "text": "O, my offence is rank it smells to heaven;",
        "char_start": 93646,
        "char_end": 93688,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i3",
        "text": "It hath the primal eldest curse upon't,",
        "char_start": 93689,
        "char_end": 93728,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i4",
        "text": "A brother's murder. Pray can I not,",
        "char_start": 93729,
        "char_end": 93764,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i5",
        "text": "Though inclination be as sharp as will:",
        "char_start": 93765,
        "char_end": 93804,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i6",
        "text": "My stronger guilt defeats my strong intent;",
        "char_start": 93805,
        "char_end": 93848,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i7",
        "text": "And, like a man to double business bound,",
        "char_start": 93849,
        "char_end": 93890,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i8",
        "text": "I stand in pause where I shall first begin,",
        "char_start": 93891,
        "char_end": 93934,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i9",
        "text": "And both neglect. What if this cursed hand",
        "char_start": 93935,
        "char_end": 93977,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i10",
        "text": "Were thicker than itself with brother's blood,",
        "char_start": 93978,
        "char_end": 94024,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i11",
        "text": "Is there not rain enough in the sweet heavens",
        "char_start": 94025,
        "char_end": 94070,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i12",
        "text": "To wash it white as snow? Whereto serves mercy",
        "char_start": 94071,
        "char_end": 94117,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i13",
        "text": "But to confront the visage of offence?",
        "char_start": 94118,
        "char_end": 94156,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i14",
        "text": "And what's in prayer but this two-fold force,",
        "char_start": 94157,
        "char_end": 94202,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i15",
        "text": "To be forestalled ere we come to fall,",
        "char_start": 94203,
        "char_end": 94241,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i16",
        "text": "Or pardon'd being down? Then I'll look up;",
        "char_start": 94242,
        "char_end": 94284,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i17",
        "text": "My fault is past. But, O, what form of prayer",
        "char_start": 94285,
        "char_end": 94330,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i18",
        "text": "Can serve my turn? 'Forgive me my foul murder'?",
        "char_start": 94331,
        "char_end": 94378,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i19",
        "text": "That cannot be; since I am still possess'd",
        "char_start": 94379,
        "char_end": 94421,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i20",
        "text": "Of those effects for which I did the murder,",
        "char_start": 94422,
        "char_end": 94466,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i21",
        "text": "My crown, mine own ambition and my queen.",
        "char_start": 94467,
        "char_end": 94508,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i22",
        "text": "May one be pardon'd and retain the offence?",
        "char_start": 94509,
        "char_end": 94552,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i23",
        "text": "In the corrupted currents of this world",
        "char_start": 94553,
        "char_end": 94592,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i24",
        "text": "Offence's gilded hand may shove by justice,",
        "char_start": 94593,
        "char_end": 94636,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i25",
        "text": "And oft 'tis seen the wicked prize itself",
        "char_start": 94637,
        "char_end": 94678,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i26",
        "text": "Buys out the law: but 'tis not so above;",
        "char_start": 94679,
        "char_end": 94719,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i27",
        "text": "There is no shuffling, there the action lies",
        "char_start": 94720,
        "char_end": 94764,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i28",
        "text": "In his true nature; and we ourselves compell'd,",
        "char_start": 94765,
        "char_end": 94812,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i29",
        "text": "Even to the teeth and forehead of our faults,",
        "char_start": 94813,
        "char_end": 94858,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i30",
        "text": "To give in evidence. What then? what rests?",
        "char_start": 94859,
        "char_end": 94902,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i31",
        "text": "Try what repentance can: what can it not?",
        "char_start": 94903,
        "char_end": 94944,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i32",
        "text": "Yet what can it when one can not repent?",
        "char_start": 94945,
        "char_end": 94985,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i33",
        "text": "O wretched state! O bosom black as death!",
        "char_start": 94986,
        "char_end": 95027,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i34",
        "text": "O limed soul, that, struggling to be free,",
        "char_start": 95028,
        "char_end": 95070,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i35",
        "text": "Art more engaged! Help, angels! Make assay!",
        "char_start": 95071,
        "char_end": 95114,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i36",
        "text": "Bow, stubborn knees; and, heart with strings of steel,",
        "char_start": 95115,
        "char_end": 95169,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i37",
        "text": "Be soft as sinews of the newborn babe!",
        "char_start": 95170,
        "char_end": 95208,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i38",
        "text": "All may be well.",
        "char_start": 95209,
        "char_end": 95225,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i39",
        "text": "Retires and kneels",
        "char_start": 95226,
        "char_end": 95244,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp8i40",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET",
        "char_start": 95245,
        "char_end": 95257,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i0",
        "text": "Now might I do it pat, now he is praying;",
        "char_start": 95258,
        "char_end": 95299,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i1",
        "text": "And now I'll do't. And so he goes to heaven;",
        "char_start": 95300,
        "char_end": 95344,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i2",
        "text": "And so am I revenged. That would be scann'd:",
        "char_start": 95345,
        "char_end": 95389,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i3",
        "text": "A villain kills my father; and for that,",
        "char_start": 95390,
        "char_end": 95430,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i4",
        "text": "I, his sole son, do this same villain send",
        "char_start": 95431,
        "char_end": 95473,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i5",
        "text": "To heaven.",
        "char_start": 95474,
        "char_end": 95484,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i6",
        "text": "O, this is hire and salary, not revenge.",
        "char_start": 95485,
        "char_end": 95525,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i7",
        "text": "He took my father grossly, full of bread;",
        "char_start": 95526,
        "char_end": 95567,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i8",
        "text": "With all his crimes broad blown, as flush as May;",
        "char_start": 95568,
        "char_end": 95617,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i9",
        "text": "And how his audit stands who knows save heaven?",
        "char_start": 95618,
        "char_end": 95665,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i10",
        "text": "But in our circumstance and course of thought,",
        "char_start": 95666,
        "char_end": 95712,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i11",
        "text": "'Tis heavy with him: and am I then revenged,",
        "char_start": 95713,
        "char_end": 95757,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i12",
        "text": "To take him in the purging of his soul,",
        "char_start": 95758,
        "char_end": 95797,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i13",
        "text": "When he is fit and season'd for his passage?",
        "char_start": 95798,
        "char_end": 95842,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i14",
        "text": "No!",
        "char_start": 95843,
        "char_end": 95846,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i15",
        "text": "Up, sword; and know thou a more horrid hent:",
        "char_start": 95847,
        "char_end": 95891,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i16",
        "text": "When he is drunk asleep, or in his rage,",
        "char_start": 95892,
        "char_end": 95932,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i17",
        "text": "Or in the incestuous pleasure of his bed;",
        "char_start": 95933,
        "char_end": 95974,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i18",
        "text": "At gaming, swearing, or about some act",
        "char_start": 95975,
        "char_end": 96013,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i19",
        "text": "That has no relish of salvation in't;",
        "char_start": 96014,
        "char_end": 96051,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i20",
        "text": "Then trip him, that his heels may kick at heaven,",
        "char_start": 96052,
        "char_end": 96101,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i21",
        "text": "And that his soul may be as damn'd and black",
        "char_start": 96102,
        "char_end": 96146,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i22",
        "text": "As hell, whereto it goes. My mother stays:",
        "char_start": 96147,
        "char_end": 96189,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i23",
        "text": "This physic but prolongs thy sickly days.",
        "char_start": 96190,
        "char_end": 96231,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp9i24",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 96232,
        "char_end": 96236,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp10i0",
        "text": "[Rising] My words fly up, my thoughts remain below:",
        "char_start": 96237,
        "char_end": 96288,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp10i1",
        "text": "Words without thoughts never to heaven go.",
        "char_start": 96289,
        "char_end": 96331,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "3.3.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s3:sp10i2",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 96332,
        "char_end": 96336,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:open",
        "text": "Enter QUEEN GERTRUDE and POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 96337,
        "char_end": 96370,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp1i0",
        "text": "He will come straight. Look you lay home to him:",
        "char_start": 96371,
        "char_end": 96419,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp1i1",
        "text": "Tell him his pranks have been too broad to bear with,",
        "char_start": 96420,
        "char_end": 96473,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp1i2",
        "text": "And that your grace hath screen'd and stood between",
        "char_start": 96474,
        "char_end": 96525,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp1i3",
        "text": "Much heat and him. I'll sconce me even here.",
        "char_start": 96526,
        "char_end": 96570,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp1i4",
        "text": "Pray you, be round with him.",
        "char_start": 96571,
        "char_end": 96599,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp2i0",
        "text": "[Within] Mother, mother, mother!",
        "char_start": 96600,
        "char_end": 96632,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp3i0",
        "text": "I'll warrant you,",
        "char_start": 96633,
        "char_end": 96650,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp3i1",
        "text": "Fear me not: withdraw, I hear him coming.",
        "char_start": 96651,
        "char_end": 96692,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp3i2",
        "text": "POLONIUS hides behind the arras",
        "char_start": 96693,
        "char_end": 96724,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp3i3",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET",
        "char_start": 96725,
        "char_end": 96737,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp4i0",
        "text": "Now, mother, what's the matter?",
        "char_start": 96738,
        "char_end": 96769,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp5i0",
        "text": "Hamlet, thou hast thy father much offended.",
        "char_start": 96770,
        "char_end": 96813,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp6i0",
        "text": "Mother, you have my father much offended.",
        "char_start": 96814,
        "char_end": 96855,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp7i0",
        "text": "Come, come, you answer with an idle tongue.",
        "char_start": 96856,
        "char_end": 96899,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp8i0",
        "text": "Go, go, you question with a wicked tongue.",
        "char_start": 96900,
        "char_end": 96942,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp9i0",
        "text": "Why, how now, Hamlet!",
        "char_start": 96943,
        "char_end": 96964,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp10i0",
        "text": "What's the matter now?",
        "char_start": 96965,
        "char_end": 96987,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp11i0",
        "text": "Have you forgot me?",
        "char_start": 96988,
        "char_end": 97007,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp12i0",
        "text": "No, by the rood, not so:",
        "char_start": 97008,
        "char_end": 97032,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp12i1",
        "text": "You are the queen, your husband's brother's wife;",
        "char_start": 97033,
        "char_end": 97082,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp12i2",
        "text": "And--would it were not so!--you are my mother.",
        "char_start": 97083,
        "char_end": 97129,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp13i0",
        "text": "Nay, then, I'll set those to you that can speak.",
        "char_start": 97130,
        "char_end": 97178,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp14i0",
        "text": "Come, come, and sit you down; you shall not budge;",
        "char_start": 97179,
        "char_end": 97229,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp14i1",
        "text": "You go not till I set you up a glass",
        "char_start": 97230,
        "char_end": 97266,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp14i2",
        "text": "Where you may see the inmost part of you.",
        "char_start": 97267,
        "char_end": 97308,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp15i0",
        "text": "What wilt thou do? thou wilt not murder me?",
        "char_start": 97309,
        "char_end": 97352,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp15i1",
        "text": "Help, help, ho!",
        "char_start": 97353,
        "char_end": 97368,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp16i0",
        "text": "[Behind] What, ho! help, help, help!",
        "char_start": 97369,
        "char_end": 97405,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp17i0",
        "text": "[Drawing] How now! a rat? Dead, for a ducat, dead!",
        "char_start": 97406,
        "char_end": 97456,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp17i1",
        "text": "Makes a pass through the arras",
        "char_start": 97457,
        "char_end": 97487,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp18i0",
        "text": "[Behind] O, I am slain!",
        "char_start": 97488,
        "char_end": 97511,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp18i1",
        "text": "Falls and dies",
        "char_start": 97512,
        "char_end": 97526,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LORD POLONIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp19i0",
        "text": "O me, what hast thou done?",
        "char_start": 97527,
        "char_end": 97553,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp20i0",
        "text": "Nay, I know not:",
        "char_start": 97554,
        "char_end": 97570,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp20i1",
        "text": "Is it the king?",
        "char_start": 97571,
        "char_end": 97586,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp21i0",
        "text": "O, what a rash and bloody deed is this!",
        "char_start": 97587,
        "char_end": 97626,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp22i0",
        "text": "A bloody deed! almost as bad, good mother,",
        "char_start": 97627,
        "char_end": 97669,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp22i1",
        "text": "As kill a king, and marry with his brother.",
        "char_start": 97670,
        "char_end": 97713,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp23i0",
        "text": "As kill a king!",
        "char_start": 97714,
        "char_end": 97729,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i0",
        "text": "Ay, lady, 'twas my word.",
        "char_start": 97730,
        "char_end": 97754,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i1",
        "text": "Lifts up the array and discovers POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 97755,
        "char_end": 97796,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i2",
        "text": "Thou wretched, rash, intruding fool, farewell!",
        "char_start": 97797,
        "char_end": 97843,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i3",
        "text": "I took thee for thy better: take thy fortune;",
        "char_start": 97844,
        "char_end": 97889,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i4",
        "text": "Thou find'st to be too busy is some danger.",
        "char_start": 97890,
        "char_end": 97933,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i5",
        "text": "Leave wringing of your hands: peace! sit you down,",
        "char_start": 97934,
        "char_end": 97984,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i6",
        "text": "And let me wring your heart; for so I shall,",
        "char_start": 97985,
        "char_end": 98029,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i7",
        "text": "If it be made of penetrable stuff,",
        "char_start": 98030,
        "char_end": 98064,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i8",
        "text": "If damned custom have not brass'd it so",
        "char_start": 98065,
        "char_end": 98104,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp24i9",
        "text": "That it is proof and bulwark against sense.",
        "char_start": 98105,
        "char_end": 98148,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp25i0",
        "text": "What have I done, that thou darest wag thy tongue",
        "char_start": 98149,
        "char_end": 98198,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp25i1",
        "text": "In noise so rude against me?",
        "char_start": 98199,
        "char_end": 98227,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i0",
        "text": "Such an act",
        "char_start": 98228,
        "char_end": 98239,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i1",
        "text": "That blurs the grace and blush of modesty,",
        "char_start": 98240,
        "char_end": 98282,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i2",
        "text": "Calls virtue hypocrite, takes off the rose",
        "char_start": 98283,
        "char_end": 98325,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i3",
        "text": "From the fair forehead of an innocent love",
        "char_start": 98326,
        "char_end": 98368,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i4",
        "text": "And sets a blister there, makes marriage-vows",
        "char_start": 98369,
        "char_end": 98414,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i5",
        "text": "As false as dicers' oaths: O, such a deed",
        "char_start": 98415,
        "char_end": 98456,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i6",
        "text": "As from the body of contraction plucks",
        "char_start": 98457,
        "char_end": 98495,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i7",
        "text": "The very soul, and sweet religion makes",
        "char_start": 98496,
        "char_end": 98535,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i8",
        "text": "A rhapsody of words: heaven's face doth glow:",
        "char_start": 98536,
        "char_end": 98581,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i9",
        "text": "Yea, this solidity and compound mass,",
        "char_start": 98582,
        "char_end": 98619,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i10",
        "text": "With tristful visage, as against the doom,",
        "char_start": 98620,
        "char_end": 98662,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp26i11",
        "text": "Is thought-sick at the act.",
        "char_start": 98663,
        "char_end": 98690,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp27i0",
        "text": "Ay me, what act,",
        "char_start": 98691,
        "char_end": 98707,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp27i1",
        "text": "That roars so loud, and thunders in the index?",
        "char_start": 98708,
        "char_end": 98754,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i0",
        "text": "Look here, upon this picture, and on this,",
        "char_start": 98755,
        "char_end": 98797,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i1",
        "text": "The counterfeit presentment of two brothers.",
        "char_start": 98798,
        "char_end": 98842,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i2",
        "text": "See, what a grace was seated on this brow;",
        "char_start": 98843,
        "char_end": 98885,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i3",
        "text": "Hyperion's curls; the front of Jove himself;",
        "char_start": 98886,
        "char_end": 98930,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i4",
        "text": "An eye like Mars, to threaten and command;",
        "char_start": 98931,
        "char_end": 98973,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i5",
        "text": "A station like the herald Mercury",
        "char_start": 98974,
        "char_end": 99007,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i6",
        "text": "New-lighted on a heaven-kissing hill;",
        "char_start": 99008,
        "char_end": 99045,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i7",
        "text": "A combination and a form indeed,",
        "char_start": 99046,
        "char_end": 99078,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i8",
        "text": "Where every god did seem to set his seal,",
        "char_start": 99079,
        "char_end": 99120,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i9",
        "text": "To give the world assurance of a man:",
        "char_start": 99121,
        "char_end": 99158,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i10",
        "text": "This was your husband. Look you now, what follows:",
        "char_start": 99159,
        "char_end": 99209,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i11",
        "text": "Here is your husband; like a mildew'd ear,",
        "char_start": 99210,
        "char_end": 99252,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i12",
        "text": "Blasting his wholesome brother. Have you eyes?",
        "char_start": 99253,
        "char_end": 99299,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i13",
        "text": "Could you on this fair mountain leave to feed,",
        "char_start": 99300,
        "char_end": 99346,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i14",
        "text": "And batten on this moor? Ha! have you eyes?",
        "char_start": 99347,
        "char_end": 99390,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i15",
        "text": "You cannot call it love; for at your age",
        "char_start": 99391,
        "char_end": 99431,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i16",
        "text": "The hey-day in the blood is tame, it's humble,",
        "char_start": 99432,
        "char_end": 99478,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i17",
        "text": "And waits upon the judgment: and what judgment",
        "char_start": 99479,
        "char_end": 99525,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i18",
        "text": "Would step from this to this? Sense, sure, you have,",
        "char_start": 99526,
        "char_end": 99578,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i19",
        "text": "Else could you not have motion; but sure, that sense",
        "char_start": 99579,
        "char_end": 99631,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i20",
        "text": "Is apoplex'd; for madness would not err,",
        "char_start": 99632,
        "char_end": 99672,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i21",
        "text": "Nor sense to ecstasy was ne'er so thrall'd",
        "char_start": 99673,
        "char_end": 99715,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i22",
        "text": "But it reserved some quantity of choice,",
        "char_start": 99716,
        "char_end": 99756,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i23",
        "text": "To serve in such a difference. What devil was't",
        "char_start": 99757,
        "char_end": 99804,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i24",
        "text": "That thus hath cozen'd you at hoodman-blind?",
        "char_start": 99805,
        "char_end": 99849,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i25",
        "text": "Eyes without feeling, feeling without sight,",
        "char_start": 99850,
        "char_end": 99894,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i26",
        "text": "Ears without hands or eyes, smelling sans all,",
        "char_start": 99895,
        "char_end": 99941,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i27",
        "text": "Or but a sickly part of one true sense",
        "char_start": 99942,
        "char_end": 99980,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i28",
        "text": "Could not so mope.",
        "char_start": 99981,
        "char_end": 99999,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i29",
        "text": "O shame! where is thy blush? Rebellious hell,",
        "char_start": 100000,
        "char_end": 100045,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i30",
        "text": "If thou canst mutine in a matron's bones,",
        "char_start": 100046,
        "char_end": 100087,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i31",
        "text": "To flaming youth let virtue be as wax,",
        "char_start": 100088,
        "char_end": 100126,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i32",
        "text": "And melt in her own fire: proclaim no shame",
        "char_start": 100127,
        "char_end": 100170,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i33",
        "text": "When the compulsive ardour gives the charge,",
        "char_start": 100171,
        "char_end": 100215,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i34",
        "text": "Since frost itself as actively doth burn",
        "char_start": 100216,
        "char_end": 100256,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp28i35",
        "text": "And reason panders will.",
        "char_start": 100257,
        "char_end": 100281,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp29i0",
        "text": "O Hamlet, speak no more:",
        "char_start": 100282,
        "char_end": 100306,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp29i1",
        "text": "Thou turn'st mine eyes into my very soul;",
        "char_start": 100307,
        "char_end": 100348,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp29i2",
        "text": "And there I see such black and grained spots",
        "char_start": 100349,
        "char_end": 100393,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp29i3",
        "text": "As will not leave their tinct.",
        "char_start": 100394,
        "char_end": 100424,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp30i0",
        "text": "Nay, but to live",
        "char_start": 100425,
        "char_end": 100441,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp30i1",
        "text": "In the rank sweat of an enseamed bed,",
        "char_start": 100442,
        "char_end": 100479,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp30i2",
        "text": "Stew'd in corruption, honeying and making love",
        "char_start": 100480,
        "char_end": 100526,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp30i3",
        "text": "Over the nasty sty,--",
        "char_start": 100527,
        "char_end": 100548,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp31i0",
        "text": "O, speak to me no more;",
        "char_start": 100549,
        "char_end": 100572,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp31i1",
        "text": "These words, like daggers, enter in mine ears;",
        "char_start": 100573,
        "char_end": 100619,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp31i2",
        "text": "No more, sweet Hamlet!",
        "char_start": 100620,
        "char_end": 100642,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp32i0",
        "text": "A murderer and a villain;",
        "char_start": 100643,
        "char_end": 100668,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp32i1",
        "text": "A slave that is not twentieth part the tithe",
        "char_start": 100669,
        "char_end": 100713,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp32i2",
        "text": "Of your precedent lord; a vice of kings;",
        "char_start": 100714,
        "char_end": 100754,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp32i3",
        "text": "A cutpurse of the empire and the rule,",
        "char_start": 100755,
        "char_end": 100793,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp32i4",
        "text": "That from a shelf the precious diadem stole,",
        "char_start": 100794,
        "char_end": 100838,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp32i5",
        "text": "And put it in his pocket!",
        "char_start": 100839,
        "char_end": 100864,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp33i0",
        "text": "No more!",
        "char_start": 100865,
        "char_end": 100873,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp34i0",
        "text": "A king of shreds and patches,--",
        "char_start": 100874,
        "char_end": 100905,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp34i1",
        "text": "Enter Ghost",
        "char_start": 100906,
        "char_end": 100917,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp34i2",
        "text": "Save me, and hover o'er me with your wings,",
        "char_start": 100918,
        "char_end": 100961,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp34i3",
        "text": "You heavenly guards! What would your gracious figure?",
        "char_start": 100962,
        "char_end": 101015,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp35i0",
        "text": "Alas, he's mad!",
        "char_start": 101016,
        "char_end": 101031,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp36i0",
        "text": "Do you not come your tardy son to chide,",
        "char_start": 101032,
        "char_end": 101072,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp36i1",
        "text": "That, lapsed in time and passion, lets go by",
        "char_start": 101073,
        "char_end": 101117,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp36i2",
        "text": "The important acting of your dread command? O, say!",
        "char_start": 101118,
        "char_end": 101169,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp37i0",
        "text": "Do not forget: this visitation",
        "char_start": 101170,
        "char_end": 101200,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp37i1",
        "text": "Is but to whet thy almost blunted purpose.",
        "char_start": 101201,
        "char_end": 101243,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp37i2",
        "text": "But, look, amazement on thy mother sits:",
        "char_start": 101244,
        "char_end": 101284,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp37i3",
        "text": "O, step between her and her fighting soul:",
        "char_start": 101285,
        "char_end": 101327,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp37i4",
        "text": "Conceit in weakest bodies strongest works:",
        "char_start": 101328,
        "char_end": 101370,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp37i5",
        "text": "Speak to her, Hamlet.",
        "char_start": 101371,
        "char_end": 101392,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Ghost"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp38i0",
        "text": "How is it with you, lady?",
        "char_start": 101393,
        "char_end": 101418,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp39i0",
        "text": "Alas, how is't with you,",
        "char_start": 101419,
        "char_end": 101443,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp39i1",
        "text": "That you do bend your eye on vacancy",
        "char_start": 101444,
        "char_end": 101480,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp39i2",
        "text": "And with the incorporal air do hold discourse?",
        "char_start": 101481,
        "char_end": 101527,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp39i3",
        "text": "Forth at your eyes your spirits wildly peep;",
        "char_start": 101528,
        "char_end": 101572,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp39i4",
        "text": "And, as the sleeping soldiers in the alarm,",
        "char_start": 101573,
        "char_end": 101616,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp39i5",
        "text": "Your bedded hair, like life in excrements,",
        "char_start": 101617,
        "char_end": 101659,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp39i6",
        "text": "Starts up, and stands on end. O gentle son,",
        "char_start": 101660,
        "char_end": 101703,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp39i7",
        "text": "Upon the heat and flame of thy distemper",
        "char_start": 101704,
        "char_end": 101744,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp39i8",
        "text": "Sprinkle cool patience. Whereon do you look?",
        "char_start": 101745,
        "char_end": 101789,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp40i0",
        "text": "On him, on him! Look you, how pale he glares!",
        "char_start": 101790,
        "char_end": 101835,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp40i1",
        "text": "His form and cause conjoin'd, preaching to stones,",
        "char_start": 101836,
        "char_end": 101886,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp40i2",
        "text": "Would make them capable. Do not look upon me;",
        "char_start": 101887,
        "char_end": 101932,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp40i3",
        "text": "Lest with this piteous action you convert",
        "char_start": 101933,
        "char_end": 101974,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp40i4",
        "text": "My stern effects: then what I have to do",
        "char_start": 101975,
        "char_end": 102015,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp40i5",
        "text": "Will want true colour; tears perchance for blood.",
        "char_start": 102016,
        "char_end": 102065,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp41i0",
        "text": "To whom do you speak this?",
        "char_start": 102066,
        "char_end": 102092,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp42i0",
        "text": "Do you see nothing there?",
        "char_start": 102093,
        "char_end": 102118,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp43i0",
        "text": "Nothing at all; yet all that is I see.",
        "char_start": 102119,
        "char_end": 102157,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp44i0",
        "text": "Nor did you nothing hear?",
        "char_start": 102158,
        "char_end": 102183,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp45i0",
        "text": "No, nothing but ourselves.",
        "char_start": 102184,
        "char_end": 102210,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp46i0",
        "text": "Why, look you there! look, how it steals away!",
        "char_start": 102211,
        "char_end": 102257,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp46i1",
        "text": "My father, in his habit as he lived!",
        "char_start": 102258,
        "char_end": 102294,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp46i2",
        "text": "Look, where he goes, even now, out at the portal!",
        "char_start": 102295,
        "char_end": 102344,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp46i3",
        "text": "Exit Ghost",
        "char_start": 102345,
        "char_end": 102355,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp47i0",
        "text": "This the very coinage of your brain:",
        "char_start": 102356,
        "char_end": 102392,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp47i1",
        "text": "This bodiless creation ecstasy",
        "char_start": 102393,
        "char_end": 102423,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp47i2",
        "text": "Is very cunning in.",
        "char_start": 102424,
        "char_end": 102443,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i0",
        "text": "Ecstasy!",
        "char_start": 102444,
        "char_end": 102452,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i1",
        "text": "My pulse, as yours, doth temperately keep time,",
        "char_start": 102453,
        "char_end": 102500,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i2",
        "text": "And makes as healthful music: it is not madness",
        "char_start": 102501,
        "char_end": 102548,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i3",
        "text": "That I have utter'd: bring me to the test,",
        "char_start": 102549,
        "char_end": 102591,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i4",
        "text": "And I the matter will re-word; which madness",
        "char_start": 102592,
        "char_end": 102636,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i5",
        "text": "Would gambol from. Mother, for love of grace,",
        "char_start": 102637,
        "char_end": 102682,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i6",
        "text": "Lay not that mattering unction to your soul,",
        "char_start": 102683,
        "char_end": 102727,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i7",
        "text": "That not your trespass, but my madness speaks:",
        "char_start": 102728,
        "char_end": 102774,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i8",
        "text": "It will but skin and film the ulcerous place,",
        "char_start": 102775,
        "char_end": 102820,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i9",
        "text": "Whilst rank corruption, mining all within,",
        "char_start": 102821,
        "char_end": 102863,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i10",
        "text": "Infects unseen. Confess yourself to heaven;",
        "char_start": 102864,
        "char_end": 102907,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i11",
        "text": "Repent what's past; avoid what is to come;",
        "char_start": 102908,
        "char_end": 102950,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i12",
        "text": "And do not spread the compost on the weeds,",
        "char_start": 102951,
        "char_end": 102994,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i13",
        "text": "To make them ranker. Forgive me this my virtue;",
        "char_start": 102995,
        "char_end": 103042,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i14",
        "text": "For in the fatness of these pursy times",
        "char_start": 103043,
        "char_end": 103082,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i15",
        "text": "Virtue itself of vice must pardon beg,",
        "char_start": 103083,
        "char_end": 103121,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp48i16",
        "text": "Yea, curb and woo for leave to do him good.",
        "char_start": 103122,
        "char_end": 103165,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp49i0",
        "text": "O Hamlet, thou hast cleft my heart in twain.",
        "char_start": 103166,
        "char_end": 103210,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i0",
        "text": "O, throw away the worser part of it,",
        "char_start": 103211,
        "char_end": 103247,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i1",
        "text": "And live the purer with the other half.",
        "char_start": 103248,
        "char_end": 103287,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i2",
        "text": "Good night: but go not to mine uncle's bed;",
        "char_start": 103288,
        "char_end": 103331,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i3",
        "text": "Assume a virtue, if you have it not.",
        "char_start": 103332,
        "char_end": 103368,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i4",
        "text": "That monster, custom, who all sense doth eat,",
        "char_start": 103369,
        "char_end": 103414,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i5",
        "text": "Of habits devil, is angel yet in this,",
        "char_start": 103415,
        "char_end": 103453,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i6",
        "text": "That to the use of actions fair and good",
        "char_start": 103454,
        "char_end": 103494,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i7",
        "text": "He likewise gives a frock or livery,",
        "char_start": 103495,
        "char_end": 103531,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i8",
        "text": "That aptly is put on. Refrain to-night,",
        "char_start": 103532,
        "char_end": 103571,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i9",
        "text": "And that shall lend a kind of easiness",
        "char_start": 103572,
        "char_end": 103610,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i10",
        "text": "To the next abstinence: the next more easy;",
        "char_start": 103611,
        "char_end": 103654,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i11",
        "text": "For use almost can change the stamp of nature,",
        "char_start": 103655,
        "char_end": 103701,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i12",
        "text": "And either [ ] the devil, or throw him out",
        "char_start": 103702,
        "char_end": 103744,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i13",
        "text": "With wondrous potency. Once more, good night:",
        "char_start": 103745,
        "char_end": 103790,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i14",
        "text": "And when you are desirous to be bless'd,",
        "char_start": 103791,
        "char_end": 103831,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i15",
        "text": "I'll blessing beg of you. For this same lord,",
        "char_start": 103832,
        "char_end": 103877,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i16",
        "text": "Pointing to POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 103878,
        "char_end": 103898,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i17",
        "text": "I do repent: but heaven hath pleased it so,",
        "char_start": 103899,
        "char_end": 103942,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i18",
        "text": "To punish me with this and this with me,",
        "char_start": 103943,
        "char_end": 103983,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i19",
        "text": "That I must be their scourge and minister.",
        "char_start": 103984,
        "char_end": 104026,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i20",
        "text": "I will bestow him, and will answer well",
        "char_start": 104027,
        "char_end": 104066,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i21",
        "text": "The death I gave him. So, again, good night.",
        "char_start": 104067,
        "char_end": 104111,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i22",
        "text": "I must be cruel, only to be kind:",
        "char_start": 104112,
        "char_end": 104145,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i23",
        "text": "Thus bad begins and worse remains behind.",
        "char_start": 104146,
        "char_end": 104187,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp50i24",
        "text": "One word more, good lady.",
        "char_start": 104188,
        "char_end": 104213,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp51i0",
        "text": "What shall I do?",
        "char_start": 104214,
        "char_end": 104230,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i0",
        "text": "Not this, by no means, that I bid you do:",
        "char_start": 104231,
        "char_end": 104272,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i1",
        "text": "Let the bloat king tempt you again to bed;",
        "char_start": 104273,
        "char_end": 104315,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i2",
        "text": "Pinch wanton on your cheek; call you his mouse;",
        "char_start": 104316,
        "char_end": 104363,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i3",
        "text": "And let him, for a pair of reechy kisses,",
        "char_start": 104364,
        "char_end": 104405,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i4",
        "text": "Or paddling in your neck with his damn'd fingers,",
        "char_start": 104406,
        "char_end": 104455,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i5",
        "text": "Make you to ravel all this matter out,",
        "char_start": 104456,
        "char_end": 104494,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.203",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i6",
        "text": "That I essentially am not in madness,",
        "char_start": 104495,
        "char_end": 104532,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.204",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i7",
        "text": "But mad in craft. 'Twere good you let him know;",
        "char_start": 104533,
        "char_end": 104580,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.205",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i8",
        "text": "For who, that's but a queen, fair, sober, wise,",
        "char_start": 104581,
        "char_end": 104628,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.206",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i9",
        "text": "Would from a paddock, from a bat, a gib,",
        "char_start": 104629,
        "char_end": 104669,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.207",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i10",
        "text": "Such dear concernings hide? who would do so?",
        "char_start": 104670,
        "char_end": 104714,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.208",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i11",
        "text": "No, in despite of sense and secrecy,",
        "char_start": 104715,
        "char_end": 104751,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.209",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i12",
        "text": "Unpeg the basket on the house's top.",
        "char_start": 104752,
        "char_end": 104788,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.210",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i13",
        "text": "Let the birds fly, and, like the famous ape,",
        "char_start": 104789,
        "char_end": 104833,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.211",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i14",
        "text": "To try conclusions, in the basket creep,",
        "char_start": 104834,
        "char_end": 104874,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.212",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp52i15",
        "text": "And break your own neck down.",
        "char_start": 104875,
        "char_end": 104904,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.213",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp53i0",
        "text": "Be thou assured, if words be made of breath,",
        "char_start": 104905,
        "char_end": 104949,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.214",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp53i1",
        "text": "And breath of life, I have no life to breathe",
        "char_start": 104950,
        "char_end": 104995,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.215",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp53i2",
        "text": "What thou hast said to me.",
        "char_start": 104996,
        "char_end": 105022,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.216",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp54i0",
        "text": "I must to England; you know that?",
        "char_start": 105023,
        "char_end": 105056,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.217",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp55i0",
        "text": "Alack,",
        "char_start": 105057,
        "char_end": 105063,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.218",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp55i1",
        "text": "I had forgot: 'tis so concluded on.",
        "char_start": 105064,
        "char_end": 105099,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.219",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i0",
        "text": "There's letters seal'd: and my two schoolfellows,",
        "char_start": 105100,
        "char_end": 105149,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.220",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i1",
        "text": "Whom I will trust as I will adders fang'd,",
        "char_start": 105150,
        "char_end": 105192,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.221",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i2",
        "text": "They bear the mandate; they must sweep my way,",
        "char_start": 105193,
        "char_end": 105239,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.222",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i3",
        "text": "And marshal me to knavery. Let it work;",
        "char_start": 105240,
        "char_end": 105279,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.223",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i4",
        "text": "For 'tis the sport to have the engineer",
        "char_start": 105280,
        "char_end": 105319,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.224",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i5",
        "text": "Hoist with his own petard: and 't shall go hard",
        "char_start": 105320,
        "char_end": 105367,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.225",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i6",
        "text": "But I will delve one yard below their mines,",
        "char_start": 105368,
        "char_end": 105412,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.226",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i7",
        "text": "And blow them at the moon: O, 'tis most sweet,",
        "char_start": 105413,
        "char_end": 105459,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.227",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i8",
        "text": "When in one line two crafts directly meet.",
        "char_start": 105460,
        "char_end": 105502,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.228",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i9",
        "text": "This man shall set me packing:",
        "char_start": 105503,
        "char_end": 105533,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.229",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i10",
        "text": "I'll lug the guts into the neighbour room.",
        "char_start": 105534,
        "char_end": 105576,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.230",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i11",
        "text": "Mother, good night. Indeed this counsellor",
        "char_start": 105577,
        "char_end": 105619,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.231",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i12",
        "text": "Is now most still, most secret and most grave,",
        "char_start": 105620,
        "char_end": 105666,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.232",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i13",
        "text": "Who was in life a foolish prating knave.",
        "char_start": 105667,
        "char_end": 105707,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.233",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i14",
        "text": "Come, sir, to draw toward an end with you.",
        "char_start": 105708,
        "char_end": 105750,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.234",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i15",
        "text": "Good night, mother.",
        "char_start": 105751,
        "char_end": 105770,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "3.4.235",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a3s4:sp56i16",
        "text": "Exeunt severally; HAMLET dragging in POLONIUS",
        "char_start": 105771,
        "char_end": 105816,
        "act": 3,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:open",
        "text": "Enter KING CLAUDIUS, QUEEN GERTRUDE, ROSENCRANTZ, and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 105817,
        "char_end": 105883,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp1i0",
        "text": "There's matter in these sighs, these profound heaves:",
        "char_start": 105884,
        "char_end": 105937,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp1i1",
        "text": "You must translate: 'tis fit we understand them.",
        "char_start": 105938,
        "char_end": 105986,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp1i2",
        "text": "Where is your son?",
        "char_start": 105987,
        "char_end": 106005,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp2i0",
        "text": "Bestow this place on us a little while.",
        "char_start": 106006,
        "char_end": 106045,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp2i1",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 106046,
        "char_end": 106081,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp2i2",
        "text": "Ah, my good lord, what have I seen to-night!",
        "char_start": 106082,
        "char_end": 106126,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp3i0",
        "text": "What, Gertrude? How does Hamlet?",
        "char_start": 106127,
        "char_end": 106159,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp4i0",
        "text": "Mad as the sea and wind, when both contend",
        "char_start": 106160,
        "char_end": 106202,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp4i1",
        "text": "Which is the mightier: in his lawless fit,",
        "char_start": 106203,
        "char_end": 106245,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp4i2",
        "text": "Behind the arras hearing something stir,",
        "char_start": 106246,
        "char_end": 106286,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp4i3",
        "text": "Whips out his rapier, cries, 'A rat, a rat!'",
        "char_start": 106287,
        "char_end": 106331,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp4i4",
        "text": "And, in this brainish apprehension, kills",
        "char_start": 106332,
        "char_end": 106373,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp4i5",
        "text": "The unseen good old man.",
        "char_start": 106374,
        "char_end": 106398,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i0",
        "text": "O heavy deed!",
        "char_start": 106399,
        "char_end": 106412,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i1",
        "text": "It had been so with us, had we been there:",
        "char_start": 106413,
        "char_end": 106455,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i2",
        "text": "His liberty is full of threats to all;",
        "char_start": 106456,
        "char_end": 106494,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i3",
        "text": "To you yourself, to us, to every one.",
        "char_start": 106495,
        "char_end": 106532,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i4",
        "text": "Alas, how shall this bloody deed be answer'd?",
        "char_start": 106533,
        "char_end": 106578,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i5",
        "text": "It will be laid to us, whose providence",
        "char_start": 106579,
        "char_end": 106618,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i6",
        "text": "Should have kept short, restrain'd and out of haunt,",
        "char_start": 106619,
        "char_end": 106671,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i7",
        "text": "This mad young man: but so much was our love,",
        "char_start": 106672,
        "char_end": 106717,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i8",
        "text": "We would not understand what was most fit;",
        "char_start": 106718,
        "char_end": 106760,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i9",
        "text": "But, like the owner of a foul disease,",
        "char_start": 106761,
        "char_end": 106799,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i10",
        "text": "To keep it from divulging, let it feed",
        "char_start": 106800,
        "char_end": 106838,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp5i11",
        "text": "Even on the pith of Life. Where is he gone?",
        "char_start": 106839,
        "char_end": 106882,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp6i0",
        "text": "To draw apart the body he hath kill'd:",
        "char_start": 106883,
        "char_end": 106921,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp6i1",
        "text": "O'er whom his very madness, like some ore",
        "char_start": 106922,
        "char_end": 106963,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp6i2",
        "text": "Among a mineral of metals base,",
        "char_start": 106964,
        "char_end": 106995,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp6i3",
        "text": "Shows itself pure; he weeps for what is done.",
        "char_start": 106996,
        "char_end": 107041,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i0",
        "text": "O Gertrude, come away!",
        "char_start": 107042,
        "char_end": 107064,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i1",
        "text": "The sun no sooner shall the mountains touch,",
        "char_start": 107065,
        "char_end": 107109,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i2",
        "text": "But we will ship him hence: and this vile deed",
        "char_start": 107110,
        "char_end": 107156,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i3",
        "text": "We must, with all our majesty and skill,",
        "char_start": 107157,
        "char_end": 107197,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i4",
        "text": "Both countenance and excuse. Ho, Guildenstern!",
        "char_start": 107198,
        "char_end": 107244,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i5",
        "text": "Re-enter ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 107245,
        "char_end": 107282,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i6",
        "text": "Friends both, go join you with some further aid:",
        "char_start": 107283,
        "char_end": 107331,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i7",
        "text": "Hamlet in madness hath Polonius slain,",
        "char_start": 107332,
        "char_end": 107370,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i8",
        "text": "And from his mother's closet hath he dragg'd him:",
        "char_start": 107371,
        "char_end": 107420,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i9",
        "text": "Go seek him out; speak fair, and bring the body",
        "char_start": 107421,
        "char_end": 107468,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i10",
        "text": "Into the chapel. I pray you, haste in this.",
        "char_start": 107469,
        "char_end": 107512,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i11",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 107513,
        "char_end": 107548,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i12",
        "text": "Come, Gertrude, we'll call up our wisest friends;",
        "char_start": 107549,
        "char_end": 107598,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i13",
        "text": "And let them know, both what we mean to do,",
        "char_start": 107599,
        "char_end": 107642,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i14",
        "text": "And what's untimely done. O, come away!",
        "char_start": 107643,
        "char_end": 107682,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i15",
        "text": "My soul is full of discord and dismay.",
        "char_start": 107683,
        "char_end": 107721,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "4.1.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s1:sp7i16",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 107722,
        "char_end": 107728,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:open",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET",
        "char_start": 107729,
        "char_end": 107741,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp1i0",
        "text": "Safely stowed.",
        "char_start": 107742,
        "char_end": 107756,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp2i0",
        "text": "[Within] Hamlet! Lord Hamlet!",
        "char_start": 107757,
        "char_end": 107786,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ:"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp3i0",
        "text": "[Within] Hamlet! Lord Hamlet!",
        "char_start": 107787,
        "char_end": 107816,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN:"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp4i0",
        "text": "What noise? who calls on Hamlet?",
        "char_start": 107817,
        "char_end": 107849,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp4i1",
        "text": "O, here they come.",
        "char_start": 107850,
        "char_end": 107868,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp4i2",
        "text": "Enter ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 107869,
        "char_end": 107903,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp5i0",
        "text": "What have you done, my lord, with the dead body?",
        "char_start": 107904,
        "char_end": 107952,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp6i0",
        "text": "Compounded it with dust, whereto 'tis kin.",
        "char_start": 107953,
        "char_end": 107995,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp7i0",
        "text": "Tell us where 'tis, that we may take it thence",
        "char_start": 107996,
        "char_end": 108042,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp7i1",
        "text": "And bear it to the chapel.",
        "char_start": 108043,
        "char_end": 108069,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp8i0",
        "text": "Do not believe it.",
        "char_start": 108070,
        "char_end": 108088,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp9i0",
        "text": "Believe what?",
        "char_start": 108089,
        "char_end": 108102,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp10i0",
        "text": "That I can keep your counsel and not mine own.",
        "char_start": 108103,
        "char_end": 108149,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp10i1",
        "text": "Besides, to be demanded of a sponge! what",
        "char_start": 108150,
        "char_end": 108191,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp10i2",
        "text": "replication should be made by the son of a king?",
        "char_start": 108192,
        "char_end": 108240,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp11i0",
        "text": "Take you me for a sponge, my lord?",
        "char_start": 108241,
        "char_end": 108275,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp12i0",
        "text": "Ay, sir, that soaks up the king's countenance, his",
        "char_start": 108276,
        "char_end": 108326,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp12i1",
        "text": "rewards, his authorities. But such officers do the",
        "char_start": 108327,
        "char_end": 108377,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp12i2",
        "text": "king best service in the end: he keeps them, like",
        "char_start": 108378,
        "char_end": 108427,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp12i3",
        "text": "an ape, in the corner of his jaw; first mouthed, to",
        "char_start": 108428,
        "char_end": 108479,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp12i4",
        "text": "be last swallowed: when he needs what you have",
        "char_start": 108480,
        "char_end": 108526,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp12i5",
        "text": "gleaned, it is but squeezing you, and, sponge, you",
        "char_start": 108527,
        "char_end": 108577,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp12i6",
        "text": "shall be dry again.",
        "char_start": 108578,
        "char_end": 108597,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp13i0",
        "text": "I understand you not, my lord.",
        "char_start": 108598,
        "char_end": 108628,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp14i0",
        "text": "I am glad of it: a knavish speech sleeps in a",
        "char_start": 108629,
        "char_end": 108674,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp14i1",
        "text": "foolish ear.",
        "char_start": 108675,
        "char_end": 108687,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp15i0",
        "text": "My lord, you must tell us where the body is, and go",
        "char_start": 108688,
        "char_end": 108739,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp15i1",
        "text": "with us to the king.",
        "char_start": 108740,
        "char_end": 108760,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp16i0",
        "text": "The body is with the king, but the king is not with",
        "char_start": 108761,
        "char_end": 108812,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp16i1",
        "text": "the body. The king is a thing--",
        "char_start": 108813,
        "char_end": 108844,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp17i0",
        "text": "A thing, my lord!",
        "char_start": 108845,
        "char_end": 108862,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "GUILDENSTERN"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp18i0",
        "text": "Of nothing: bring me to him. Hide fox, and all after.",
        "char_start": 108863,
        "char_end": 108916,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "4.2.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s2:sp18i1",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 108917,
        "char_end": 108923,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:open",
        "text": "Enter KING CLAUDIUS, attended",
        "char_start": 108924,
        "char_end": 108953,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i0",
        "text": "I have sent to seek him, and to find the body.",
        "char_start": 108954,
        "char_end": 109000,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i1",
        "text": "How dangerous is it that this man goes loose!",
        "char_start": 109001,
        "char_end": 109046,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i2",
        "text": "Yet must not we put the strong law on him:",
        "char_start": 109047,
        "char_end": 109089,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i3",
        "text": "He's loved of the distracted multitude,",
        "char_start": 109090,
        "char_end": 109129,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i4",
        "text": "Who like not in their judgment, but their eyes;",
        "char_start": 109130,
        "char_end": 109177,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i5",
        "text": "And where tis so, the offender's scourge is weigh'd,",
        "char_start": 109178,
        "char_end": 109230,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i6",
        "text": "But never the offence. To bear all smooth and even,",
        "char_start": 109231,
        "char_end": 109282,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i7",
        "text": "This sudden sending him away must seem",
        "char_start": 109283,
        "char_end": 109321,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i8",
        "text": "Deliberate pause: diseases desperate grown",
        "char_start": 109322,
        "char_end": 109364,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i9",
        "text": "By desperate appliance are relieved,",
        "char_start": 109365,
        "char_end": 109401,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i10",
        "text": "Or not at all.",
        "char_start": 109402,
        "char_end": 109416,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i11",
        "text": "Enter ROSENCRANTZ",
        "char_start": 109417,
        "char_end": 109434,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp1i12",
        "text": "How now! what hath befall'n?",
        "char_start": 109435,
        "char_end": 109463,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp2i0",
        "text": "Where the dead body is bestow'd, my lord,",
        "char_start": 109464,
        "char_end": 109505,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp2i1",
        "text": "We cannot get from him.",
        "char_start": 109506,
        "char_end": 109529,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp3i0",
        "text": "But where is he?",
        "char_start": 109530,
        "char_end": 109546,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp4i0",
        "text": "Without, my lord; guarded, to know your pleasure.",
        "char_start": 109547,
        "char_end": 109596,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp5i0",
        "text": "Bring him before us.",
        "char_start": 109597,
        "char_end": 109617,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp6i0",
        "text": "Ho, Guildenstern! bring in my lord.",
        "char_start": 109618,
        "char_end": 109653,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp6i1",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 109654,
        "char_end": 109683,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp7i0",
        "text": "Now, Hamlet, where's Polonius?",
        "char_start": 109684,
        "char_end": 109714,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp8i0",
        "text": "At supper.",
        "char_start": 109715,
        "char_end": 109725,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp9i0",
        "text": "At supper! where?",
        "char_start": 109726,
        "char_end": 109743,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp10i0",
        "text": "Not where he eats, but where he is eaten: a certain",
        "char_start": 109744,
        "char_end": 109795,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp10i1",
        "text": "convocation of politic worms are e'en at him. Your",
        "char_start": 109796,
        "char_end": 109846,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp10i2",
        "text": "worm is your only emperor for diet: we fat all",
        "char_start": 109847,
        "char_end": 109893,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp10i3",
        "text": "creatures else to fat us, and we fat ourselves for",
        "char_start": 109894,
        "char_end": 109944,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp10i4",
        "text": "maggots: your fat king and your lean beggar is but",
        "char_start": 109945,
        "char_end": 109995,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp10i5",
        "text": "variable service, two dishes, but to one table:",
        "char_start": 109996,
        "char_end": 110043,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp10i6",
        "text": "that's the end.",
        "char_start": 110044,
        "char_end": 110059,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp11i0",
        "text": "Alas, alas!",
        "char_start": 110060,
        "char_end": 110071,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp12i0",
        "text": "A man may fish with the worm that hath eat of a",
        "char_start": 110072,
        "char_end": 110119,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp12i1",
        "text": "king, and eat of the fish that hath fed of that worm.",
        "char_start": 110120,
        "char_end": 110173,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp13i0",
        "text": "What dost you mean by this?",
        "char_start": 110174,
        "char_end": 110201,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp14i0",
        "text": "Nothing but to show you how a king may go a",
        "char_start": 110202,
        "char_end": 110245,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp14i1",
        "text": "progress through the guts of a beggar.",
        "char_start": 110246,
        "char_end": 110284,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp15i0",
        "text": "Where is Polonius?",
        "char_start": 110285,
        "char_end": 110303,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp16i0",
        "text": "In heaven; send hither to see: if your messenger",
        "char_start": 110304,
        "char_end": 110352,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp16i1",
        "text": "find him not there, seek him i' the other place",
        "char_start": 110353,
        "char_end": 110400,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp16i2",
        "text": "yourself. But indeed, if you find him not within",
        "char_start": 110401,
        "char_end": 110449,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp16i3",
        "text": "this month, you shall nose him as you go up the",
        "char_start": 110450,
        "char_end": 110497,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp16i4",
        "text": "stairs into the lobby.",
        "char_start": 110498,
        "char_end": 110520,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp17i0",
        "text": "Go seek him there.",
        "char_start": 110521,
        "char_end": 110539,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp17i1",
        "text": "To some Attendants",
        "char_start": 110540,
        "char_end": 110558,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp18i0",
        "text": "He will stay till ye come.",
        "char_start": 110559,
        "char_end": 110585,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp18i1",
        "text": "Exeunt Attendants",
        "char_start": 110586,
        "char_end": 110603,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp19i0",
        "text": "Hamlet, this deed, for thine especial safety,--",
        "char_start": 110604,
        "char_end": 110651,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp19i1",
        "text": "Which we do tender, as we dearly grieve",
        "char_start": 110652,
        "char_end": 110691,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp19i2",
        "text": "For that which thou hast done,--must send thee hence",
        "char_start": 110692,
        "char_end": 110744,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp19i3",
        "text": "With fiery quickness: therefore prepare thyself;",
        "char_start": 110745,
        "char_end": 110793,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp19i4",
        "text": "The bark is ready, and the wind at help,",
        "char_start": 110794,
        "char_end": 110834,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp19i5",
        "text": "The associates tend, and every thing is bent",
        "char_start": 110835,
        "char_end": 110879,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp19i6",
        "text": "For England.",
        "char_start": 110880,
        "char_end": 110892,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp20i0",
        "text": "For England!",
        "char_start": 110893,
        "char_end": 110905,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp21i0",
        "text": "Ay, Hamlet.",
        "char_start": 110906,
        "char_end": 110917,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp22i0",
        "text": "Good.",
        "char_start": 110918,
        "char_end": 110923,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp23i0",
        "text": "So is it, if thou knew'st our purposes.",
        "char_start": 110924,
        "char_end": 110963,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp24i0",
        "text": "I see a cherub that sees them. But, come; for",
        "char_start": 110964,
        "char_end": 111009,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp24i1",
        "text": "England! Farewell, dear mother.",
        "char_start": 111010,
        "char_end": 111041,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp25i0",
        "text": "Thy loving father, Hamlet.",
        "char_start": 111042,
        "char_end": 111068,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp26i0",
        "text": "My mother: father and mother is man and wife; man",
        "char_start": 111069,
        "char_end": 111118,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp26i1",
        "text": "and wife is one flesh; and so, my mother. Come, for England!",
        "char_start": 111119,
        "char_end": 111179,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp26i2",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 111180,
        "char_end": 111184,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i0",
        "text": "Follow him at foot; tempt him with speed aboard;",
        "char_start": 111185,
        "char_end": 111233,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i1",
        "text": "Delay it not; I'll have him hence to-night:",
        "char_start": 111234,
        "char_end": 111277,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i2",
        "text": "Away! for every thing is seal'd and done",
        "char_start": 111278,
        "char_end": 111318,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i3",
        "text": "That else leans on the affair: pray you, make haste.",
        "char_start": 111319,
        "char_end": 111371,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i4",
        "text": "Exeunt ROSENCRANTZ and GUILDENSTERN",
        "char_start": 111372,
        "char_end": 111407,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i5",
        "text": "And, England, if my love thou hold'st at aught--",
        "char_start": 111408,
        "char_end": 111456,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i6",
        "text": "As my great power thereof may give thee sense,",
        "char_start": 111457,
        "char_end": 111503,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i7",
        "text": "Since yet thy cicatrice looks raw and red",
        "char_start": 111504,
        "char_end": 111545,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i8",
        "text": "After the Danish sword, and thy free awe",
        "char_start": 111546,
        "char_end": 111586,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i9",
        "text": "Pays homage to us--thou mayst not coldly set",
        "char_start": 111587,
        "char_end": 111631,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i10",
        "text": "Our sovereign process; which imports at full,",
        "char_start": 111632,
        "char_end": 111677,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i11",
        "text": "By letters congruing to that effect,",
        "char_start": 111678,
        "char_end": 111714,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i12",
        "text": "The present death of Hamlet. Do it, England;",
        "char_start": 111715,
        "char_end": 111759,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i13",
        "text": "For like the hectic in my blood he rages,",
        "char_start": 111760,
        "char_end": 111801,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i14",
        "text": "And thou must cure me: till I know 'tis done,",
        "char_start": 111802,
        "char_end": 111847,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i15",
        "text": "Howe'er my haps, my joys were ne'er begun.",
        "char_start": 111848,
        "char_end": 111890,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": "4.3.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s3:sp27i16",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 111891,
        "char_end": 111895,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 3,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:open",
        "text": "Enter FORTINBRAS, a Captain, and Soldiers, marching",
        "char_start": 111896,
        "char_end": 111947,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp1i0",
        "text": "Go, captain, from me greet the Danish king;",
        "char_start": 111948,
        "char_end": 111991,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp1i1",
        "text": "Tell him that, by his licence, Fortinbras",
        "char_start": 111992,
        "char_end": 112033,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp1i2",
        "text": "Craves the conveyance of a promised march",
        "char_start": 112034,
        "char_end": 112075,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp1i3",
        "text": "Over his kingdom. You know the rendezvous.",
        "char_start": 112076,
        "char_end": 112118,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp1i4",
        "text": "If that his majesty would aught with us,",
        "char_start": 112119,
        "char_end": 112159,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp1i5",
        "text": "We shall express our duty in his eye;",
        "char_start": 112160,
        "char_end": 112197,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp1i6",
        "text": "And let him know so.",
        "char_start": 112198,
        "char_end": 112218,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp2i0",
        "text": "I will do't, my lord.",
        "char_start": 112219,
        "char_end": 112240,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp3i0",
        "text": "Go softly on.",
        "char_start": 112241,
        "char_end": 112254,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp3i1",
        "text": "Exeunt FORTINBRAS and Soldiers",
        "char_start": 112255,
        "char_end": 112285,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp3i2",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET, ROSENCRANTZ, GUILDENSTERN, and others",
        "char_start": 112286,
        "char_end": 112337,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp4i0",
        "text": "Good sir, whose powers are these?",
        "char_start": 112338,
        "char_end": 112371,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp5i0",
        "text": "They are of Norway, sir.",
        "char_start": 112372,
        "char_end": 112396,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp6i0",
        "text": "How purposed, sir, I pray you?",
        "char_start": 112397,
        "char_end": 112427,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp7i0",
        "text": "Against some part of Poland.",
        "char_start": 112428,
        "char_end": 112456,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp8i0",
        "text": "Who commands them, sir?",
        "char_start": 112457,
        "char_end": 112480,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp9i0",
        "text": "The nephews to old Norway, Fortinbras.",
        "char_start": 112481,
        "char_end": 112519,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp10i0",
        "text": "Goes it against the main of Poland, sir,",
        "char_start": 112520,
        "char_end": 112560,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp10i1",
        "text": "Or for some frontier?",
        "char_start": 112561,
        "char_end": 112582,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp11i0",
        "text": "Truly to speak, and with no addition,",
        "char_start": 112583,
        "char_end": 112620,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp11i1",
        "text": "We go to gain a little patch of ground",
        "char_start": 112621,
        "char_end": 112659,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp11i2",
        "text": "That hath in it no profit but the name.",
        "char_start": 112660,
        "char_end": 112699,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp11i3",
        "text": "To pay five ducats, five, I would not farm it;",
        "char_start": 112700,
        "char_end": 112746,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp11i4",
        "text": "Nor will it yield to Norway or the Pole",
        "char_start": 112747,
        "char_end": 112786,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp11i5",
        "text": "A ranker rate, should it be sold in fee.",
        "char_start": 112787,
        "char_end": 112827,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp12i0",
        "text": "Why, then the Polack never will defend it.",
        "char_start": 112828,
        "char_end": 112870,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp13i0",
        "text": "Yes, it is already garrison'd.",
        "char_start": 112871,
        "char_end": 112901,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp14i0",
        "text": "Two thousand souls and twenty thousand ducats",
        "char_start": 112902,
        "char_end": 112947,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp14i1",
        "text": "Will not debate the question of this straw:",
        "char_start": 112948,
        "char_end": 112991,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp14i2",
        "text": "This is the imposthume of much wealth and peace,",
        "char_start": 112992,
        "char_end": 113040,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp14i3",
        "text": "That inward breaks, and shows no cause without",
        "char_start": 113041,
        "char_end": 113087,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp14i4",
        "text": "Why the man dies. I humbly thank you, sir.",
        "char_start": 113088,
        "char_end": 113130,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp15i0",
        "text": "God be wi' you, sir.",
        "char_start": 113131,
        "char_end": 113151,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp15i1",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 113152,
        "char_end": 113156,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "Captain"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp16i0",
        "text": "Wilt please you go, my lord?",
        "char_start": 113157,
        "char_end": 113185,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "ROSENCRANTZ"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i0",
        "text": "I'll be with you straight go a little before.",
        "char_start": 113186,
        "char_end": 113231,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i1",
        "text": "Exeunt all except HAMLET",
        "char_start": 113232,
        "char_end": 113256,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i2",
        "text": "How all occasions do inform against me,",
        "char_start": 113257,
        "char_end": 113296,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i3",
        "text": "And spur my dull revenge! What is a man,",
        "char_start": 113297,
        "char_end": 113337,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i4",
        "text": "If his chief good and market of his time",
        "char_start": 113338,
        "char_end": 113378,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i5",
        "text": "Be but to sleep and feed? a beast, no more.",
        "char_start": 113379,
        "char_end": 113422,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i6",
        "text": "Sure, he that made us with such large discourse,",
        "char_start": 113423,
        "char_end": 113471,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i7",
        "text": "Looking before and after, gave us not",
        "char_start": 113472,
        "char_end": 113509,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i8",
        "text": "That capability and god-like reason",
        "char_start": 113510,
        "char_end": 113545,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i9",
        "text": "To fust in us unused. Now, whether it be",
        "char_start": 113546,
        "char_end": 113586,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i10",
        "text": "Bestial oblivion, or some craven scruple",
        "char_start": 113587,
        "char_end": 113627,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i11",
        "text": "Of thinking too precisely on the event,",
        "char_start": 113628,
        "char_end": 113667,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i12",
        "text": "A thought which, quarter'd, hath but one part wisdom",
        "char_start": 113668,
        "char_end": 113720,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i13",
        "text": "And ever three parts coward, I do not know",
        "char_start": 113721,
        "char_end": 113763,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i14",
        "text": "Why yet I live to say 'This thing's to do;'",
        "char_start": 113764,
        "char_end": 113807,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i15",
        "text": "Sith I have cause and will and strength and means",
        "char_start": 113808,
        "char_end": 113857,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i16",
        "text": "To do't. Examples gross as earth exhort me:",
        "char_start": 113858,
        "char_end": 113901,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i17",
        "text": "Witness this army of such mass and charge",
        "char_start": 113902,
        "char_end": 113943,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i18",
        "text": "Led by a delicate and tender prince,",
        "char_start": 113944,
        "char_end": 113980,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i19",
        "text": "Whose spirit with divine ambition puff'd",
        "char_start": 113981,
        "char_end": 114021,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i20",
        "text": "Makes mouths at the invisible event,",
        "char_start": 114022,
        "char_end": 114058,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i21",
        "text": "Exposing what is mortal and unsure",
        "char_start": 114059,
        "char_end": 114093,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i22",
        "text": "To all that fortune, death and danger dare,",
        "char_start": 114094,
        "char_end": 114137,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i23",
        "text": "Even for an egg-shell. Rightly to be great",
        "char_start": 114138,
        "char_end": 114180,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i24",
        "text": "Is not to stir without great argument,",
        "char_start": 114181,
        "char_end": 114219,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i25",
        "text": "But greatly to find quarrel in a straw",
        "char_start": 114220,
        "char_end": 114258,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i26",
        "text": "When honour's at the stake. How stand I then,",
        "char_start": 114259,
        "char_end": 114304,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i27",
        "text": "That have a father kill'd, a mother stain'd,",
        "char_start": 114305,
        "char_end": 114349,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i28",
        "text": "Excitements of my reason and my blood,",
        "char_start": 114350,
        "char_end": 114388,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i29",
        "text": "And let all sleep? while, to my shame, I see",
        "char_start": 114389,
        "char_end": 114433,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i30",
        "text": "The imminent death of twenty thousand men,",
        "char_start": 114434,
        "char_end": 114476,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i31",
        "text": "That, for a fantasy and trick of fame,",
        "char_start": 114477,
        "char_end": 114515,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i32",
        "text": "Go to their graves like beds, fight for a plot",
        "char_start": 114516,
        "char_end": 114562,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i33",
        "text": "Whereon the numbers cannot try the cause,",
        "char_start": 114563,
        "char_end": 114604,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i34",
        "text": "Which is not tomb enough and continent",
        "char_start": 114605,
        "char_end": 114643,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i35",
        "text": "To hide the slain? O, from this time forth,",
        "char_start": 114644,
        "char_end": 114687,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i36",
        "text": "My thoughts be bloody, or be nothing worth!",
        "char_start": 114688,
        "char_end": 114731,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": "4.4.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s4:sp17i37",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 114732,
        "char_end": 114736,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 4,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:open",
        "text": "Enter QUEEN GERTRUDE, HORATIO, and a Gentleman",
        "char_start": 114737,
        "char_end": 114783,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp1i0",
        "text": "I will not speak with her.",
        "char_start": 114784,
        "char_end": 114810,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp2i0",
        "text": "She is importunate, indeed distract:",
        "char_start": 114811,
        "char_end": 114847,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp2i1",
        "text": "Her mood will needs be pitied.",
        "char_start": 114848,
        "char_end": 114878,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp3i0",
        "text": "What would she have?",
        "char_start": 114879,
        "char_end": 114899,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i0",
        "text": "She speaks much of her father; says she hears",
        "char_start": 114900,
        "char_end": 114945,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i1",
        "text": "There's tricks i' the world; and hems, and beats her heart;",
        "char_start": 114946,
        "char_end": 115005,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i2",
        "text": "Spurns enviously at straws; speaks things in doubt,",
        "char_start": 115006,
        "char_end": 115057,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i3",
        "text": "That carry but half sense: her speech is nothing,",
        "char_start": 115058,
        "char_end": 115107,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i4",
        "text": "Yet the unshaped use of it doth move",
        "char_start": 115108,
        "char_end": 115144,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i5",
        "text": "The hearers to collection; they aim at it,",
        "char_start": 115145,
        "char_end": 115187,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i6",
        "text": "And botch the words up fit to their own thoughts;",
        "char_start": 115188,
        "char_end": 115237,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i7",
        "text": "Which, as her winks, and nods, and gestures",
        "char_start": 115238,
        "char_end": 115281,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i8",
        "text": "yield them,",
        "char_start": 115282,
        "char_end": 115293,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i9",
        "text": "Indeed would make one think there might be thought,",
        "char_start": 115294,
        "char_end": 115345,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp4i10",
        "text": "Though nothing sure, yet much unhappily.",
        "char_start": 115346,
        "char_end": 115386,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp5i0",
        "text": "'Twere good she were spoken with; for she may strew",
        "char_start": 115387,
        "char_end": 115438,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp5i1",
        "text": "Dangerous conjectures in ill-breeding minds.",
        "char_start": 115439,
        "char_end": 115483,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp6i0",
        "text": "Let her come in.",
        "char_start": 115484,
        "char_end": 115500,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp6i1",
        "text": "Exit HORATIO",
        "char_start": 115501,
        "char_end": 115513,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp6i2",
        "text": "To my sick soul, as sin's true nature is,",
        "char_start": 115514,
        "char_end": 115555,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp6i3",
        "text": "Each toy seems prologue to some great amiss:",
        "char_start": 115556,
        "char_end": 115600,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp6i4",
        "text": "So full of artless jealousy is guilt,",
        "char_start": 115601,
        "char_end": 115638,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp6i5",
        "text": "It spills itself in fearing to be spilt.",
        "char_start": 115639,
        "char_end": 115679,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp6i6",
        "text": "Re-enter HORATIO, with OPHELIA",
        "char_start": 115680,
        "char_end": 115710,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp7i0",
        "text": "Where is the beauteous majesty of Denmark?",
        "char_start": 115711,
        "char_end": 115753,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp8i0",
        "text": "How now, Ophelia!",
        "char_start": 115754,
        "char_end": 115771,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp9i0",
        "text": "[Sings]",
        "char_start": 115772,
        "char_end": 115779,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp9i1",
        "text": "How should I your true love know",
        "char_start": 115780,
        "char_end": 115812,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp9i2",
        "text": "From another one?",
        "char_start": 115813,
        "char_end": 115830,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp9i3",
        "text": "By his cockle hat and staff,",
        "char_start": 115831,
        "char_end": 115859,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp9i4",
        "text": "And his sandal shoon.",
        "char_start": 115860,
        "char_end": 115881,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp10i0",
        "text": "Alas, sweet lady, what imports this song?",
        "char_start": 115882,
        "char_end": 115923,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp11i0",
        "text": "Say you? nay, pray you, mark.",
        "char_start": 115924,
        "char_end": 115953,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp11i1",
        "text": "Sings",
        "char_start": 115954,
        "char_end": 115959,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp11i2",
        "text": "He is dead and gone, lady,",
        "char_start": 115960,
        "char_end": 115986,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp11i3",
        "text": "He is dead and gone;",
        "char_start": 115987,
        "char_end": 116007,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp11i4",
        "text": "At his head a grass-green turf,",
        "char_start": 116008,
        "char_end": 116039,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp11i5",
        "text": "At his heels a stone.",
        "char_start": 116040,
        "char_end": 116061,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp12i0",
        "text": "Nay, but, Ophelia,--",
        "char_start": 116062,
        "char_end": 116082,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp13i0",
        "text": "Pray you, mark.",
        "char_start": 116083,
        "char_end": 116098,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp13i1",
        "text": "Sings",
        "char_start": 116099,
        "char_end": 116104,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp13i2",
        "text": "White his shroud as the mountain snow,--",
        "char_start": 116105,
        "char_end": 116145,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp13i3",
        "text": "Enter KING CLAUDIUS",
        "char_start": 116146,
        "char_end": 116165,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp14i0",
        "text": "Alas, look here, my lord.",
        "char_start": 116166,
        "char_end": 116191,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp15i0",
        "text": "[Sings]",
        "char_start": 116192,
        "char_end": 116199,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp15i1",
        "text": "Larded with sweet flowers",
        "char_start": 116200,
        "char_end": 116225,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp15i2",
        "text": "Which bewept to the grave did go",
        "char_start": 116226,
        "char_end": 116258,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp15i3",
        "text": "With true-love showers.",
        "char_start": 116259,
        "char_end": 116282,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp16i0",
        "text": "How do you, pretty lady?",
        "char_start": 116283,
        "char_end": 116307,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp17i0",
        "text": "Well, God 'ild you! They say the owl was a baker's",
        "char_start": 116308,
        "char_end": 116358,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp17i1",
        "text": "daughter. Lord, we know what we are, but know not",
        "char_start": 116359,
        "char_end": 116408,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp17i2",
        "text": "what we may be. God be at your table!",
        "char_start": 116409,
        "char_end": 116446,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp18i0",
        "text": "Conceit upon her father.",
        "char_start": 116447,
        "char_end": 116471,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i0",
        "text": "Pray you, let's have no words of this; but when they",
        "char_start": 116472,
        "char_end": 116524,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i1",
        "text": "ask you what it means, say you this:",
        "char_start": 116525,
        "char_end": 116561,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i2",
        "text": "Sings",
        "char_start": 116562,
        "char_end": 116567,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i3",
        "text": "To-morrow is Saint Valentine's day,",
        "char_start": 116568,
        "char_end": 116603,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i4",
        "text": "All in the morning betime,",
        "char_start": 116604,
        "char_end": 116630,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i5",
        "text": "And I a maid at your window,",
        "char_start": 116631,
        "char_end": 116659,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i6",
        "text": "To be your Valentine.",
        "char_start": 116660,
        "char_end": 116681,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i7",
        "text": "Then up he rose, and donn'd his clothes,",
        "char_start": 116682,
        "char_end": 116722,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i8",
        "text": "And dupp'd the chamber-door;",
        "char_start": 116723,
        "char_end": 116751,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i9",
        "text": "Let in the maid, that out a maid",
        "char_start": 116752,
        "char_end": 116784,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp19i10",
        "text": "Never departed more.",
        "char_start": 116785,
        "char_end": 116805,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp20i0",
        "text": "Pretty Ophelia!",
        "char_start": 116806,
        "char_end": 116821,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i0",
        "text": "Indeed, la, without an oath, I'll make an end on't:",
        "char_start": 116822,
        "char_end": 116873,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i1",
        "text": "Sings",
        "char_start": 116874,
        "char_end": 116879,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i2",
        "text": "By Gis and by Saint Charity,",
        "char_start": 116880,
        "char_end": 116908,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i3",
        "text": "Alack, and fie for shame!",
        "char_start": 116909,
        "char_end": 116934,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i4",
        "text": "Young men will do't, if they come to't;",
        "char_start": 116935,
        "char_end": 116974,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i5",
        "text": "By cock, they are to blame.",
        "char_start": 116975,
        "char_end": 117002,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i6",
        "text": "Quoth she, before you tumbled me,",
        "char_start": 117003,
        "char_end": 117036,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i7",
        "text": "You promised me to wed.",
        "char_start": 117037,
        "char_end": 117060,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i8",
        "text": "So would I ha' done, by yonder sun,",
        "char_start": 117061,
        "char_end": 117096,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp21i9",
        "text": "An thou hadst not come to my bed.",
        "char_start": 117097,
        "char_end": 117130,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp22i0",
        "text": "How long hath she been thus?",
        "char_start": 117131,
        "char_end": 117159,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp23i0",
        "text": "I hope all will be well. We must be patient: but I",
        "char_start": 117160,
        "char_end": 117210,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp23i1",
        "text": "cannot choose but weep, to think they should lay him",
        "char_start": 117211,
        "char_end": 117263,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp23i2",
        "text": "i' the cold ground. My brother shall know of it:",
        "char_start": 117264,
        "char_end": 117312,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp23i3",
        "text": "and so I thank you for your good counsel. Come, my",
        "char_start": 117313,
        "char_end": 117363,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp23i4",
        "text": "coach! Good night, ladies; good night, sweet ladies;",
        "char_start": 117364,
        "char_end": 117416,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp23i5",
        "text": "good night, good night.",
        "char_start": 117417,
        "char_end": 117440,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp23i6",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 117441,
        "char_end": 117445,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i0",
        "text": "Follow her close; give her good watch,",
        "char_start": 117446,
        "char_end": 117484,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i1",
        "text": "I pray you.",
        "char_start": 117485,
        "char_end": 117496,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i2",
        "text": "Exit HORATIO",
        "char_start": 117497,
        "char_end": 117509,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i3",
        "text": "O, this is the poison of deep grief; it springs",
        "char_start": 117510,
        "char_end": 117557,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i4",
        "text": "All from her father's death. O Gertrude, Gertrude,",
        "char_start": 117558,
        "char_end": 117608,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i5",
        "text": "When sorrows come, they come not single spies",
        "char_start": 117609,
        "char_end": 117654,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i6",
        "text": "But in battalions. First, her father slain:",
        "char_start": 117655,
        "char_end": 117698,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i7",
        "text": "Next, your son gone; and he most violent author",
        "char_start": 117699,
        "char_end": 117746,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i8",
        "text": "Of his own just remove: the people muddied,",
        "char_start": 117747,
        "char_end": 117790,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i9",
        "text": "Thick and unwholesome in their thoughts and whispers,",
        "char_start": 117791,
        "char_end": 117844,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i10",
        "text": "For good Polonius' death; and we have done but greenly,",
        "char_start": 117845,
        "char_end": 117900,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i11",
        "text": "In hugger-mugger to inter him: poor Ophelia",
        "char_start": 117901,
        "char_end": 117944,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i12",
        "text": "Divided from herself and her fair judgment,",
        "char_start": 117945,
        "char_end": 117988,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i13",
        "text": "Without the which we are pictures, or mere beasts:",
        "char_start": 117989,
        "char_end": 118039,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i14",
        "text": "Last, and as much containing as all these,",
        "char_start": 118040,
        "char_end": 118082,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i15",
        "text": "Her brother is in secret come from France;",
        "char_start": 118083,
        "char_end": 118125,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i16",
        "text": "Feeds on his wonder, keeps himself in clouds,",
        "char_start": 118126,
        "char_end": 118171,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i17",
        "text": "And wants not buzzers to infect his ear",
        "char_start": 118172,
        "char_end": 118211,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i18",
        "text": "With pestilent speeches of his father's death;",
        "char_start": 118212,
        "char_end": 118258,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i19",
        "text": "Wherein necessity, of matter beggar'd,",
        "char_start": 118259,
        "char_end": 118297,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i20",
        "text": "Will nothing stick our person to arraign",
        "char_start": 118298,
        "char_end": 118338,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i21",
        "text": "In ear and ear. O my dear Gertrude, this,",
        "char_start": 118339,
        "char_end": 118380,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i22",
        "text": "Like to a murdering-piece, in many places",
        "char_start": 118381,
        "char_end": 118422,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i23",
        "text": "Gives me superfluous death.",
        "char_start": 118423,
        "char_end": 118450,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp24i24",
        "text": "A noise within",
        "char_start": 118451,
        "char_end": 118465,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp25i0",
        "text": "Alack, what noise is this?",
        "char_start": 118466,
        "char_end": 118492,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp26i0",
        "text": "Where are my Switzers? Let them guard the door.",
        "char_start": 118493,
        "char_end": 118540,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp26i1",
        "text": "Enter another Gentleman",
        "char_start": 118541,
        "char_end": 118564,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp26i2",
        "text": "What is the matter?",
        "char_start": 118565,
        "char_end": 118584,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i0",
        "text": "Save yourself, my lord:",
        "char_start": 118585,
        "char_end": 118608,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i1",
        "text": "The ocean, overpeering of his list,",
        "char_start": 118609,
        "char_end": 118644,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i2",
        "text": "Eats not the flats with more impetuous haste",
        "char_start": 118645,
        "char_end": 118689,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i3",
        "text": "Than young Laertes, in a riotous head,",
        "char_start": 118690,
        "char_end": 118728,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i4",
        "text": "O'erbears your officers. The rabble call him lord;",
        "char_start": 118729,
        "char_end": 118779,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i5",
        "text": "And, as the world were now but to begin,",
        "char_start": 118780,
        "char_end": 118820,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i6",
        "text": "Antiquity forgot, custom not known,",
        "char_start": 118821,
        "char_end": 118856,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i7",
        "text": "The ratifiers and props of every word,",
        "char_start": 118857,
        "char_end": 118895,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i8",
        "text": "They cry 'Choose we: Laertes shall be king:'",
        "char_start": 118896,
        "char_end": 118940,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i9",
        "text": "Caps, hands, and tongues, applaud it to the clouds:",
        "char_start": 118941,
        "char_end": 118992,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp27i10",
        "text": "'Laertes shall be king, Laertes king!'",
        "char_start": 118993,
        "char_end": 119031,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Gentleman"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp28i0",
        "text": "How cheerfully on the false trail they cry!",
        "char_start": 119032,
        "char_end": 119075,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp28i1",
        "text": "O, this is counter, you false Danish dogs!",
        "char_start": 119076,
        "char_end": 119118,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp29i0",
        "text": "The doors are broke.",
        "char_start": 119119,
        "char_end": 119139,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp29i1",
        "text": "Noise within",
        "char_start": 119140,
        "char_end": 119152,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp29i2",
        "text": "Enter LAERTES, armed; Danes following",
        "char_start": 119153,
        "char_end": 119190,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp30i0",
        "text": "Where is this king? Sirs, stand you all without.",
        "char_start": 119191,
        "char_end": 119239,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp31i0",
        "text": "No, let's come in.",
        "char_start": 119240,
        "char_end": 119258,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Danes"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp32i0",
        "text": "I pray you, give me leave.",
        "char_start": 119259,
        "char_end": 119285,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp33i0",
        "text": "We will, we will.",
        "char_start": 119286,
        "char_end": 119303,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Danes"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp33i1",
        "text": "They retire without the door",
        "char_start": 119304,
        "char_end": 119332,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "Danes"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp34i0",
        "text": "I thank you: keep the door. O thou vile king,",
        "char_start": 119333,
        "char_end": 119378,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp34i1",
        "text": "Give me my father!",
        "char_start": 119379,
        "char_end": 119397,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp35i0",
        "text": "Calmly, good Laertes.",
        "char_start": 119398,
        "char_end": 119419,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp36i0",
        "text": "That drop of blood that's calm proclaims me bastard,",
        "char_start": 119420,
        "char_end": 119472,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp36i1",
        "text": "Cries cuckold to my father, brands the harlot",
        "char_start": 119473,
        "char_end": 119518,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp36i2",
        "text": "Even here, between the chaste unsmirched brow",
        "char_start": 119519,
        "char_end": 119564,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp36i3",
        "text": "Of my true mother.",
        "char_start": 119565,
        "char_end": 119583,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp37i0",
        "text": "What is the cause, Laertes,",
        "char_start": 119584,
        "char_end": 119611,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp37i1",
        "text": "That thy rebellion looks so giant-like?",
        "char_start": 119612,
        "char_end": 119651,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp37i2",
        "text": "Let him go, Gertrude; do not fear our person:",
        "char_start": 119652,
        "char_end": 119697,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp37i3",
        "text": "There's such divinity doth hedge a king,",
        "char_start": 119698,
        "char_end": 119738,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp37i4",
        "text": "That treason can but peep to what it would,",
        "char_start": 119739,
        "char_end": 119782,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp37i5",
        "text": "Acts little of his will. Tell me, Laertes,",
        "char_start": 119783,
        "char_end": 119825,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp37i6",
        "text": "Why thou art thus incensed. Let him go, Gertrude.",
        "char_start": 119826,
        "char_end": 119875,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp37i7",
        "text": "Speak, man.",
        "char_start": 119876,
        "char_end": 119887,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp38i0",
        "text": "Where is my father?",
        "char_start": 119888,
        "char_end": 119907,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp39i0",
        "text": "Dead.",
        "char_start": 119908,
        "char_end": 119913,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp40i0",
        "text": "But not by him.",
        "char_start": 119914,
        "char_end": 119929,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp41i0",
        "text": "Let him demand his fill.",
        "char_start": 119930,
        "char_end": 119954,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp42i0",
        "text": "How came he dead? I'll not be juggled with:",
        "char_start": 119955,
        "char_end": 119998,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp42i1",
        "text": "To hell, allegiance! vows, to the blackest devil!",
        "char_start": 119999,
        "char_end": 120048,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp42i2",
        "text": "Conscience and grace, to the profoundest pit!",
        "char_start": 120049,
        "char_end": 120094,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp42i3",
        "text": "I dare damnation. To this point I stand,",
        "char_start": 120095,
        "char_end": 120135,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp42i4",
        "text": "That both the worlds I give to negligence,",
        "char_start": 120136,
        "char_end": 120178,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp42i5",
        "text": "Let come what comes; only I'll be revenged",
        "char_start": 120179,
        "char_end": 120221,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp42i6",
        "text": "Most thoroughly for my father.",
        "char_start": 120222,
        "char_end": 120252,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp43i0",
        "text": "Who shall stay you?",
        "char_start": 120253,
        "char_end": 120272,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp44i0",
        "text": "My will, not all the world:",
        "char_start": 120273,
        "char_end": 120300,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp44i1",
        "text": "And for my means, I'll husband them so well,",
        "char_start": 120301,
        "char_end": 120345,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp44i2",
        "text": "They shall go far with little.",
        "char_start": 120346,
        "char_end": 120376,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp45i0",
        "text": "Good Laertes,",
        "char_start": 120377,
        "char_end": 120390,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp45i1",
        "text": "If you desire to know the certainty",
        "char_start": 120391,
        "char_end": 120426,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp45i2",
        "text": "Of your dear father's death, is't writ in your revenge,",
        "char_start": 120427,
        "char_end": 120482,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp45i3",
        "text": "That, swoopstake, you will draw both friend and foe,",
        "char_start": 120483,
        "char_end": 120535,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp45i4",
        "text": "Winner and loser?",
        "char_start": 120536,
        "char_end": 120553,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp46i0",
        "text": "None but his enemies.",
        "char_start": 120554,
        "char_end": 120575,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp47i0",
        "text": "Will you know them then?",
        "char_start": 120576,
        "char_end": 120600,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp48i0",
        "text": "To his good friends thus wide I'll ope my arms;",
        "char_start": 120601,
        "char_end": 120648,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp48i1",
        "text": "And like the kind life-rendering pelican,",
        "char_start": 120649,
        "char_end": 120690,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp48i2",
        "text": "Repast them with my blood.",
        "char_start": 120691,
        "char_end": 120717,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp49i0",
        "text": "Why, now you speak",
        "char_start": 120718,
        "char_end": 120736,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp49i1",
        "text": "Like a good child and a true gentleman.",
        "char_start": 120737,
        "char_end": 120776,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp49i2",
        "text": "That I am guiltless of your father's death,",
        "char_start": 120777,
        "char_end": 120820,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp49i3",
        "text": "And am most sensible in grief for it,",
        "char_start": 120821,
        "char_end": 120858,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp49i4",
        "text": "It shall as level to your judgment pierce",
        "char_start": 120859,
        "char_end": 120900,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp49i5",
        "text": "As day does to your eye.",
        "char_start": 120901,
        "char_end": 120925,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp50i0",
        "text": "[Within] Let her come in.",
        "char_start": 120926,
        "char_end": 120951,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Danes"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i0",
        "text": "How now! what noise is that?",
        "char_start": 120952,
        "char_end": 120980,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i1",
        "text": "Re-enter OPHELIA",
        "char_start": 120981,
        "char_end": 120997,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i2",
        "text": "O heat, dry up my brains! tears seven times salt,",
        "char_start": 120998,
        "char_end": 121047,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i3",
        "text": "Burn out the sense and virtue of mine eye!",
        "char_start": 121048,
        "char_end": 121090,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i4",
        "text": "By heaven, thy madness shall be paid by weight,",
        "char_start": 121091,
        "char_end": 121138,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i5",
        "text": "Till our scale turn the beam. O rose of May!",
        "char_start": 121139,
        "char_end": 121183,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i6",
        "text": "Dear maid, kind sister, sweet Ophelia!",
        "char_start": 121184,
        "char_end": 121222,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i7",
        "text": "O heavens! is't possible, a young maid's wits",
        "char_start": 121223,
        "char_end": 121268,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i8",
        "text": "Should be as moral as an old man's life?",
        "char_start": 121269,
        "char_end": 121309,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i9",
        "text": "Nature is fine in love, and where 'tis fine,",
        "char_start": 121310,
        "char_end": 121354,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i10",
        "text": "It sends some precious instance of itself",
        "char_start": 121355,
        "char_end": 121396,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp51i11",
        "text": "After the thing it loves.",
        "char_start": 121397,
        "char_end": 121422,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp52i0",
        "text": "[Sings]",
        "char_start": 121423,
        "char_end": 121430,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp52i1",
        "text": "They bore him barefaced on the bier;",
        "char_start": 121431,
        "char_end": 121467,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp52i2",
        "text": "Hey non nonny, nonny, hey nonny;",
        "char_start": 121468,
        "char_end": 121500,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp52i3",
        "text": "And in his grave rain'd many a tear:--",
        "char_start": 121501,
        "char_end": 121539,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp52i4",
        "text": "Fare you well, my dove!",
        "char_start": 121540,
        "char_end": 121563,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp53i0",
        "text": "Hadst thou thy wits, and didst persuade revenge,",
        "char_start": 121564,
        "char_end": 121612,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp53i1",
        "text": "It could not move thus.",
        "char_start": 121613,
        "char_end": 121636,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp54i0",
        "text": "[Sings]",
        "char_start": 121637,
        "char_end": 121644,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp54i1",
        "text": "You must sing a-down a-down,",
        "char_start": 121645,
        "char_end": 121673,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp54i2",
        "text": "An you call him a-down-a.",
        "char_start": 121674,
        "char_end": 121699,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp54i3",
        "text": "O, how the wheel becomes it! It is the false",
        "char_start": 121700,
        "char_end": 121744,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp54i4",
        "text": "steward, that stole his master's daughter.",
        "char_start": 121745,
        "char_end": 121787,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp55i0",
        "text": "This nothing's more than matter.",
        "char_start": 121788,
        "char_end": 121820,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp56i0",
        "text": "There's rosemary, that's for remembrance; pray,",
        "char_start": 121821,
        "char_end": 121868,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp56i1",
        "text": "love, remember: and there is pansies. that's for thoughts.",
        "char_start": 121869,
        "char_end": 121927,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp57i0",
        "text": "A document in madness, thoughts and remembrance fitted.",
        "char_start": 121928,
        "char_end": 121983,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp58i0",
        "text": "There's fennel for you, and columbines: there's rue",
        "char_start": 121984,
        "char_end": 122035,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp58i1",
        "text": "for you; and here's some for me: we may call it",
        "char_start": 122036,
        "char_end": 122083,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp58i2",
        "text": "herb-grace o' Sundays: O you must wear your rue with",
        "char_start": 122084,
        "char_end": 122136,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp58i3",
        "text": "a difference. There's a daisy: I would give you",
        "char_start": 122137,
        "char_end": 122184,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp58i4",
        "text": "some violets, but they withered all when my father",
        "char_start": 122185,
        "char_end": 122235,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp58i5",
        "text": "died: they say he made a good end,--",
        "char_start": 122236,
        "char_end": 122272,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp58i6",
        "text": "Sings",
        "char_start": 122273,
        "char_end": 122278,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp58i7",
        "text": "For bonny sweet Robin is all my joy.",
        "char_start": 122279,
        "char_end": 122315,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp59i0",
        "text": "Thought and affliction, passion, hell itself,",
        "char_start": 122316,
        "char_end": 122361,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp59i1",
        "text": "She turns to favour and to prettiness.",
        "char_start": 122362,
        "char_end": 122400,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i0",
        "text": "[Sings]",
        "char_start": 122401,
        "char_end": 122408,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.203",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i1",
        "text": "And will he not come again?",
        "char_start": 122409,
        "char_end": 122436,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.204",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i2",
        "text": "And will he not come again?",
        "char_start": 122437,
        "char_end": 122464,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.205",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i3",
        "text": "No, no, he is dead:",
        "char_start": 122465,
        "char_end": 122484,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.206",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i4",
        "text": "Go to thy death-bed:",
        "char_start": 122485,
        "char_end": 122505,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.207",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i5",
        "text": "He never will come again.",
        "char_start": 122506,
        "char_end": 122531,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.208",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i6",
        "text": "His beard was as white as snow,",
        "char_start": 122532,
        "char_end": 122563,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.209",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i7",
        "text": "All flaxen was his poll:",
        "char_start": 122564,
        "char_end": 122588,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.210",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i8",
        "text": "He is gone, he is gone,",
        "char_start": 122589,
        "char_end": 122612,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.211",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i9",
        "text": "And we cast away moan:",
        "char_start": 122613,
        "char_end": 122635,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.212",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i10",
        "text": "God ha' mercy on his soul!",
        "char_start": 122636,
        "char_end": 122662,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.213",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i11",
        "text": "And of all Christian souls, I pray God. God be wi' ye.",
        "char_start": 122663,
        "char_end": 122717,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.214",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp60i12",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 122718,
        "char_end": 122722,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "OPHELIA"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp61i0",
        "text": "Do you see this, O God?",
        "char_start": 122723,
        "char_end": 122746,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.215",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i0",
        "text": "Laertes, I must commune with your grief,",
        "char_start": 122747,
        "char_end": 122787,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.216",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i1",
        "text": "Or you deny me right. Go but apart,",
        "char_start": 122788,
        "char_end": 122823,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.217",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i2",
        "text": "Make choice of whom your wisest friends you will.",
        "char_start": 122824,
        "char_end": 122873,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.218",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i3",
        "text": "And they shall hear and judge 'twixt you and me:",
        "char_start": 122874,
        "char_end": 122922,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.219",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i4",
        "text": "If by direct or by collateral hand",
        "char_start": 122923,
        "char_end": 122957,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.220",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i5",
        "text": "They find us touch'd, we will our kingdom give,",
        "char_start": 122958,
        "char_end": 123005,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.221",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i6",
        "text": "Our crown, our life, and all that we can ours,",
        "char_start": 123006,
        "char_end": 123052,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.222",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i7",
        "text": "To you in satisfaction; but if not,",
        "char_start": 123053,
        "char_end": 123088,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.223",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i8",
        "text": "Be you content to lend your patience to us,",
        "char_start": 123089,
        "char_end": 123132,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.224",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i9",
        "text": "And we shall jointly labour with your soul",
        "char_start": 123133,
        "char_end": 123175,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.225",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp62i10",
        "text": "To give it due content.",
        "char_start": 123176,
        "char_end": 123199,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.226",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp63i0",
        "text": "Let this be so;",
        "char_start": 123200,
        "char_end": 123215,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.227",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp63i1",
        "text": "His means of death, his obscure funeral--",
        "char_start": 123216,
        "char_end": 123257,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.228",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp63i2",
        "text": "No trophy, sword, nor hatchment o'er his bones,",
        "char_start": 123258,
        "char_end": 123305,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.229",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp63i3",
        "text": "No noble rite nor formal ostentation--",
        "char_start": 123306,
        "char_end": 123344,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.230",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp63i4",
        "text": "Cry to be heard, as 'twere from heaven to earth,",
        "char_start": 123345,
        "char_end": 123393,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.231",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp63i5",
        "text": "That I must call't in question.",
        "char_start": 123394,
        "char_end": 123425,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.232",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp64i0",
        "text": "So you shall;",
        "char_start": 123426,
        "char_end": 123439,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.233",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp64i1",
        "text": "And where the offence is let the great axe fall.",
        "char_start": 123440,
        "char_end": 123488,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.234",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp64i2",
        "text": "I pray you, go with me.",
        "char_start": 123489,
        "char_end": 123512,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": "4.5.235",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s5:sp64i3",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 123513,
        "char_end": 123519,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 5,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:open",
        "text": "Enter HORATIO and a Servant",
        "char_start": 123520,
        "char_end": 123547,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp1i0",
        "text": "What are they that would speak with me?",
        "char_start": 123548,
        "char_end": 123587,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp2i0",
        "text": "Sailors, sir: they say they have letters for you.",
        "char_start": 123588,
        "char_end": 123637,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Servant"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp3i0",
        "text": "Let them come in.",
        "char_start": 123638,
        "char_end": 123655,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp3i1",
        "text": "Exit Servant",
        "char_start": 123656,
        "char_end": 123668,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp3i2",
        "text": "I do not know from what part of the world",
        "char_start": 123669,
        "char_end": 123710,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp3i3",
        "text": "I should be greeted, if not from Lord Hamlet.",
        "char_start": 123711,
        "char_end": 123756,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp3i4",
        "text": "Enter Sailors",
        "char_start": 123757,
        "char_end": 123770,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp4i0",
        "text": "God bless you, sir.",
        "char_start": 123771,
        "char_end": 123790,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Sailor"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp5i0",
        "text": "Let him bless thee too.",
        "char_start": 123791,
        "char_end": 123814,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp6i0",
        "text": "He shall, sir, an't please him. There's a letter for",
        "char_start": 123815,
        "char_end": 123867,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Sailor"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp6i1",
        "text": "you, sir; it comes from the ambassador that was",
        "char_start": 123868,
        "char_end": 123915,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Sailor"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp6i2",
        "text": "bound for England; if your name be Horatio, as I am",
        "char_start": 123916,
        "char_end": 123967,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Sailor"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp6i3",
        "text": "let to know it is.",
        "char_start": 123968,
        "char_end": 123986,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Sailor"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i0",
        "text": "[Reads] 'Horatio, when thou shalt have overlooked",
        "char_start": 123987,
        "char_end": 124036,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i1",
        "text": "this, give these fellows some means to the king:",
        "char_start": 124037,
        "char_end": 124085,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i2",
        "text": "they have letters for him. Ere we were two days old",
        "char_start": 124086,
        "char_end": 124137,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i3",
        "text": "at sea, a pirate of very warlike appointment gave us",
        "char_start": 124138,
        "char_end": 124190,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i4",
        "text": "chase. Finding ourselves too slow of sail, we put on",
        "char_start": 124191,
        "char_end": 124243,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i5",
        "text": "a compelled valour, and in the grapple I boarded",
        "char_start": 124244,
        "char_end": 124292,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i6",
        "text": "them: on the instant they got clear of our ship; so",
        "char_start": 124293,
        "char_end": 124344,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i7",
        "text": "I alone became their prisoner. They have dealt with",
        "char_start": 124345,
        "char_end": 124396,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i8",
        "text": "me like thieves of mercy: but they knew what they",
        "char_start": 124397,
        "char_end": 124446,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i9",
        "text": "did; I am to do a good turn for them. Let the king",
        "char_start": 124447,
        "char_end": 124497,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i10",
        "text": "have the letters I have sent; and repair thou to me",
        "char_start": 124498,
        "char_end": 124549,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i11",
        "text": "with as much speed as thou wouldst fly death. I",
        "char_start": 124550,
        "char_end": 124597,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i12",
        "text": "have words to speak in thine ear will make thee",
        "char_start": 124598,
        "char_end": 124645,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i13",
        "text": "dumb; yet are they much too light for the bore of",
        "char_start": 124646,
        "char_end": 124695,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i14",
        "text": "the matter. These good fellows will bring thee",
        "char_start": 124696,
        "char_end": 124742,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i15",
        "text": "where I am. Rosencrantz and Guildenstern hold their",
        "char_start": 124743,
        "char_end": 124794,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i16",
        "text": "course for England: of them I have much to tell",
        "char_start": 124795,
        "char_end": 124842,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i17",
        "text": "thee. Farewell.",
        "char_start": 124843,
        "char_end": 124858,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i18",
        "text": "'He that thou knowest thine, HAMLET.'",
        "char_start": 124859,
        "char_end": 124896,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i19",
        "text": "Come, I will make you way for these your letters;",
        "char_start": 124897,
        "char_end": 124946,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i20",
        "text": "And do't the speedier, that you may direct me",
        "char_start": 124947,
        "char_end": 124992,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i21",
        "text": "To him from whom you brought them.",
        "char_start": 124993,
        "char_end": 125027,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": "4.6.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s6:sp7i22",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 125028,
        "char_end": 125034,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 6,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:open",
        "text": "Enter KING CLAUDIUS and LAERTES",
        "char_start": 125035,
        "char_end": 125066,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp1i0",
        "text": "Now must your conscience my acquaintance seal,",
        "char_start": 125067,
        "char_end": 125113,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp1i1",
        "text": "And you must put me in your heart for friend,",
        "char_start": 125114,
        "char_end": 125159,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp1i2",
        "text": "Sith you have heard, and with a knowing ear,",
        "char_start": 125160,
        "char_end": 125204,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp1i3",
        "text": "That he which hath your noble father slain",
        "char_start": 125205,
        "char_end": 125247,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp1i4",
        "text": "Pursued my life.",
        "char_start": 125248,
        "char_end": 125264,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp2i0",
        "text": "It well appears: but tell me",
        "char_start": 125265,
        "char_end": 125293,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp2i1",
        "text": "Why you proceeded not against these feats,",
        "char_start": 125294,
        "char_end": 125336,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp2i2",
        "text": "So crimeful and so capital in nature,",
        "char_start": 125337,
        "char_end": 125374,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp2i3",
        "text": "As by your safety, wisdom, all things else,",
        "char_start": 125375,
        "char_end": 125418,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp2i4",
        "text": "You mainly were stirr'd up.",
        "char_start": 125419,
        "char_end": 125446,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i0",
        "text": "O, for two special reasons;",
        "char_start": 125447,
        "char_end": 125474,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i1",
        "text": "Which may to you, perhaps, seem much unsinew'd,",
        "char_start": 125475,
        "char_end": 125522,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i2",
        "text": "But yet to me they are strong. The queen his mother",
        "char_start": 125523,
        "char_end": 125574,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i3",
        "text": "Lives almost by his looks; and for myself--",
        "char_start": 125575,
        "char_end": 125618,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i4",
        "text": "My virtue or my plague, be it either which--",
        "char_start": 125619,
        "char_end": 125663,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i5",
        "text": "She's so conjunctive to my life and soul,",
        "char_start": 125664,
        "char_end": 125705,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i6",
        "text": "That, as the star moves not but in his sphere,",
        "char_start": 125706,
        "char_end": 125752,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i7",
        "text": "I could not but by her. The other motive,",
        "char_start": 125753,
        "char_end": 125794,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i8",
        "text": "Why to a public count I might not go,",
        "char_start": 125795,
        "char_end": 125832,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i9",
        "text": "Is the great love the general gender bear him;",
        "char_start": 125833,
        "char_end": 125879,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i10",
        "text": "Who, dipping all his faults in their affection,",
        "char_start": 125880,
        "char_end": 125927,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i11",
        "text": "Would, like the spring that turneth wood to stone,",
        "char_start": 125928,
        "char_end": 125978,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i12",
        "text": "Convert his gyves to graces; so that my arrows,",
        "char_start": 125979,
        "char_end": 126026,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i13",
        "text": "Too slightly timber'd for so loud a wind,",
        "char_start": 126027,
        "char_end": 126068,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i14",
        "text": "Would have reverted to my bow again,",
        "char_start": 126069,
        "char_end": 126105,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp3i15",
        "text": "And not where I had aim'd them.",
        "char_start": 126106,
        "char_end": 126137,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp4i0",
        "text": "And so have I a noble father lost;",
        "char_start": 126138,
        "char_end": 126172,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp4i1",
        "text": "A sister driven into desperate terms,",
        "char_start": 126173,
        "char_end": 126210,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp4i2",
        "text": "Whose worth, if praises may go back again,",
        "char_start": 126211,
        "char_end": 126253,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp4i3",
        "text": "Stood challenger on mount of all the age",
        "char_start": 126254,
        "char_end": 126294,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp4i4",
        "text": "For her perfections: but my revenge will come.",
        "char_start": 126295,
        "char_end": 126341,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp5i0",
        "text": "Break not your sleeps for that: you must not think",
        "char_start": 126342,
        "char_end": 126392,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp5i1",
        "text": "That we are made of stuff so flat and dull",
        "char_start": 126393,
        "char_end": 126435,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp5i2",
        "text": "That we can let our beard be shook with danger",
        "char_start": 126436,
        "char_end": 126482,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp5i3",
        "text": "And think it pastime. You shortly shall hear more:",
        "char_start": 126483,
        "char_end": 126533,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp5i4",
        "text": "I loved your father, and we love ourself;",
        "char_start": 126534,
        "char_end": 126575,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp5i5",
        "text": "And that, I hope, will teach you to imagine--",
        "char_start": 126576,
        "char_end": 126621,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp5i6",
        "text": "Enter a Messenger",
        "char_start": 126622,
        "char_end": 126639,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp5i7",
        "text": "How now! what news?",
        "char_start": 126640,
        "char_end": 126659,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp6i0",
        "text": "Letters, my lord, from Hamlet:",
        "char_start": 126660,
        "char_end": 126690,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Messenger"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp6i1",
        "text": "This to your majesty; this to the queen.",
        "char_start": 126691,
        "char_end": 126731,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Messenger"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp7i0",
        "text": "From Hamlet! who brought them?",
        "char_start": 126732,
        "char_end": 126762,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp8i0",
        "text": "Sailors, my lord, they say; I saw them not:",
        "char_start": 126763,
        "char_end": 126806,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Messenger"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp8i1",
        "text": "They were given me by Claudio; he received them",
        "char_start": 126807,
        "char_end": 126854,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Messenger"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp8i2",
        "text": "Of him that brought them.",
        "char_start": 126855,
        "char_end": 126880,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Messenger"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i0",
        "text": "Laertes, you shall hear them. Leave us.",
        "char_start": 126881,
        "char_end": 126920,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i1",
        "text": "Exit Messenger",
        "char_start": 126921,
        "char_end": 126935,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i2",
        "text": "Reads",
        "char_start": 126936,
        "char_end": 126941,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i3",
        "text": "'High and mighty, You shall know I am set naked on",
        "char_start": 126942,
        "char_end": 126992,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i4",
        "text": "your kingdom. To-morrow shall I beg leave to see",
        "char_start": 126993,
        "char_end": 127041,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i5",
        "text": "your kingly eyes: when I shall, first asking your",
        "char_start": 127042,
        "char_end": 127091,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i6",
        "text": "pardon thereunto, recount the occasion of my sudden",
        "char_start": 127092,
        "char_end": 127143,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i7",
        "text": "and more strange return. 'HAMLET.'",
        "char_start": 127144,
        "char_end": 127178,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i8",
        "text": "What should this mean? Are all the rest come back?",
        "char_start": 127179,
        "char_end": 127229,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp9i9",
        "text": "Or is it some abuse, and no such thing?",
        "char_start": 127230,
        "char_end": 127269,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp10i0",
        "text": "Know you the hand?",
        "char_start": 127270,
        "char_end": 127288,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp11i0",
        "text": "'Tis Hamlets character. 'Naked!",
        "char_start": 127289,
        "char_end": 127320,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp11i1",
        "text": "And in a postscript here, he says 'alone.'",
        "char_start": 127321,
        "char_end": 127363,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp11i2",
        "text": "Can you advise me?",
        "char_start": 127364,
        "char_end": 127382,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp12i0",
        "text": "I'm lost in it, my lord. But let him come;",
        "char_start": 127383,
        "char_end": 127425,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp12i1",
        "text": "It warms the very sickness in my heart,",
        "char_start": 127426,
        "char_end": 127465,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp12i2",
        "text": "That I shall live and tell him to his teeth,",
        "char_start": 127466,
        "char_end": 127510,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp12i3",
        "text": "'Thus didest thou.'",
        "char_start": 127511,
        "char_end": 127530,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp13i0",
        "text": "If it be so, Laertes--",
        "char_start": 127531,
        "char_end": 127553,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp13i1",
        "text": "As how should it be so? how otherwise?--",
        "char_start": 127554,
        "char_end": 127594,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp13i2",
        "text": "Will you be ruled by me?",
        "char_start": 127595,
        "char_end": 127619,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp14i0",
        "text": "Ay, my lord;",
        "char_start": 127620,
        "char_end": 127632,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp14i1",
        "text": "So you will not o'errule me to a peace.",
        "char_start": 127633,
        "char_end": 127672,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp15i0",
        "text": "To thine own peace. If he be now return'd,",
        "char_start": 127673,
        "char_end": 127715,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp15i1",
        "text": "As checking at his voyage, and that he means",
        "char_start": 127716,
        "char_end": 127760,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp15i2",
        "text": "No more to undertake it, I will work him",
        "char_start": 127761,
        "char_end": 127801,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp15i3",
        "text": "To an exploit, now ripe in my device,",
        "char_start": 127802,
        "char_end": 127839,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp15i4",
        "text": "Under the which he shall not choose but fall:",
        "char_start": 127840,
        "char_end": 127885,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp15i5",
        "text": "And for his death no wind of blame shall breathe,",
        "char_start": 127886,
        "char_end": 127935,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp15i6",
        "text": "But even his mother shall uncharge the practise",
        "char_start": 127936,
        "char_end": 127983,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp15i7",
        "text": "And call it accident.",
        "char_start": 127984,
        "char_end": 128005,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp16i0",
        "text": "My lord, I will be ruled;",
        "char_start": 128006,
        "char_end": 128031,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp16i1",
        "text": "The rather, if you could devise it so",
        "char_start": 128032,
        "char_end": 128069,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp16i2",
        "text": "That I might be the organ.",
        "char_start": 128070,
        "char_end": 128096,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp17i0",
        "text": "It falls right.",
        "char_start": 128097,
        "char_end": 128112,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp17i1",
        "text": "You have been talk'd of since your travel much,",
        "char_start": 128113,
        "char_end": 128160,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp17i2",
        "text": "And that in Hamlet's hearing, for a quality",
        "char_start": 128161,
        "char_end": 128204,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp17i3",
        "text": "Wherein, they say, you shine: your sum of parts",
        "char_start": 128205,
        "char_end": 128252,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp17i4",
        "text": "Did not together pluck such envy from him",
        "char_start": 128253,
        "char_end": 128294,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp17i5",
        "text": "As did that one, and that, in my regard,",
        "char_start": 128295,
        "char_end": 128335,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp17i6",
        "text": "Of the unworthiest siege.",
        "char_start": 128336,
        "char_end": 128361,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp18i0",
        "text": "What part is that, my lord?",
        "char_start": 128362,
        "char_end": 128389,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i0",
        "text": "A very riband in the cap of youth,",
        "char_start": 128390,
        "char_end": 128424,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i1",
        "text": "Yet needful too; for youth no less becomes",
        "char_start": 128425,
        "char_end": 128467,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i2",
        "text": "The light and careless livery that it wears",
        "char_start": 128468,
        "char_end": 128511,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i3",
        "text": "Than settled age his sables and his weeds,",
        "char_start": 128512,
        "char_end": 128554,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i4",
        "text": "Importing health and graveness. Two months since,",
        "char_start": 128555,
        "char_end": 128604,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i5",
        "text": "Here was a gentleman of Normandy:--",
        "char_start": 128605,
        "char_end": 128640,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i6",
        "text": "I've seen myself, and served against, the French,",
        "char_start": 128641,
        "char_end": 128690,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i7",
        "text": "And they can well on horseback: but this gallant",
        "char_start": 128691,
        "char_end": 128739,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i8",
        "text": "Had witchcraft in't; he grew unto his seat;",
        "char_start": 128740,
        "char_end": 128783,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i9",
        "text": "And to such wondrous doing brought his horse,",
        "char_start": 128784,
        "char_end": 128829,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i10",
        "text": "As he had been incorpsed and demi-natured",
        "char_start": 128830,
        "char_end": 128871,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i11",
        "text": "With the brave beast: so far he topp'd my thought,",
        "char_start": 128872,
        "char_end": 128922,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i12",
        "text": "That I, in forgery of shapes and tricks,",
        "char_start": 128923,
        "char_end": 128963,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp19i13",
        "text": "Come short of what he did.",
        "char_start": 128964,
        "char_end": 128990,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp20i0",
        "text": "A Norman was't?",
        "char_start": 128991,
        "char_end": 129006,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp21i0",
        "text": "A Norman.",
        "char_start": 129007,
        "char_end": 129016,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp22i0",
        "text": "Upon my life, Lamond.",
        "char_start": 129017,
        "char_end": 129038,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp23i0",
        "text": "The very same.",
        "char_start": 129039,
        "char_end": 129053,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp24i0",
        "text": "I know him well: he is the brooch indeed",
        "char_start": 129054,
        "char_end": 129094,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp24i1",
        "text": "And gem of all the nation.",
        "char_start": 129095,
        "char_end": 129121,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i0",
        "text": "He made confession of you,",
        "char_start": 129122,
        "char_end": 129148,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i1",
        "text": "And gave you such a masterly report",
        "char_start": 129149,
        "char_end": 129184,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i2",
        "text": "For art and exercise in your defence",
        "char_start": 129185,
        "char_end": 129221,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i3",
        "text": "And for your rapier most especially,",
        "char_start": 129222,
        "char_end": 129258,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i4",
        "text": "That he cried out, 'twould be a sight indeed,",
        "char_start": 129259,
        "char_end": 129304,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i5",
        "text": "If one could match you: the scrimers of their nation,",
        "char_start": 129305,
        "char_end": 129358,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i6",
        "text": "He swore, had had neither motion, guard, nor eye,",
        "char_start": 129359,
        "char_end": 129408,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i7",
        "text": "If you opposed them. Sir, this report of his",
        "char_start": 129409,
        "char_end": 129453,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i8",
        "text": "Did Hamlet so envenom with his envy",
        "char_start": 129454,
        "char_end": 129489,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i9",
        "text": "That he could nothing do but wish and beg",
        "char_start": 129490,
        "char_end": 129531,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i10",
        "text": "Your sudden coming o'er, to play with him.",
        "char_start": 129532,
        "char_end": 129574,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp25i11",
        "text": "Now, out of this,--",
        "char_start": 129575,
        "char_end": 129594,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp26i0",
        "text": "What out of this, my lord?",
        "char_start": 129595,
        "char_end": 129621,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp27i0",
        "text": "Laertes, was your father dear to you?",
        "char_start": 129622,
        "char_end": 129659,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp27i1",
        "text": "Or are you like the painting of a sorrow,",
        "char_start": 129660,
        "char_end": 129701,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp27i2",
        "text": "A face without a heart?",
        "char_start": 129702,
        "char_end": 129725,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp28i0",
        "text": "Why ask you this?",
        "char_start": 129726,
        "char_end": 129743,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i0",
        "text": "Not that I think you did not love your father;",
        "char_start": 129744,
        "char_end": 129790,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i1",
        "text": "But that I know love is begun by time;",
        "char_start": 129791,
        "char_end": 129829,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i2",
        "text": "And that I see, in passages of proof,",
        "char_start": 129830,
        "char_end": 129867,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i3",
        "text": "Time qualifies the spark and fire of it.",
        "char_start": 129868,
        "char_end": 129908,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i4",
        "text": "There lives within the very flame of love",
        "char_start": 129909,
        "char_end": 129950,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i5",
        "text": "A kind of wick or snuff that will abate it;",
        "char_start": 129951,
        "char_end": 129994,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i6",
        "text": "And nothing is at a like goodness still;",
        "char_start": 129995,
        "char_end": 130035,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i7",
        "text": "For goodness, growing to a plurisy,",
        "char_start": 130036,
        "char_end": 130071,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i8",
        "text": "Dies in his own too much: that we would do",
        "char_start": 130072,
        "char_end": 130114,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i9",
        "text": "We should do when we would; for this 'would' changes",
        "char_start": 130115,
        "char_end": 130167,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i10",
        "text": "And hath abatements and delays as many",
        "char_start": 130168,
        "char_end": 130206,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i11",
        "text": "As there are tongues, are hands, are accidents;",
        "char_start": 130207,
        "char_end": 130254,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i12",
        "text": "And then this 'should' is like a spendthrift sigh,",
        "char_start": 130255,
        "char_end": 130305,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i13",
        "text": "That hurts by easing. But, to the quick o' the ulcer:--",
        "char_start": 130306,
        "char_end": 130361,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i14",
        "text": "Hamlet comes back: what would you undertake,",
        "char_start": 130362,
        "char_end": 130406,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i15",
        "text": "To show yourself your father's son in deed",
        "char_start": 130407,
        "char_end": 130449,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp29i16",
        "text": "More than in words?",
        "char_start": 130450,
        "char_end": 130469,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp30i0",
        "text": "To cut his throat i' the church.",
        "char_start": 130470,
        "char_end": 130502,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i0",
        "text": "No place, indeed, should murder sanctuarize;",
        "char_start": 130503,
        "char_end": 130547,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i1",
        "text": "Revenge should have no bounds. But, good Laertes,",
        "char_start": 130548,
        "char_end": 130597,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i2",
        "text": "Will you do this, keep close within your chamber.",
        "char_start": 130598,
        "char_end": 130647,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i3",
        "text": "Hamlet return'd shall know you are come home:",
        "char_start": 130648,
        "char_end": 130693,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i4",
        "text": "We'll put on those shall praise your excellence",
        "char_start": 130694,
        "char_end": 130741,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i5",
        "text": "And set a double varnish on the fame",
        "char_start": 130742,
        "char_end": 130778,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i6",
        "text": "The Frenchman gave you, bring you in fine together",
        "char_start": 130779,
        "char_end": 130829,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i7",
        "text": "And wager on your heads: he, being remiss,",
        "char_start": 130830,
        "char_end": 130872,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i8",
        "text": "Most generous and free from all contriving,",
        "char_start": 130873,
        "char_end": 130916,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i9",
        "text": "Will not peruse the foils; so that, with ease,",
        "char_start": 130917,
        "char_end": 130963,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i10",
        "text": "Or with a little shuffling, you may choose",
        "char_start": 130964,
        "char_end": 131006,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i11",
        "text": "A sword unbated, and in a pass of practise",
        "char_start": 131007,
        "char_end": 131049,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp31i12",
        "text": "Requite him for your father.",
        "char_start": 131050,
        "char_end": 131078,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i0",
        "text": "I will do't:",
        "char_start": 131079,
        "char_end": 131091,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i1",
        "text": "And, for that purpose, I'll anoint my sword.",
        "char_start": 131092,
        "char_end": 131136,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i2",
        "text": "I bought an unction of a mountebank,",
        "char_start": 131137,
        "char_end": 131173,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i3",
        "text": "So mortal that, but dip a knife in it,",
        "char_start": 131174,
        "char_end": 131212,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i4",
        "text": "Where it draws blood no cataplasm so rare,",
        "char_start": 131213,
        "char_end": 131255,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i5",
        "text": "Collected from all simples that have virtue",
        "char_start": 131256,
        "char_end": 131299,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i6",
        "text": "Under the moon, can save the thing from death",
        "char_start": 131300,
        "char_end": 131345,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i7",
        "text": "That is but scratch'd withal: I'll touch my point",
        "char_start": 131346,
        "char_end": 131395,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i8",
        "text": "With this contagion, that, if I gall him slightly,",
        "char_start": 131396,
        "char_end": 131446,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp32i9",
        "text": "It may be death.",
        "char_start": 131447,
        "char_end": 131463,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i0",
        "text": "Let's further think of this;",
        "char_start": 131464,
        "char_end": 131492,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i1",
        "text": "Weigh what convenience both of time and means",
        "char_start": 131493,
        "char_end": 131538,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i2",
        "text": "May fit us to our shape: if this should fail,",
        "char_start": 131539,
        "char_end": 131584,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i3",
        "text": "And that our drift look through our bad performance,",
        "char_start": 131585,
        "char_end": 131637,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i4",
        "text": "'Twere better not assay'd: therefore this project",
        "char_start": 131638,
        "char_end": 131687,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i5",
        "text": "Should have a back or second, that might hold,",
        "char_start": 131688,
        "char_end": 131734,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i6",
        "text": "If this should blast in proof. Soft! let me see:",
        "char_start": 131735,
        "char_end": 131783,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i7",
        "text": "We'll make a solemn wager on your cunnings: I ha't.",
        "char_start": 131784,
        "char_end": 131835,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i8",
        "text": "When in your motion you are hot and dry--",
        "char_start": 131836,
        "char_end": 131877,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i9",
        "text": "As make your bouts more violent to that end--",
        "char_start": 131878,
        "char_end": 131923,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i10",
        "text": "And that he calls for drink, I'll have prepared him",
        "char_start": 131924,
        "char_end": 131975,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i11",
        "text": "A chalice for the nonce, whereon but sipping,",
        "char_start": 131976,
        "char_end": 132021,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i12",
        "text": "If he by chance escape your venom'd stuck,",
        "char_start": 132022,
        "char_end": 132064,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i13",
        "text": "Our purpose may hold there.",
        "char_start": 132065,
        "char_end": 132092,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i14",
        "text": "Enter QUEEN GERTRUDE",
        "char_start": 132093,
        "char_end": 132113,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp33i15",
        "text": "How now, sweet queen!",
        "char_start": 132114,
        "char_end": 132135,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp34i0",
        "text": "One woe doth tread upon another's heel,",
        "char_start": 132136,
        "char_end": 132175,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp34i1",
        "text": "So fast they follow; your sister's drown'd, Laertes.",
        "char_start": 132176,
        "char_end": 132228,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp35i0",
        "text": "Drown'd! O, where?",
        "char_start": 132229,
        "char_end": 132247,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i0",
        "text": "There is a willow grows aslant a brook,",
        "char_start": 132248,
        "char_end": 132287,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i1",
        "text": "That shows his hoar leaves in the glassy stream;",
        "char_start": 132288,
        "char_end": 132336,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i2",
        "text": "There with fantastic garlands did she come",
        "char_start": 132337,
        "char_end": 132379,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i3",
        "text": "Of crow-flowers, nettles, daisies, and long purples",
        "char_start": 132380,
        "char_end": 132431,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i4",
        "text": "That liberal shepherds give a grosser name,",
        "char_start": 132432,
        "char_end": 132475,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i5",
        "text": "But our cold maids do dead men's fingers call them:",
        "char_start": 132476,
        "char_end": 132527,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i6",
        "text": "There, on the pendent boughs her coronet weeds",
        "char_start": 132528,
        "char_end": 132574,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i7",
        "text": "Clambering to hang, an envious sliver broke;",
        "char_start": 132575,
        "char_end": 132619,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i8",
        "text": "When down her weedy trophies and herself",
        "char_start": 132620,
        "char_end": 132660,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i9",
        "text": "Fell in the weeping brook. Her clothes spread wide;",
        "char_start": 132661,
        "char_end": 132712,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i10",
        "text": "And, mermaid-like, awhile they bore her up:",
        "char_start": 132713,
        "char_end": 132756,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i11",
        "text": "Which time she chanted snatches of old tunes;",
        "char_start": 132757,
        "char_end": 132802,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i12",
        "text": "As one incapable of her own distress,",
        "char_start": 132803,
        "char_end": 132840,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i13",
        "text": "Or like a creature native and indued",
        "char_start": 132841,
        "char_end": 132877,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i14",
        "text": "Unto that element: but long it could not be",
        "char_start": 132878,
        "char_end": 132921,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i15",
        "text": "Till that her garments, heavy with their drink,",
        "char_start": 132922,
        "char_end": 132969,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i16",
        "text": "Pull'd the poor wretch from her melodious lay",
        "char_start": 132970,
        "char_end": 133015,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp36i17",
        "text": "To muddy death.",
        "char_start": 133016,
        "char_end": 133031,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp37i0",
        "text": "Alas, then, she is drown'd?",
        "char_start": 133032,
        "char_end": 133059,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp38i0",
        "text": "Drown'd, drown'd.",
        "char_start": 133060,
        "char_end": 133077,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp39i0",
        "text": "Too much of water hast thou, poor Ophelia,",
        "char_start": 133078,
        "char_end": 133120,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp39i1",
        "text": "And therefore I forbid my tears: but yet",
        "char_start": 133121,
        "char_end": 133161,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp39i2",
        "text": "It is our trick; nature her custom holds,",
        "char_start": 133162,
        "char_end": 133203,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.203",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp39i3",
        "text": "Let shame say what it will: when these are gone,",
        "char_start": 133204,
        "char_end": 133252,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.204",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp39i4",
        "text": "The woman will be out. Adieu, my lord:",
        "char_start": 133253,
        "char_end": 133291,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.205",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp39i5",
        "text": "I have a speech of fire, that fain would blaze,",
        "char_start": 133292,
        "char_end": 133339,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.206",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp39i6",
        "text": "But that this folly douts it.",
        "char_start": 133340,
        "char_end": 133369,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.207",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp39i7",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 133370,
        "char_end": 133374,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp40i0",
        "text": "Let's follow, Gertrude:",
        "char_start": 133375,
        "char_end": 133398,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.208",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp40i1",
        "text": "How much I had to do to calm his rage!",
        "char_start": 133399,
        "char_end": 133437,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.209",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp40i2",
        "text": "Now fear I this will give it start again;",
        "char_start": 133438,
        "char_end": 133479,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.210",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp40i3",
        "text": "Therefore let's follow.",
        "char_start": 133480,
        "char_end": 133503,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": "4.7.211",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a4s7:sp40i4",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 133504,
        "char_end": 133510,
        "act": 4,
        "scene": 7,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:open",
        "text": "Enter two Clowns, with spades, & c",
        "char_start": 133511,
        "char_end": 133545,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp1i0",
        "text": "Is she to be buried in Christian burial that",
        "char_start": 133546,
        "char_end": 133590,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp1i1",
        "text": "wilfully seeks her own salvation?",
        "char_start": 133591,
        "char_end": 133624,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp2i0",
        "text": "I tell thee she is: and therefore make her grave",
        "char_start": 133625,
        "char_end": 133673,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp2i1",
        "text": "straight: the crowner hath sat on her, and finds it",
        "char_start": 133674,
        "char_end": 133725,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp2i2",
        "text": "Christian burial.",
        "char_start": 133726,
        "char_end": 133743,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp3i0",
        "text": "How can that be, unless she drowned herself in her",
        "char_start": 133744,
        "char_end": 133794,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp3i1",
        "text": "own defence?",
        "char_start": 133795,
        "char_end": 133807,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp4i0",
        "text": "Why, 'tis found so.",
        "char_start": 133808,
        "char_end": 133827,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp5i0",
        "text": "It must be 'se offendendo;' it cannot be else. For",
        "char_start": 133828,
        "char_end": 133878,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp5i1",
        "text": "here lies the point: if I drown myself wittingly,",
        "char_start": 133879,
        "char_end": 133928,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp5i2",
        "text": "it argues an act: and an act hath three branches: it",
        "char_start": 133929,
        "char_end": 133981,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp5i3",
        "text": "is, to act, to do, to perform: argal, she drowned",
        "char_start": 133982,
        "char_end": 134031,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp5i4",
        "text": "herself wittingly.",
        "char_start": 134032,
        "char_end": 134050,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp6i0",
        "text": "Nay, but hear you, goodman delver,--",
        "char_start": 134051,
        "char_end": 134087,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp7i0",
        "text": "Give me leave. Here lies the water; good: here",
        "char_start": 134088,
        "char_end": 134134,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp7i1",
        "text": "stands the man; good; if the man go to this water,",
        "char_start": 134135,
        "char_end": 134185,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp7i2",
        "text": "and drown himself, it is, will he, nill he, he",
        "char_start": 134186,
        "char_end": 134232,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp7i3",
        "text": "goes,--mark you that; but if the water come to him",
        "char_start": 134233,
        "char_end": 134283,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp7i4",
        "text": "and drown him, he drowns not himself: argal, he",
        "char_start": 134284,
        "char_end": 134331,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp7i5",
        "text": "that is not guilty of his own death shortens not his own life.",
        "char_start": 134332,
        "char_end": 134394,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp8i0",
        "text": "But is this law?",
        "char_start": 134395,
        "char_end": 134411,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp9i0",
        "text": "Ay, marry, is't; crowner's quest law.",
        "char_start": 134412,
        "char_end": 134449,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp10i0",
        "text": "Will you ha' the truth on't? If this had not been",
        "char_start": 134450,
        "char_end": 134499,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp10i1",
        "text": "a gentlewoman, she should have been buried out o'",
        "char_start": 134500,
        "char_end": 134549,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp10i2",
        "text": "Christian burial.",
        "char_start": 134550,
        "char_end": 134567,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp11i0",
        "text": "Why, there thou say'st: and the more pity that",
        "char_start": 134568,
        "char_end": 134614,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp11i1",
        "text": "great folk should have countenance in this world to",
        "char_start": 134615,
        "char_end": 134666,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp11i2",
        "text": "drown or hang themselves, more than their even",
        "char_start": 134667,
        "char_end": 134713,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp11i3",
        "text": "Christian. Come, my spade. There is no ancient",
        "char_start": 134714,
        "char_end": 134760,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp11i4",
        "text": "gentleman but gardeners, ditchers, and grave-makers:",
        "char_start": 134761,
        "char_end": 134813,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp11i5",
        "text": "they hold up Adam's profession.",
        "char_start": 134814,
        "char_end": 134845,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp12i0",
        "text": "Was he a gentleman?",
        "char_start": 134846,
        "char_end": 134865,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp13i0",
        "text": "He was the first that ever bore arms.",
        "char_start": 134866,
        "char_end": 134903,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp14i0",
        "text": "Why, he had none.",
        "char_start": 134904,
        "char_end": 134921,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp15i0",
        "text": "What, art a heathen? How dost thou understand the",
        "char_start": 134922,
        "char_end": 134971,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp15i1",
        "text": "Scripture? The Scripture says 'Adam digged:'",
        "char_start": 134972,
        "char_end": 135016,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp15i2",
        "text": "could he dig without arms? I'll put another",
        "char_start": 135017,
        "char_end": 135060,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp15i3",
        "text": "question to thee: if thou answerest me not to the",
        "char_start": 135061,
        "char_end": 135110,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp15i4",
        "text": "purpose, confess thyself--",
        "char_start": 135111,
        "char_end": 135137,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp16i0",
        "text": "Go to.",
        "char_start": 135138,
        "char_end": 135144,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp17i0",
        "text": "What is he that builds stronger than either the",
        "char_start": 135145,
        "char_end": 135192,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp17i1",
        "text": "mason, the shipwright, or the carpenter?",
        "char_start": 135193,
        "char_end": 135233,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp18i0",
        "text": "The gallows-maker; for that frame outlives a",
        "char_start": 135234,
        "char_end": 135278,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp18i1",
        "text": "thousand tenants.",
        "char_start": 135279,
        "char_end": 135296,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp19i0",
        "text": "I like thy wit well, in good faith: the gallows",
        "char_start": 135297,
        "char_end": 135344,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp19i1",
        "text": "does well; but how does it well? it does well to",
        "char_start": 135345,
        "char_end": 135393,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp19i2",
        "text": "those that do in: now thou dost ill to say the",
        "char_start": 135394,
        "char_end": 135440,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp19i3",
        "text": "gallows is built stronger than the church: argal,",
        "char_start": 135441,
        "char_end": 135490,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp19i4",
        "text": "the gallows may do well to thee. To't again, come.",
        "char_start": 135491,
        "char_end": 135541,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp20i0",
        "text": "'Who builds stronger than a mason, a shipwright, or",
        "char_start": 135542,
        "char_end": 135593,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp20i1",
        "text": "a carpenter?'",
        "char_start": 135594,
        "char_end": 135607,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp21i0",
        "text": "Ay, tell me that, and unyoke.",
        "char_start": 135608,
        "char_end": 135637,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp22i0",
        "text": "Marry, now I can tell.",
        "char_start": 135638,
        "char_end": 135660,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp23i0",
        "text": "To't.",
        "char_start": 135661,
        "char_end": 135666,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp24i0",
        "text": "Mass, I cannot tell.",
        "char_start": 135667,
        "char_end": 135687,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp24i1",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET and HORATIO, at a distance",
        "char_start": 135688,
        "char_end": 135727,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "Second Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i0",
        "text": "Cudgel thy brains no more about it, for your dull",
        "char_start": 135728,
        "char_end": 135777,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i1",
        "text": "ass will not mend his pace with beating; and, when",
        "char_start": 135778,
        "char_end": 135828,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i2",
        "text": "you are asked this question next, say 'a",
        "char_start": 135829,
        "char_end": 135869,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i3",
        "text": "grave-maker: 'the houses that he makes last till",
        "char_start": 135870,
        "char_end": 135918,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i4",
        "text": "doomsday. Go, get thee to Yaughan: fetch me a",
        "char_start": 135919,
        "char_end": 135964,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i5",
        "text": "stoup of liquor.",
        "char_start": 135965,
        "char_end": 135981,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i6",
        "text": "Exit Second Clown",
        "char_start": 135982,
        "char_end": 135999,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i7",
        "text": "He digs and sings",
        "char_start": 136000,
        "char_end": 136017,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i8",
        "text": "In youth, when I did love, did love,",
        "char_start": 136018,
        "char_end": 136054,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i9",
        "text": "Methought it was very sweet,",
        "char_start": 136055,
        "char_end": 136083,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i10",
        "text": "To contract, O, the time, for, ah, my behove,",
        "char_start": 136084,
        "char_end": 136129,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp25i11",
        "text": "O, methought, there was nothing meet.",
        "char_start": 136130,
        "char_end": 136167,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp26i0",
        "text": "Has this fellow no feeling of his business, that he",
        "char_start": 136168,
        "char_end": 136219,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp26i1",
        "text": "sings at grave-making?",
        "char_start": 136220,
        "char_end": 136242,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp27i0",
        "text": "Custom hath made it in him a property of easiness.",
        "char_start": 136243,
        "char_end": 136293,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp28i0",
        "text": "'Tis e'en so: the hand of little employment hath",
        "char_start": 136294,
        "char_end": 136342,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp28i1",
        "text": "the daintier sense.",
        "char_start": 136343,
        "char_end": 136362,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp29i0",
        "text": "[Sings]",
        "char_start": 136363,
        "char_end": 136370,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp29i1",
        "text": "But age, with his stealing steps,",
        "char_start": 136371,
        "char_end": 136404,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp29i2",
        "text": "Hath claw'd me in his clutch,",
        "char_start": 136405,
        "char_end": 136434,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp29i3",
        "text": "And hath shipped me intil the land,",
        "char_start": 136435,
        "char_end": 136470,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp29i4",
        "text": "As if I had never been such.",
        "char_start": 136471,
        "char_end": 136499,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp29i5",
        "text": "Throws up a skull",
        "char_start": 136500,
        "char_end": 136517,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp30i0",
        "text": "That skull had a tongue in it, and could sing once:",
        "char_start": 136518,
        "char_end": 136569,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp30i1",
        "text": "how the knave jowls it to the ground, as if it were",
        "char_start": 136570,
        "char_end": 136621,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp30i2",
        "text": "Cain's jaw-bone, that did the first murder! It",
        "char_start": 136622,
        "char_end": 136668,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp30i3",
        "text": "might be the pate of a politician, which this ass",
        "char_start": 136669,
        "char_end": 136718,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp30i4",
        "text": "now o'er-reaches; one that would circumvent God,",
        "char_start": 136719,
        "char_end": 136767,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp30i5",
        "text": "might it not?",
        "char_start": 136768,
        "char_end": 136781,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp31i0",
        "text": "It might, my lord.",
        "char_start": 136782,
        "char_end": 136800,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp32i0",
        "text": "Or of a courtier; which could say 'Good morrow,",
        "char_start": 136801,
        "char_end": 136848,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp32i1",
        "text": "sweet lord! How dost thou, good lord?' This might",
        "char_start": 136849,
        "char_end": 136898,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp32i2",
        "text": "be my lord such-a-one, that praised my lord",
        "char_start": 136899,
        "char_end": 136942,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp32i3",
        "text": "such-a-one's horse, when he meant to beg it; might it not?",
        "char_start": 136943,
        "char_end": 137001,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp33i0",
        "text": "Ay, my lord.",
        "char_start": 137002,
        "char_end": 137014,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp34i0",
        "text": "Why, e'en so: and now my Lady Worm's; chapless, and",
        "char_start": 137015,
        "char_end": 137066,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp34i1",
        "text": "knocked about the mazzard with a sexton's spade:",
        "char_start": 137067,
        "char_end": 137115,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp34i2",
        "text": "here's fine revolution, an we had the trick to",
        "char_start": 137116,
        "char_end": 137162,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp34i3",
        "text": "see't. Did these bones cost no more the breeding,",
        "char_start": 137163,
        "char_end": 137212,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp34i4",
        "text": "but to play at loggats with 'em? mine ache to think on't.",
        "char_start": 137213,
        "char_end": 137270,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp35i0",
        "text": "[Sings]",
        "char_start": 137271,
        "char_end": 137278,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp35i1",
        "text": "A pick-axe, and a spade, a spade,",
        "char_start": 137279,
        "char_end": 137312,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp35i2",
        "text": "For and a shrouding sheet:",
        "char_start": 137313,
        "char_end": 137339,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp35i3",
        "text": "O, a pit of clay for to be made",
        "char_start": 137340,
        "char_end": 137371,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp35i4",
        "text": "For such a guest is meet.",
        "char_start": 137372,
        "char_end": 137397,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp35i5",
        "text": "Throws up another skull",
        "char_start": 137398,
        "char_end": 137421,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i0",
        "text": "There's another: why may not that be the skull of a",
        "char_start": 137422,
        "char_end": 137473,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i1",
        "text": "lawyer? Where be his quiddities now, his quillets,",
        "char_start": 137474,
        "char_end": 137524,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i2",
        "text": "his cases, his tenures, and his tricks? why does he",
        "char_start": 137525,
        "char_end": 137576,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i3",
        "text": "suffer this rude knave now to knock him about the",
        "char_start": 137577,
        "char_end": 137626,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i4",
        "text": "sconce with a dirty shovel, and will not tell him of",
        "char_start": 137627,
        "char_end": 137679,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i5",
        "text": "his action of battery? Hum! This fellow might be",
        "char_start": 137680,
        "char_end": 137728,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i6",
        "text": "in's time a great buyer of land, with his statutes,",
        "char_start": 137729,
        "char_end": 137780,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i7",
        "text": "his recognizances, his fines, his double vouchers,",
        "char_start": 137781,
        "char_end": 137831,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i8",
        "text": "his recoveries: is this the fine of his fines, and",
        "char_start": 137832,
        "char_end": 137882,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i9",
        "text": "the recovery of his recoveries, to have his fine",
        "char_start": 137883,
        "char_end": 137931,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i10",
        "text": "pate full of fine dirt? will his vouchers vouch him",
        "char_start": 137932,
        "char_end": 137983,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i11",
        "text": "no more of his purchases, and double ones too, than",
        "char_start": 137984,
        "char_end": 138035,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i12",
        "text": "the length and breadth of a pair of indentures? The",
        "char_start": 138036,
        "char_end": 138087,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i13",
        "text": "very conveyances of his lands will hardly lie in",
        "char_start": 138088,
        "char_end": 138136,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp36i14",
        "text": "this box; and must the inheritor himself have no more, ha?",
        "char_start": 138137,
        "char_end": 138195,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp37i0",
        "text": "Not a jot more, my lord.",
        "char_start": 138196,
        "char_end": 138220,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp38i0",
        "text": "Is not parchment made of sheepskins?",
        "char_start": 138221,
        "char_end": 138257,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp39i0",
        "text": "Ay, my lord, and of calf-skins too.",
        "char_start": 138258,
        "char_end": 138293,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp40i0",
        "text": "They are sheep and calves which seek out assurance",
        "char_start": 138294,
        "char_end": 138344,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp40i1",
        "text": "in that. I will speak to this fellow. Whose",
        "char_start": 138345,
        "char_end": 138388,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp40i2",
        "text": "grave's this, sirrah?",
        "char_start": 138389,
        "char_end": 138410,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp41i0",
        "text": "Mine, sir.",
        "char_start": 138411,
        "char_end": 138421,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp41i1",
        "text": "Sings",
        "char_start": 138422,
        "char_end": 138427,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp41i2",
        "text": "O, a pit of clay for to be made",
        "char_start": 138428,
        "char_end": 138459,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp41i3",
        "text": "For such a guest is meet.",
        "char_start": 138460,
        "char_end": 138485,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp42i0",
        "text": "I think it be thine, indeed; for thou liest in't.",
        "char_start": 138486,
        "char_end": 138535,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp43i0",
        "text": "You lie out on't, sir, and therefore it is not",
        "char_start": 138536,
        "char_end": 138582,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp43i1",
        "text": "yours: for my part, I do not lie in't, and yet it is mine.",
        "char_start": 138583,
        "char_end": 138641,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp44i0",
        "text": "'Thou dost lie in't, to be in't and say it is thine:",
        "char_start": 138642,
        "char_end": 138694,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp44i1",
        "text": "'tis for the dead, not for the quick; therefore thou liest.",
        "char_start": 138695,
        "char_end": 138754,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp45i0",
        "text": "'Tis a quick lie, sir; 'twill away gain, from me to",
        "char_start": 138755,
        "char_end": 138806,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp45i1",
        "text": "you.",
        "char_start": 138807,
        "char_end": 138811,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp46i0",
        "text": "What man dost thou dig it for?",
        "char_start": 138812,
        "char_end": 138842,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp47i0",
        "text": "For no man, sir.",
        "char_start": 138843,
        "char_end": 138859,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp48i0",
        "text": "What woman, then?",
        "char_start": 138860,
        "char_end": 138877,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp49i0",
        "text": "For none, neither.",
        "char_start": 138878,
        "char_end": 138896,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp50i0",
        "text": "Who is to be buried in't?",
        "char_start": 138897,
        "char_end": 138922,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp51i0",
        "text": "One that was a woman, sir; but, rest her soul, she's dead.",
        "char_start": 138923,
        "char_end": 138981,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp52i0",
        "text": "How absolute the knave is! we must speak by the",
        "char_start": 138982,
        "char_end": 139029,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp52i1",
        "text": "card, or equivocation will undo us. By the Lord,",
        "char_start": 139030,
        "char_end": 139078,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp52i2",
        "text": "Horatio, these three years I have taken a note of",
        "char_start": 139079,
        "char_end": 139128,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp52i3",
        "text": "it; the age is grown so picked that the toe of the",
        "char_start": 139129,
        "char_end": 139179,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp52i4",
        "text": "peasant comes so near the heel of the courtier, he",
        "char_start": 139180,
        "char_end": 139230,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp52i5",
        "text": "gaffs his kibe. How long hast thou been a",
        "char_start": 139231,
        "char_end": 139272,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp52i6",
        "text": "grave-maker?",
        "char_start": 139273,
        "char_end": 139285,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp53i0",
        "text": "Of all the days i' the year, I came to't that day",
        "char_start": 139286,
        "char_end": 139335,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp53i1",
        "text": "that our last king Hamlet overcame Fortinbras.",
        "char_start": 139336,
        "char_end": 139382,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp54i0",
        "text": "How long is that since?",
        "char_start": 139383,
        "char_end": 139406,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp55i0",
        "text": "Cannot you tell that? every fool can tell that: it",
        "char_start": 139407,
        "char_end": 139457,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp55i1",
        "text": "was the very day that young Hamlet was born; he that",
        "char_start": 139458,
        "char_end": 139510,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp55i2",
        "text": "is mad, and sent into England.",
        "char_start": 139511,
        "char_end": 139541,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp56i0",
        "text": "Ay, marry, why was he sent into England?",
        "char_start": 139542,
        "char_end": 139582,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp57i0",
        "text": "Why, because he was mad: he shall recover his wits",
        "char_start": 139583,
        "char_end": 139633,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp57i1",
        "text": "there; or, if he do not, it's no great matter there.",
        "char_start": 139634,
        "char_end": 139686,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp58i0",
        "text": "Why?",
        "char_start": 139687,
        "char_end": 139691,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp59i0",
        "text": "'Twill, a not be seen in him there; there the men",
        "char_start": 139692,
        "char_end": 139741,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp59i1",
        "text": "are as mad as he.",
        "char_start": 139742,
        "char_end": 139759,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp60i0",
        "text": "How came he mad?",
        "char_start": 139760,
        "char_end": 139776,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp61i0",
        "text": "Very strangely, they say.",
        "char_start": 139777,
        "char_end": 139802,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp62i0",
        "text": "How strangely?",
        "char_start": 139803,
        "char_end": 139817,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp63i0",
        "text": "Faith, e'en with losing his wits.",
        "char_start": 139818,
        "char_end": 139851,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp64i0",
        "text": "Upon what ground?",
        "char_start": 139852,
        "char_end": 139869,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp65i0",
        "text": "Why, here in Denmark: I have been sexton here, man",
        "char_start": 139870,
        "char_end": 139920,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp65i1",
        "text": "and boy, thirty years.",
        "char_start": 139921,
        "char_end": 139943,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp66i0",
        "text": "How long will a man lie i' the earth ere he rot?",
        "char_start": 139944,
        "char_end": 139992,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp67i0",
        "text": "I' faith, if he be not rotten before he die--as we",
        "char_start": 139993,
        "char_end": 140043,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp67i1",
        "text": "have many pocky corses now-a-days, that will scarce",
        "char_start": 140044,
        "char_end": 140095,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp67i2",
        "text": "hold the laying in--he will last you some eight year",
        "char_start": 140096,
        "char_end": 140148,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp67i3",
        "text": "or nine year: a tanner will last you nine year.",
        "char_start": 140149,
        "char_end": 140196,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp68i0",
        "text": "Why he more than another?",
        "char_start": 140197,
        "char_end": 140222,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp69i0",
        "text": "Why, sir, his hide is so tanned with his trade, that",
        "char_start": 140223,
        "char_end": 140275,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp69i1",
        "text": "he will keep out water a great while; and your water",
        "char_start": 140276,
        "char_end": 140328,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp69i2",
        "text": "is a sore decayer of your whoreson dead body.",
        "char_start": 140329,
        "char_end": 140374,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp69i3",
        "text": "Here's a skull now; this skull has lain in the earth",
        "char_start": 140375,
        "char_end": 140427,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp69i4",
        "text": "three and twenty years.",
        "char_start": 140428,
        "char_end": 140451,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp70i0",
        "text": "Whose was it?",
        "char_start": 140452,
        "char_end": 140465,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp71i0",
        "text": "A whoreson mad fellow's it was: whose do you think it was?",
        "char_start": 140466,
        "char_end": 140524,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp72i0",
        "text": "Nay, I know not.",
        "char_start": 140525,
        "char_end": 140541,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp73i0",
        "text": "A pestilence on him for a mad rogue! a' poured a",
        "char_start": 140542,
        "char_end": 140590,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp73i1",
        "text": "flagon of Rhenish on my head once. This same skull,",
        "char_start": 140591,
        "char_end": 140642,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp73i2",
        "text": "sir, was Yorick's skull, the king's jester.",
        "char_start": 140643,
        "char_end": 140686,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp74i0",
        "text": "This?",
        "char_start": 140687,
        "char_end": 140692,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp75i0",
        "text": "E'en that.",
        "char_start": 140693,
        "char_end": 140703,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Clown"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i0",
        "text": "Let me see.",
        "char_start": 140704,
        "char_end": 140715,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i1",
        "text": "Takes the skull",
        "char_start": 140716,
        "char_end": 140731,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i2",
        "text": "Alas, poor Yorick! I knew him, Horatio: a fellow",
        "char_start": 140732,
        "char_end": 140780,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i3",
        "text": "of infinite jest, of most excellent fancy: he hath",
        "char_start": 140781,
        "char_end": 140831,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i4",
        "text": "borne me on his back a thousand times; and now, how",
        "char_start": 140832,
        "char_end": 140883,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i5",
        "text": "abhorred in my imagination it is! my gorge rims at",
        "char_start": 140884,
        "char_end": 140934,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i6",
        "text": "it. Here hung those lips that I have kissed I know",
        "char_start": 140935,
        "char_end": 140985,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i7",
        "text": "not how oft. Where be your gibes now? your",
        "char_start": 140986,
        "char_end": 141028,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i8",
        "text": "gambols? your songs? your flashes of merriment,",
        "char_start": 141029,
        "char_end": 141076,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i9",
        "text": "that were wont to set the table on a roar? Not one",
        "char_start": 141077,
        "char_end": 141127,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i10",
        "text": "now, to mock your own grinning? quite chap-fallen?",
        "char_start": 141128,
        "char_end": 141178,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i11",
        "text": "Now get you to my lady's chamber, and tell her, let",
        "char_start": 141179,
        "char_end": 141230,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i12",
        "text": "her paint an inch thick, to this favour she must",
        "char_start": 141231,
        "char_end": 141279,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i13",
        "text": "come; make her laugh at that. Prithee, Horatio, tell",
        "char_start": 141280,
        "char_end": 141332,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp76i14",
        "text": "me one thing.",
        "char_start": 141333,
        "char_end": 141346,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp77i0",
        "text": "What's that, my lord?",
        "char_start": 141347,
        "char_end": 141368,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp78i0",
        "text": "Dost thou think Alexander looked o' this fashion i'",
        "char_start": 141369,
        "char_end": 141420,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp78i1",
        "text": "the earth?",
        "char_start": 141421,
        "char_end": 141431,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp79i0",
        "text": "E'en so.",
        "char_start": 141432,
        "char_end": 141440,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp80i0",
        "text": "And smelt so? pah!",
        "char_start": 141441,
        "char_end": 141459,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp80i1",
        "text": "Puts down the skull",
        "char_start": 141460,
        "char_end": 141479,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp81i0",
        "text": "E'en so, my lord.",
        "char_start": 141480,
        "char_end": 141497,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp82i0",
        "text": "To what base uses we may return, Horatio! Why may",
        "char_start": 141498,
        "char_end": 141547,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp82i1",
        "text": "not imagination trace the noble dust of Alexander,",
        "char_start": 141548,
        "char_end": 141598,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp82i2",
        "text": "till he find it stopping a bung-hole?",
        "char_start": 141599,
        "char_end": 141636,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp83i0",
        "text": "'Twere to consider too curiously, to consider so.",
        "char_start": 141637,
        "char_end": 141686,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.203",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i0",
        "text": "No, faith, not a jot; but to follow him thither with",
        "char_start": 141687,
        "char_end": 141739,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.204",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i1",
        "text": "modesty enough, and likelihood to lead it: as",
        "char_start": 141740,
        "char_end": 141785,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.205",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i2",
        "text": "thus: Alexander died, Alexander was buried,",
        "char_start": 141786,
        "char_end": 141829,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.206",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i3",
        "text": "Alexander returneth into dust; the dust is earth; of",
        "char_start": 141830,
        "char_end": 141882,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.207",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i4",
        "text": "earth we make loam; and why of that loam, whereto he",
        "char_start": 141883,
        "char_end": 141935,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.208",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i5",
        "text": "was converted, might they not stop a beer-barrel?",
        "char_start": 141936,
        "char_end": 141985,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.209",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i6",
        "text": "Imperious Caesar, dead and turn'd to clay,",
        "char_start": 141986,
        "char_end": 142028,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.210",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i7",
        "text": "Might stop a hole to keep the wind away:",
        "char_start": 142029,
        "char_end": 142069,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.211",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i8",
        "text": "O, that that earth, which kept the world in awe,",
        "char_start": 142070,
        "char_end": 142118,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.212",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i9",
        "text": "Should patch a wall to expel the winter flaw!",
        "char_start": 142119,
        "char_end": 142164,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.213",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i10",
        "text": "But soft! but soft! aside: here comes the king.",
        "char_start": 142165,
        "char_end": 142212,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.214",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i11",
        "text": "Enter Priest, & c. in procession; the Corpse of OPHELIA, LAERTES and Mourners following; KING CLAUDIUS, QUEEN GERTRUDE, their trains, & c",
        "char_start": 142213,
        "char_end": 142350,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i12",
        "text": "The queen, the courtiers: who is this they follow?",
        "char_start": 142351,
        "char_end": 142401,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.215",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i13",
        "text": "And with such maimed rites? This doth betoken",
        "char_start": 142402,
        "char_end": 142447,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.216",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i14",
        "text": "The corse they follow did with desperate hand",
        "char_start": 142448,
        "char_end": 142493,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.217",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i15",
        "text": "Fordo its own life: 'twas of some estate.",
        "char_start": 142494,
        "char_end": 142535,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.218",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i16",
        "text": "Couch we awhile, and mark.",
        "char_start": 142536,
        "char_end": 142562,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.219",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp84i17",
        "text": "Retiring with HORATIO",
        "char_start": 142563,
        "char_end": 142584,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp85i0",
        "text": "What ceremony else?",
        "char_start": 142585,
        "char_end": 142604,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.220",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp86i0",
        "text": "That is Laertes,",
        "char_start": 142605,
        "char_end": 142621,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.221",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp86i1",
        "text": "A very noble youth: mark.",
        "char_start": 142622,
        "char_end": 142647,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.222",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp87i0",
        "text": "What ceremony else?",
        "char_start": 142648,
        "char_end": 142667,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.223",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp88i0",
        "text": "Her obsequies have been as far enlarged",
        "char_start": 142668,
        "char_end": 142707,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.224",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp88i1",
        "text": "As we have warrantise: her death was doubtful;",
        "char_start": 142708,
        "char_end": 142754,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.225",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp88i2",
        "text": "And, but that great command o'ersways the order,",
        "char_start": 142755,
        "char_end": 142803,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.226",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp88i3",
        "text": "She should in ground unsanctified have lodged",
        "char_start": 142804,
        "char_end": 142849,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.227",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp88i4",
        "text": "Till the last trumpet: for charitable prayers,",
        "char_start": 142850,
        "char_end": 142896,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.228",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp88i5",
        "text": "Shards, flints and pebbles should be thrown on her;",
        "char_start": 142897,
        "char_end": 142948,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.229",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp88i6",
        "text": "Yet here she is allow'd her virgin crants,",
        "char_start": 142949,
        "char_end": 142991,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.230",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp88i7",
        "text": "Her maiden strewments and the bringing home",
        "char_start": 142992,
        "char_end": 143035,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.231",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp88i8",
        "text": "Of bell and burial.",
        "char_start": 143036,
        "char_end": 143055,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.232",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp89i0",
        "text": "Must there no more be done?",
        "char_start": 143056,
        "char_end": 143083,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.233",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp90i0",
        "text": "No more be done:",
        "char_start": 143084,
        "char_end": 143100,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.234",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp90i1",
        "text": "We should profane the service of the dead",
        "char_start": 143101,
        "char_end": 143142,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.235",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp90i2",
        "text": "To sing a requiem and such rest to her",
        "char_start": 143143,
        "char_end": 143181,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.236",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp90i3",
        "text": "As to peace-parted souls.",
        "char_start": 143182,
        "char_end": 143207,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.237",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Priest"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp91i0",
        "text": "Lay her i' the earth:",
        "char_start": 143208,
        "char_end": 143229,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.238",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp91i1",
        "text": "And from her fair and unpolluted flesh",
        "char_start": 143230,
        "char_end": 143268,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.239",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp91i2",
        "text": "May violets spring! I tell thee, churlish priest,",
        "char_start": 143269,
        "char_end": 143318,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.240",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp91i3",
        "text": "A ministering angel shall my sister be,",
        "char_start": 143319,
        "char_end": 143358,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.241",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp91i4",
        "text": "When thou liest howling.",
        "char_start": 143359,
        "char_end": 143383,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.242",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp92i0",
        "text": "What, the fair Ophelia!",
        "char_start": 143384,
        "char_end": 143407,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.243",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp93i0",
        "text": "Sweets to the sweet: farewell!",
        "char_start": 143408,
        "char_end": 143438,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.244",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp93i1",
        "text": "Scattering flowers",
        "char_start": 143439,
        "char_end": 143457,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp93i2",
        "text": "I hoped thou shouldst have been my Hamlet's wife;",
        "char_start": 143458,
        "char_end": 143507,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.245",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp93i3",
        "text": "I thought thy bride-bed to have deck'd, sweet maid,",
        "char_start": 143508,
        "char_end": 143559,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.246",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp93i4",
        "text": "And not have strew'd thy grave.",
        "char_start": 143560,
        "char_end": 143591,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.247",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i0",
        "text": "O, treble woe",
        "char_start": 143592,
        "char_end": 143605,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.248",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i1",
        "text": "Fall ten times treble on that cursed head,",
        "char_start": 143606,
        "char_end": 143648,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.249",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i2",
        "text": "Whose wicked deed thy most ingenious sense",
        "char_start": 143649,
        "char_end": 143691,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.250",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i3",
        "text": "Deprived thee of! Hold off the earth awhile,",
        "char_start": 143692,
        "char_end": 143736,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.251",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i4",
        "text": "Till I have caught her once more in mine arms:",
        "char_start": 143737,
        "char_end": 143783,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.252",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i5",
        "text": "Leaps into the grave",
        "char_start": 143784,
        "char_end": 143804,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i6",
        "text": "Now pile your dust upon the quick and dead,",
        "char_start": 143805,
        "char_end": 143848,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.253",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i7",
        "text": "Till of this flat a mountain you have made,",
        "char_start": 143849,
        "char_end": 143892,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.254",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i8",
        "text": "To o'ertop old Pelion, or the skyish head",
        "char_start": 143893,
        "char_end": 143934,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.255",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp94i9",
        "text": "Of blue Olympus.",
        "char_start": 143935,
        "char_end": 143951,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.256",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp95i0",
        "text": "[Advancing] What is he whose grief",
        "char_start": 143952,
        "char_end": 143986,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.257",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp95i1",
        "text": "Bears such an emphasis? whose phrase of sorrow",
        "char_start": 143987,
        "char_end": 144033,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.258",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp95i2",
        "text": "Conjures the wandering stars, and makes them stand",
        "char_start": 144034,
        "char_end": 144084,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.259",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp95i3",
        "text": "Like wonder-wounded hearers? This is I,",
        "char_start": 144085,
        "char_end": 144124,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.260",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp95i4",
        "text": "Hamlet the Dane.",
        "char_start": 144125,
        "char_end": 144141,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.261",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp95i5",
        "text": "Leaps into the grave",
        "char_start": 144142,
        "char_end": 144162,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp96i0",
        "text": "The devil take thy soul!",
        "char_start": 144163,
        "char_end": 144187,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.262",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp96i1",
        "text": "Grappling with him",
        "char_start": 144188,
        "char_end": 144206,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp97i0",
        "text": "Thou pray'st not well.",
        "char_start": 144207,
        "char_end": 144229,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.263",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp97i1",
        "text": "I prithee, take thy fingers from my throat;",
        "char_start": 144230,
        "char_end": 144273,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.264",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp97i2",
        "text": "For, though I am not splenitive and rash,",
        "char_start": 144274,
        "char_end": 144315,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.265",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp97i3",
        "text": "Yet have I something in me dangerous,",
        "char_start": 144316,
        "char_end": 144353,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.266",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp97i4",
        "text": "Which let thy wiseness fear: hold off thy hand.",
        "char_start": 144354,
        "char_end": 144401,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.267",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp98i0",
        "text": "Pluck them asunder.",
        "char_start": 144402,
        "char_end": 144421,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.268",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp99i0",
        "text": "Hamlet, Hamlet!",
        "char_start": 144422,
        "char_end": 144437,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.269",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp100i0",
        "text": "Gentlemen,--",
        "char_start": 144438,
        "char_end": 144450,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.270",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "All"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp101i0",
        "text": "Good my lord, be quiet.",
        "char_start": 144451,
        "char_end": 144474,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.271",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp101i1",
        "text": "The Attendants part them, and they come out of the grave",
        "char_start": 144475,
        "char_end": 144531,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp102i0",
        "text": "Why I will fight with him upon this theme",
        "char_start": 144532,
        "char_end": 144573,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.272",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp102i1",
        "text": "Until my eyelids will no longer wag.",
        "char_start": 144574,
        "char_end": 144610,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.273",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp103i0",
        "text": "O my son, what theme?",
        "char_start": 144611,
        "char_end": 144632,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.274",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp104i0",
        "text": "I loved Ophelia: forty thousand brothers",
        "char_start": 144633,
        "char_end": 144673,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.275",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp104i1",
        "text": "Could not, with all their quantity of love,",
        "char_start": 144674,
        "char_end": 144717,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.276",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp104i2",
        "text": "Make up my sum. What wilt thou do for her?",
        "char_start": 144718,
        "char_end": 144760,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.277",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp105i0",
        "text": "O, he is mad, Laertes.",
        "char_start": 144761,
        "char_end": 144783,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.278",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp106i0",
        "text": "For love of God, forbear him.",
        "char_start": 144784,
        "char_end": 144813,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.279",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i0",
        "text": "'Swounds, show me what thou'lt do:",
        "char_start": 144814,
        "char_end": 144848,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.280",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i1",
        "text": "Woo't weep? woo't fight? woo't fast? woo't tear thyself?",
        "char_start": 144849,
        "char_end": 144905,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.281",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i2",
        "text": "Woo't drink up eisel? eat a crocodile?",
        "char_start": 144906,
        "char_end": 144944,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.282",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i3",
        "text": "I'll do't. Dost thou come here to whine?",
        "char_start": 144945,
        "char_end": 144985,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.283",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i4",
        "text": "To outface me with leaping in her grave?",
        "char_start": 144986,
        "char_end": 145026,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.284",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i5",
        "text": "Be buried quick with her, and so will I:",
        "char_start": 145027,
        "char_end": 145067,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.285",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i6",
        "text": "And, if thou prate of mountains, let them throw",
        "char_start": 145068,
        "char_end": 145115,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.286",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i7",
        "text": "Millions of acres on us, till our ground,",
        "char_start": 145116,
        "char_end": 145157,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.287",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i8",
        "text": "Singeing his pate against the burning zone,",
        "char_start": 145158,
        "char_end": 145201,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.288",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i9",
        "text": "Make Ossa like a wart! Nay, an thou'lt mouth,",
        "char_start": 145202,
        "char_end": 145247,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.289",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp107i10",
        "text": "I'll rant as well as thou.",
        "char_start": 145248,
        "char_end": 145274,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.290",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp108i0",
        "text": "This is mere madness:",
        "char_start": 145275,
        "char_end": 145296,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.291",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp108i1",
        "text": "And thus awhile the fit will work on him;",
        "char_start": 145297,
        "char_end": 145338,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.292",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp108i2",
        "text": "Anon, as patient as the female dove,",
        "char_start": 145339,
        "char_end": 145375,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.293",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp108i3",
        "text": "When that her golden couplets are disclosed,",
        "char_start": 145376,
        "char_end": 145420,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.294",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp108i4",
        "text": "His silence will sit drooping.",
        "char_start": 145421,
        "char_end": 145451,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.295",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp109i0",
        "text": "Hear you, sir;",
        "char_start": 145452,
        "char_end": 145466,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.296",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp109i1",
        "text": "What is the reason that you use me thus?",
        "char_start": 145467,
        "char_end": 145507,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.297",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp109i2",
        "text": "I loved you ever: but it is no matter;",
        "char_start": 145508,
        "char_end": 145546,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.298",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp109i3",
        "text": "Let Hercules himself do what he may,",
        "char_start": 145547,
        "char_end": 145583,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.299",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp109i4",
        "text": "The cat will mew and dog will have his day.",
        "char_start": 145584,
        "char_end": 145627,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.300",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp109i5",
        "text": "Exit",
        "char_start": 145628,
        "char_end": 145632,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i0",
        "text": "I pray you, good Horatio, wait upon him.",
        "char_start": 145633,
        "char_end": 145673,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.301",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i1",
        "text": "Exit HORATIO",
        "char_start": 145674,
        "char_end": 145686,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i2",
        "text": "To LAERTES",
        "char_start": 145687,
        "char_end": 145697,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i3",
        "text": "Strengthen your patience in our last night's speech;",
        "char_start": 145698,
        "char_end": 145750,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.302",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i4",
        "text": "We'll put the matter to the present push.",
        "char_start": 145751,
        "char_end": 145792,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.303",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i5",
        "text": "Good Gertrude, set some watch over your son.",
        "char_start": 145793,
        "char_end": 145837,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.304",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i6",
        "text": "This grave shall have a living monument:",
        "char_start": 145838,
        "char_end": 145878,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.305",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i7",
        "text": "An hour of quiet shortly shall we see;",
        "char_start": 145879,
        "char_end": 145917,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.306",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i8",
        "text": "Till then, in patience our proceeding be.",
        "char_start": 145918,
        "char_end": 145959,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": "5.1.307",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s1:sp110i9",
        "text": "Exeunt",
        "char_start": 145960,
        "char_end": 145966,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 1,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:open",
        "text": "Enter HAMLET and HORATIO",
        "char_start": 145967,
        "char_end": 145991,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "opening_stage_direction",
        "speaker": null
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp1i0",
        "text": "So much for this, sir: now shall you see the other;",
        "char_start": 145992,
        "char_end": 146043,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.1",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp1i1",
        "text": "You do remember all the circumstance?",
        "char_start": 146044,
        "char_end": 146081,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.2",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp2i0",
        "text": "Remember it, my lord?",
        "char_start": 146082,
        "char_end": 146103,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.3",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp3i0",
        "text": "Sir, in my heart there was a kind of fighting,",
        "char_start": 146104,
        "char_end": 146150,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.4",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp3i1",
        "text": "That would not let me sleep: methought I lay",
        "char_start": 146151,
        "char_end": 146195,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.5",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp3i2",
        "text": "Worse than the mutines in the bilboes. Rashly,",
        "char_start": 146196,
        "char_end": 146242,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.6",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp3i3",
        "text": "And praised be rashness for it, let us know,",
        "char_start": 146243,
        "char_end": 146287,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.7",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp3i4",
        "text": "Our indiscretion sometimes serves us well,",
        "char_start": 146288,
        "char_end": 146330,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.8",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp3i5",
        "text": "When our deep plots do pall: and that should teach us",
        "char_start": 146331,
        "char_end": 146384,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.9",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp3i6",
        "text": "There's a divinity that shapes our ends,",
        "char_start": 146385,
        "char_end": 146425,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.10",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp3i7",
        "text": "Rough-hew them how we will,--",
        "char_start": 146426,
        "char_end": 146455,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.11",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp4i0",
        "text": "That is most certain.",
        "char_start": 146456,
        "char_end": 146477,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.12",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i0",
        "text": "Up from my cabin,",
        "char_start": 146478,
        "char_end": 146495,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.13",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i1",
        "text": "My sea-gown scarf'd about me, in the dark",
        "char_start": 146496,
        "char_end": 146537,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.14",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i2",
        "text": "Groped I to find out them; had my desire.",
        "char_start": 146538,
        "char_end": 146579,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.15",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i3",
        "text": "Finger'd their packet, and in fine withdrew",
        "char_start": 146580,
        "char_end": 146623,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.16",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i4",
        "text": "To mine own room again; making so bold,",
        "char_start": 146624,
        "char_end": 146663,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.17",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i5",
        "text": "My fears forgetting manners, to unseal",
        "char_start": 146664,
        "char_end": 146702,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.18",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i6",
        "text": "Their grand commission; where I found, Horatio,--",
        "char_start": 146703,
        "char_end": 146752,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.19",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i7",
        "text": "O royal knavery!--an exact command,",
        "char_start": 146753,
        "char_end": 146788,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.20",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i8",
        "text": "Larded with many several sorts of reasons",
        "char_start": 146789,
        "char_end": 146830,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.21",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i9",
        "text": "Importing Denmark's health and England's too,",
        "char_start": 146831,
        "char_end": 146876,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.22",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i10",
        "text": "With, ho! such bugs and goblins in my life,",
        "char_start": 146877,
        "char_end": 146920,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.23",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i11",
        "text": "That, on the supervise, no leisure bated,",
        "char_start": 146921,
        "char_end": 146962,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.24",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i12",
        "text": "No, not to stay the grinding of the axe,",
        "char_start": 146963,
        "char_end": 147003,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.25",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp5i13",
        "text": "My head should be struck off.",
        "char_start": 147004,
        "char_end": 147033,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.26",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp6i0",
        "text": "Is't possible?",
        "char_start": 147034,
        "char_end": 147048,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.27",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp7i0",
        "text": "Here's the commission: read it at more leisure.",
        "char_start": 147049,
        "char_end": 147096,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.28",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp7i1",
        "text": "But wilt thou hear me how I did proceed?",
        "char_start": 147097,
        "char_end": 147137,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.29",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp8i0",
        "text": "I beseech you.",
        "char_start": 147138,
        "char_end": 147152,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.30",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp9i0",
        "text": "Being thus be-netted round with villanies,--",
        "char_start": 147153,
        "char_end": 147197,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.31",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp9i1",
        "text": "Ere I could make a prologue to my brains,",
        "char_start": 147198,
        "char_end": 147239,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.32",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp9i2",
        "text": "They had begun the play--I sat me down,",
        "char_start": 147240,
        "char_end": 147279,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.33",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp9i3",
        "text": "Devised a new commission, wrote it fair:",
        "char_start": 147280,
        "char_end": 147320,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.34",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp9i4",
        "text": "I once did hold it, as our statists do,",
        "char_start": 147321,
        "char_end": 147360,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.35",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp9i5",
        "text": "A baseness to write fair and labour'd much",
        "char_start": 147361,
        "char_end": 147403,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.36",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp9i6",
        "text": "How to forget that learning, but, sir, now",
        "char_start": 147404,
        "char_end": 147446,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.37",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp9i7",
        "text": "It did me yeoman's service: wilt thou know",
        "char_start": 147447,
        "char_end": 147489,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.38",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp9i8",
        "text": "The effect of what I wrote?",
        "char_start": 147490,
        "char_end": 147517,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.39",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp10i0",
        "text": "Ay, good my lord.",
        "char_start": 147518,
        "char_end": 147535,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.40",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i0",
        "text": "An earnest conjuration from the king,",
        "char_start": 147536,
        "char_end": 147573,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.41",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i1",
        "text": "As England was his faithful tributary,",
        "char_start": 147574,
        "char_end": 147612,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.42",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i2",
        "text": "As love between them like the palm might flourish,",
        "char_start": 147613,
        "char_end": 147663,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.43",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i3",
        "text": "As peace should stiff her wheaten garland wear",
        "char_start": 147664,
        "char_end": 147710,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.44",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i4",
        "text": "And stand a comma 'tween their amities,",
        "char_start": 147711,
        "char_end": 147750,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.45",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i5",
        "text": "And many such-like 'As'es of great charge,",
        "char_start": 147751,
        "char_end": 147793,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.46",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i6",
        "text": "That, on the view and knowing of these contents,",
        "char_start": 147794,
        "char_end": 147842,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.47",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i7",
        "text": "Without debatement further, more or less,",
        "char_start": 147843,
        "char_end": 147884,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.48",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i8",
        "text": "He should the bearers put to sudden death,",
        "char_start": 147885,
        "char_end": 147927,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.49",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp11i9",
        "text": "Not shriving-time allow'd.",
        "char_start": 147928,
        "char_end": 147954,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.50",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp12i0",
        "text": "How was this seal'd?",
        "char_start": 147955,
        "char_end": 147975,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.51",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp13i0",
        "text": "Why, even in that was heaven ordinant.",
        "char_start": 147976,
        "char_end": 148014,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.52",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp13i1",
        "text": "I had my father's signet in my purse,",
        "char_start": 148015,
        "char_end": 148052,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.53",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp13i2",
        "text": "Which was the model of that Danish seal;",
        "char_start": 148053,
        "char_end": 148093,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.54",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp13i3",
        "text": "Folded the writ up in form of the other,",
        "char_start": 148094,
        "char_end": 148134,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.55",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp13i4",
        "text": "Subscribed it, gave't the impression, placed it safely,",
        "char_start": 148135,
        "char_end": 148190,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.56",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp13i5",
        "text": "The changeling never known. Now, the next day",
        "char_start": 148191,
        "char_end": 148236,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.57",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp13i6",
        "text": "Was our sea-fight; and what to this was sequent",
        "char_start": 148237,
        "char_end": 148284,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.58",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp13i7",
        "text": "Thou know'st already.",
        "char_start": 148285,
        "char_end": 148306,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.59",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp14i0",
        "text": "So Guildenstern and Rosencrantz go to't.",
        "char_start": 148307,
        "char_end": 148347,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.60",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp15i0",
        "text": "Why, man, they did make love to this employment;",
        "char_start": 148348,
        "char_end": 148396,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.61",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp15i1",
        "text": "They are not near my conscience; their defeat",
        "char_start": 148397,
        "char_end": 148442,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.62",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp15i2",
        "text": "Does by their own insinuation grow:",
        "char_start": 148443,
        "char_end": 148478,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.63",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp15i3",
        "text": "'Tis dangerous when the baser nature comes",
        "char_start": 148479,
        "char_end": 148521,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.64",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp15i4",
        "text": "Between the pass and fell incensed points",
        "char_start": 148522,
        "char_end": 148563,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.65",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp15i5",
        "text": "Of mighty opposites.",
        "char_start": 148564,
        "char_end": 148584,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.66",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp16i0",
        "text": "Why, what a king is this!",
        "char_start": 148585,
        "char_end": 148610,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.67",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp17i0",
        "text": "Does it not, think'st thee, stand me now upon--",
        "char_start": 148611,
        "char_end": 148658,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.68",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp17i1",
        "text": "He that hath kill'd my king and whored my mother,",
        "char_start": 148659,
        "char_end": 148708,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.69",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp17i2",
        "text": "Popp'd in between the election and my hopes,",
        "char_start": 148709,
        "char_end": 148753,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.70",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp17i3",
        "text": "Thrown out his angle for my proper life,",
        "char_start": 148754,
        "char_end": 148794,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.71",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp17i4",
        "text": "And with such cozenage--is't not perfect conscience,",
        "char_start": 148795,
        "char_end": 148847,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.72",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp17i5",
        "text": "To quit him with this arm? and is't not to be damn'd,",
        "char_start": 148848,
        "char_end": 148901,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.73",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp17i6",
        "text": "To let this canker of our nature come",
        "char_start": 148902,
        "char_end": 148939,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.74",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp17i7",
        "text": "In further evil?",
        "char_start": 148940,
        "char_end": 148956,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.75",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp18i0",
        "text": "It must be shortly known to him from England",
        "char_start": 148957,
        "char_end": 149001,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.76",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp18i1",
        "text": "What is the issue of the business there.",
        "char_start": 149002,
        "char_end": 149042,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.77",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp19i0",
        "text": "It will be short: the interim is mine;",
        "char_start": 149043,
        "char_end": 149081,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.78",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp19i1",
        "text": "And a man's life's no more than to say 'One.'",
        "char_start": 149082,
        "char_end": 149127,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.79",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp19i2",
        "text": "But I am very sorry, good Horatio,",
        "char_start": 149128,
        "char_end": 149162,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.80",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp19i3",
        "text": "That to Laertes I forgot myself;",
        "char_start": 149163,
        "char_end": 149195,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.81",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp19i4",
        "text": "For, by the image of my cause, I see",
        "char_start": 149196,
        "char_end": 149232,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.82",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp19i5",
        "text": "The portraiture of his: I'll court his favours.",
        "char_start": 149233,
        "char_end": 149280,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.83",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp19i6",
        "text": "But, sure, the bravery of his grief did put me",
        "char_start": 149281,
        "char_end": 149327,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.84",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp19i7",
        "text": "Into a towering passion.",
        "char_start": 149328,
        "char_end": 149352,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.85",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp20i0",
        "text": "Peace! who comes here?",
        "char_start": 149353,
        "char_end": 149375,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.86",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp20i1",
        "text": "Enter OSRIC",
        "char_start": 149376,
        "char_end": 149387,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp21i0",
        "text": "Your lordship is right welcome back to Denmark.",
        "char_start": 149388,
        "char_end": 149435,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.87",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp22i0",
        "text": "I humbly thank you, sir. Dost know this water-fly?",
        "char_start": 149436,
        "char_end": 149486,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.88",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp23i0",
        "text": "No, my good lord.",
        "char_start": 149487,
        "char_end": 149504,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.89",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp24i0",
        "text": "Thy state is the more gracious; for 'tis a vice to",
        "char_start": 149505,
        "char_end": 149555,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.90",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp24i1",
        "text": "know him. He hath much land, and fertile: let a",
        "char_start": 149556,
        "char_end": 149603,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.91",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp24i2",
        "text": "beast be lord of beasts, and his crib shall stand at",
        "char_start": 149604,
        "char_end": 149656,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.92",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp24i3",
        "text": "the king's mess: 'tis a chough; but, as I say,",
        "char_start": 149657,
        "char_end": 149703,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.93",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp24i4",
        "text": "spacious in the possession of dirt.",
        "char_start": 149704,
        "char_end": 149739,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.94",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp25i0",
        "text": "Sweet lord, if your lordship were at leisure, I",
        "char_start": 149740,
        "char_end": 149787,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.95",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp25i1",
        "text": "should impart a thing to you from his majesty.",
        "char_start": 149788,
        "char_end": 149834,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.96",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp26i0",
        "text": "I will receive it, sir, with all diligence of",
        "char_start": 149835,
        "char_end": 149880,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.97",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp26i1",
        "text": "spirit. Put your bonnet to his right use; 'tis for the head.",
        "char_start": 149881,
        "char_end": 149941,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.98",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp27i0",
        "text": "I thank your lordship, it is very hot.",
        "char_start": 149942,
        "char_end": 149980,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.99",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp28i0",
        "text": "No, believe me, 'tis very cold; the wind is",
        "char_start": 149981,
        "char_end": 150024,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.100",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp28i1",
        "text": "northerly.",
        "char_start": 150025,
        "char_end": 150035,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.101",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp29i0",
        "text": "It is indifferent cold, my lord, indeed.",
        "char_start": 150036,
        "char_end": 150076,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.102",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp30i0",
        "text": "But yet methinks it is very sultry and hot for my",
        "char_start": 150077,
        "char_end": 150126,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.103",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp30i1",
        "text": "complexion.",
        "char_start": 150127,
        "char_end": 150138,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.104",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp31i0",
        "text": "Exceedingly, my lord; it is very sultry,--as",
        "char_start": 150139,
        "char_end": 150183,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.105",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp31i1",
        "text": "'twere,--I cannot tell how. But, my lord, his",
        "char_start": 150184,
        "char_end": 150229,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.106",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp31i2",
        "text": "majesty bade me signify to you that he has laid a",
        "char_start": 150230,
        "char_end": 150279,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.107",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp31i3",
        "text": "great wager on your head: sir, this is the matter,--",
        "char_start": 150280,
        "char_end": 150332,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.108",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp32i0",
        "text": "I beseech you, remember--",
        "char_start": 150333,
        "char_end": 150358,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.109",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp32i1",
        "text": "HAMLET moves him to put on his hat",
        "char_start": 150359,
        "char_end": 150393,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp33i0",
        "text": "Nay, good my lord; for mine ease, in good faith.",
        "char_start": 150394,
        "char_end": 150442,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.110",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp33i1",
        "text": "Sir, here is newly come to court Laertes; believe",
        "char_start": 150443,
        "char_end": 150492,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.111",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp33i2",
        "text": "me, an absolute gentleman, full of most excellent",
        "char_start": 150493,
        "char_end": 150542,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.112",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp33i3",
        "text": "differences, of very soft society and great showing:",
        "char_start": 150543,
        "char_end": 150595,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.113",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp33i4",
        "text": "indeed, to speak feelingly of him, he is the card or",
        "char_start": 150596,
        "char_end": 150648,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.114",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp33i5",
        "text": "calendar of gentry, for you shall find in him the",
        "char_start": 150649,
        "char_end": 150698,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.115",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp33i6",
        "text": "continent of what part a gentleman would see.",
        "char_start": 150699,
        "char_end": 150744,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.116",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp34i0",
        "text": "Sir, his definement suffers no perdition in you;",
        "char_start": 150745,
        "char_end": 150793,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.117",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp34i1",
        "text": "though, I know, to divide him inventorially would",
        "char_start": 150794,
        "char_end": 150843,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.118",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp34i2",
        "text": "dizzy the arithmetic of memory, and yet but yaw",
        "char_start": 150844,
        "char_end": 150891,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.119",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp34i3",
        "text": "neither, in respect of his quick sail. But, in the",
        "char_start": 150892,
        "char_end": 150942,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.120",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp34i4",
        "text": "verity of extolment, I take him to be a soul of",
        "char_start": 150943,
        "char_end": 150990,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.121",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp34i5",
        "text": "great article; and his infusion of such dearth and",
        "char_start": 150991,
        "char_end": 151041,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.122",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp34i6",
        "text": "rareness, as, to make true diction of him, his",
        "char_start": 151042,
        "char_end": 151088,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.123",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp34i7",
        "text": "semblable is his mirror; and who else would trace",
        "char_start": 151089,
        "char_end": 151138,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.124",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp34i8",
        "text": "him, his umbrage, nothing more.",
        "char_start": 151139,
        "char_end": 151170,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.125",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp35i0",
        "text": "Your lordship speaks most infallibly of him.",
        "char_start": 151171,
        "char_end": 151215,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.126",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp36i0",
        "text": "The concernancy, sir? why do we wrap the gentleman",
        "char_start": 151216,
        "char_end": 151266,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.127",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp36i1",
        "text": "in our more rawer breath?",
        "char_start": 151267,
        "char_end": 151292,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.128",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp37i0",
        "text": "Sir?",
        "char_start": 151293,
        "char_end": 151297,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.129",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp38i0",
        "text": "Is't not possible to understand in another tongue?",
        "char_start": 151298,
        "char_end": 151348,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.130",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp38i1",
        "text": "You will do't, sir, really.",
        "char_start": 151349,
        "char_end": 151376,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.131",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp39i0",
        "text": "What imports the nomination of this gentleman?",
        "char_start": 151377,
        "char_end": 151423,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.132",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp40i0",
        "text": "Of Laertes?",
        "char_start": 151424,
        "char_end": 151435,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.133",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp41i0",
        "text": "His purse is empty already; all's golden words are spent.",
        "char_start": 151436,
        "char_end": 151493,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.134",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp42i0",
        "text": "Of him, sir.",
        "char_start": 151494,
        "char_end": 151506,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.135",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp43i0",
        "text": "I know you are not ignorant--",
        "char_start": 151507,
        "char_end": 151536,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.136",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp44i0",
        "text": "I would you did, sir; yet, in faith, if you did,",
        "char_start": 151537,
        "char_end": 151585,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.137",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp44i1",
        "text": "it would not much approve me. Well, sir?",
        "char_start": 151586,
        "char_end": 151626,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.138",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp45i0",
        "text": "You are not ignorant of what excellence Laertes is--",
        "char_start": 151627,
        "char_end": 151679,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.139",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp46i0",
        "text": "I dare not confess that, lest I should compare with",
        "char_start": 151680,
        "char_end": 151731,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.140",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp46i1",
        "text": "him in excellence; but, to know a man well, were to",
        "char_start": 151732,
        "char_end": 151783,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.141",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp46i2",
        "text": "know himself.",
        "char_start": 151784,
        "char_end": 151797,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.142",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp47i0",
        "text": "I mean, sir, for his weapon; but in the imputation",
        "char_start": 151798,
        "char_end": 151848,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.143",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp47i1",
        "text": "laid on him by them, in his meed he's unfellowed.",
        "char_start": 151849,
        "char_end": 151898,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.144",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp48i0",
        "text": "What's his weapon?",
        "char_start": 151899,
        "char_end": 151917,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.145",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp49i0",
        "text": "Rapier and dagger.",
        "char_start": 151918,
        "char_end": 151936,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.146",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp50i0",
        "text": "That's two of his weapons: but, well.",
        "char_start": 151937,
        "char_end": 151974,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.147",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp51i0",
        "text": "The king, sir, hath wagered with him six Barbary",
        "char_start": 151975,
        "char_end": 152023,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.148",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp51i1",
        "text": "horses: against the which he has imponed, as I take",
        "char_start": 152024,
        "char_end": 152075,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.149",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp51i2",
        "text": "it, six French rapiers and poniards, with their",
        "char_start": 152076,
        "char_end": 152123,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.150",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp51i3",
        "text": "assigns, as girdle, hangers, and so: three of the",
        "char_start": 152124,
        "char_end": 152173,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.151",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp51i4",
        "text": "carriages, in faith, are very dear to fancy, very",
        "char_start": 152174,
        "char_end": 152223,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.152",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp51i5",
        "text": "responsive to the hilts, most delicate carriages,",
        "char_start": 152224,
        "char_end": 152273,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.153",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp51i6",
        "text": "and of very liberal conceit.",
        "char_start": 152274,
        "char_end": 152302,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.154",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp52i0",
        "text": "What call you the carriages?",
        "char_start": 152303,
        "char_end": 152331,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.155",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp53i0",
        "text": "I knew you must be edified by the margent ere you had done.",
        "char_start": 152332,
        "char_end": 152391,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.156",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp54i0",
        "text": "The carriages, sir, are the hangers.",
        "char_start": 152392,
        "char_end": 152428,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.157",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp55i0",
        "text": "The phrase would be more german to the matter, if we",
        "char_start": 152429,
        "char_end": 152481,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.158",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp55i1",
        "text": "could carry cannon by our sides: I would it might",
        "char_start": 152482,
        "char_end": 152531,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.159",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp55i2",
        "text": "be hangers till then. But, on: six Barbary horses",
        "char_start": 152532,
        "char_end": 152581,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.160",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp55i3",
        "text": "against six French swords, their assigns, and three",
        "char_start": 152582,
        "char_end": 152633,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.161",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp55i4",
        "text": "liberal-conceited carriages; that's the French bet",
        "char_start": 152634,
        "char_end": 152684,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.162",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp55i5",
        "text": "against the Danish. Why is this 'imponed,' as you call it?",
        "char_start": 152685,
        "char_end": 152743,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.163",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp56i0",
        "text": "The king, sir, hath laid, that in a dozen passes",
        "char_start": 152744,
        "char_end": 152792,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.164",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp56i1",
        "text": "between yourself and him, he shall not exceed you",
        "char_start": 152793,
        "char_end": 152842,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.165",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp56i2",
        "text": "three hits: he hath laid on twelve for nine; and it",
        "char_start": 152843,
        "char_end": 152894,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.166",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp56i3",
        "text": "would come to immediate trial, if your lordship",
        "char_start": 152895,
        "char_end": 152942,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.167",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp56i4",
        "text": "would vouchsafe the answer.",
        "char_start": 152943,
        "char_end": 152970,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.168",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp57i0",
        "text": "How if I answer 'no'?",
        "char_start": 152971,
        "char_end": 152992,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.169",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp58i0",
        "text": "I mean, my lord, the opposition of your person in trial.",
        "char_start": 152993,
        "char_end": 153049,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.170",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp59i0",
        "text": "Sir, I will walk here in the hall: if it please his",
        "char_start": 153050,
        "char_end": 153101,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.171",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp59i1",
        "text": "majesty, 'tis the breathing time of day with me; let",
        "char_start": 153102,
        "char_end": 153154,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.172",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp59i2",
        "text": "the foils be brought, the gentleman willing, and the",
        "char_start": 153155,
        "char_end": 153207,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.173",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp59i3",
        "text": "king hold his purpose, I will win for him an I can;",
        "char_start": 153208,
        "char_end": 153259,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.174",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp59i4",
        "text": "if not, I will gain nothing but my shame and the odd hits.",
        "char_start": 153260,
        "char_end": 153318,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.175",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp60i0",
        "text": "Shall I re-deliver you e'en so?",
        "char_start": 153319,
        "char_end": 153350,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.176",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp61i0",
        "text": "To this effect, sir; after what flourish your nature will.",
        "char_start": 153351,
        "char_end": 153409,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.177",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp62i0",
        "text": "I commend my duty to your lordship.",
        "char_start": 153410,
        "char_end": 153445,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.178",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp63i0",
        "text": "Yours, yours.",
        "char_start": 153446,
        "char_end": 153459,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.179",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp63i1",
        "text": "Exit OSRIC",
        "char_start": 153460,
        "char_end": 153470,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp63i2",
        "text": "He does well to commend it himself; there are no",
        "char_start": 153471,
        "char_end": 153519,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.180",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp63i3",
        "text": "tongues else for's turn.",
        "char_start": 153520,
        "char_end": 153544,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.181",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp64i0",
        "text": "This lapwing runs away with the shell on his head.",
        "char_start": 153545,
        "char_end": 153595,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.182",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp65i0",
        "text": "He did comply with his dug, before he sucked it.",
        "char_start": 153596,
        "char_end": 153644,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.183",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp65i1",
        "text": "Thus has he--and many more of the same bevy that I",
        "char_start": 153645,
        "char_end": 153695,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.184",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp65i2",
        "text": "know the dressy age dotes on--only got the tune of",
        "char_start": 153696,
        "char_end": 153746,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.185",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp65i3",
        "text": "the time and outward habit of encounter; a kind of",
        "char_start": 153747,
        "char_end": 153797,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.186",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp65i4",
        "text": "yesty collection, which carries them through and",
        "char_start": 153798,
        "char_end": 153846,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.187",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp65i5",
        "text": "through the most fond and winnowed opinions; and do",
        "char_start": 153847,
        "char_end": 153898,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.188",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp65i6",
        "text": "but blow them to their trial, the bubbles are out.",
        "char_start": 153899,
        "char_end": 153949,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.189",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp65i7",
        "text": "Enter a Lord",
        "char_start": 153950,
        "char_end": 153962,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp66i0",
        "text": "My lord, his majesty commended him to you by young",
        "char_start": 153963,
        "char_end": 154013,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.190",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Lord"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp66i1",
        "text": "Osric, who brings back to him that you attend him in",
        "char_start": 154014,
        "char_end": 154066,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.191",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Lord"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp66i2",
        "text": "the hall: he sends to know if your pleasure hold to",
        "char_start": 154067,
        "char_end": 154118,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.192",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Lord"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp66i3",
        "text": "play with Laertes, or that you will take longer time.",
        "char_start": 154119,
        "char_end": 154172,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.193",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Lord"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp67i0",
        "text": "I am constant to my purpose; they follow the king's",
        "char_start": 154173,
        "char_end": 154224,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.194",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp67i1",
        "text": "pleasure: if his fitness speaks, mine is ready; now",
        "char_start": 154225,
        "char_end": 154276,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.195",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp67i2",
        "text": "or whensoever, provided I be so able as now.",
        "char_start": 154277,
        "char_end": 154321,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.196",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp68i0",
        "text": "The king and queen and all are coming down.",
        "char_start": 154322,
        "char_end": 154365,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.197",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Lord"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp69i0",
        "text": "In happy time.",
        "char_start": 154366,
        "char_end": 154380,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.198",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp70i0",
        "text": "The queen desires you to use some gentle",
        "char_start": 154381,
        "char_end": 154421,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.199",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Lord"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp70i1",
        "text": "entertainment to Laertes before you fall to play.",
        "char_start": 154422,
        "char_end": 154471,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.200",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "Lord"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp71i0",
        "text": "She well instructs me.",
        "char_start": 154472,
        "char_end": 154494,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.201",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp71i1",
        "text": "Exit Lord",
        "char_start": 154495,
        "char_end": 154504,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp72i0",
        "text": "You will lose this wager, my lord.",
        "char_start": 154505,
        "char_end": 154539,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.202",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp73i0",
        "text": "I do not think so: since he went into France, I",
        "char_start": 154540,
        "char_end": 154587,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.203",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp73i1",
        "text": "have been in continual practise: I shall win at the",
        "char_start": 154588,
        "char_end": 154639,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.204",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp73i2",
        "text": "odds. But thou wouldst not think how ill all's here",
        "char_start": 154640,
        "char_end": 154691,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.205",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp73i3",
        "text": "about my heart: but it is no matter.",
        "char_start": 154692,
        "char_end": 154728,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.206",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp74i0",
        "text": "Nay, good my lord,--",
        "char_start": 154729,
        "char_end": 154749,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.207",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp75i0",
        "text": "It is but foolery; but it is such a kind of",
        "char_start": 154750,
        "char_end": 154793,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.208",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp75i1",
        "text": "gain-giving, as would perhaps trouble a woman.",
        "char_start": 154794,
        "char_end": 154840,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.209",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp76i0",
        "text": "If your mind dislike any thing, obey it: I will",
        "char_start": 154841,
        "char_end": 154888,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.210",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp76i1",
        "text": "forestall their repair hither, and say you are not",
        "char_start": 154889,
        "char_end": 154939,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.211",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp76i2",
        "text": "fit.",
        "char_start": 154940,
        "char_end": 154944,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.212",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp77i0",
        "text": "Not a whit, we defy augury: there's a special",
        "char_start": 154945,
        "char_end": 154990,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.213",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp77i1",
        "text": "providence in the fall of a sparrow. If it be now,",
        "char_start": 154991,
        "char_end": 155041,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.214",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp77i2",
        "text": "'tis not to come; if it be not to come, it will be",
        "char_start": 155042,
        "char_end": 155092,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.215",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp77i3",
        "text": "now; if it be not now, yet it will come: the",
        "char_start": 155093,
        "char_end": 155137,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.216",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp77i4",
        "text": "readiness is all: since no man has aught of what he",
        "char_start": 155138,
        "char_end": 155189,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.217",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp77i5",
        "text": "leaves, what is't to leave betimes?",
        "char_start": 155190,
        "char_end": 155225,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.218",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp77i6",
        "text": "Enter KING CLAUDIUS, QUEEN GERTRUDE, LAERTES, Lords, OSRIC, and Attendants with foils, & c",
        "char_start": 155226,
        "char_end": 155316,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp78i0",
        "text": "Come, Hamlet, come, and take this hand from me.",
        "char_start": 155317,
        "char_end": 155364,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.219",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp78i1",
        "text": "KING CLAUDIUS puts LAERTES' hand into HAMLET's",
        "char_start": 155365,
        "char_end": 155411,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i0",
        "text": "Give me your pardon, sir: I've done you wrong;",
        "char_start": 155412,
        "char_end": 155458,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.220",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i1",
        "text": "But pardon't, as you are a gentleman.",
        "char_start": 155459,
        "char_end": 155496,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.221",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i2",
        "text": "This presence knows,",
        "char_start": 155497,
        "char_end": 155517,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.222",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i3",
        "text": "And you must needs have heard, how I am punish'd",
        "char_start": 155518,
        "char_end": 155566,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.223",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i4",
        "text": "With sore distraction. What I have done,",
        "char_start": 155567,
        "char_end": 155607,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.224",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i5",
        "text": "That might your nature, honour and exception",
        "char_start": 155608,
        "char_end": 155652,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.225",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i6",
        "text": "Roughly awake, I here proclaim was madness.",
        "char_start": 155653,
        "char_end": 155696,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.226",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i7",
        "text": "Was't Hamlet wrong'd Laertes? Never Hamlet:",
        "char_start": 155697,
        "char_end": 155740,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.227",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i8",
        "text": "If Hamlet from himself be ta'en away,",
        "char_start": 155741,
        "char_end": 155778,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.228",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i9",
        "text": "And when he's not himself does wrong Laertes,",
        "char_start": 155779,
        "char_end": 155824,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.229",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i10",
        "text": "Then Hamlet does it not, Hamlet denies it.",
        "char_start": 155825,
        "char_end": 155867,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.230",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i11",
        "text": "Who does it, then? His madness: if't be so,",
        "char_start": 155868,
        "char_end": 155911,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.231",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i12",
        "text": "Hamlet is of the faction that is wrong'd;",
        "char_start": 155912,
        "char_end": 155953,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.232",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i13",
        "text": "His madness is poor Hamlet's enemy.",
        "char_start": 155954,
        "char_end": 155989,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.233",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i14",
        "text": "Sir, in this audience,",
        "char_start": 155990,
        "char_end": 156012,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.234",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i15",
        "text": "Let my disclaiming from a purposed evil",
        "char_start": 156013,
        "char_end": 156052,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.235",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i16",
        "text": "Free me so far in your most generous thoughts,",
        "char_start": 156053,
        "char_end": 156099,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.236",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i17",
        "text": "That I have shot mine arrow o'er the house,",
        "char_start": 156100,
        "char_end": 156143,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.237",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp79i18",
        "text": "And hurt my brother.",
        "char_start": 156144,
        "char_end": 156164,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.238",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp80i0",
        "text": "I am satisfied in nature,",
        "char_start": 156165,
        "char_end": 156190,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.239",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp80i1",
        "text": "Whose motive, in this case, should stir me most",
        "char_start": 156191,
        "char_end": 156238,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.240",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp80i2",
        "text": "To my revenge: but in my terms of honour",
        "char_start": 156239,
        "char_end": 156279,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.241",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp80i3",
        "text": "I stand aloof; and will no reconcilement,",
        "char_start": 156280,
        "char_end": 156321,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.242",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp80i4",
        "text": "Till by some elder masters, of known honour,",
        "char_start": 156322,
        "char_end": 156366,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.243",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp80i5",
        "text": "I have a voice and precedent of peace,",
        "char_start": 156367,
        "char_end": 156405,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.244",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp80i6",
        "text": "To keep my name ungored. But till that time,",
        "char_start": 156406,
        "char_end": 156450,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.245",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp80i7",
        "text": "I do receive your offer'd love like love,",
        "char_start": 156451,
        "char_end": 156492,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.246",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp80i8",
        "text": "And will not wrong it.",
        "char_start": 156493,
        "char_end": 156515,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.247",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp81i0",
        "text": "I embrace it freely;",
        "char_start": 156516,
        "char_end": 156536,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.248",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp81i1",
        "text": "And will this brother's wager frankly play.",
        "char_start": 156537,
        "char_end": 156580,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.249",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp81i2",
        "text": "Give us the foils. Come on.",
        "char_start": 156581,
        "char_end": 156608,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.250",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp82i0",
        "text": "Come, one for me.",
        "char_start": 156609,
        "char_end": 156626,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.251",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp83i0",
        "text": "I'll be your foil, Laertes: in mine ignorance",
        "char_start": 156627,
        "char_end": 156672,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.252",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp83i1",
        "text": "Your skill shall, like a star i' the darkest night,",
        "char_start": 156673,
        "char_end": 156724,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.253",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp83i2",
        "text": "Stick fiery off indeed.",
        "char_start": 156725,
        "char_end": 156748,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.254",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp84i0",
        "text": "You mock me, sir.",
        "char_start": 156749,
        "char_end": 156766,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.255",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp85i0",
        "text": "No, by this hand.",
        "char_start": 156767,
        "char_end": 156784,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.256",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp86i0",
        "text": "Give them the foils, young Osric. Cousin Hamlet,",
        "char_start": 156785,
        "char_end": 156833,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.257",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp86i1",
        "text": "You know the wager?",
        "char_start": 156834,
        "char_end": 156853,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.258",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp87i0",
        "text": "Very well, my lord",
        "char_start": 156854,
        "char_end": 156872,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.259",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp87i1",
        "text": "Your grace hath laid the odds o' the weaker side.",
        "char_start": 156873,
        "char_end": 156922,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.260",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp88i0",
        "text": "I do not fear it; I have seen you both:",
        "char_start": 156923,
        "char_end": 156962,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.261",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp88i1",
        "text": "But since he is better'd, we have therefore odds.",
        "char_start": 156963,
        "char_end": 157012,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.262",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp89i0",
        "text": "This is too heavy, let me see another.",
        "char_start": 157013,
        "char_end": 157051,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.263",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp90i0",
        "text": "This likes me well. These foils have all a length?",
        "char_start": 157052,
        "char_end": 157102,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.264",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp90i1",
        "text": "They prepare to play",
        "char_start": 157103,
        "char_end": 157123,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp91i0",
        "text": "Ay, my good lord.",
        "char_start": 157124,
        "char_end": 157141,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.265",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i0",
        "text": "Set me the stoops of wine upon that table.",
        "char_start": 157142,
        "char_end": 157184,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.266",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i1",
        "text": "If Hamlet give the first or second hit,",
        "char_start": 157185,
        "char_end": 157224,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.267",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i2",
        "text": "Or quit in answer of the third exchange,",
        "char_start": 157225,
        "char_end": 157265,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.268",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i3",
        "text": "Let all the battlements their ordnance fire:",
        "char_start": 157266,
        "char_end": 157310,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.269",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i4",
        "text": "The king shall drink to Hamlet's better breath;",
        "char_start": 157311,
        "char_end": 157358,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.270",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i5",
        "text": "And in the cup an union shall he throw,",
        "char_start": 157359,
        "char_end": 157398,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.271",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i6",
        "text": "Richer than that which four successive kings",
        "char_start": 157399,
        "char_end": 157443,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.272",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i7",
        "text": "In Denmark's crown have worn. Give me the cups;",
        "char_start": 157444,
        "char_end": 157491,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.273",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i8",
        "text": "And let the kettle to the trumpet speak,",
        "char_start": 157492,
        "char_end": 157532,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.274",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i9",
        "text": "The trumpet to the cannoneer without,",
        "char_start": 157533,
        "char_end": 157570,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.275",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i10",
        "text": "The cannons to the heavens, the heavens to earth,",
        "char_start": 157571,
        "char_end": 157620,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.276",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i11",
        "text": "'Now the king dunks to Hamlet.' Come, begin:",
        "char_start": 157621,
        "char_end": 157665,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.277",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp92i12",
        "text": "And you, the judges, bear a wary eye.",
        "char_start": 157666,
        "char_end": 157703,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.278",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp93i0",
        "text": "Come on, sir.",
        "char_start": 157704,
        "char_end": 157717,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.279",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp94i0",
        "text": "Come, my lord.",
        "char_start": 157718,
        "char_end": 157732,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.280",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp94i1",
        "text": "They play",
        "char_start": 157733,
        "char_end": 157742,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp95i0",
        "text": "One.",
        "char_start": 157743,
        "char_end": 157747,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.281",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp96i0",
        "text": "No.",
        "char_start": 157748,
        "char_end": 157751,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.282",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp97i0",
        "text": "Judgment.",
        "char_start": 157752,
        "char_end": 157761,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.283",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp98i0",
        "text": "A hit, a very palpable hit.",
        "char_start": 157762,
        "char_end": 157789,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.284",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp99i0",
        "text": "Well; again.",
        "char_start": 157790,
        "char_end": 157802,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.285",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp100i0",
        "text": "Stay; give me drink. Hamlet, this pearl is thine;",
        "char_start": 157803,
        "char_end": 157852,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.286",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp100i1",
        "text": "Here's to thy health.",
        "char_start": 157853,
        "char_end": 157874,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.287",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp100i2",
        "text": "Trumpets sound, and cannon shot off within",
        "char_start": 157875,
        "char_end": 157917,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp100i3",
        "text": "Give him the cup.",
        "char_start": 157918,
        "char_end": 157935,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.288",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp101i0",
        "text": "I'll play this bout first; set it by awhile. Come.",
        "char_start": 157936,
        "char_end": 157986,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.289",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp101i1",
        "text": "They play",
        "char_start": 157987,
        "char_end": 157996,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp101i2",
        "text": "Another hit; what say you?",
        "char_start": 157997,
        "char_end": 158023,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.290",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp102i0",
        "text": "A touch, a touch, I do confess.",
        "char_start": 158024,
        "char_end": 158055,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.291",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp103i0",
        "text": "Our son shall win.",
        "char_start": 158056,
        "char_end": 158074,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.292",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp104i0",
        "text": "He's fat, and scant of breath.",
        "char_start": 158075,
        "char_end": 158105,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.293",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp104i1",
        "text": "Here, Hamlet, take my napkin, rub thy brows;",
        "char_start": 158106,
        "char_end": 158150,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.294",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp104i2",
        "text": "The queen carouses to thy fortune, Hamlet.",
        "char_start": 158151,
        "char_end": 158193,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.295",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp105i0",
        "text": "Good madam!",
        "char_start": 158194,
        "char_end": 158205,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.296",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp106i0",
        "text": "Gertrude, do not drink.",
        "char_start": 158206,
        "char_end": 158229,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.297",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp107i0",
        "text": "I will, my lord; I pray you, pardon me.",
        "char_start": 158230,
        "char_end": 158269,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.298",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp108i0",
        "text": "[Aside] It is the poison'd cup: it is too late.",
        "char_start": 158270,
        "char_end": 158317,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.299",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp109i0",
        "text": "I dare not drink yet, madam; by and by.",
        "char_start": 158318,
        "char_end": 158357,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.300",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp110i0",
        "text": "Come, let me wipe thy face.",
        "char_start": 158358,
        "char_end": 158385,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.301",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp111i0",
        "text": "My lord, I'll hit him now.",
        "char_start": 158386,
        "char_end": 158412,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.302",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp112i0",
        "text": "I do not think't.",
        "char_start": 158413,
        "char_end": 158430,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.303",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp113i0",
        "text": "[Aside] And yet 'tis almost 'gainst my conscience.",
        "char_start": 158431,
        "char_end": 158481,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.304",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp114i0",
        "text": "Come, for the third, Laertes: you but dally;",
        "char_start": 158482,
        "char_end": 158526,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.305",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp114i1",
        "text": "I pray you, pass with your best violence;",
        "char_start": 158527,
        "char_end": 158568,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.306",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp114i2",
        "text": "I am afeard you make a wanton of me.",
        "char_start": 158569,
        "char_end": 158605,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.307",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp115i0",
        "text": "Say you so? come on.",
        "char_start": 158606,
        "char_end": 158626,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.308",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp115i1",
        "text": "They play",
        "char_start": 158627,
        "char_end": 158636,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp116i0",
        "text": "Nothing, neither way.",
        "char_start": 158637,
        "char_end": 158658,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.309",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp117i0",
        "text": "Have at you now!",
        "char_start": 158659,
        "char_end": 158675,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.310",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp117i1",
        "text": "LAERTES wounds HAMLET; then in scuffling, they change rapiers, and HAMLET wounds LAERTES",
        "char_start": 158676,
        "char_end": 158764,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp118i0",
        "text": "Part them; they are incensed.",
        "char_start": 158765,
        "char_end": 158794,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.311",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp119i0",
        "text": "Nay, come, again.",
        "char_start": 158795,
        "char_end": 158812,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.312",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp119i1",
        "text": "QUEEN GERTRUDE falls",
        "char_start": 158813,
        "char_end": 158833,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp120i0",
        "text": "Look to the queen there, ho!",
        "char_start": 158834,
        "char_end": 158862,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.313",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp121i0",
        "text": "They bleed on both sides. How is it, my lord?",
        "char_start": 158863,
        "char_end": 158908,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.314",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp122i0",
        "text": "How is't, Laertes?",
        "char_start": 158909,
        "char_end": 158927,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.315",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp123i0",
        "text": "Why, as a woodcock to mine own springe, Osric;",
        "char_start": 158928,
        "char_end": 158974,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.316",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp123i1",
        "text": "I am justly kill'd with mine own treachery.",
        "char_start": 158975,
        "char_end": 159018,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.317",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp124i0",
        "text": "How does the queen?",
        "char_start": 159019,
        "char_end": 159038,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.318",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp125i0",
        "text": "She swounds to see them bleed.",
        "char_start": 159039,
        "char_end": 159069,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.319",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp126i0",
        "text": "No, no, the drink, the drink,--O my dear Hamlet,--",
        "char_start": 159070,
        "char_end": 159120,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.320",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp126i1",
        "text": "The drink, the drink! I am poison'd.",
        "char_start": 159121,
        "char_end": 159157,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.321",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp126i2",
        "text": "Dies",
        "char_start": 159158,
        "char_end": 159162,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "QUEEN GERTRUDE"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp127i0",
        "text": "O villany! Ho! let the door be lock'd:",
        "char_start": 159163,
        "char_end": 159201,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.322",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp127i1",
        "text": "Treachery! Seek it out.",
        "char_start": 159202,
        "char_end": 159225,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.323",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp128i0",
        "text": "It is here, Hamlet: Hamlet, thou art slain;",
        "char_start": 159226,
        "char_end": 159269,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.324",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp128i1",
        "text": "No medicine in the world can do thee good;",
        "char_start": 159270,
        "char_end": 159312,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.325",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp128i2",
        "text": "In thee there is not half an hour of life;",
        "char_start": 159313,
        "char_end": 159355,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.326",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp128i3",
        "text": "The treacherous instrument is in thy hand,",
        "char_start": 159356,
        "char_end": 159398,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.327",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp128i4",
        "text": "Unbated and envenom'd: the foul practise",
        "char_start": 159399,
        "char_end": 159439,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.328",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp128i5",
        "text": "Hath turn'd itself on me lo, here I lie,",
        "char_start": 159440,
        "char_end": 159480,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.329",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp128i6",
        "text": "Never to rise again: thy mother's poison'd:",
        "char_start": 159481,
        "char_end": 159524,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.330",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp128i7",
        "text": "I can no more: the king, the king's to blame.",
        "char_start": 159525,
        "char_end": 159570,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.331",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp129i0",
        "text": "The point!--envenom'd too!",
        "char_start": 159571,
        "char_end": 159597,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.332",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp129i1",
        "text": "Then, venom, to thy work.",
        "char_start": 159598,
        "char_end": 159623,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.333",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp129i2",
        "text": "Stabs KING CLAUDIUS",
        "char_start": 159624,
        "char_end": 159643,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp130i0",
        "text": "Treason! treason!",
        "char_start": 159644,
        "char_end": 159661,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.334",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "All"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp131i0",
        "text": "O, yet defend me, friends; I am but hurt.",
        "char_start": 159662,
        "char_end": 159703,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.335",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "KING CLAUDIUS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp132i0",
        "text": "Here, thou incestuous, murderous, damned Dane,",
        "char_start": 159704,
        "char_end": 159750,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.336",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp132i1",
        "text": "Drink off this potion. Is thy union here?",
        "char_start": 159751,
        "char_end": 159792,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.337",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp132i2",
        "text": "Follow my mother.",
        "char_start": 159793,
        "char_end": 159810,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.338",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp132i3",
        "text": "KING CLAUDIUS dies",
        "char_start": 159811,
        "char_end": 159829,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp133i0",
        "text": "He is justly served;",
        "char_start": 159830,
        "char_end": 159850,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.339",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp133i1",
        "text": "It is a poison temper'd by himself.",
        "char_start": 159851,
        "char_end": 159886,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.340",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp133i2",
        "text": "Exchange forgiveness with me, noble Hamlet:",
        "char_start": 159887,
        "char_end": 159930,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.341",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp133i3",
        "text": "Mine and my father's death come not upon thee,",
        "char_start": 159931,
        "char_end": 159977,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.342",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp133i4",
        "text": "Nor thine on me.",
        "char_start": 159978,
        "char_end": 159994,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.343",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp133i5",
        "text": "Dies",
        "char_start": 159995,
        "char_end": 159999,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "LAERTES"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp134i0",
        "text": "Heaven make thee free of it! I follow thee.",
        "char_start": 160000,
        "char_end": 160043,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.344",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp134i1",
        "text": "I am dead, Horatio. Wretched queen, adieu!",
        "char_start": 160044,
        "char_end": 160086,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.345",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp134i2",
        "text": "You that look pale and tremble at this chance,",
        "char_start": 160087,
        "char_end": 160133,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.346",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp134i3",
        "text": "That are but mutes or audience to this act,",
        "char_start": 160134,
        "char_end": 160177,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.347",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp134i4",
        "text": "Had I but time--as this fell sergeant, death,",
        "char_start": 160178,
        "char_end": 160223,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.348",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp134i5",
        "text": "Is strict in his arrest--O, I could tell you--",
        "char_start": 160224,
        "char_end": 160270,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.349",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp134i6",
        "text": "But let it be. Horatio, I am dead;",
        "char_start": 160271,
        "char_end": 160305,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.350",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp134i7",
        "text": "Thou livest; report me and my cause aright",
        "char_start": 160306,
        "char_end": 160348,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.351",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp134i8",
        "text": "To the unsatisfied.",
        "char_start": 160349,
        "char_end": 160368,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.352",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp135i0",
        "text": "Never believe it:",
        "char_start": 160369,
        "char_end": 160386,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.353",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp135i1",
        "text": "I am more an antique Roman than a Dane:",
        "char_start": 160387,
        "char_end": 160426,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.354",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp135i2",
        "text": "Here's yet some liquor left.",
        "char_start": 160427,
        "char_end": 160455,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.355",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i0",
        "text": "As thou'rt a man,",
        "char_start": 160456,
        "char_end": 160473,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.356",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i1",
        "text": "Give me the cup: let go; by heaven, I'll have't.",
        "char_start": 160474,
        "char_end": 160522,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.357",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i2",
        "text": "O good Horatio, what a wounded name,",
        "char_start": 160523,
        "char_end": 160559,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.358",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i3",
        "text": "Things standing thus unknown, shall live behind me!",
        "char_start": 160560,
        "char_end": 160611,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.359",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i4",
        "text": "If thou didst ever hold me in thy heart",
        "char_start": 160612,
        "char_end": 160651,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.360",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i5",
        "text": "Absent thee from felicity awhile,",
        "char_start": 160652,
        "char_end": 160685,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.361",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i6",
        "text": "And in this harsh world draw thy breath in pain,",
        "char_start": 160686,
        "char_end": 160734,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.362",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i7",
        "text": "To tell my story.",
        "char_start": 160735,
        "char_end": 160752,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.363",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i8",
        "text": "March afar off, and shot within",
        "char_start": 160753,
        "char_end": 160784,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp136i9",
        "text": "What warlike noise is this?",
        "char_start": 160785,
        "char_end": 160812,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.364",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp137i0",
        "text": "Young Fortinbras, with conquest come from Poland,",
        "char_start": 160813,
        "char_end": 160862,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.365",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp137i1",
        "text": "To the ambassadors of England gives",
        "char_start": 160863,
        "char_end": 160898,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.366",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp137i2",
        "text": "This warlike volley.",
        "char_start": 160899,
        "char_end": 160919,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.367",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "OSRIC"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp138i0",
        "text": "O, I die, Horatio;",
        "char_start": 160920,
        "char_end": 160938,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.368",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp138i1",
        "text": "The potent poison quite o'er-crows my spirit:",
        "char_start": 160939,
        "char_end": 160984,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.369",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp138i2",
        "text": "I cannot live to hear the news from England;",
        "char_start": 160985,
        "char_end": 161029,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.370",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp138i3",
        "text": "But I do prophesy the election lights",
        "char_start": 161030,
        "char_end": 161067,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.371",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp138i4",
        "text": "On Fortinbras: he has my dying voice;",
        "char_start": 161068,
        "char_end": 161105,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.372",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp138i5",
        "text": "So tell him, with the occurrents, more and less,",
        "char_start": 161106,
        "char_end": 161154,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.373",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp138i6",
        "text": "Which have solicited. The rest is silence.",
        "char_start": 161155,
        "char_end": 161197,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.374",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp138i7",
        "text": "Dies",
        "char_start": 161198,
        "char_end": 161202,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HAMLET"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp139i0",
        "text": "Now cracks a noble heart. Good night sweet prince:",
        "char_start": 161203,
        "char_end": 161253,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.375",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp139i1",
        "text": "And flights of angels sing thee to thy rest!",
        "char_start": 161254,
        "char_end": 161298,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.376",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp139i2",
        "text": "Why does the drum come hither?",
        "char_start": 161299,
        "char_end": 161329,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.377",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp139i3",
        "text": "March within",
        "char_start": 161330,
        "char_end": 161342,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp139i4",
        "text": "Enter FORTINBRAS, the English Ambassadors, and others",
        "char_start": 161343,
        "char_end": 161396,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": null,
        "item_kind": "stage_direction",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp140i0",
        "text": "Where is this sight?",
        "char_start": 161397,
        "char_end": 161417,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.378",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp141i0",
        "text": "What is it ye would see?",
        "char_start": 161418,
        "char_end": 161442,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.379",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp141i1",
        "text": "If aught of woe or wonder, cease your search.",
        "char_start": 161443,
        "char_end": 161488,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.380",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp142i0",
        "text": "This quarry cries on havoc. O proud death,",
        "char_start": 161489,
        "char_end": 161531,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.381",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp142i1",
        "text": "What feast is toward in thine eternal cell,",
        "char_start": 161532,
        "char_end": 161575,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.382",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp142i2",
        "text": "That thou so many princes at a shot",
        "char_start": 161576,
        "char_end": 161611,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.383",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp142i3",
        "text": "So bloodily hast struck?",
        "char_start": 161612,
        "char_end": 161636,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.384",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp143i0",
        "text": "The sight is dismal;",
        "char_start": 161637,
        "char_end": 161657,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.385",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Ambassador"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp143i1",
        "text": "And our affairs from England come too late:",
        "char_start": 161658,
        "char_end": 161701,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.386",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Ambassador"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp143i2",
        "text": "The ears are senseless that should give us hearing,",
        "char_start": 161702,
        "char_end": 161753,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.387",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Ambassador"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp143i3",
        "text": "To tell him his commandment is fulfill'd,",
        "char_start": 161754,
        "char_end": 161795,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.388",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Ambassador"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp143i4",
        "text": "That Rosencrantz and Guildenstern are dead:",
        "char_start": 161796,
        "char_end": 161839,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.389",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Ambassador"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp143i5",
        "text": "Where should we have our thanks?",
        "char_start": 161840,
        "char_end": 161872,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.390",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "First Ambassador"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i0",
        "text": "Not from his mouth,",
        "char_start": 161873,
        "char_end": 161892,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.391",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i1",
        "text": "Had it the ability of life to thank you:",
        "char_start": 161893,
        "char_end": 161933,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.392",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i2",
        "text": "He never gave commandment for their death.",
        "char_start": 161934,
        "char_end": 161976,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.393",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i3",
        "text": "But since, so jump upon this bloody question,",
        "char_start": 161977,
        "char_end": 162022,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.394",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i4",
        "text": "You from the Polack wars, and you from England,",
        "char_start": 162023,
        "char_end": 162070,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.395",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i5",
        "text": "Are here arrived give order that these bodies",
        "char_start": 162071,
        "char_end": 162116,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.396",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i6",
        "text": "High on a stage be placed to the view;",
        "char_start": 162117,
        "char_end": 162155,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.397",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i7",
        "text": "And let me speak to the yet unknowing world",
        "char_start": 162156,
        "char_end": 162199,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.398",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i8",
        "text": "How these things came about: so shall you hear",
        "char_start": 162200,
        "char_end": 162246,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.399",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i9",
        "text": "Of carnal, bloody, and unnatural acts,",
        "char_start": 162247,
        "char_end": 162285,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.400",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i10",
        "text": "Of accidental judgments, casual slaughters,",
        "char_start": 162286,
        "char_end": 162329,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.401",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i11",
        "text": "Of deaths put on by cunning and forced cause,",
        "char_start": 162330,
        "char_end": 162375,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.402",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i12",
        "text": "And, in this upshot, purposes mistook",
        "char_start": 162376,
        "char_end": 162413,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.403",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i13",
        "text": "Fall'n on the inventors' reads: all this can I",
        "char_start": 162414,
        "char_end": 162460,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.404",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp144i14",
        "text": "Truly deliver.",
        "char_start": 162461,
        "char_end": 162475,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.405",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp145i0",
        "text": "Let us haste to hear it,",
        "char_start": 162476,
        "char_end": 162500,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.406",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp145i1",
        "text": "And call the noblest to the audience.",
        "char_start": 162501,
        "char_end": 162538,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.407",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp145i2",
        "text": "For me, with sorrow I embrace my fortune:",
        "char_start": 162539,
        "char_end": 162580,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.408",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp145i3",
        "text": "I have some rights of memory in this kingdom,",
        "char_start": 162581,
        "char_end": 162626,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.409",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp145i4",
        "text": "Which now to claim my vantage doth invite me.",
        "char_start": 162627,
        "char_end": 162672,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.410",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp146i0",
        "text": "Of that I shall have also cause to speak,",
        "char_start": 162673,
        "char_end": 162714,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.411",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp146i1",
        "text": "And from his mouth whose voice will draw on more;",
        "char_start": 162715,
        "char_end": 162764,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.412",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp146i2",
        "text": "But let this same be presently perform'd,",
        "char_start": 162765,
        "char_end": 162806,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.413",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp146i3",
        "text": "Even while men's minds are wild; lest more mischance",
        "char_start": 162807,
        "char_end": 162859,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.414",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp146i4",
        "text": "On plots and errors, happen.",
        "char_start": 162860,
        "char_end": 162888,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.415",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "HORATIO"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp147i0",
        "text": "Let four captains",
        "char_start": 162889,
        "char_end": 162906,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.416",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp147i1",
        "text": "Bear Hamlet, like a soldier, to the stage;",
        "char_start": 162907,
        "char_end": 162949,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.417",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp147i2",
        "text": "For he was likely, had he been put on,",
        "char_start": 162950,
        "char_end": 162988,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.418",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp147i3",
        "text": "To have proved most royally: and, for his passage,",
        "char_start": 162989,
        "char_end": 163039,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.419",
        "item_kind": "line",
        "speaker": "PRINCE FORTINBRAS"
      },
      {
        "span_id": "passage-hamlet-1a218d0f:a5s2:sp147i4",
        "text": "The soldiers' music and the rites of war",
        "char_start": 163040,
        "char_end": 163080,
        "act": 5,
        "scene": 2,
        "line_anchor": "5.2.420",
        "item_kind": "line",
